(126, 'Joshua Salisi', '2021-08-25', '05:23:25pm', ' SIR. BENEDICT ASK ME TO INSTLALL THE POS IN MY LAPTOP. AND I TRY MY BEST TO INSTALL AND I LEARNED SO MUCH IN MY INSTALLATION OF POS.  ABOUT THE REINSTALLING OF XAMPP AND I ALWAYS REMEMBER ABOUT THE COMPUTER NAME.\r\n\r\nI GET FLASHDRIVE TO SIR BRYANT FOR FORMAT  THE LAPTOP OF MAAM CHARMINE. AND JANIEL TEACH ME HOW TO REFORMAT . AND I TRY TO JANIEL UNIT AND I PUT THE MAAM CHARMINE LAPTOP SSD.  \r\n'),
