(132, 'Joshua Salisi', '2021-08-27', '05:09:52pm', ' I INSTALL POS RETAIL IN THE LAPTOP OF SIR. BENEDIC.\r\n\r\nSIR. RABBI ASK ME TO PRINT THE DOCUMENT OF MAAM CHARMINE.\r\n\r\nI TECH THE VILLA CARMELIA . THE ISSUE IS THE PRINTTING SCALE IS HIGH 120. THEN I CHANGE THE PRINTTING SCALE INTO 100.\r\n\r\n I TECH THE MKM BUILDER. THE ISSUE IS THE CASHIER POS IS NOT OPENING . BECAUSE OF THE IP ADDRESS IS NOT COMPATIBLE OR NOT SAME AND THEN I CHANGE THE IP ADDRESS. I GET THE IP ADDRESS OF THE SERVER AND I PASTE IN THE CASHIER POS.\r\n\r\nI PASTE THE FILE BACKUP IN THE TALAVERA GAS STATION AND I BACKUP THEIR FILE OR SQL FILE.\r\n'),
