(138, 'Joshua Salisi', '2021-09-01', '05:24:04pm', 'I AM LOOKING FOR A POSSIBLE CLIENT. AND I SEND TO GROCERY STORES AND RESTAURANTS. THAT WE CAN BECOME A CLIENT.\r\nI TECH ROWENA SANTOS IN BULAON. THE ISSUE IS THE POS IS NOT OPENING SO I DO FIRST IS TO BACKUP THEIR SQL AND THE I DO THE CHECKING WHAT IS THE CAUSE AND ICALL SIR PARULI AND HE SAY CHECK THE PROPERTIES OF THE CASHEIR AND THE I UNSTALL THE OLD VERSION OF THE CHROME AND I INSTALL IT. AND I COPY THE C:Program Files (x86)GoogleChromeApplicationchrome.exe AND THEN PASTE IT IN THE TARGET.\r\n'),
