(141, 'Joshua Salisi', '2021-09-03', '05:51:13pm', ' I ONSITE THE ITABEMONO I CHECK WHAT HAPPEN IN THEIR UNIT. BECAUSE THE STAFF OF THE ITABEMONO SAID THAT THE UNIT HAVE SPARK IN THE POWER SUPPLY PART AND I ASK THEM WHAT HAPPEN? AND THE THEY SAID THE PART OF THE POWER SUPPLY HAVE A SPARK. AND THE ASK THEM TO PULL OUT THE UNIT. BECAUSE I WILL CHECK IT IN THE OFFICE. THEN I OPEN THE POWER SUPPLY AND I WAS LOOKING FOR WHERE THE SPARK STARTED. THE ASK THE STAFF OF ITABEMONO TO REPLACE THEIR POWER SUPPLY WORT 1000 PESOS. THEN I START TO PUT THE NEW POWER SUPPLY TO THEIR UNIT. AND DELIVED IT TO THEM AND SET UP AGAIN.\r\n\r\nTHEN JANIEL ASK ME TO REMOTE THE BPEX SAN FERNANDO TO INSTALL A NEW DRIVER FOR BARCODE PRINTER.'),
