(202, 'Janiel Manalang', '2021-09-28', '09:20:41pm', ' DAY END REPORT LAST 09/27/21\r\nTECH SUPPORT  APALIT\r\n REFORMAT THE POS UNIT  BECAUSE ONLY SHOW IN THE POS IS BLUE SCREEN INSTALL APPLICATION NEEDED\r\n\r\n\r\nTECH SUPPORT JOY ORTEGA \r\n    CLEAN THE POS UNIT BUT THE MONITOR THAT SET ARE NOT WORKING I PULL OU THE POS \r\n\r\n\r\nTECH SUPPORT FOR TODAY\r\n   CHECK THE POS UNIT OF JOY ORTEGA BUT THE PROBLEM OF THE POS IS THE MOBO NOT WORKING . ASK FOR THE CLIENT WANT TO REPLACE THE MOBO . SAY ASK THEIR BOSS\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\nAPALIT \r\n\r\nREMOVE THE OLD ONE REPLACE NEW ONE AND INSTALL AND BACKUP THIER FILES\r\n\r\n'),
(203, 'Joshua Salisi', '2021-09-29', '05:08:38pm', ' I GO TO JAYSON REYES TO GET THE R2D2. BECAUSE ITS BEEN A WEEK SINCE I GAVE TO SIR JAYSON REYES THE BARCODE SCANNER. SO GET THAT BARCODE SCANNER TO HIM.\r\nJANIEL ASK ME TO REMOTE THE PUFF AND PEARL BECAUSE THEIR STICKER PRINTER AND RECEIPT PRINTER IS NOT WORKING SO I UNSTALL ALL THE DRIVER. THE I INSTALL THE NEW ONE. \r\nI GO TO MAJAYPER TO UPDATE THEIR POS AND FIX THE PRINTER STICKER.\r\n'),
(204, 'Janiel Manalang', '2021-09-29', '05:11:39pm', 'DAY END REPORT FOR TODAY\r\n\r\nINSTALL ALL  DRIVER AND SOFTWARE IN THE APALIT  BECAUSE THE POS OF APALIT REMOVE ALL INSTALL LAST SEPTEMBER \r\n28,2021\r\n\r\n\r\nGOING TO MADAPDAP TO DELIVER THE POS UNIT OF MS JOY NOT WORKING BECAUSE OF MOBO\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\nGOING TO HIGHVIEW HACIENDA TO MAKE A DEMO THE CLIENT . \r\n\r\n\r\nGOING TO MS AIDEE GALANG HENSON  TO DELIVERED THE 2BOX THERMAL PAPER.\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\nUPDATES  SUBIC BUT NO RESPONSE FOR THEM.\r\n\r\n'),
(205, 'Joshua Salisi', '2021-09-30', '05:08:57pm', ' JANIEL ASK ME TO WATCH THE TRANFERING FILE FOR SUBIC. AND THEN IF FINISH THE TRANSFERING I CLOSE AND ACCESS.\r\nI SET UP THE SYSTEM UNIT FOR SIR DHICC BECAUSE HE DONâ€™T HAVE TO USE IF JANIEL USING THE PC. THEN I DESIDE TO SETUP THAT FOR SIR DHICC.\r\nTHE I FILE THE EXPENCES FOR GOING TO MAKATI.\r\n'),
(206, 'Benedict Vivar', '2021-09-30', '05:28:32pm', ' -create a report for all the\r\nhardwares thAT WE need next week. \r\nincluding the hardwares for\r\n WOWA and GENERAL TRIAS\r\nAND I SEND TO MAAM CHARMINE\r\n-LIST THE AVAILABLE\r\nHARDWARES\r\n-CALLING CHINALYN TO SET THE\r\nDATE OF DELIVERY IN CAVITE\r\n-SENDING QUOTATIONS TO\r\nROZELLE CAJ\r\n-ANSWERING INQIRIES\r\nALARMA ANGELO\r\nROSALIE CAINGLET REOMA\r\nNALLIE MAY IDIOMA CILOT\r\n-FISHING INQUIRIES FROM OTHER GROUPS\r\nJUFEL BAGONA\r\nGANI ZEROTWO\r\nROSE ANN FASTIDIO ARCIAG\r\n-ARRANGE RNZ PICTURES\r\nQUOTATION,CONTRACT\r\nBY FOLDER\r\n'),
(207, 'Janiel Manalang', '2021-09-30', '05:30:27pm', ' DAY END REPORT  \r\nBIR\r\nPASS THE PAPERS IN THE BIR FOR REGISTRATION OF THE POS THE ESALES AND SWORN STATEMENT \r\n\r\nBACKUP SQL OF SUBIC RESTO BAR \r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\nSUBIC RETAIL POS \r\n\r\n\r\nCOPY AND REPLACE THE NEW UPDATE IN THE FOLDER ABOUT ORDERING REPORT AND SIR RABBI EXPLAIN THE REPORT TO MS SHIENA INSTALL THE ADMIN OF 2 SOFTWARE IN THE SERVER IN COMPUTER OF MS SHIENa'),
(208, 'Janiel Manalang', '2021-09-30', '05:32:50pm', ' DAY END REPORT  \r\nBIR\r\nPASS THE PAPERS IN THE BIR FOR REGISTRATION OF THE POS THE ESALES AND SWORN STATEMENT \r\n\r\nBACKUP SQL OF SUBIC RESTO BAR \r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\nSUBIC RETAIL POS \r\n\r\n\r\nCOPY AND REPLACE THE NEW UPDATE IN THE FOLDER ABOUT ORDERING REPORT AND SIR RABBI EXPLAIN THE REPORT TO MS SHIENA INSTALL THE ADMIN OF 2 SOFTWARE IN THE SERVER IN COMPUTER OF MS SHIENa');
