(209, 'Joshua Salisi', '2021-10-01', '05:16:58pm', ' I BACKUP THE NEST FOR THE UPDATE FOR THE SALE OF SEPTEMBER. THEN FIND THE MISSING RECEIPT NUMBER THEN I GET IT ONE BY ONE IF THEIRS A MISSING RECEIPT NUMBER. AND GET THE TOTAL SALE. \r\nTHEN FILE ALL THE HARD WARE DELIVER AND OTHER EXPENCES FOR THE RNZ. \r\nTHEN I SETUP THE SYSTEM UNIT FOR DELIVER BY TOMORROW.\r\n'),
