(217, 'Janiel Manalang', '2021-10-06', '05:41:00pm', ' DAY END REPORT\r\nOctober 04,2021\r\nTECH SUPPORT APALIT  \r\nReason\r\nâ€¢	PREVIOUS ISSUE THE PRINTER NOT WORKING BUT UPON CHECKING THE HARDWARE MONITOR NOT WORKING WELL\r\nCause \r\nâ€¢	THE CAUSE FOR THAT ISSUE THE POWER INTERRUPTION AND THE POOPS OF THE COCKROACH THE MONITOR HAVE GREEN LIGHT ONLY\r\nResolution \r\nâ€¢	REPLACE THE NEW HARDDISK FOR THAT ISSUE TO INSTALL THE PRINTER AND STICKER PRINTER AND GET THE OLD MONITOR FOR THE PREVIOUS POS UNIT TO REPLACE FOR THE MONITOR NOT WORKING INSTALL THE POS AND RENDER THE FILES OF THE CLIENT IN TO NEW HARDISK TELL THEM NEED TO BUY A UPS TO PREVENT THE THAT ISSUE AND CLEAN THE PLACE OF THE POS EVERY SINGLE DAY I PULL OUT THE MONITOR TO CHECK IN THE OFFICE.\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\nDay end report \r\n\r\nOctober 05, 2021\r\nPASAY STORE\r\n REASON FOR TECH\r\nInstall pole display in the computer\r\n\r\nWOWA STORE\r\nDELIVERY TO WOWA  INSTALL THE POS UNIT AND MAKE CONSO THE COMPUTER\r\n\r\nGrab and chill\r\nOctober 6 2021\r\n\r\nREASON FOR TECH\r\nâ€¢	INPUT NOT SUPPORTED\r\nCAUSE FOR'),
(218, 'Joshua Salisi', '2021-10-06', '05:44:52pm', ' I SET UP THE SYSTEM UNIT BECAUSE THEY TRANSFER THE SYSTEM UNIT FROM ANGELES CITY TO ARAYAT PAMPANGA. THEN A WAIT THEM ATLEAST 20 TO 30 MINUTES. TO SET UP THE SYSTEM.\r\nI HELP JANIEL FOR BACKUPING FOR JACKSANTOSPOS.\r\n'),
(219, 'Benedict Vivar', '2021-10-08', '05:27:37pm', ' -ANSWERING CALL INQUIRIES \r\nTO  Marissa Mondigo\r\n-SET DELIVERY TO \r\nMR DANGEL DESULTURA\r\nON SEPT 13 \r\nFINGDING ALL BRGY CAPTAIN\r\nAND INPUT ALL NAME TO\r\nTHE PROPOSAL\r\n-MAKE A CONTRACT TO\r\nJVP MINI GROCERY\r\n(CLIENT BY MAAM CHARMINE)\r\n'),
(220, 'Joshua Salisi', '2021-10-11', '05:51:54pm', ' 10/07/21\r\nI CHECH THE PRINTER OF THE RELIEF PLUS AND THE CASHDRAWER. BECAUSE THE PRINTER IS NOT CONTINUOUSLY PRINTING POSSIBLE CAUSE IS THE PRINTER CABLE. AND I TEST IT FEW TIME AND IT IS ALL GOOD. AND THE CASHDRAWER IS  NOT OPENING PROPERLY AND CLOSING PROPERLY. THEN I TRY TO REMOVE THE DRAWER AND I SEE THE FLAT BAR WAS NOT PROPERLY  ATTACH IN THE LOCK OF THE CASHDRAWER.\r\nI TECH THE LOCKDOWN BALIBAGO TO CHECK THEIR POS.\r\n\r\n10/08/21\r\nJANIEL ASK ME TO FIX THE PRINTER OF THE JACKSTORE.BECAUSE THE PRINTER IS NOT PRINTING PROPERLY I CHECKUP THE PRINTER OUTSIDE AND INSIDE. AND I SEE IN THE INSIDE IS THE THERMAL HEAD IS NOT PROPERLY ATTACH.\r\nI TECH LOCKDOWN BECAUSE THE SYSTEM UNIT IS NOT WORKING AGAIN SO I DESIDE IT TO CHANGE THE POWER SUPPLY THEN SIR RABBI HELP ME FOR THE PROBLEM BECAUSE I DONâ€™T KNOW THE OTHER SOLUTION BECAUSE IT IS STILL NOT OPENING AGAIN. THEN HE TRY THE RAM DANCE THEN KABOOM IT WORK.\r\n10/11/21\r\nTHE PRINTER OF THE WOWA STORE THERE WAS PRINTING A SPECIAL CHARACTER SO I '),
(221, 'Janiel Manalang', '2021-10-11', '06:35:00pm', '\r\n  THE COMPUTER UNIT CAN BE OPEN STACK IN BLACK WITH BLINKING CURSOR	â€¢ CORRUPTED OF THE HARRDISK AND SSD â€¢ VIRUS OF USB	â€¢ FIRST I TRIED TO REFORMAT THE UNIT BUT THE COMPUTER DID NOT RESPONSE â€¢ I TRY TO ANOTHER COMPUTER BUT CANNOT BE REFORMAT â€¢ I GOING TO PC BYTES TO DELIVER THE UNIT THAT CAN BE OPEN â€¢ UPON CHECKING THE UNIT THEY SEE A VIRUS THAT WHY THE REFORMAT THE BOTH HDD '),
