(223, 'Janiel Manalang', '2021-10-11', '06:37:23pm', '\r\n  THE COMPUTER UNIT CAN BE OPEN STACK IN BLACK WITH BLINKING CURSOR	â€¢ CORRUPTED OF THE HARRDISK AND SSD â€¢ VIRUS OF USB	â€¢ FIRST I TRIED TO REFORMAT THE UNIT BUT THE COMPUTER DID NOT RESPONSE â€¢ I TRY TO ANOTHER COMPUTER BUT CANNOT BE REFORMAT â€¢ I GOING TO PC BYTES TO DELIVER THE UNIT THAT CAN BE OPEN â€¢ UPON CHECKING THE UNIT THEY SEE A VIRUS THAT WHY THE REFORMAT THE BOTH HDD '),
