(225, 'Joshua Salisi', '2021-10-13', '05:41:29pm', ' 10/12/21\r\nI CHECK THE SYSTEM UNIT OF JACK STORE THE I REPLACE A NEW PSU FOR THAT BECAUSE THE OLD PSU WAS BROKEN SO I DECIDE SO REPLACE A BRAND NEW PSU. THEN SIR PARULI HE CHECK ALSON AND THE MOBO WAS BROKEN ALSO. WE ARE WAITING FOR THE UPDATE OF JACKSTORE.\r\nTHEN I GO TO SIR MIKE TO GET THE PSU FOR THE JACKSTORE SYSTEM UNIT AND I CHANGE ITEM FOR THE KEYBOARD OF WOWA STORE.\r\nTHE I DELIVER 1BOX OF THERMAL PAPER FOR C AND G STORE IN SAN MANUEL LAPAZ. THEN I DUMP THEIR SQL .\r\nAFTER I DELIVER THE THERMAL PAPER. I GO TO MONJAYFER VET CLINIC FOR THEIR STICKER PRINTER AND THE RECEIPT PRINTER BECAUSE THEY REMOVE THEIR USB PORT BECAUSE IT IS NOT PRINTER . SO I INSTALL AGAIN THEIR DRIVER.\r\n10/13/21\r\nI TEST THE SYSTEM UNIT OF DISTRICT BREW. THEN I PULL OUT. THEN THEY GAVE ME 2000 PESOS FOR THE TECH FEE\r\nAFTER THAT I GO TO SIR MIKE TO PAY THE PSU AND THE KEYBOARD.\r\n THEN I CLEAN THE OFFICE BECAUSE LAST DAY I DONâ€™T HAVE TIME TO CLEAN. ITS TO LATE IT IS ALMOST 5 45PM I GET TO OFFICE.\r\nTHEN SIR RABB'),
(226, 'Benedict Vivar', '2021-10-14', '05:49:51pm', ' -SET UP POS HARDWARE FOR CLIENT DEMO\r\n\r\n- IMPUT INQUIRIES AND DELIVERED CLIENT ON\r\nON MARKETING TAB\r\n\r\n-ASSIST AND SET THE ONLINE DEMO FOR JEWELRY\r\nBUSINESS AND CREATE LIST FOR \r\nCLIENT CONCERN\r\n\r\n-UPDATE CLIENT INQUIRIES\r\n\r\n-'),
(227, 'Joshua Salisi', '2021-10-07', '04:09:42pm', ' I TECH THE RECEIPT OF THE JACKSTORE BECAUSE IT IS NOT PRINTING. SO I OPEN THE PRINTER THEN I SEE THE THERMAL HEAD WAS NOT PROPERLY ATTACH I\r\n\r\nI FIX THE PRINTER AND CASH DRAWER OF THE RELIEF PLUS. BECAUSE THE PRINTER WAS NOT CONTINUOUS PRINTING. THEN THE CASHDRAWER WAS NOT PROPERLY ATTACH THE FLAT BAR THE LOCK.\r\n'),
(228, 'Joshua Salisi', '2021-10-08', '04:14:22pm', ' I TECH THE LOCKDOWN BALIBAGO BECAUSE THE SYSTEM UNIT IS AUTOMATIC SHUT DOWN THEN I PULL OUT THE UNIT . THEN TRY TO FIX AT THE OFFICE. I CHANGE THE PSU AND THE OTHER RAM SLOT WAS BROKEN.\r\n\r\nI GO TO SIR MIKE TO CHANGE THE KEYBOAR. AND I DELIVER IT TO WOWA STORE.\r\n\r\n'),
(229, 'Joshua Salisi', '2021-10-12', '04:15:59pm', ' I DELIVER THE 1BOX THERMAL PAPER TO C AND G STORE AT LA PAZ TARLAC\r\n\r\nTHEN I GO TO MONJAYFER AT ARAYAT TO REINSTALL THE DRIVER OF THEIR TWO PRINTER.\r\n'),
(230, 'joshua salisi', '2021-10-15', '05:26:40pm', ' I arrange my file into pending , done and work order. I buy my own folder.\r\nThen I arrange also the cables , tools and the other at the stock area.\r\nI educate the relief plus for their discount in senior because the anytime their purch a product the discount was 5% . and then I said to them that after the bir process they will process the 20% discount. Then before or they cant process I bir it still in 5%. But now the store is bir accredited. So the 20% discount was in process now but then will delete and input again.\r\n\r\n'),
(231, 'Janiel Manalang', '2021-10-15', '05:30:59pm', ' DAY END REPORT \r\n10/15/21\r\n \r\n\r\n TECH SUPPORT\r\n	ALLWING ALABANG REMOVE THE DISCOUNT AN HAVE ERROR TELL TO MS VERONICA THAT WHEN\r\nTHEY DISCOUNT IN SPECIFIC HAVE AN AMOUNT TO AVOID THAT KIND OF ERROR\r\n\r\nHIGHVIEW CLIENT\r\n	CALL TO FOLLOW UP THE CLIENT ABOUT THE POS SOFTWARE AND PRINTER AND BARCODE SCANNER.\r\n '),
