(274, 'Janiel Manalang', '2021-11-09', '05:09:51pm', ' CREATING REPORT ABOUT THE  ROYAL RESTO \r\n\r\n\r\nTECH SUPPORT \r\nTALAVERA THE NEST\r\n\r\nREASON FOR TECH\r\nâ€¢	CONNECTING THE SERVER AND THE CASHIER IN 1 ROUTER\r\nCAUSE \r\nâ€¢	THE SERVER  REFORMAT AND REMOVE ALL FILES\r\n\r\nRESO\r\nâ€¢	CONNECTING IN THE ROUTER   BUT THE LANDCABLE CAN RANGE THE  ROUTER\r\nTHAT WHY WIFI CONNECTED IN  SERVER TO PING BOTH SIDE THE ADMIN AND CASHIER/\r\n\r\nTECH SUPPORT IN SUBIC RETAIL\r\nNovember 09 2021\r\n\r\nIssue\r\nâ€¢	Upon checking the system of the retail in subic I tried  several times about the misdate when you input a correct date the all transaction show in both side in the  shift report and  x reading and day end report, when you input incorrect date shift report and day end report show that the only  correct date show only .\r\n\r\n\r\nRecommendation \r\nâ€¢	Fix the date in subic to avoid misdate  in the subic o\r\n \r\n\r\n'),
