(299, 'Janiel Manalang', '2021-11-23', '05:24:38pm', ' Day end report\r\ngoing to sir mike to check the pos unit \r\nTechnical support   \r\nLockdown balibago and \r\ncutcut friendship\r\n\r\n\r\nConcern, Back Up, Check the POS\r\nDeliver the receipt of lockdown payment in retainers fee, And we back up the system and check  the POS SYSTEM\r\n\r\n\r\nSTATUS: DONE/CLOSED\r\n\r\n\r\nReason for tech \r\nThe computer unit cannot turn on \r\nThe Computer Blackout \r\n\r\nCause for that\r\nPower interruption of the unit\r\nThe ups unit have a problem \r\nThey have a different sound.\r\n\r\nResolution\r\nUPON CHECKING \r\nTHE UPS HAVE AND DIFFERENT SOUND AND UNPLUG ALL CABLES AND PLUG AGAIN BUT UPON CHECKING THE UPS CAN NOT CHARGES DIRECTLY AND CHECKING AGAIN TO DIFFERENT OUTLET\r\n\r\nIN THE MEANTIME THE CABLES  OF COMPUTER PLUG IN THE EXTENSION AND STAFF OF THE MANG CHA  SAYS THE COMPUTER PROPERLY WORKING NOW USING THE EXTENSION\r\n\r\n\r\nSTATUS:DONE/CLOSED\r\n'),
