(329, 'Joshua Salisi', '2022-01-05', '05:30:21pm', ' I went to Dawson to maintenance the pos. I back up the SQL and clean the system unit. Then I open the system unit. Then I see the problem, is slow to open the system unit. I test to plug in the other outlet.  Then I open it and it is normal to open now. The problem is the power consumption for the system unit is not enough.\r\n\r\nI file the receipt of delivery last few days\r\n\r\nI clean the office'),
