(343, 'Joshua Salisi', '2022-01-17', '05:40:34pm', ' I access the Jewelry pasay, to check why the other product was missing. Then I check the database and then backup the sql first. Then I check the present render then I see the other product was missing because the item register is 300 plus. Then  I check the backup of janiel. I see the product is 400plus so the cause is the misrendering.\r\nMaam charmine ask me to deliver the milktea from sapang bato to holy angel village phase 4.\r\nSir rabbi asks me to print an acknowledgment receipt then deliver to the client in cuayan.\r\n'),
(344, 'Joshua Salisi', '2022-01-18', '05:18:37pm', ' I SET UP THE SYSTEM UNIT FOR CHECKING THE CAUSE OF OVERHEATING. THEN I MONITOR EVERY HOUR.  THEN I TRY TO OPEN A BROWSER THEN I CREATE 3 TABS OF YOUTUBE THEN I PLAY I. ITâ€™S ALMOST 5 HOURS THE SYSTEM UNIT IS STILL NOT SHUTTING DOWN. SO MY POSSIBLE REASON IS THE ELECTRICITY POWER IN THEIR PLACE WAS STRONG. I WILL MONITOR THIS SYSTEM UNIT UNTIL TOMORROW.\r\nI TRY THE 3 RFID SCANNERS 1 BY 1. THEN I TEST THE 1ST ONE THEN ALL 60 RFID CARD WAS WORKING. THEN I TRY THE 2ND ONE STILL WORKING AND THEN THE 3RD ONE IS NOT WORKING. THEN I SEPARATE THE RFID NOT WORKING. THEN I SEND IT TO SIR. RABBI FOR THE RESULT OF THE RFID SCANNER AND CARD.\r\n\r\nThen test the printer for delivery by tomorrow.\r\n\r\n'),
(345, 'Joshua Salisi', '2022-01-19', '05:05:11pm', ' I went to intersave to pickup the payment for pos and then i went to pampang market to buy for the burger and the i delivered it to sapang bato and i also went to sir rabbi house. Then i go to psbank to depo.\r\nI went to intersave to update the pos. Then iwent to emperor car accessories to get the ticket\r\nI test the 2 printer and barcode scanner. In the A8 system unit\r\n\r\n'),
