(424, 'Janiel Manalang', '2022-03-24', '05:14:34pm', 'GUIDE KEIL ABOUT REMOVE THE S.I NUMBER IN THE DATABASE.\r\nI WENT TO SAN LEONARDO  N.E TO DELIVERY THE POS.\r\n\r\n FIRST WE CHECK THE CABLES IF THEY HAVE EXTRA TO AVOID  BUYING UTP CABLE BUT UPON CHECKING NO EXTRA CABLES.  WE  GOING TO HARDWARES TO BUY CAT5 CABLING IN THE  MARICOR HARDWARE  CRIMP THE UTP CABLE AFTER THAT WE DO THE  CONSOLIDATED AND PRINTER SHARING.'),
(425, 'Janiel Manalang', '2022-03-25', '05:23:25pm', 'FINDING THE  CONTRACT OF MARICOR.\r\nGUIDE KEIL ABOUT HOW TO VOID THE  ITEM IN THE RESTO BAR IN SUBIC.\r\n\r\nI WENT TO IKEBUKURO  JAPANESE STORE.\r\n\r\nTHE CLIENT INFORM US ABOUT THE DISCOUNT BY QTY TO FALL IN UPGRADING OF THE POS.	TO AVOID MANUALLY COMPUTE OF DISCOUNT	I REPORT TO SIR VIVAR TO MAKE A PROPOSAL ABOUT THE UPGRADING OF THE SOFTWARE ..	DONE\r\n	THE CLIENT INFORM US ABOUT THE DISCOUNT, FONT SIZE IN THE RECEIPT AND VOIDING DOUBLE TRANSACTION.	UPON CHECKING THAT CONCERN THEY DID NOT PROPERLY USE THE PROPER PROCESS IN THE POS THEY DIDN`T CLEARCART AFTER TRANSACTION	FIRST: I BACKUP THE POS UNIT. SECOND: I RESIZE THE FONT SIZE IN THE SCALE OF THE PRINTER SETTING THIRD: I REMOVE THE DOUBLE TRANSACTION IN THE DATABASE ITEM BUCKET COUNT. 4TH. TEACH THE CLIENT IN THE DISCOUNT FOR SPECIFIC REPORT HOW THE PROCESS DISCOUNT. ANSWER THE CLIENT IF THEY HAVE CONCERN CLIENT HAVE CONCERN IN THE ADMIN ACCOUNT TO RESIZE THE PROFIT BOXES.\r\n\r\n'),
(426, 'aeron elison', '2022-03-25', '05:30:33pm', ' Day end report \r\n> I make an inventory for our hardware items\r\n> Sir rabbi discuss on how to expand data base\r\n>  Share and post about our services.\r\n\r\n\r\n'),
(427, 'c ilagan', '2022-03-25', '05:36:50pm', '  March 25, 2022\r\nDayend Report\r\nKeil Ilagan\r\n\r\n*Share and post.\r\n*Sir rabbi discuss to us on how to expand database\r\n*Sir rabbi teach me on how to install POS with BIR registered\r\n*Sir janiel help me to resolve the issue about on how to delete the pending table logs. '),
(428, 'Benedict Vivar', '2022-03-25', '05:42:45pm', ' SENDING QUOTATION TO AND ANSWERING CALL\r\nDISCUSS THE PRICE FOR SHIPPING AND INCLUSIONS\r\nMAAM JEN GALICINAO- SAMELO\r\n(ISABELA)\r\nSIR GERALD GAON TANGLIBEM\r\n(SORSOGON)\r\nWAITING FOR APPROVAL\r\n\r\nANDWERING INQUIRIES\r\n\r\nGOING TO HARDWARES TO BUY\r\nMOLDING AND NO NAILS\r\n\r\nSAMPLE AND TEACH OJT HOW\r\nTO INSTALLED THE MOLDING \r\n\r\nCALLING IKEBUKURO MANAGER\r\nASKING FOR PROPOSAL REQUEST\r\nFOR THE UPGRADING AND CREATE \r\nTHE PROPOSAL AND SEND \r\nTO EMAIL MANAGER (IKEBUKURO SIR JOEL)'),
(429, 'Benedict Vivar', '2022-03-28', '05:40:34pm', ' posting ang sharing on facebook\r\naccount and facebook page\r\n\r\ncreat new proposal to\r\nmaam jen galisinao-samelo\r\nisabela\r\n\r\nupdate sir dhoy del valle\r\nabout proposal for upgrading\r\n\r\nfishing from other pos provider\r\nand pos group\r\n\r\ngoing to nepo quad to buy\r\nice cream\r\n\r\nanswering inquiries'),
(430, 'Janiel Manalang', '2022-03-28', '06:24:17pm', ' SHARE AND POST \r\nUPDATING MS REMY ABOUT CONCERN IN CANCEL TRANSACTION.\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n TECH SUPPORT\r\nJANIEL\r\nIKAS PHARMACY\r\nMARCH 28, 2022\r\n\r\nREASON\r\n WE ADVISE THE CLIENT   ABOUT NEW UPDATES IN THE POS LIKE THE EXPIRATION DATE OF THE PRODUCT.\r\n\r\n\r\nCAUSE\r\nTHE CLIENT WANTS TO HAVE A DIFFERENT  EXPIRATION DATE ON THE ITEM.\r\nRESOLUTION\r\nFIRST I BACK UP BOTH FILES AND SQL.\r\nSECOND I TEST THE PHARMACY CASHIER AND GROCERY TO CHECK IF THEY PING EACH OTHER.\r\nAFTER TESTING  I WILL  DISCUSS THE NEW UPDATE WITH MS  APRIL.\r\nAND ASK THEM IF THEY HAVE CONCERNS.\r\nNO OTHER CONCERN FOR MAAM APRIL.\r\n\r\nSTATUS: DONE'),
(431, 'aeron elison', '2022-03-28', '09:51:18am', ' Day end Report\r\nI went to nueva ecija in ms. maricrielle hardware to do this solution in her concern \r\n\r\nTech update the drivers of the exceeding operating system -- status system unit still not turning off after shutdown.\r\n\r\nTech install different drivers to make sure that the system will not lack in any drivers. - status still not turning off after shutdown.\r\n\r\nTech try to test the old hard disk of the system unit to verify that is a software malfunction -- status the system unit is shutting down and turning off . \r\n\r\nTech last resort is to format the unit in windows 7.\r\n\r\nTech reformat the system unit again in windows 10 to verify that is a software malfunction. -- status still not turning off after shutdown.\r\n\r\nTech ask the client to turn it back to windows 7 , the client answer that we can turn it back to windows 7 but need to connect terminal 1 and terminal 2 in one printer. \r\n\r\nAfter all the possible solution the system unit is now turning off after shutdown and already connect'),
(432, 'aeron elison', '2022-03-29', '05:36:25pm', ' Day end Report \r\n> Share and post about our POS product\r\n>Chatting other possible client in different pages  \r\n> Help Keil Ilagan on expanding data base \r\n'),
(433, 'Benedict Vivar', '2022-03-29', '05:36:51pm', ' MORNING MEETING\r\n\r\nGIVING TASK THE OJT\r\nAND I TALK TO THEM FOR\r\nOUR GAME PLAN FOR\r\nMARKETING\r\n\r\nPOSTING AND SHARING TO FB\r\nPAGE AND FB GROUPS\r\n\r\nANSWERING INQUIRIES \r\n\r\nCREAT AND SENDING PROPOSAL TO\r\nSIR EKTAD DUENAS\r\nMISS RHOSE MHAY \r\nMISS CHRISTINE REGALADO ABALOS\r\n\r\nSET ZOOM MEETING TO\r\nMISS SHYRA KATE ENGGO'),
(434, 'Janiel Manalang', '2022-03-29', '05:46:40pm', ' TECH SUPPORT \r\n\r\nGUIDE  KEIL ABOUT EXPANDING DATABASE IN THE TALAVERA \r\n\r\nGAS STATION AND MARICOR HARDWARES.\r\n MAKE A MEETING ABOUT  HOW TO MAKE A SALES.\r\nMAKE A REPORT ABOUT THE  SALES REPORT AND \r\n\r\nMAINTENANCE AND THEY PROFIT.\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\nMAKE A DEMO IN THE BAGUIO CITY ABOUT IN THE RESTO.'),
