(437, 'Janiel Manalang', '2022-03-30', '05:33:59pm', '   DAY END REPORT\r\nSHARE AND POSTING\r\nOFFER TECH SUPPORT MAINTENANCE\r\nTEACH SOME  POS IN THE NEWBIE\r\n\r\nCONCERN ABOUT THE SALES\r\nTECH SUPPORT\r\nJANIEL\r\nMARCH 30  2022\r\nSUBIC RESTO\r\n\r\nREASON\r\nTHE CLIENT INFORM US ABOUT THE SALES ON AUGUST 31, 2021 SEPTEMBER 14, 2021\r\nCAUSE:\r\nBECAUSE THE NEW UPDATE ARE ALREADY IMPLEMENTED THAT THE OLD TRANSACTION ERASE STARTS TO NEW POS.\r\nREASON:\r\nI RENDER THE  2 POS SQL IN THE BOTH POS IN THE SUBIC RESTO\r\nAFTER I RENDER I SAVE IT AS A PDF THE FILES.\r\nWE SEND TO IN ACCOUNTING STAFF OF SUBIC.\r\n\r\nSTATUSDONE\r\n\r\nTech support\r\njaniel\r\nmarch 30 2022\r\nikas Pharmacy\r\n\r\nREASON\r\nTHE CLIENT INFORM US ABOUT THE POS SLOWLY PROCESSED IN THE CASHIER AND ADMIN SIDE\r\nCAUSE\r\nTHE POS UNIT CONSOLIDATED AND THEY HAVE AN NETWORK\r\nUPON CHECKING THE POS UNIT NEED TO BE RESTARTED.\r\nRESOLUTION\r\n1ST I CHECK THE CASHIER  SHORTCUT AND THE ADMIN.\r\nI RESTART THE POS UNIT BECAUSE MAAM IKAS TOLD ME ABOUT ONLY THE  MONITOR TURNOFF  AND I RESTART THE POS UNIT TO AVOID THAT ERROR.\r\nUPON REST'),
