(442, 'Janiel Manalang', '2022-03-31', '05:41:11pm', ' answer tech support by not accessing\r\npost and share.\r\ndiscuss about the retail in the newbie tech support.\r\nbuying ink in marisol.\r\n\r\n\r\ni went to ikebukuro \r\nTech support \r\nmarch 31, 2021\r\nIKEBUKURO JAPANESE RESTO BAR.\r\n\r\nREASON\r\n*Client inform us that the manager needs to teach about the inventory in the POS\r\n	\r\n\r\nCAUSE\r\n*TO CHECK THE INVENTORY PER PORTION. TO HAVE AN RECORD OF BEGINNING QTY AND ENDING.	'),
(443, 'aeron elison', '2022-04-01', '05:32:01pm', ' Dayend Report\r\n\r\nI check the Sytem unit that brougth by johnnys super market.\r\n\r\nMake an invetory report about the system unit that Johnny,s super market bring here.\r\n\r\nFormat the system unit to windows 10 \r\n\r\nI install xammp navicat subline, google chrome\r\n\r\nShare and post about the POS.\r\n'),
(444, 'c ilagan', '2022-04-01', '05:32:25pm', ' Dayend Report\r\nApril 01, 2022\r\nKeil Ilagan\r\n\r\n*Share and post.\r\n*Cleaning the POS of Shohei.\r\nTech Note\r\nApril 01, 2022\r\nKeil Ilagan\r\nLloyd Jansen Trinidad\r\n\r\nReason:\r\nMonthly Maintenance of the POS\r\n\r\nCause:\r\nFor cleaning the POS\r\n\r\nResolution:\r\nBackup and cleaning the POS and checking monthly sales.\r\n\r\nStatus:\r\nDONE!\r\n\r\n*Inventory list of client.'),
(445, 'Janiel Manalang', '2022-04-01', '05:33:36pm', 'i went to shohei japanese minimart\r\nshare and post.\r\nanswer customer concern. \r\n\r\n\r\nTech support\r\njaniel\r\nApril 1 2022\r\nikas Pharmacy\r\n\r\nREASON\r\nTHE CLIENT INFORM US ABOUT SALES ON MARCH 29 AND 30  COMBINING ON MARCH 30.\r\n\r\nCAUSE\r\nTHE WRONG DATE OF THE COMPUTER.\r\n\r\nRESOLUTION\r\nFIRST I CHECK THE DATE IN THE ITEM COUNT \r\nAFTER CHECKING THE DATE I CHANGE THE  DATE IN THE COMPUTER SETTING AND CHANGE THE TIME ZONE.\r\nAND CLICK THE DAY END REPORT AND CHECK IF THE MARCH 31 AND  APRIL 1 COMBINE BUT UPON CHECKING THE SALES OF  MARCH 31 2022  NOT APPEAR IN THE  APRIL 1 \r\nTHE POS IS READY TO USE.\r\n\r\n\r\nSTATUS:DONE'),
(446, 'Benedict Vivar', '2022-04-01', '05:35:32pm', ' IMPUTING ALL RNZ FACEBOOK\r\nGROUP IN EXEL \r\n\r\nCREATE AND SENDING PROPOSAL TO\r\nMAAM HARHON DE VERA\r\nMAAM GHIE FREMINTA\r\nMAAM MARJORINA SANTOS\r\nMAAM CHA MITSUI\r\nSIR JB BANDOMA\r\nMAAM DEMLENLY DOLOSO\r\n\r\nANSWERING COMMENT INQUIRIES\r\nAND SEND DIRECT MESSAGE \r\n\r\nUPDATE POSIBLE CLIENT\r\n\r\nANSWERING INQUIRIES CONSERNE\r\nABOUT POS SYSTEM AND HARDWARE\r\nINCLUSION\r\n');
