(447, 'Janiel Manalang', '2022-04-04', '05:23:44pm', ' SHARE AND POST\r\nANSWERING THE CUSTOMER CONCERN\r\nTECH SUPPORT WOWA , KGG AND, IKAS\r\n\r\nTech support \r\nAPRIL 4 2022\r\nKGG MINIMART\r\nJANIEL\r\n\r\nREASON\r\n*FOR UPDATING THE MONTLY MAINTENANCE OF THE POS.\r\n	\r\n\r\nCAUSE\r\n*FOR CHECKING AND LESS THE MONTLY SALES OF THE CLIENT\r\n\r\n\r\nRESOLUTION\r\n*FIRST I BACKUP THE POS FILES AND SQL.\r\n*COPY AND REPLACE THE NEW UPDATE AND PASTE IN THE POS  DATABASE OF THE CLIENT\r\n*BUCKET_ITEMCOUNT\r\n*BUCKET_RECEIPT\r\n*bucket_voiditems\r\n*bucket_discountlist\r\n*INFORM THE CLIENT UPDATE ALREADY DONE.\r\nSTATUS:DONE\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\nTech support \r\nAPRIL 4 2022\r\nIKAS \r\nJANIEL\r\n\r\nREASON\r\n* THE CLIENT INFORM US ABOUT THE SLOWLY POS.\r\n	\r\n\r\nCAUSE\r\n* THE CLIENT INFORM US ABOUT THE SLOWLY POS.\r\n* Because the of the transmit of the data of the pos.	\r\n\r\n\r\nRESOLUTION\r\n*make a video  about the pos and told client about the pos not slowly.\r\nno other concern.\r\n\r\n\r\nSTATUS:DONE\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n'),
(448, 'Benedict Vivar', '2022-04-04', '05:23:54pm', ' UPDATE SENDING PROPOSAL LAST FRIDAY\r\n\r\nISABELA MAM JEN GALICIANO SAMELO\r\nBAGUIO MAAM MARIE CLAIRE CAYONG\r\nRIZAL KITTY KREATOS\r\nNUEVA ECIJA JB BADONMA\r\nTAGUIG CHA MITSUI\r\nIMUS CAVITE HARHON DE VERA\r\nDEMYENLYN DOLOSO\r\n\r\nANSWERING QUESTIONS \r\nABOUT POS\r\n\r\nANSWERING COMMENT INQUIRIES \r\nAND SENDING MESSAGE TO\r\n\r\nGUERRO BOOGIE\r\nMICHAEL DELA CRUZ\r\nYUHJHIHN PRO-IT\r\nROSALIA BENGANO\r\nRKENNETH PAYUMO\r\nEARN ONALOS\r\n\r\nSENDING MESSAGE TO\r\nKOREAN STORE TO THEIR FB PAGE'),
(449, 'aeron elison', '2022-04-04', '05:26:34pm', ' Dayend Report \r\n\r\n>Went to wowa grocery to deliver 1 box of thermal paper \r\n> Went to Wowa grocery to check their printer and fix IT.\r\n\r\n>Post in my rnz account about our POS product \r\n'),
