(451, 'Janiel Manalang', '2022-04-05', '05:45:38pm', 'shared and post \r\nanswer pos question of keil\r\nanswer aeron concern\r\n\r\nTECH SUPPORT\r\nTHE WOODS\r\nTHE CLIENT INFORM US ABOUT THE ADDING ADDITIONAL PRODUCT.	THEY HAVE AN NEW PRODUCT IN THE MENU.	IBACKUP FIRST THE SQL AND FILES OF THE THEWOODS ADDING THE ADDITIONAL PRODUCT IN THE OFFICE\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n'),
(452, 'c ilagan', '2022-04-05', '05:46:32pm', ' Dayend Report\r\nApril 05, 2022\r\nKeil Ilagan\r\n\r\n*Share and post\r\n*Removing the zues account in atlanta fuel\r\nTech Note:\r\nAtlanta Fuel\r\nKeil Ilagan\r\nApril 05, 2022\r\n\r\nReason:\r\nThe client inform us to remove monthly sales maintenance of atlanta gas station\r\n\r\nCause:\r\nThe client inform us to remove monthly sales maintenance of atlanta gas station\r\n\r\nResolution:\r\nThe client inform us to see all sales in the month of march and remove zues account. \r\n*Confirmed by sir rabbi\r\n\r\nStatus:\r\nDONE\r\n'),
(453, 'Benedict Vivar', '2022-04-05', '05:46:58pm', ' SENDING MESSAGE TO COMMENT\r\nINQUIRIES\r\n\r\nANSWERING INQUIRIES CONCERNS\r\n\r\nUPDATE SEND MESSAGE TO \r\nPOSIBLE CLIENT\r\n\r\nCREATE PHOTO SHOP \r\nLAY OUT RNZ BROCHURE'),
