(455, 'c ilagan', '2022-04-06', '06:01:04pm', ' Dayend Report\r\nKeil Ilagan\r\nApril 06, 2022\r\n\r\n*Share and post\r\n*updating the program of atlanta fuel\r\n*help sir janiel about arranging the SI number'),
(456, 'aeron elison', '2022-04-06', '06:13:15pm', ' Tech support The nest convenience store \r\nconfig the ip address of it.\r\nTell the client to check the lan cable\r\nShare and post about the POS \r\nChat possible client in the page.'),
(457, 'Janiel Manalang', '2022-04-06', '06:18:17pm', 'tech support\r\nshare and post\r\nanswer inquries of the client\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n Tech support \r\nAPRIL 6 022\r\ntalavera gas station\r\nJANIEL\r\n\r\nREASON\r\n*Client inform us to  update thier S.I number.\r\n	\r\n\r\nCAUSE\r\n* To  check the pos S.I  NUMBER IF ARRANGE PROPERLY.\r\n\r\n\r\nRESOLUTION\r\n*FIRST I BACKUP THE POS FILES AND SQL.\r\nI GET THE  BUCKET_ITEM COUNT AND BUCKET RECEIPT\r\n\r\nARANNGE THE SI NUMBER 000000000001 TO \r\nLAST SI OF THE RECEIPT. BUCKET RECEIPT\r\n\r\nSTART OF 23816 TO LAST IF S.I NUMBER.\r\n\r\n\r\nSTATUS:DONE\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\nTech support \r\nAPRIL 6 2022\r\nMEDSAVERS\r\nJANIEL\r\n\r\nREASON\r\n* THE CLIENT HAVE AN CONCERN IN THE POS.\r\n	\r\n\r\nCAUSE\r\n*THE CLIENT WANT TO KNOW ABOUT THE LIST OF THE PRODUCT HOW THE BARCODE SCANNER WORK AND CHANGE THE BUSINESS INFO.\r\n\r\n\r\nRESOLUTION\r\n*I BACKUP THE SQL AND FILES OF THE MEDSAVERS. WE EDIT THE BUSINESS_INFO THE TIN NUMBER AND THE GMAIL. REMOVE THE OLD ADMIN THE USER . AND ADD NEW ADMIN REIN TEACH THE CLIENT HOW TO WORKS THE BARCODE SCANNER. NO OTHER CONCERN OF THE CLIENT PAYMENT 1,000\r\n\r\n'),
(458, 'aeron elison', '2022-04-07', '05:33:38pm', ' Dayend report\r\nAeron Elison \r\n\r\nSir rabbi task us about making new accounts and products on Mrs. Ikas POS\r\n\r\nI make 5 products and do 20 transaction on Mrs. Ikas POS \r\n\r\nI make an document report of the transaction I made and compute it if the sales are tallied.\r\n\r\nShare and Post .\r\n\r\nTech Maam macrielle concern about the auto shutdow of the admin and make this step by step by the help of keil. \r\n\r\n>Tech Back up the data base \r\n\r\n>Tech Remove the Power button Icon in the program \r\n\r\n>Tech ask the client for other concern, client answer there is no other concern. \r\n\r\nCall client of talavera retail and check there unit.\r\n'),
(459, 'Janiel Manalang', '2022-04-07', '05:49:15pm', 'shared and post\r\nanswering pos concern\r\nschedule pos .\r\n\r\n\r\n TECH SUPPORT\r\nIKAS PHARMACY\r\nJANIEL AND AERON\r\nAPRIL 7 2022\r\n\r\n\r\nREASON\r\n THE CLIENT HAVE AN ISSUE ABOUT INTERMITENT DAY END REPORT  IN NET ACCOUNT.\r\n\r\nCAUSE \r\nUPON CHECKING IN THE POS THE CLIENT INPUT DUPLICATE BARCODE IN SAME ITEM DIFFERENT SUPPLIER \r\n\r\n\r\nRESOLUTIOM\r\nFIRST I BACKUP THE SQL AND FILES OF THE POS.\r\nAFTER  I BACKUP THE POS AND THE SQL  WE TEST IT IN THE OFFICE WE CREATE 5 ITEM IN THE GROCERY AND PHARMACY AND WE PROCESS IT 1 BY 1 THE PRODUCT  AND WE SCREENSHOT THE RECEIPT 1 BY 1 TO CHECK IF THE PROGRAM HAVE AN ISSUE . AFTER THAT PROCESS WE COMPUTE THE 20 RECEIPT WE CREATE IN PHARMACY AND SAME TIME IN THE GROCERY AFTER THAT THE PHARMACY AND GROCERY POS IS TALLY WE HAVE PROOF FOR THAT PROCESS.\r\n\r\n\r\n \r\nUPON CHECKING THE POS WHEN YOU SCAN THE ITEM WILL AUTOMATIC 2 ITEMS AND EXACT ITEM APPEAR IN THE CASHIER SIDE. \r\n \r\nPLEASE CHECK YOUR PRODUCT SOME OF YOUR PRODUCT HAVE AND ERROR.\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\nWE TEST 20 PHARMACY TRAN'),
(460, 'aeron elison', '2022-04-08', '05:53:43pm', ' Dayend Report \r\n\r\nShare and Post \r\nInstall the woods POS in our PC.\r\nTask the OJT to Assemble Disassemble of the PC.\r\n'),
(461, 'c ilagan', '2022-04-08', '05:57:22pm', ' Dayend Report\r\nKeil Ilagan\r\nApril 08, 2022\r\n\r\n*Went to MMS to update new receipt of BIR\r\n*Went to Shohei to update new receipt of BIR\r\n*Went to Relief to update new receipt of BIR\r\n*Share and post\r\n'),
(462, 'Janiel Manalang', '2022-04-08', '06:02:48pm', '\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\nTECH SUPPORT \r\n\r\nANSWER INQUIRE OF CLIENT\r\nTEACH KEIL ABOUT THE POS.\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n Backup Database and Update the new format for receipt	Backup Database and Update the new format for receipt	Backup Database and Update the new format for receipt Step by step on how i edit the new format receipt Business info ] design table ] add validuntil varchar 100 0 null open POScheckoutprintnow1.php add after ////////////////////////////////////// PO ACCOUNTS STARTS HERE //////////////////////////////////// XXvaliduntil XX XXrow[`validuntil`]XX replace it XXnbspXXXXnbspXXXXnbspXXXXnbspXXACCREDITATIONXX:21A7361198142020051311[br] XXnbspXXXXnbspXXXXnbspXXXXnbspXXDATE ISSUED: June 2'),
