(464, 'Janiel Manalang', '2022-04-12', '01:09:02pm', ' \r\ninfrom client about holiday  off\r\n\r\n\r\nshohei\r\nJaniel Manalang THE CLIENT INFROM US ABOUT THE POS NOT WORKING	THE XAMPP NOT ALREADY STARTUP AND XAMPP OF THE MYSQL AND APACHE NOT AUTOMATICALLY RUNNING.	I AUTO RUN THE APACHE AND MYSQL AND I AUTO RUN THE POS.\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\nwindmart \r\nTHE CLIENT INFORM US ABOUT MONTHLY MAINTENANCE OF THE POS. AND BILLION STORE VALUE.	WRONG INPUT OF QTY AND THE POS NEEDED TO BACKUP.	FIRST CLEAN THE POS REMOVE SOME SQL FILES NOT NEEDED FIND THE WRONG QTY OF THE ITEM AND CLEAN THE POS . NO ANOTHER CONCER'),
(465, 'aeron elison', '2022-04-18', '05:30:38pm', ' Dayend Report\r\nAeron Elison\r\n\r\nShare and Post.\r\nWent to Talavera The Nest for onsite Tech \r\nAnd do this procedure \r\nTech asks the client to try different Power Cable. Still not working\r\nTech Clean the ram of the system unit. Still not working\r\nTech replaces the ram of the system unit. Working properly \r\nTech concludes that the main problem of the system unit is Ram Failure.\r\n\r\n'),
