(541, 'Janiel Manalang', '2022-05-12', '05:56:28pm', ' TECH SUPPORT FOR TODAY\r\nJANIEL \r\nALLWING BETTERLIVING\r\nMAY 12 2022\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\nREASON FOR TECH \r\n THE CLIENT CONCERN ABOUT THE TABLE 2\r\n\r\nTHE CLIENT PAID THE TABLE2 TO BUT THE TRANSACTION STILL IN THE TABLE 2.\r\n\r\n\r\nCAUSE \r\n  THE CLIENT DID NOT CLEARCART AFTER TRANSACTION THAT WHY THE TRANSACTION  BE THERE.\r\n\r\n\r\nRESOLUTION\r\nFIRST WE CHECK THE  TRANSACTION DOUBLE AND WE BACKUP THE FILES AND SQL \r\n\r\nAFTER THAT WE CLEAR ALL DATA IN TABLE 2.\r\n\r\nPLEASE ALWAYS CLEARTCART AFTER TRANSACTION THANKYOU.\r\n\r\nNO OTHER CONCERN.\r\n\r\nSTATUS:DONE'),
