(556, 'Janiel Manalang', '2022-05-18', '06:05:45pm', ' Tech support\r\nSubic resto\r\nJaniel \r\n05-19-22\r\n\r\n\r\nREASON:\r\nâ€¢	REASON THE CLIENT INFORM US ABOUT THE DISCOUNT DID NOT LESS IN THE TOTAL AMOUNT.\r\n\r\nCause:\r\nâ€¢	CAUSE POSSIBLE CAUSE WRONG PROCESS OF THE DISCOUNT THE CASHIER DID NOT INPUT PAX IN THE TABLE.\r\n\r\n\r\nResolution\r\nâ€¢	RESO WE BACKUP FIRST THE FILES AND SQL OF THE POS AFTER THAT WE PROCESS THE POS OF ROYAL IN THE SUBIC AFTER PROCESS WE FIND OUT THE CASHIER OF THE ROYAL PARK DID NOT FOLLOW THE PROPER PROCEDURE THEY DID NOT INPUT A PAX IN THE TABLE WENT THEY GIVE A DISCOUNT.\r\n\r\nStatus: Done\r\n\r\n'),
