(562, 'Janiel Manalang', '2022-05-20', '05:37:39pm', ' THE CLIENT INFORM IS, CHAT IN TO REQUEST FOR ONSITE VISIT.	THE CLIENT ASK FOR ASSISTANCE FOR MOVING THE POS IN DIFFERENT PLACE,	TECH SETUP THE POS UNIT TO THE PLACE WHERE THE CLIENT REQUESTED TO PUT IN. TECH TRY TO PRINT THE KITCHEN SERVER. TECH DISCUSS ABOUT THE ROUTER WHEN GOT TURNOFF AND CHANGE TO ANOTHER IP ADDRESS WE TEACH THE CLIENT ON HOW TO CHANGE IP ADDRESS IN THE TABLET IP ADD WE VIDEO HOW TO GET THE IP IN THE COMPUTER USING CMD CLICK THE CMD TYPE:IPCONFIG GET THE IPV4 SAMPLE IS 192.168.0.103'),
