(618, 'Janiel Manalang', '2022-06-21', '05:32:00pm', 'share and post\r\n \r\nTech  support report of JOHNNYS\r\n\r\n	WE TEST THE SOFTWARE OF JOHNNYS WE CONSOLIDATED THE 3 COMPUTER UNIT  IN THE OFFICE AFTER WE TEST THE SOFTWARE OF JOHNNYS WE FIND OUT THE ITEM WILL BE IN NEGATIVE AND WHEN YOU PROCESS THE ITEM THEY 1 ITEM ONLY SHOW IN THE INTERFACE OF THE RECEIPT BUT WHEN YOU CHECKING IN THE  RECEIPT ALL ITEM SHOW AND THE INTERFACE OF THE CASHIER SHOW IM SORRY. WE TEST 20 STAND ALONE PROCESS  AND MAKE A PROCESS IN THE SAME TIME TO CHECK IF THEY HAVE AN ERROR BUT NO ERROR SHOW IN THE POS SIDE.\r\n'),
(619, 'Janiel Manalang', '2022-06-22', '05:25:46pm', ' REASON\r\nTHE CLIENT HAS AN CONCERN ABOUT THE QTY OF THE  PREMIUM AND UNLEADED\r\nCAUSE\r\nWRONG INPUTING OF THE ITEM\r\nRESOLUTION\r\nTECH BACKUP THE SQL  AND FILES  TO TEST IN THE OFFICE\r\nAFTER CHECKING THE POS DONT HAVE ERROR LESS AND ADDING THE PRODUCT AND WE HAVE AN VIDEO FOR THAT WE SEND TO MS KATH'),
(620, 'Janiel Manalang', '2022-06-23', '05:51:07pm', 'share and post\r\nremove the duplicated item and supplier in client chong. \r\n\r\nTECH SUPPORT\r\njaniel\r\nMD PLUS\r\nJUNE 23, 2022\r\n\r\nREASON\r\nTHE CLIENT HAS AN CONCERN ABOUT ADMIN NOT WORKING PROPERLY.\r\nCAUSE\r\nTHE ROUTER CHANGED THE IP ADDRESS OF THE CASHIER.\r\nRESOLUTION\r\nFIRST WE CALL THE CLIENT 3TIMES BUT DID NOT ANSWER THE CALLS\r\nAFTER THAT WE TEACH THE CLIENT HOW TO USE  AND EXCHANGE IP ADDRESS\r\nFIRST  CLICK THE WINDOW LOGO IN THE CASHIER AFTER THAT SEARCH CMD AND TYPE THE IPOCONFIG.\r\nAFTER THAT CHANGE THE IP ADDRESS THE IN THE ADMIN TO 100.\r\nSTATUS: DONE.\r\n'),
