(1637, 'SIMON LEE', '2023-07-04', '04:51:55pm', ' update smpi forex process by adding delete denamination and conduct orientation for the new employee, teach them how to add, view, edit, delete and search in php also introduce the hardware and software of the RNZ POS'),
(1638, 'ivan nunag', '2023-07-03', '04:53:46pm', ' DAY END REPORT\r\n\r\nI was assigned to search and list down 200 businesses around pampanga.\r\n'),
(1639, 'Cris John D. Sunga', '2023-07-04', '04:54:59pm', ' Today is my 2nd day in training, In the morning we continued our previous task yesterday about the update and delete function using php language, html and css. In the afternoon, our mentor task us to add search function in which it will display the input in the search bar. After that, Mr. Simon Lee teach us and gave us a grasp of idea about the hardwares being offered by the company to its client. He also explained the process and steps in installing the pos system into the client from the assembling of the hardwares and installing the softwares and modifying the databases.'),
(1640, 'ivan nunag', '2023-07-04', '04:55:35pm', ' DAY END REPORT\r\n\r\nI was assigned to start manage my new company account to post and find new client.'),
(1641, 'carlo celso', '2023-07-04', '04:57:20pm', 'Task Report - July 4, 2023\r\n\r\nSummary:\r\nDuring the period of July 4, 2023, I made significant progress on two major training tasks. Firstly, We continued working on the HTML database table, implementing the update and delete features. I successfully completed this task, enhancing the functionality of the table. Secondly, I focused on developing a search engine feature for the table, which was also accomplished. Additionally, I learned about POS hardware used in Point of Sale (POS) systems, including installation, configuration, and operation through the teaching of Sir Simon V. Lee.'),
(1642, 'jhang gomez', '2023-07-04', '06:00:33pm', '--CREATE MANUAL FOR SMPI\r\n--WALK THRU AMARIA GROCERY\r\n--ACCESS ATLANTA MAIN , ATLANTA SAN PASCUAL, BULILIT1 , BULILIT2, BULILIT3 AND REARRANGE SI NUMBER AND ADD SALES'),
(1643, 'lance clarin garcia', '2023-07-04', '06:42:10pm', '-GO TO BUDDYS MART TO MONTHLY MAINTENANCE THEIR 5 SYSTEM UNIT\r\n-GO TO GARDENS MART TO GIVE INTERNET AND SIR RABBI GAIN ACCESS\r\n-GO TO DABSHOP TO BUY MONITOR, MOUSE AND KEYBOAR\r\n-CREATE VIDEO MANUAL TO SEND IN SMPI VIBER GROUP'),
(1644, 'SIMON LEE', '2023-07-05', '04:45:56pm', ' Continue the training of the new employee discus the retail, and resto system and training ivan about marketing spill. '),
(1645, 'ivan nunag', '2023-07-05', '04:47:07pm', ' DAY END REPORT\r\nToday, I was assigned to create and practice my spill on how to communicate with clients.'),
(1646, 'carlo celso', '2023-07-05', '04:55:02pm', 'As a participant in the training seminar, I had the opportunity to learn and acquire skills in troubleshooting various POS hardware components. This included the unit, monitor, mouse, keyboard, barcode scanner, customer display, kitchen display, screen, and other relevant hardware components. The seminar also focused on deepening our understanding of POS software and editing program. We exploring the concept of Arduino master-slave communication afterwards.'),
(1647, 'lance clarin garcia', '2023-07-05', '04:58:26pm', '-GO TO JOHNNYS SUPERMARKET TO MONTHLY MAINTENANCE THEIR SYSTEM UNIT IN WAREHOUSE AND BACK OFFICE'),
(1648, 'crisjohn sunga', '2023-07-05', '04:59:31pm', ' During my third day of training Mr. Jaynel and Lance explained to us on how to troubleshoot hardware from the printers, mouse, keyboard, system unit and other peripherals. They also teach us on other technical side about the hardware. After that Mr. Simon Lee  explained the POS system about the service like the one that the restaurants are using. He explained all the interface, function of each from the front end and the back end side of the program. In my free time, we self study about arduino and the prototype that we are going to work on in the next few days.'),
(1649, 'jhang gomez', '2023-07-05', '05:02:01pm', '--TRAIN NEW RNZ EMPLOYEE ABOUT TROUBLE SHOOTING\r\n--WALK THRU THEGARDEN\r\n--GOTO JOHNNYS AND MAINTENANCE POS\r\n'),
(1650, 'SIMON LEE', '2023-07-06', '04:35:31pm', ' Update some POS system concerns Buddys Mart, continue training and POS other SMPI and JS system'),
(1651, 'lance clarin garcia', '2023-07-06', '04:37:22pm', '-continue making the manual and make the video manual\r\n-support buddys mart\r\n-support batangas'),
(1652, 'carlo celso', '2023-07-06', '04:38:39pm', ' Today we searched and focused on the compatibility between Arduino and various peripherals for the prototype. I simulated the working of a relay, which is an electromechanical switch controlled by Arduino to activate a load. Additionally, I explored the compatibility of RFID scanner with Arduino, finding that they can communicate through serial protocols. Lastly, I investigated the integration of an Ethernet shield, which enables internet connectivity for Arduino.'),
(1653, 'jhang gomez', '2023-07-06', '04:39:56pm', '--ACCESS BUDDYS TERMINAL 1, 2, 3, 4 AND UPDATE FILE (AUTOMATIC UPDATE WHEN INPUTING CASHIER ACCOUNT AND ACCESSCODE IN SERVER)\r\n--ACCESS BATANGAS ROYAL PARK AND CREATE SHORTCUT FOR CASHIER AND ADMIN BUTTON\r\n--ASSIST THE GARDEN\r\n--CREATE MANUAL FOR SMPI (RENEW REPRESENTATIVE)'),
(1654, 'crisjohn sunga', '2023-07-06', '04:44:57pm', ' During my 4th day of training, we self studied and simulate about arduino uno and other components that we will be using for the prototype. We research about the possible connections, coding and other informations about the components of the prototype. '),
(1655, 'ivan nunag', '2023-07-06', '04:45:09pm', 'I was assigned to start calling clients, and listing down all their information in Marketing report.'),
(1656, 'SIMON LEE', '2023-07-07', '04:45:36pm', 'CHECK OTHER SMPI PROCESS AND ERRORS AND DOWNLOAD FULL SYSTEM FILE'),
(1657, 'ivan nunag', '2023-07-07', '04:46:36pm', ' I was assigned to make a powerpoint presentation of my Marketing and Sales Report about my 1st week calls and clients. '),
(1658, 'crisjohn sunga', '2023-07-07', '04:50:45pm', ' On my 5th day of training in the morning we track the wires and pin connections of the other wires starting from the master and slave. We also check the pins of the third arduino where the GPS was connected. On the afternoon onwards, we check the source code and we identified on where it will be uploaded on to the 3 arduinos. '),
(1659, 'lance clarin garcia', '2023-07-07', '04:54:29pm', '-continue create the video manual in smpi\r\n-go to buddys mart to check the terminal 3\r\n-setup office computers'),
(1660, 'jhang gomez', '2023-07-07', '04:56:19pm', '--ACCESS THE GARDEN AND REINSTALL PRINTER DRIVERS\r\n--SETUP OFFICE UNIT\r\n--GOTO BUDDYS AND UPDATE TERMINAL 3 RETRAIN ABOUT SALES REPORT\r\n '),
(1661, 'lance clarin garcia', '2023-07-08', '09:53:50am', '-CUT SALES IN C AND G\r\n-GET DATABASE IN SMPI AND COLLIDE THEM'),
(1662, 'jhang gomez', '2023-07-09', '09:01:51pm', '--GOTO SMPI B.MENDOZA BRANCH AND INSTALL SMPI LOCAL FILE\r\n--ACCESS AND TEST SMPI BMENDOZA BRANCH AFTER SIMON DO THE DATA EXPANSION'),
(1663, 'SIMON LEE', '2023-07-09', '09:04:35pm', 'site visit at SMPI B Mendoza at San Fernando to install local System and test, we continue reconfigure the xampp at the office to make the system run so fast change the value of the following ADD to phpmyadmin/config.inc.php\r\nExecTimeLimit 6000\r\nAnd Change php.ini\r\npost_max_size 750M\r\nupload_max_filesize  750M\r\nmax_execution_time 5000\r\nmax_input_time  5000\r\nmemory_limit  -1\r\nAnd Change my.ini\r\nmax_allowed_packet  200M (in my.ini)\r\ninnodb_buffer_pool_size  2G\r\nrestart XAMPP'),
(1664, 'ivan nunag', '2023-07-10', '04:59:08pm', 'Today i report my marketing sales.\r\n \r\nI assigned to make a promotion picture/poster '),
(1665, 'jhang gomez', '2023-07-10', '08:06:20pm', '--ASSIST LANCE IN SMPI TECH SUPPORT\r\n--WALK THRU AMARIA GROCERY\r\n--GOTO JOHNNYS SUPERMARKEET\r\n--ACCESS SMPI BRANCHES AND BACKUP DATABASE\r\n--MIGRATE SMPI BRANCHES'),
(1666, 'crisjohn sunga', '2023-07-11', '04:45:10pm', 'Today, in the morning Mr. Simon told me to try and modify some codes for the SMPI database and web. First, I backup the files and databases before I proceed on adding new field and textbox on the new employee account. I tried to modify the back end of it too. In the afternoon, we try blinking the leds on both arduino uno and arduino mega. I also self study some necessary components and flow of the coding.\r\n'),
(1667, 'ivan nunag', '2023-07-11', '04:45:23pm', '- I started to edit my second promotion picture.\r\n- Posting and follow up on client\r\n'),
(1668, 'jhang gomez', '2023-07-12', '04:42:13pm', ' --TECH SUPPORT SMPI\r\n--UPDATE OLD BRANCH  CODE OF SMPI TO NEW BRANCH CODE\r\n--ASSIST SIR JEFFREY IN CONCERNS\r\n--ACCESS JOY MERCADO (TELABASTAGAN BRANCH) AND REINTALL XAMPP'),
(1669, 'crisjohn sunga', '2023-07-12', '04:56:02pm', ' Today, we conducted unit testing for the newly arrived components like the ethernet shield, arduino uno R3, and Sensor. We also uploaded codes for the arduinos and attach the ethernet shields and tried to on and off leds through website. We also trying to figure out how the ir sensor works.'),
(1670, 'ivan nunag', '2023-07-12', '04:56:31pm', ' I started to make a video on how to input and process product on retail system.\r\n\r\nfollow up clients'),
(1671, 'lance clarin garcia', '2023-07-13', '04:36:07pm', '-SUPPORT SMPI CONCERNS LIKE DELETED PT NUMBER AND UREDEEMED'),
(1672, 'jhang gomez', '2023-07-13', '04:40:16pm', '--TECH SUPPORT SMPI CONCERNS\r\n'),
(1673, 'carlo celso', '2023-07-13', '04:41:50pm', '   Today, we successfully assembled an Arduino Uno program along with a sensor and observed that it functions properly. With the code we discovered and subsequently modified, the setup was able to detect objects. Our next objective is to incorporate a GPS module, and we plan to continue working on it tomorrow for better soldering.'),
(1674, 'ivan nunag', '2023-07-13', '04:44:03pm', ' I assigned to make a video on how to input and process product on resto system\r\n'),
(1675, 'carlo celso', '2023-07-14', '04:46:51pm', ' Today, we attempted to obtain latitude and longitude using an Adafruit GPS module and display it on an HTML webpage. By engaging in this process, we aimed to enhance our comprehension of the task at hand. We also sought to gain insights into how to analyze and modify the code effectively in order to achieve the desired outcome.'),
(1676, 'ivan nunag', '2023-07-14', '04:51:41pm', ' I presented the photo advertisement and video demo i made'),
(1677, 'lance clarin garcia', '2023-07-14', '04:52:48pm', '-SUPPORT SMPI CONCERNS LIKE DELETE PT NUMBERS AND UNREDEEMED TRANSACTION'),
(1678, 'jhang gomez', '2023-07-14', '04:53:24pm', '--SUPPORT SMPI CONCERNS\r\n--INSTALL BARRIER SYSTEM IN CARLOS PC\r\n--SETUP REPORT OF IVAN \r\n'),
(1679, 'SIMON LEE', '2023-07-14', '04:54:04pm', ' UPDATE SMPI SYSTEM PAGINATION AND REMOVING OTHER UNNECESSARY BOOTSTRAP AND OTHER COMPUTATION ALSO UPDATE MISS D SYSTEM'),
(1680, 'SIMON LEE', '2023-07-15', '04:35:14pm', 'update smpi table list and some in discount computation concerns'),
(1681, 'ivan nunag', '2023-07-17', '04:51:56pm', ' i wrote a script about on the video advertisment that i was assigned'),
(1682, 'jhang gomez', '2023-07-17', '04:53:36pm', '--ASSIST SMPI IN CONCERNS\r\n--ACCESS SUBIC TECO AND ASSIST IN THEIR CONCERS'),
(1683, 'carlo celso', '2023-07-17', '04:55:20pm', ' Today, we have successfully obtained the latitude and longitude data, along with the distance, from the Arduino Uno equipped with an Ethernet shield and GPS. Furthermore, we have assigned static IP addresses to the Ethernet shield, ensuring a stable and accessible system. And merged the code.'),
(1684, 'crisjohn sunga', '2023-07-17', '04:55:53pm', ' Today, I assisted Carlo on setting up the GPS and tried to integrated the arduinos together. I just assist him for the sensor but only for the wirings. In the afternoon the coordinates finaly shown up in the website when rfid was tap. '),
(1685, 'lance clarin garcia', '2023-07-17', '04:56:04pm', '-support SMPI like delete PT numbers and unredeem\r\n-create TAPS document'),
(1686, 'carlo celso', '2023-07-18', '05:07:41pm', 'Today, I made significant progress in reprogramming the code for the Arduino Uno prototype, overcoming challenges along the way. The task involved debugging and testing to resolve unexpected bugs and improve performance. The effort has resulted in a promising and enhanced prototype, with only a few minor optimizations remaining for completion. The experience was valuable, and I am confident in the almost successful outcome of the process.'),
(1687, 'jhang gomez', '2023-07-18', '05:09:40pm', '--ACESS AND WALK THRU SUBIC RESTO FOR CHECKING OF JANUARY TO APRIL SALES\r\n--ASSIST SMPI CONCERNS '),
(1688, 'lance clarin garcia', '2023-07-18', '05:09:49pm', '-SUPPORT SMPI LIKE DELETE AND UNREDEEM PT NUMBERS\r\n-CONTINUE RETYPE TAPS AGREEMENT'),
(1689, 'ivan nunag', '2023-07-18', '05:11:04pm', ' - I continnue writing my script about on my video advertisment ( RETAIL )\r\n\r\n- Posting'),
(1690, 'ivan nunag', '2023-07-19', '04:45:36pm', '- I transfer my script and presented it to Sir Rabbi.\r\n\r\n- Posting\r\n'),
(1691, 'crisjohn sunga', '2023-07-19', '04:45:39pm', ' Today, we test the prototype copy from the office and travel to the house of our employer. The approximate km was 28km from the office and all went well until we return back into the office. In the afternoon, we start disassembling the original prototype and assembling the new prototype into the casing.'),
(1692, 'carlo celso', '2023-07-19', '04:46:06pm', 'Today, we tested the prototype outside to obtain the latitude, longitude, and kilometers using the Arduino Ethernet Shield with GPS. In the afternoon, we disassembled the old prototype and replaced it with the new one. During this time, we brainstormed the changes that could be made to improve the prototype.'),
(1693, 'jhang gomez', '2023-07-19', '06:37:55pm', '--GOTO JOHHNYS SUPERMARKET\r\n--ASSIST SMPI I NCONCERN\r\n--DATA MIGRATION IN SMPI'),
(1694, 'lance clarin garcia', '2023-07-19', '08:16:27am', '-GO TO JOHNNYS SUPERMARKET TO CHECK TERMINAL 08\r\n-SUPPORT SMPI LIKE DELETE AND UNREDEEM PT NUMBERS\r\n-GET SMPI DATA TO MIGRATE TO NEW SYSTEM'),
(1695, 'Benedict Vivar', '2023-07-17', '03:03:15pm', ' molding cctv'),
(1696, 'Benedict Vivar', '2023-07-18', '03:04:39pm', 'DAY END REPORT\r\n\r\nMOLDING CCTV AND HELP CAR5LO AND CJ BARRIER'),
(1697, 'Benedict Vivar', '2023-07-19', '03:07:43pm', ' DAY END REPORT\r\n\r\nWE WENT TO CLARK AND SAPANG BATO TESTING NEW ASSEMBLE ARDUINO AND DIS ASSEMBLE OLD ARDUINO TO STAINLESS AND HELP INPUT NEW ARDUINO TO STAINLESS'),
(1698, 'Benedict Vivar', '2023-07-20', '03:09:35pm', ' DAY END REPORT\r\n\r\n\r\n WE WENT TO PNB DEPOSIT 15000\r\nWE WENT TO CONVERGE PAY BILLS\r\nWE WENT TO PAMPANG BUY BURGER'),
(1699, 'carlo celso', '2023-07-20', '04:38:27pm', ' Today, I conducted research to determine if I can send an HTTP request from an Arduino Uno to a PHP server for sending signal about a buzzer. However, I am unsure if this is feasible due to complications with IP addresses. Additionally, I am concerned about the memory cache limitations of the Arduino and the speed of the GPS, which I am currently researching.'),
(1700, 'crisjohn sunga', '2023-07-20', '04:42:52pm', ' Today we configurate the prototype and test it to ensure that it will functioning well. After that, we clone the old bsrrier and recode it like how the new prototype works. After that I research on how to store speed through kph and on how it will be transfer the data.'),
(1701, 'SIMON LEE', '2023-07-20', '04:44:20pm', ' assist JS concerns about corrupted database (diagnose: database cannot be retrieve) also update SMPI payroll assign new schedule for new employee rectify Sir Ryan concerns'),
(1702, 'lance clarin garcia', '2023-07-20', '04:52:10pm', '-SUPPORT SMPI LIKE DELETE AND UNREDEEM PT NUMBERS'),
(1703, 'jhang gomez', '2023-07-20', '04:58:10pm', '--ASSIST SMPI IN CONCERNS\r\n--UPLOAD DATA ,STA. ANA,CANDABA,ESSEL,MINALIN,DM GUAGUA\r\n--EDIT BRANCH CODE OF DM GUAGUA'),
(1704, 'ivan nunag', '2023-07-20', '04:58:36pm', 'I practice my script for my video presentation for tomorrow.\r\nPosting , follow up'),
(1705, 'carlo celso', '2023-07-21', '04:53:51pm', ' Today, we are merging and experimenting with how to activate the motor horn using an Arduino Uno and a relay. We will also explore other ideas to enhance and improve the project.\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n'),
(1706, 'lance clarin garcia', '2023-07-21', '09:09:28pm', '-SUPPORT SMPI CONCERNS LIKE DELETE AND UNREDEEM PT NUMBERS IN VIBER'),
(1707, 'ivan nunag', '2023-07-21', '10:45:46pm', ' We started filming the video presentation for Retail Pos System advertisement (demo).'),
(1708, 'SIMON LEE', '2023-07-22', '04:39:28pm', ' UPDATE SMPI PAYROLL RENDER REPORT COMPUTATION AND ATTENDANCE MANAGEMENT ALSO THE TAP IN TAP OUT SYSTEM'),
(1709, 'jhang gomez', '2023-07-22', '04:53:18pm', '--ASSIST POORBOSS\r\n--ASSIST  ODESALOU\r\n--GO TO JOHNNYS SUPERMARKET\r\n--ASSIST SMPI'),
(1710, 'jhang gomez', '2023-07-24', '04:44:40pm', '--ACCESS JOHNNYS TERMINAL 8 AND EDIT SI NUMBER \r\n--ACCESS SUBIC AND PASTE POSCHECKOUT1.PHP\r\n--GOTO LOLOBOY AND REFORMAT POS\r\n--ASSIST SMPI CONCERNS'),
(1711, 'lance clarin garcia', '2023-07-24', '08:23:28am', '-SUPPORT SMPI CONCERNS LIKE DELETE PT NUMBER AND UNREDEEM PT NUMBERS\r\n-GO TO POORBOSS TO CHECK THEIR POS AND REFORMAT THEIR SYSTEM UNIT DUE TO THEIR POS IS DELETED OPERATING SYSTEM'),
(1712, 'carlo celso', '2023-07-25', '04:41:27pm', ' Today, we attempted to widen the range of a sensor. At first, we were successful in bringing it back to its original range. However, as time went by, its range became 9 again. To address this issue, we added a capacitor of 10 microfarads to ensure voltage stability and safety while also increasing the range slightly by just 2 units. Additionally, we utilized a resistor for the LED to slightly dim its light.'),
(1713, 'SIMON LEE', '2023-07-25', '04:46:53pm', 'SMPI update : autocompute late, OT, UT and other payroll deduction also the editing of status like absent, dayoff, paid leave, unpaid leave and others'),
(1714, 'ivan nunag', '2023-07-25', '04:52:46pm', ' - Posting\r\n - Edit the Video for Retail POS\r\n - Wrote a Script for Services/Resto POS'),
(1715, 'crisjohn sunga', '2023-07-25', '05:00:10pm', ' Today we try to figure out why the IR sensor drop by troubleshooting and finding the cause that migh affect the IR sensor, some possibilities are Electromagnetic interference, voltage drop or electrical noise that might cause the issue. In the morning we tried to fix the pin in A0 so communication between the sensor and arduino will not be interfered. We also set the switching power supply since we dont have the 12V relay yet. In the afternoon we bought electrical components and tried to applied it on the sensor and led because in this way it will be much safer and avoid electrical noise'),
(1716, 'lance clarin garcia', '2023-07-25', '05:06:16pm', '-SUPPORT SMPI CONCERNS LIKE DELETE AND UNREEDEM PT NUMBERS'),
(1717, 'jhang gomez', '2023-07-25', '05:06:33pm', '--ASSIST POORBOSS\r\n--ACCESS SUBIC RESTO AND EDIT REPORTING \r\n--ASSIST SMPI'),
(1718, 'SIMON LEE', '2023-07-26', '04:21:54pm', ' UPDATE SMPI PAYROLL SYSTEM SPECIFICALLY IN RENDER PAYROLL REPORT'),
(1719, 'ivan nunag', '2023-07-26', '04:23:22pm', ' - Posting\r\n - Follow up clients\r\n - Continue to write a script for cashiering part\r\n - Edit video advertisement'),
(1720, 'carlo celso', '2023-07-26', '04:40:24pm', ' Today, we tried to study the GPS code so that I could insert the code for obtaining speed data. Unfortunately, despite my numerous attempts, I encountered a limitation where the speed data can only be continuously retrieved for three times before it gets stuck. However, the code does work within these limitations. Additionally, we somehow widened range of sensor. Instead of measuring a distance of only 9, we can now measure distances of 20 or more.'),
(1721, 'crisjohn sunga', '2023-07-26', '04:42:00pm', ' Today I attach the shrinking tubes into the jumper wires and arranged the prototype. We also thest both the ir sensor in which we conclude that the newly bought sensor has higher range than the older sensor. We also talked about on how to apply speed per km and brainstorm about it while Carlo implemented the code and we tried it on the spare arduinos'),
(1722, 'jhang gomez', '2023-07-26', '05:02:55pm', '--ASSIST SMPI CONCERNS\r\n--ASSSIST BUDDYS'),
(1723, 'lance clarin garcia', '2023-07-26', '05:03:27pm', '-ASSIST SMPI LIKE DELETE AND UNREDEEM PT NUMBERS AND ASSIST SOME BRANCH IN THEIR CONCERNS'),
(1724, 'carlo celso', '2023-07-27', '04:35:24pm', ' Today, I added a code on the prototype to obtain speed on Arduino Mega 2560 instead of UNO, but there is still a bug that adds a surprisingly small distance after entering 1111. Additionally, I attempted to light up a newly bought 12V LED using a 5V relay and Arduino UNO.\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n'),
(1725, 'lance clarin garcia', '2023-07-27', '04:50:53pm', '-support smpi like delete and unredeem pt numbers'),
(1726, 'ivan nunag', '2023-07-27', '04:51:28pm', ' -Edit Video Advertisement for tiktok\r\n -Posting ( offer trial for software)\r\n -Follow up'),
(1727, 'jhang gomez', '2023-07-27', '04:51:51pm', '--ASSIST SMPI CONCERNS\r\n--GOTO ROBINSON AND PUSH CART FOR MADAM'),
(1728, 'carlo celso', '2023-07-28', '05:00:08pm', ' Today, I added another GPS module and programmed it to measure speed on the same microcontroller, the Arduino Mega 2560. It works fine, as we tested it outside to ensure its accuracy, error, and precision.'),
(1729, 'crisjohn sunga', '2023-07-28', '05:00:43pm', 'In the morning I use a software in building PCB and Schematic diagrams. I work onto the schematic diagram of the prototype in which I create the Schematic of the Arduino Uno i which the LEDs, buzzer, relay and sensors are located. After that, I also created the schematic diagram of the Mega 2560 in which it has the Adafruit GPS and the Ethernet Shield. We also test the speed function of the GPS while in the car'),
(1730, 'lance clarin garcia', '2023-07-29', '04:34:15pm', '-ACCESS BUDDYS MART TO UPDATE PRICE IN BAKELKEL\r\n-MEETING ABOUT LTFRB'),
(1731, 'SIMON LEE', '2023-07-29', '04:34:23pm', ' UPDATE SMPI PAYROLL RENDER PAYROLL REPORT AND ASSIST JS ABOUT THEIR CONCERNS AND ALSO UPDATE LTFRB PAYROLL INCLUDING ASSIGN SCHEDULE BY DATE RANGE AND PRINNT PAYROLL REPORT'),
(1732, 'jhang gomez', '2023-07-29', '04:34:40pm', '--ASSIST BUDDYS IN CONCERN\r\n--MEETING ABOUT LTFRB\r\n'),
(1733, 'CRIS JAIVIC RAMOS', '2023-07-31', '04:49:40pm', '-sir jang and lance teach and assist me to some smpi concerns and in other tech support\r\n-delete some pt number in smpi\r\n-edit status of some concerns in smpi\r\n-unredeemed some old pt number in smpi\r\n'),
(1734, 'SIMON LEE', '2023-07-31', '04:49:49pm', ' UPDATE SMPI EVALUATION FORM AND 13th MONTH PAY PROCESS'),
(1735, 'lance clarin garcia', '2023-07-31', '04:51:35pm', '-TECH SUPPORT MMS MINIMART, REINSTALL PRINTER POS DRIVER\r\n-TRAINING JAIVIC ABOUT SMPI ON HOW TO SUPPORT THEM'),
(1736, 'jhang gomez', '2023-07-31', '04:53:08pm', ' --RETRAIN CRIS ON HOW TO TECH SUPPORT IN SMPI\r\n--ACCESS RMZAFRA AND CHECK ANGELES BRANCH\r\n--HELP MAAM CHARMINE IN RESTOCK\r\n--ASSIST MMS CLIENT CONCERN\r\n--PRINT AND ARRANGE LTFRB FILES\r\n'),
(1737, 'crisjohn sunga', '2023-07-31', '04:55:45pm', ' Today we work on doing the 12V relay and Led, buzzer and also test yhe prototype. we fix some wiring in the prototype and try to powered the prototype as a whole '),
(1738, 'CRIS JAIVIC RAMOS', '2023-08-01', '04:42:37pm', 'assist smpi to their concerns\r\n-delete pt number\r\n-unredeemed old pt number\r\n\r\nedit some balance of rmzafra for their clients\r\n-branch sta rita\r\n-branch mabalacat\r\n-branch angeles (half)'),
(1739, 'SIMON LEE', '2023-08-01', '04:43:48pm', 'Continue Updating SMPI payroll add the evaluation form and and rendering 13th month pay'),
(1740, 'jhang gomez', '2023-08-01', '04:45:01pm', '--ASSIST SMPI CONCERN\r\n--ACCESS RMZAFRA BRANCHES AND CHECK CLIENT RECORD'),
(1741, 'carlo celso', '2023-08-01', '04:48:05pm', ' Today, we made several attempts and trials to operate the 12V relay module. After many trials and errors, we figured out that we need an NPN transistor for the Arduino pin to increase its current, allowing us to control the relay effectively. Additionally, we inserted a rocker switch for the power supply. Tomorrow, we plan to include a charger header with its USB hub connected to the rocker switch.'),
(1742, 'ivan nunag', '2023-08-01', '04:56:42pm', '- Edit video\r\n- Posted video advertisement for tiktok and reels\r\n- follow up clients\r\n'),
(1743, 'lance clarin garcia', '2023-08-01', '07:32:51am', '-CHECK RM ZAFRA CLIENT RECORD IF THEY HAVE CORRECT BALANCE\r\n-HELP CRIS JOHN TO BUY PARTS IN ANGELES CITY\r\n-SUPPORT SMPI LIKE DELETE AND UNREDEEM PT NUMBERS'),
(1744, 'ivan nunag', '2023-08-02', '04:37:24pm', ' - Workout my service script\r\n - Posting video advertisement on pages\r\n - Follow up clients\r\n '),
(1745, 'SIMON LEE', '2023-08-02', '04:39:26pm', 'Update SMPI about concerns in payroll and  also Update LTFRB Payroll system'),
(1746, 'crisjohn sunga', '2023-08-02', '04:43:07pm', ' Finalizing of the prototype and addin 2 more Led into the prototype. Integrating the Usb hub into the SMPSU to minimize the power outlet being used. '),
(1747, 'carlo celso', '2023-08-02', '04:45:54pm', ' Today, I attempted to make an Arduino send values to PHP, but I discovered that Arduino has limitations; it cannot directly control the webpage or command the PHP server or web server. Additionally, we added two LEDs, red and green, to the prototype and assembled it fully on the surface of a chair.'),
