(1775, 'lance clarin garcia', '2023-08-10', '06:17:20pm', '-SUPPORT STA MONICA PAWNSHOP LIKE DELETE AND UNREDEEM PT NUMBERS'),
(1776, 'carlo celso', '2023-08-10', '09:54:59pm', ' Today, we tested the ultrasonic sensor outside to determine if any conflicts exist. We concluded that there are none. Then, we transferred it to the prototype, managed the wires, and replaced the pin header with a heat-shrink tube method. I also modified some code to minimize the delay of the buzzer and the sensor. Additionally, I tested the prototype by scanning QR codes.'),
