(1782, 'crisjohn sunga', '2023-08-11', '09:54:13pm', 'Sorting of components and adding it to inventory, testing of the prototype.'),
(1783, 'carlo celso', '2023-08-11', '09:59:35pm', ' Today, I coded new logic for the sensor to keep the LED green while a person is passing through until they have entered. I wanted to know if this is a good idea, considering that we are still in the testing phase.'),
