(1789, 'carlo celso', '2023-08-14', '09:51:35pm', '   Today, I propose modifying the sensor code to decrease sensitivity when a person transitions to a walking pace. Additionally, I have conducted unit tests on the ultrasonic sensors, RFID scanner, and QR code scanner. I have also acquired knowledge on utilizing crimping pass-through tools.'),
