(1802, 'carlo celso', '2023-08-16', '10:00:39pm', ' Today, I added the L-type board spacer to the Arduino Uno and insert their ethernet shield, extracted the barcode scanner chip from the 2D image barcode scanner, set it up in self-sensing mode, and wired and tested the buzzer.'),
