(2128, 'crisjohn sunga', '2023-11-17', '04:55:09pm', '-Added a new column for the expiry date when adding a product.\r\n-Introduced a new field in the database schema to accommodate the expiry date.\r\n-Extended the product editing functionality to include the expiry date, ensuring seamless integration with the updated database structure.\r\n-Modified the product editing form to incorporate a new input field for specifying the expiry date.\r\n-Conducted thorough testing of the code to verify proper data insertion into the corresponding database field.\r\nNoticed a discrepancy in the on-hand quantity, which was inadvertently left unchanged. This variable has been rectified to accurately reflect the intended behavior.\r\nEnhanced the product display interface by incorporating a new row for displaying the expiration date, providing a more comprehensive view for back-end users.'),
(2129, 'carlo celso', '2023-11-17', '04:55:18pm', '  Today, I added editable quantity on order taker and automatically updated the amount due. I also added shortcut keys for placing orders and managing baskets. I included a button for sub-supplier and added a \"View Sub Supplier\" button for selecting a supplier and view its sub supplier.'),
