(2137, 'carlo celso', '2023-11-19', '05:01:31pm', ' Today, I changed the branch name and removed the branch name reference in index.php. I also obtained the cashier name in additem and searchitem. Additionally, I ensured that any branch otaker or cashier can perform duties at another branch.\r\n\r\nI added shortcut keys (F1 and Esc) for the add item functionality, and now the search item is automatically focused when the add item screen is opened. Furthermore, I implemented a shortcut key for adding items, making the entire process functional without requiring the use of a mouse.'),
