(2140, 'VINCENT FLORES', '2023-11-20', '05:28:20pm', ' -Support Midori Hotel and Casino and Fix the package subtotal and a total of woo-commerce orders.\r\n-Stress test the server unit to know if the temperature is going high and if CPU usage of the server is stable or going up to 100%.'),
(2141, 'lance clarin garcia', '2023-11-20', '05:36:42pm', ' The day-end report for purchasing network LAN components shows successful procurement of required equipment, adherence to budgetary constraints, and coordination with vendors to ensure timely delivery. All purchased items align with project specifications, contributing to the smooth progression of the network infrastructure setup.'),
(2142, 'CRIS JAIVIC RAMOS', '2023-11-20', '05:40:05pm', '-TEST SMPI PROCCESS LIKE AUCTIONING ITEMS/GADGETS AND PAWNING GADGETS TO TEST THE CPU AND TEMP OF SERVER'),
(2143, 'carlo celso', '2023-11-21', '04:44:15pm', ' Today, I am enhancing the ordertaker page to expedite order processing, improve item accessibility and search functionality, and streamline actions such as placing orders, editing quantities, and canceling orders.'),
(2144, 'crisjohn sunga', '2023-11-21', '04:52:12pm', ' In the product addition section, new input fields have been introduced for Retail Price %, where users input a number, and it automatically converts to a percentage. Additionally, Retail Profit has been included, and it is now calculated automatically. Wholesale Price, Wholesale Profit, Botika Price, and Botika Profit fields have been added, mirroring the functionality of the Retail Price and Profit.\r\n\r\nNew tables in the database have been created to store this additional data. Adjustments have been made in saveproduct.php to handle percentage values and correct data types for database insertion. The fetched data is displayed in the product tab.\r\n\r\nIn the addproduct.php file, the subsupplier field has been fixed to display \"No Supplier Available\" when there is no data from the supplier, allowing users to save the entry. This was achieved by adding an option value.\r\n\r\nWork is in progress for editproduct.php and saveeditproduct.php to enable editing of product information. The getSubsup'),
(2145, 'CRIS JAIVIC RAMOS', '2023-11-21', '04:53:35pm', '-ACCESS BEST PRICE SERVER GET THE PRODUCTS IN DATABASE THEN CREATE A EXCEL FILE FOR THE PRODUCTS\r\n-GO TO STO DOMINGO TO NOTARIZE THE CONTRACT OF LEASE\r\n-ACCESS THE NEST CONVINIENCE STORE EDIT ITEMCOUNT FOR THE MONTH OF AUGUST 2023\r\n-TEST THE FCCDRUGSTORE IN ORDERTAKER TEST ALL THE SHORCUT KEY THAT CARLO CREATE'),
(2146, 'lance clarin garcia', '2023-11-21', '05:22:16pm', 'Today, I assisted trainees at Sta Monica Pawnshop Inc in auctioning alongside Simon and Sir Ryan. Covered various aspects, including bidder interactions, item evaluation, and procedural guidelines. Overall, a productive day imparting knowledge and facilitating hands-on experience.'),
(2147, 'jhang gomez', '2023-11-21', '05:58:28pm', '--ACCESS THE NEST TEMINAL 2\r\n--ASSIST GERALD (FRIENDSHIP GARDEN) CONCERNS\r\n--TEST FCC SYSTEM UPDATES\r\n--TEST JS SYSTEM\r\n--CHANGE HEAT SINK FAN OF SIMON PC'),
(2148, 'VINCENT FLORES', '2023-11-21', '12:52:26pm', 'Review and restudy all the processes and other functions of the restaurant POS from the frontend to the backend and also scan every function file on where the data it was taken from, where it was sent, and where it was saved.'),
(2149, 'carlo celso', '2023-11-22', '04:44:05pm', ' Today, I updated the \"place order\" functionality on the order taker system to ensure that items must be added before proceeding, or that there are items in the queue. Additionally, I enhanced the \"add items\" feature, merging the search functionality on the cashier page and implementing shortcut keys to expedite the process of adding items.'),
(2150, 'crisjohn sunga', '2023-11-22', '05:02:07pm', ' \r\nToday, I completed the backend development tasks, which involved implementing calculations for various price percentages (retail, wholesale, botika), profit margins (retail, wholesale, botika), and adding new fields for products. Additionally, I made adjustments in the supplier and sub-supplier sections to handle logic where sub-suppliers are displayed only when available.\r\n\r\nIn the supplier tab, I refined the data fetching process to eliminate redundancy. Instead of fetching supplier IDs directly, I used distinct rows based on supplier IDs as a basis and hid them. This change ensures that identical suppliers with different IDs are not redundantly displayed.\r\n\r\nI made updates to the \"add supply\" tab to enforce consistency in all fields, except for quantity and expiration date. In cases where different sub-suppliers are involved, an \"item not found\" message is displayed to address potential issues with suppliers having more than one sub-supplier. I also resolved a quantity calculatio'),
(2151, 'CHRISTIAN BUNGQUE', '2023-11-22', '05:06:14pm', '-CLEAN OFFICE\r\n-TEST FCC NEW UPDATES\r\n-CREATE A REPORT ABOUT TO UPDATE IN FRIENDSHIP GARDEN RESTO.\r\n'),
(2152, 'ivan nunag', '2023-11-22', '05:23:27pm', '- POSTING\r\n- FOLLOW UP\r\n- SENT QUOTATION\r\n- START TO EDIT VIDEO ADVERTISEMENT FOR RETAIL'),
