(2166, 'VINCENT FLORES', '2023-11-24', '05:43:03pm', ' -Update the remarks ordering the first order have a remarks then add another item, and that item is not included with the first remarks\r\n-Update remarks font size\r\n-Update the tab_pos1 query to not ordered by product name, so it lists all the items even if it is the same name\r\n-Create a sale report that can select product and date range \r\n-Add a add quantity function on the edit product\r\n-Update the format and query on the void logs report to display the access code'),
