(2188, 'VINCENT FLORES', '2023-11-30', '05:44:11pm', '-Update the Friendship Gardens POS system file according to the requests and concerns from the last meeting. \r\n-Support Friendship Garden with the most recent order-taker account management update. '),
(2189, 'crisjohn sunga', '2023-11-30', '08:05:16pm', ' Today, we are conducting tests on the prototype to verify its functionality, which includes the setup process. We are checking the power supply, GPS functionality, webpage performance, sensor functionality, and the overall operation of the prototype. Additionally, we are ensuring that the prototype remains in good working order through ongoing tests.\r\n\r\nSimultaneously, while providing updates on FCC, I have been dedicated to advancing the Bad Order project. I have incorporated most of its features, particularly focusing on the frontend display to ensure user-friendliness and a seamless interface. A PHP file has been added for Pending Bad Order requests, displaying all pending requests. Furthermore, there is a PHP file for listing approved requests, showcasing those that have already been approved, and a new PHP file for disapproved requests, highlighting those that have been rejected. The data handling processes through the database are nearing completion, with only a few additional t'),
(2190, 'carlo celso', '2023-12-01', '05:00:08pm', ' Today, I assisted in updating the backend program of FCC Drugstore. I added a graph to the Ordertaker Report to display higher ordertaker names and transaction rankings per branch. I excluded cashier transactions, ensuring the report only includes ordertaker data. Additionally, I removed refund items and the corresponding refunds from all reports. For my cashier page task, I implemented a restriction on the sales invoice, preventing its generation if the receipt number is not found in the transaction logs.'),
(2191, 'CHRISTIAN BUNGQUE', '2023-12-01', '05:03:33pm', '-SUPPORT SMPI FOR THEIR CONCERN\r\n-BACK SQL FOR SERVER EVERY HOUR.\r\n'),
(2192, 'crisjohn sunga', '2023-12-01', '05:05:03pm', ' today i mostly finished the pending task especially the badorder section including the updating of each quantity in the products, additionally  I also fix some minor issues and test other section of the code. It includes the calculation section of each prices. I also added the units in different php field that are updated because the units before are not yet complete in the list. I also test the bad order because at first im using delete query in which the specific product id and its content will be deleted aso i change the code to hust update each quantity to lessen the number. I also cotinued to make the print section for the bad order. '),
