(2194, 'VINCENT FLORES', '2023-12-01', '05:38:48pm', ' -FIX ERROR ON THE POSVOIDITEM1.PHP, ALSO UPDATE THE AFFECTED AREA OF THE ERROR.\r\n  -CREATE A IF STATEMENT THAT WILL SET THE VALUE OF XDEVICE TO WHAT IS LOGINED USER AT THE POSVOIDITEM1.PHP\r\n  -CREATE A IF STATEMENT THAT WILL SET THE VALUE OF XTAB TO WHAT VALUE OF THE XDEVICE AT THE SAVEVOIDITEM1.PHP\r\n\r\n-UPDATE QUERY OF UPDATEORDERSTATUS WHEN CLICKING ITEM STATUS AND CHANGE TO CHECK ALL WITH THE SAME NAME ARE CHANGE. I UPDATE THE SQL THAT WILL BASE ON ID SO WHEN THEY CLICK ONE OF THE ITEM WITH SAME NAME THE OTHER ARE NOT AFFFECTED.\r\n-CREATE A REGISTERED AND NOT REGISTERED POSCHECKOUTPRINTNOW.PHP FILE SO WHEN UPDATING THE 2 POS OF FRIENDSHIP IT WILL NOT OVERWRITE EACH OTHER.\r\n-DISPLAY THE REFERENCE NUMBER ON THE REPRINTRECEIPT.\r\n'),
