(2197, 'VINCENT FLORES', '2023-12-04', '05:30:19pm', ' -Test the Friendship Gardens Point of Sale system to see whether the latest upgrades still have any bugs or glitches.\r\n-Support friendship garden on their concern regarding the double SI and create a report about the problem\r\n-Create a filter that determines whether the processed SI already exists if it does the query attempting to enter the data into the database will be rejected.\r\n-Update the pos of friendship garden both cashier and bir.'),
(2198, 'lance clarin garcia', '2023-12-04', '07:45:26pm', '-TECH SUPPORT SMPI\r\n-CUT SALES IN TALAVERA\r\n-TEST VINCE FRIENDSHIP GARDEN'),
(2199, 'carlo celso', '2023-12-05', '04:25:21pm', 'Earlier today, we presented the enhanced version of the FCC Drugstore system to the client, showcasing the updates we implemented according to their preferences, suggestions, and requirements. During the demonstration, we provided an in-depth view of the backend, the cashier page, and the ordertaker functionality.'),
(2200, 'crisjohn sunga', '2023-12-05', '04:26:52pm', ' Today, we showcased the recent enhancements made to the FCC system, presenting them to administrators, cashiers, order takers, and the IT team within the company. Throughout the presentation, we illustrated the functionalities of the systems and highlighted the implemented updates.'),
(2201, 'VINCENT FLORES', '2023-12-05', '05:40:34pm', ' -Support bulilit 1 on their concern on the A1 POS unit cant access the pos system\r\n-Make a video explaining how the POS inventory function works.'),
(2202, 'lance clarin garcia', '2023-12-05', '07:38:38pm', 'Subject: Assistance in Implementing New System and Chat Support at SMPI\r\n\r\nI provided comprehensive support to SMPI during the implementation of their new system, contributing to the successful integration. Additionally, I played a key role in establishing and optimizing the chat support system, ensuring a seamless experience for users. The collaborative effort resulted in a smooth transition and improved customer satisfaction.'),
