(2207, 'VINCENT FLORES', '2023-12-06', '05:44:56pm', ' -Support Malolos daisyskincare and install the pos system and other necessary applications on their new unit \r\n-Create a video for friendship garden on how to use the inventory system\r\n-Backup SMPI database on the server'),
(2208, 'carlo celso', '2023-12-06', '05:51:01pm', ' Today, I addressed updates on FCC drugstore system: I ensured that the supplier and subsupplier information is not missing on bucket_pos during exchanges, included the otakername during the process payment and exchange, displayed the disc_all in the index, fixed the discount for sc and pwd , fixed the issue with the discount buttons for 2/3%, disabled the button when already added, added timestamps for process payment and exchange, added the sales logs report to filter by specific dates or products, and included otakername in the sales logs report, as long as the quantity of receipt items is not zero.'),
(2209, 'ivan nunag', '2023-12-06', '05:51:30pm', '- POSTING\r\n- FOLLOW UP\r\n- SENT QUOTATION TO CLIENT\r\n- EDIT VIDEO'),
(2210, 'crisjohn sunga', '2023-12-06', '06:02:57pm', ' \r\nToday, I focused on implementing several updates, particularly in the Purchase Order (PO) system. I made extensive modifications, including adjustments to database tables across four databases. One notable enhancement is the automated calculation of discounts. I incorporated automatic calculations for retail, wholesale, and botika prices, as well as individual profit margins. These modifications ensure that product prices are updated consistently throughout various processes, from creating a PO to saving the purchase order.\r\n\r\nI also reworked the discount system, transitioning from fixed values to percentage-based discounts. This improvement spans the entire PO creation and saving process, impacting both initial and final stages. In addition to these changes, I initiated the development of new forms related to purchase lot numbers and established a dedicated database for this purpose. This comprehensive set of updates reflects a commitment to refining and optimizing the PO workflow.'),
(2211, 'ivan nunag', '2023-12-07', '12:56:09pm', '- POSTING\r\n- FOLLOW UP\r\n- CALL CLIENT\r\n- CREATE QUOTATION'),
(2212, 'CHRISTIAN BUNGQUE', '2023-12-07', '04:58:01pm', '-GO TO JHONNYS MART THEN BACK UP, DUMP SQL TO ALL TERMINALS AND SERVER THEN SEND WE TRANFER.\r\n-MAINTENACE, BACK UP, DUMP SQL IN BUDDYS MART AND BAKELKEL'),
(2213, 'carlo celso', '2023-12-07', '06:18:51pm', ' Today, I accomplished the following tasks: applied the promo consumable quantity on cashiering, fixed the unit on edit product and add product, ensured that when a user adds a vatable or tax-exempted item, the discount for that specific vat type is applied automatically, implemented the same functionality for editing products, included a method on card details with date ranges, fixed the receipt when a loyalty card is used in tender, displayed split method logs, set date ranges for return and damage items as well as branch, excluded the warehouse on specific pages, ensured that sales logs report includes the branch, displayed other methods, and included transaction logs for order taker name.'),
(2214, 'VINCENT FLORES', '2023-12-07', '09:18:05am', ' -Create a popup notification at the backend of the midoris Wordpress website\r\n-Cut sales of RVL terminal 1 and terminal 2 '),
