(2221, 'CHRISTIAN BUNGQUE', '2023-12-10', '04:53:06pm', ' -ARRANGE THE SI NUMBER AND INPUT S.I THAT HAVE 0 SALES\r\n-CHECK THE SALES, VAT, LESSVAT, PRICENETVAT ALL DAYS IN EACH MONTHS'),
