(2252, 'carlo celso', '2023-12-18', '05:16:17pm', ' \r\nToday, I addressed the following: Implemented a per-item discount for seniors and persons with disabilities, set a 2/3 percent per-item discount for specific items, resolved the repeated addition issue for 4G Cap, fixed the item addition process based on product_name instead of barcode for ordertakers and cashiers, refined the quantity focus, removed supplier and subsupplier details, made barcode mandatory for quantity, added barcode numbers, ensured PLU searches use equality rather than LIKE in SQL queries, enforced quantity requirements, prevented quantity changes with arrow keys, incorporated remarks for cash pullouts, included cash pullout remarks in the Day-End Report, rectified the discount calculation for all items, grouped items by product name, resolved issues with VAT-exempt sales, added a P.A. on receipts, and fixed the reprint receipt functionality.'),
(2253, 'CRIS JAIVIC RAMOS', '2023-12-18', '05:40:44pm', '-SUPPORT SMPI VIA VIBER AND ULTRA VIEWER TO THEIR CONCERNS'),
(2254, 'VINCENT FLORES', '2023-12-18', '05:41:58pm', ' Support SMPI on their concerns'),
(2255, 'CRIS JAIVIC RAMOS', '2023-12-19', '04:43:17pm', '-CREATE REPORT ON HOW TO TROUBLESHOOT THE POS COMPONENTS LIKE MONITOR, KEYBOARD, MOUSE, CASHDRAWER, BARCODE SCANNER, THERMAL PRINTER AND SYSTEM UNIT\r\n-SUPPORT SMPI VIA VIBER TO THEIR CONCERNS'),
(2256, 'CHRISTIAN BUNGQUE', '2023-12-19', '04:47:46pm', '-SUPPORT SMPI FOR THEIR CONCERNS\r\n-CREATE MANUAL FOR POS RETAILS AND INSTALLATION FOR RETAIL'),
(2257, 'carlo celso', '2023-12-19', '05:47:27pm', ' Today, I fixed the discount functionality on the front end for drugstores when selling items as wholesale or in a botika. The VAT, price net, VAT exempt sale, and other related fields are now updated accordingly. Additionally, when editing the quantity, the discount, markup, price net, VAT, and VAT exempt sale are adjusted as needed. I ensured that the transaction number is incremented properly through any process related to transaction number incrementation.\r\n\r\nFurthermore, I updated the myStocks section on the front end and addressed issues in the sales logs report on the back end, now including the discount amount. These improvements enhance the overall accuracy and reliability of the system.'),
(2258, 'VINCENT FLORES', '2023-12-19', '05:51:34pm', ' -SUPPORT SMPIs CONCERNS\r\n-CREATE A RESTAURANT POS MANUAL'),
(2259, 'lance clarin garcia', '2023-12-19', '09:05:11pm', '-CHAT SUPPORT SANTA MONICA PAWNSHOP INC\r\n-ACCESS AND GET PAWN DBF IN 2 BRANCHES\r\n-CREATE MANUAL ON HOW TO SUPPORT SMPI'),
(2260, 'CHRISTIAN BUNGQUE', '2023-12-20', '04:39:52pm', '-SUPPORT SMPI FOR THEIR CONCERNS\r\n-CREATE A REPORT OR MANUAL ABOUT HOW TO INSTALL DIFFERENT POS SYSTEM.'),
(2261, 'VINCENT FLORES', '2023-12-20', '05:33:37pm', ' -Create a manual for the restaurant POS backend\r\n-Support SMPIs concens'),
(2262, 'crisjohn sunga', '2023-12-20', '05:36:07pm', 'System Testing:\r\nConducting system testing involves identifying and rectifying bugs and errors, updating codes, and refining calculations within the total inventory report. This process includes improving the front-end presentation and overall code structure. Additionally, modifications are made to the bad order report, incorporating fields for date requested and date approved in the database. The logic for printing bad order transactions is refined to display only the latest approved transaction. A new link page is introduced, enabling users to select date ranges for bad order transactions, and all transactions within the specified range can be printed.\r\n\r\nEnhancement of Purchase Order Processes:\r\nThe \"Receive PO\" button is enhanced to ensure that it only appears and is clickable when the balance is zero or the payment is completed, preventing users from clicking it before making any payment. The actions for approving and removing payments are adjusted to address issues where, even af'),
(2263, 'carlo celso', '2023-12-20', '05:39:41pm', ' Today, I fixed the sales logs report and order logs report to subtract the discount used from the total amount of the product list. I also added pagination to prevent lag in case of bulky data retrieval. Additionally, I fixed the order taker, ensuring that when they attempt to access an occupied basket, it prevents them from doing so.'),
