(2267, 'CRIS JAIVIC RAMOS', '2023-12-21', '04:41:41pm', '-CLEAN OFFICE\r\n-SUPPORT SMPI VIA VIBER AND ULTRA VIEWER TO THEIR CONCERNS\r\n'),
(2268, 'CHRISTIAN BUNGQUE', '2023-12-21', '04:50:15pm', '-SUPPORT SMPI TO THEIR CONCERNS\r\n-CLEANING THE OFFICE.\r\n-CONTINUE FOR DOING THE INSTALLATION OF CONSO POS.\r\n'),
(2269, 'carlo celso', '2023-12-21', '05:25:25pm', '   Today, I obtained a discount on the \"bucket_pos\" when the item has the same name and receipt number. I initially attempted to use \"SELECT DISTINCT,\" limited it to 1, and reduced the discount on the price, resulting in the discounted price. When returning an item that has a discount amount, it should be returned with the discounted price rather than the original price. I implemented discounting, wholesale (ws), and botika features for item exchange. I also addressed some minor issues with the discount and activated the botika and wholesale features in the cashiering process.'),
(2270, 'VINCENT FLORES', '2023-12-21', '05:30:52pm', ' -SUPPORT SMPIs CONCERNS'),
(2271, 'lance clarin garcia', '2023-12-21', '05:40:35pm', '-CHAT SUPPORT STA MONICA PAWNSHOP INC\r\n-MIGRATE BULAON'),
(2272, 'CRIS JAIVIC RAMOS', '2023-12-22', '03:00:10pm', '-CLEAN OFFICE\r\n-SUPPORT SMPI VIA VIBER AND ULTRA VIEWER TO THEIR CONCERNS'),
(2273, 'CHRISTIAN BUNGQUE', '2023-12-22', '04:55:34pm', '-SUPPORT SMPI FOR THEIR CONCERNS\r\n-UPLOAD THE MIGRATION OF BULAON\r\n-CLEAN THE OFFICE'),
(2274, 'carlo celso', '2023-12-22', '05:34:10pm', ' Today, I have addressed the following issues and implemented solutions:\r\n\r\n**SOLVED||1.** For Solution #1, I resolved the problem related to applying discounts on the bucket_pos for items with the same name and receipt number. I utilized a \"select distinct\" approach to reduce the discount on the price, resulting in the correct discounted price. Additionally, I worked on reducing the scdiscount of items in the bucket_item count.\r\n\r\n**SOLVED||2.** Concern #2 was successfully addressed. When returning items in the bucket_pos, I ensured that the quantity is reduced based on the returning quantity. In cases where there were duplicated product names on the same receipt number, I implemented a solution to prevent the reduction of quantities for duplicated names. I also considered updating xmarkup and discount during this process.\r\n\r\n**SOLVED||3.** For Concern #3, I corrected the issue of the wrong updated discount when returning items. Furthermore, I ensured that the item count reflects the '),
(2275, 'crisjohn sunga', '2023-12-22', '05:43:02pm', ' Continuing the iterative phase of testing and optimizing codes within the backend, ensuring the seamless integration of codes across the backend, order taker, and cashier modules. Concurrently, reviewing and updating all printing files and display fields across different sections and files to guarantee accuracy and consistency. Additionally, conducting thorough checks on various processes, including handling bad orders, processing purchase orders, and managing stock reception from different branches.'),
