(2309, 'crisjohn sunga', '2024-01-05', '05:42:09pm', ' Today, we introduce the enhanced system to the FCC drugstore, encompassing IT, the owner, and the manager. The presentation flow is deemed effective. Moreover, clients have expressed numerous additional updates they wish to incorporate into the system.'),
(2310, 'ivan nunag', '2024-01-05', '05:43:03pm', '- POSTING\r\n- FOLLOW UP\r\n- SENT AN QUOTATION\r\n- ADJUST RECENT EDITED PHOTO AND VIDEO'),
(2311, 'carlo celso', '2024-01-06', '05:45:29pm', '1. FCC Drugstore System \r\n *Added a button for adding senior accounts, editing, and deleting.\r\n*Added a suggestion fill on the card ID of senior accounts for the discount feature, then auto-fill the name in the customer name field.\r\n*Removed unnecessary information and modified the frontend of the day-end report.\r\n*Displayed the amount of senior citizen (SC), persons with disabilities (PWD), percentage (Perc), and special discounts on the day-end report.\r\n*Activated the discount on charge invoices. \r\n2. Cut sales of Atlanta 1 and C&G.'),
(2312, 'crisjohn sunga', '2024-01-06', '05:50:33pm', ' *DISPLAY IN PRODUCT:\r\n-added the sales invoice in the display and on the database.\r\n-added generic name also instead of basic name.\r\n-added new update for the fix quantity per box.\r\n-show the new update for the fix quantity per box to appear in other details.\r\n-added sales invoice in products other details.\r\n\r\n\r\n*ADD PRODUCTS\r\n-changed basic name into generic name also in database\r\n-added plu field in the add products.\r\n-added new update for the fix quantity per box.\r\n-modified that the qty without minimum(can reach negative numbers)-client wants\r\n\r\n\r\n*EDIT PRODUCTS\r\n-In the edit prodiuct section added new field in which sku is editable\r\n-added new field for editable plu\r\n-added new field for editable generic name \r\n-added new field for editable fix quantity per box\r\n-modified that the qty without minimum-client wants\r\n\r\n*Sales Report\r\n-Changed the label for the 2 reports including purchase order transaction report and purchase order delivery report\r\n-added new link for date expiry wh'),
