(2318, 'carlo celso', '2024-01-10', '05:48:32pm', '*Sales Cut for Garden: Reduced sales for Garden in October, November, and December  \r\nFCC Drugsore System.\r\n*New Discount Function: Implemented a new discount function that applies to selected items.\r\n\r\n*Charge Invoice Modification: Modified the charge invoice to enhance its version for better functionality.\r\n\r\n*SPM Access Granted Column: Added a column named \"SPM Access Granted\" for improved access management.'),
(2319, 'crisjohn sunga', '2024-01-10', '05:48:53pm', ' *Batch Transfer Process\r\n\r\nIncorporated a new table named \"products_transferprocess\" into the database for batch transfers.\r\nEnhanced and introduced a new display feature in the printing section upon approval.\r\nImproved and added a new display feature in the printing section upon receipt.\r\nExpanded the data to be displayed and eliminated unnecessary information based on client preferences.\r\n*Suppliers\r\n\r\nDeveloped new files allowing users to click on a supplier, revealing a date range and a search bar for sales invoices to be added.\r\nMade Sales Invoice (SI) numbers clickable for easy access.\r\nModified the code for both Supplier and Supplier Transaction functionalities.\r\nImplemented a new program for handling sales invoices, redirecting users to a dedicated page upon clicking an SI number.\r\nIntegrated a program displaying details based on specified parameters, including product details such as Lot Number, Item Name, Unit, Supplier, Sub Supplier, Quantity Requested, Total Quantity, Rece'),
(2320, 'VINCENT FLORES', '2024-01-10', '05:57:38pm', '-Support SMPIs concern\r\n-Cut sales of RVLs terminal 1 and 2'),
(2321, 'CHRISTIAN BUNGQUE', '2024-01-11', '04:45:26pm', '-SUPPORT SMPI FOR THEIR CONCERS\r\n-BACK SQL OF SERVER IN EVERY HOUR.\r\n-GO TO VALERIO CHAN LAW OFFICE TO SEND THE FOLDER AND BRING BACK THAT FOLDER TO THE OFFICE'),
(2322, 'carlo celso', '2024-01-11', '05:32:17pm', ' FCC Drugstore System Back-End Update:\r\n*A new tab, \"Customer List,\" has been added to the system. In this tab:\r\n-The admin can select a specific client name to search for their reference number associated with the credited product.\r\n-The admin can input the payment details in this section and view the products that have been processed under the chosen reference number.\r\n-Payments made in this section can be partial, providing flexibility to the admin.\r\n-A payment method is incorporated, allowing the admin to choose between cash and cheque. If cheque is selected, the admin can input the check number associated with the payment.\r\n-Added an href link for the payment history made by the user through the customer payment.'),
(2323, 'VINCENT FLORES', '2024-01-11', '05:40:15pm', ' Support SMPIs concern'),
(2324, 'crisjohn sunga', '2024-01-11', '05:42:20pm', ' In the context of supplier management, new features have been programmed to streamline the addition of sales invoices. Users can now select a specific supplier and input a date range while utilizing a search bar for sales invoices. Clickable sales invoice numbers have been implemented, allowing users to be redirected to a dedicated page upon selection. The code for managing supplier details and transactions has been enhanced to accommodate these new functionalities.\r\n\r\nAdditionally, a new program has been developed for handling sales invoices, redirecting users to a dedicated page when a specific sales invoice number is clicked. This program integrates a comprehensive display of product details, including Lot Number, Item Name, Unit, Supplier, Sub-Supplier, as well as quantities such as Qty Requested, Total Qty, Received, Free Deal, and relevant dates like Arrival Date and Expiry. Notably, the ability to hide Lot Numbers and Purchase Order (PO) numbers in the display has been incorpor'),
(2325, 'carlo celso', '2024-01-12', '05:18:17pm', ' I have completed the customer list tab, including its functions, and successfully debugged it. Currently, I am assisting in programming the double discount feature for receiving purchase orders.'),
(2326, 'CHRISTIAN BUNGQUE', '2024-01-12', '05:43:30pm', '-SETUP THE CAMERA IN THE NEW ATTENANCE SYSTEM OF RNZ\r\n-BACK UP SQL OF SERVER IN EVERY HOUR.\r\n-SUPPORT SMPI FOR THEIR CONCERNS'),
(2327, 'crisjohn sunga', '2024-01-12', '05:44:36pm', ' Finalizing the Purchase Order process involves thorough testing, modification, and debugging to ensure a seamless and error-free system. This comprehensive phase aims to refine the functionality of the Purchase Order system, addressing any potential issues that may arise during testing.\r\n\r\nThe integration of the new processes and associated data is a crucial aspect of enhancing the overall system. \r\n\r\nAn essential component of this enhancement is the integration of the new data into various reports and display interfaces. The modified Purchase Order system should provide accurate and meaningful information in reports, facilitating a clear understanding of the relevant data points.\r\n\r\nAs part of the system refinement, the Receive Purchase Order receipt will undergo updates to accommodate the new calculations involving added discounts, which can now be applied up to three times. This modification ensures that the receipt accurately reflects the updated pricing structure, providing trans'),
(2328, 'CHRISTIAN BUNGQUE', '2024-01-13', '05:41:37pm', '-SUPPORT SMPI FOR THEIR CONCERNS\r\n-SETUP WEBCAM FOR ATLANTA MAIN ATTENDANCE'),
(2329, 'crisjohn sunga', '2024-01-13', '05:49:57pm', ' Today, we tested and tweaked the system a lot. We added some extra code to smoothly include different updates, making the whole system work better. We carefully checked and organized the databases with info about products, suppliers, and subsuppliers. Our main goal was to make sure the data is accurate and clear. We worked hard to fix any issues in the system, making it run smoother and better.'),
(2330, 'carlo celso', '2024-01-15', '05:55:31pm', '-Present the enhanced system to FCC Drugstore Magalang\r\n-Fix sales on RVL Terminal 1\r\n-Starting to code the FCC physical item inventory '),
