(2335, 'CHRISTIAN BUNGQUE', '2024-01-16', '05:52:31pm', '-SUPPORT SMPI FOR THEIR CONCERNS\r\n-BACK SQL OF SMPI SERVER IN EVERY HOUR\r\n-GUIDE DUKES TO SUPPORTS'),
(2336, 'crisjohn sunga', '2024-01-16', '05:53:23pm', 'COMPLETED TASK: \r\nRemove Lot Number Requirement:\r\nThe Lot number field is no longer mandatory.\r\nChange Label from Supplier Discount to Item Discount:\r\n\r\nThe label for the discount field related to suppliers has been updated to \"Item Discount.\"\r\nModify Dispatch in Receipt:\r\n\r\nThe name of the dispatcher will no longer be echoed; instead, it will be displayed as an underline.\r\nAdd New Field for Principal in Add Products:\r\n\r\nA new field for \"Principal\" has been added when adding new products.\r\nAdd New Field for Principal in Edit Products:\r\n\r\nA new field for \"Principal\" is now available when editing existing products.\r\nDisplay Expiry Dates from Purchase Order:\r\n\r\nAll expiry dates from the Purchase Order are now displayed.'),
(2337, 'DUKE ESGUERRA', '2024-01-16', '06:00:24pm', ' -SUPPORT SMPI FOR THEIR CONCERNS\r\n-REVIEWING THE PLATFORM OF SMPI\r\n-ASSISTING SMPI VIA UV ON THEIR CONCERN'),
