(2339, 'carlo celso', '2024-01-17', '05:51:01pm', ' ONE OF MAJOR UPDATE OF FCC DRUGSTORE\r\n--(NEW) Add charge customer return product tab, process  and less it to total amount- paid once applied and returned.\r\n'),
