(2341, 'CHRISTIAN BUNGQUE', '2024-01-17', '05:53:06pm', '-SUPPORT SMPI FOR THEIR CONCERNS\r\n-BACK SQL FOR SMPI/ATTENDANCE ATLANTA AND RNZ SERVER IN EVERY HOUR.'),
(2342, 'crisjohn sunga', '2024-01-17', '05:53:27pm', ' Today, I focused on incorporating several enhancements into the transfer approval functionality. Specifically, I implemented a restriction ensuring that if a transfer originates from a branch (except for main branch), the same branch cannot approve it; rather, only other branches are permitted to approve such transfers.\r\n\r\nFurthermore, I worked on updates within the Purchase Order (PO) system, introducing a more refined approach to handling additional discounts per item. The discount calculation mechanism for each item has been reprogrammed. Additionally, new database tables were created to accommodate the processing of this new data.\r\n\r\nI made modifications to the print functionality for both purchase slips and received items. This includes the addition of extra details such as the per-item discount, subtotals, total amounts, and the overall discount for all items.\r\n\r\nAddressing system bugs, I fixed an issue where payment completion was not triggering the subsequent receipt of a purc'),
(2343, 'carlo celso', '2024-01-17', '05:53:30pm', '*Fix the qty, lessvat, pricenetvat and amountdue of MD+.receiptnum 000000037616. \r\n*(NEW) Add customer return item, process  and less it to total amount- paid once applied and returned.'),
