(2356, 'carlo celso', '2024-01-20', '05:46:21pm', '-Transfer the product list from FCC DRUGSTORE to the database and address any minor issues, such as special characters and spaces.\r\n\r\n-Add a new button to the customer list. Its function is to select reference numbers for payment and initiate the payment processing.\r\n\r\n-Incorporate the selected payments into the report or ledger.'),
(2357, 'crisjohn sunga', '2024-01-20', '05:49:00pm', ' Omitting the display of profit in the product section.\r\nIntroducing the display of Catalog Price.\r\nImplementing a calculation for displaying discounts in Net Price.\r\nAdding a new pricing field based on the net price.\r\nIn Purchase Orders (PO), redesigning the item receiving process, refining the total cost calculation, and adjusting costs based on client instructions.\r\n\r\nSeparating and introducing a new display for reference in each supplier, including date received, Sales Invoice (SI) number, PO number, total cost, and balance.\r\nConfiguring the discount and displaying calculations for the net price and catalog price in PO.\r\nConfiguring data processing in other files connected to PO.\r\nChanging from Barcode to displaying the Lot Number.\r\nDisplaying the date of arrival based on item transactions.'),
(2358, 'CHRISTIAN BUNGQUE', '2024-01-21', '05:49:29pm', '-SUPPORT SMPI FOR THEIR CONCERN\r\n-ACCESS BULILIT 1 TO RE INSTALL THE PRINTER\r\n-BACK UP SQL OF SERVER IN EVERY HOUR\r\n-BACK UP JS FILES'),
(2359, 'DUKE ESGUERRA', '2024-01-22', '05:42:28pm', ' -ASSISTING SMPI TO RESOLVE THEIR ISSUE ABOUT ON THEIR CONCER\r\n-SAVING BACKUPS FOR SMPI, ATLANTA AND RNZ SERVER'),
(2360, 'ivan nunag', '2024-01-22', '05:46:36pm', '- EDITING PAYROLL\r\n- EDITING PACKAGE INCLUSIONS\r\n- CREATE AN QUOTATION\r\n- CALL CLIENT\r\n- POSTING \r\n- FOLLOW UP\r\n'),
(2361, 'crisjohn sunga', '2024-01-22', '05:57:22pm', ' Adjustments are made to the data processing in other files connected to the Purchase Order (PO), including the transformation of barcodes into Lot number displays. Additionally, the system now echoes the date of arrival based on item transactions. Further enhancements are implemented on the supplier tab, incorporating new changes such as enabling the payment for all Sales Invoices at once.\r\n\r\nA new feature is added to the system, allowing for the recording and display of payment history for all transactions. The frontend section of the PO undergoes modifications to accommodate these changes effectively. Rigorous testing and debugging processes are carried out to ensure the seamless integration of the new functionalities in the PO, confirming alignment with processed data and ensuring a proper display.'),
(2362, 'CHRISTIAN BUNGQUE', '2024-01-23', '05:02:50pm', '-SUPPORT SMPI FOR THEIR CONCERNS\r\n-ACCESS BUDDYS MART AND BAKELKEL TO UPDATE PRODUCTS\r\n-INSTALL ALL APP IN JS TERMINAL12 AND GO TO JS INSTALL THEIR POS. '),
(2363, 'carlo celso', '2024-01-23', '05:38:39pm', ' *Implement CRUD operations for units and include an approval and disapproval process for adding senior account.\r\n\r\n*Provide support for real-time updates on retail, wholesale, botika and markup information.\r\n\r\n*Assist in tracing cost price changes.\r\n\r\n*Adjust the system to add the product to the inventory when customers return items.'),
(2364, 'CHRISTIAN BUNGQUE', '2024-01-24', '04:56:25pm', '-DATA MIGRATING FOR MADAPDAP AND PORAC\r\n-SUPPORT SMPI SMPI FOR THEIR CONCERNS\r\n-BACK UP SQL OF SERVER IN EVERY HOUR\r\n-BACK UP AND DIAGNOSE, TROUBLESHOOT THE UNIT OF RAPHAELS RESTO.'),
(2365, 'carlo celso', '2024-01-24', '05:43:11pm', ' -Fix the SQL query for the user-chosen condition in the physical item inventory.\r\n-Correct the count of items on the reprint receipt.\r\n-Update the transaction logs when an item is exchanged.\r\n-Exclude the branch from the transaction number if it is not processing the payment of products.\r\n-Add a column in the transaction logs database for situations where the receipt number cannot be reprinted due to a reduction in quantity caused by item replacement, maintaining only the old quantity.\r\n-Address minor issues in printing item replacement receipts and reprinting receipts.\r\n-Resolve minor issues in the Item Sales Report.\r\n-Ensure that the tab becomes active when selected.\r\n-Assisting with the \"Receive Transfer All\" button.'),
(2366, 'DUKE ESGUERRA', '2024-01-24', '05:44:51pm', ' -ASSIST SMPI TO RESOLVE THEIR CONCERN\r\n-SAVING BACKUP SQL FOR SMPI, ATLANTA, AND RNZ SERVER\r\n-TROUBLESHOOT AND DIAGNOSE PC UNIT OF RAPHAEL RESTO\r\n-REVIEWING ON HOW TO DO THE MIGRATION EXPLAINED BY CHANO'),
(2367, 'crisjohn sunga', '2024-01-24', '05:45:35pm', '-On the display section, eliminate additional pricing tags for each item.\r\n\r\n-Lift restrictions when the quantity goes negative, allowing transfers based on client instructions.\r\n\r\n-Introduce a new approval button to endorse all transfers simultaneously.\r\n\r\n-Add another button for transfer disapproval; when clicked, all data will be disapproved, preventing further processing.\r\n\r\n-Rectify the quantity sold update in the product process.\r\n\r\n-Exclude the update in quantity sold.\r\nMake individual approval optional, integrating an option for approving all at once.\r\n\r\n-Make individual disapproval optional, integrating an option for disapproving all at once.\r\nInclude a display for lot numbers across four branches.\r\n\r\n-Revise the print receipt in batch transactions per client instructions, adjusting the table and content display. This includes handwritten receiving information instead of system-generated details.\r\n\r\n-In stock receiving, make the process optional for all branches. Clicking the '),
