(3529, 'DUKE ESGUERRA', '2025-03-25', '04:58:53pm', ' \r\nDAY END REPORT\r\n\r\n\r\n-TECH SUPP ON ESTER MORONG BATANGAS, CALL AND WALKTHROUGH TO CONNECT THEIR POS ON USB TETHERING AND DISABLED SHUTDOWN BUTTON AND TEST THEIR POS IF IT IS STILL SHUTTING DOWN AND ASK THEM TO CHECK THEIR POS FOR THEIR SATISFACTION\r\n-TECH SUPP ON TGP BATANGAS AND CALLLED THEM AND ACCESS THEIR POS AND REVERT BACK THE CODE ON salesreportpersupp.php.\r\n-SHARE VLOG ON VARIOUS PAGES ON FB\r\n\r\n'),
(3530, 'OJT LARWIN', '2025-03-26', '04:42:13pm', '- MOP THE INSIDE OF THE OFFICE, USE ZONROX WITH DOWNY FOR CLEANING\r\n- PROMOTE THE PACKAGE OF POINT OF SALES BY POSTING AND SHARE IN FACEBOOK GROUP.\r\n	-Manila Buy and Sell Group\r\n	-Sta.Maria Village Balibago Buy & Sell\r\n	-Angeles City MC Market Place\r\n	-ANGELES BENTAHAN ONLINE\r\n	-XEVERA FIESTA TABUN MABALACAT BUY AND SELL NEW PAGE\r\n	-JAOVIL- PANDAN COMMUNITY BUY AND SELL GROUP\r\n	-POS for SALE philippines\r\n	-Point of Sale (POS) Philippines\r\n	-Point of Sale(POS) Solutions (Softwares and Hardware)\r\n\r\n- UPDATE THE BAKELKEL PRODUCT, ACCESS IN BUDDIES SERVER TO DUMP THE PRODUCT AND EXECUTE IN BAKELKEL\r\n- UPDATE THE BEST PRICE PRODUCT, GET ACCESS TO THE BEST PRICE ADMIN TO DUMP THE PRODUCT, AND EXECUTE AT THE BEST PRICE. '),
(3531, 'CHRISTIAN BUNGQUE', '2025-03-26', '04:47:37pm', ' -ACCESS THE BASKET CONVE  AND BACK UP THEN UPDATE AND REPLACE THE LOGO IN BASKET CONVENIENCE STORE ABOUT THE REPRINT RECEIPT TAB.\r\nTHEN EXPLAIN THE PROPER PROCESS FOR THAT TAB.\r\n-CLARIFY THE WANT OF CLIENT FOR THEIR LIST OF CONCERN.\r\n-ACCESS CAFE BLU TO TRAIN IN HOW TO GENERATE EXCEL DATA IN ADMIN PART AND TELL THEM THE 2 OPTION FOR GENERATE EXCEL DATA ON SALES OR ITEM INVENTORY AND EXPLAIN WHAT IS THE DATA INSIDE OF THAT GENERATED DATA.'),
(3532, 'Lance Garcia', '2025-03-26', '04:52:40pm', ' -POST ADVERTISEMENT IN DIFFERENT GROUPS IN FACEBOOK\r\nTHIS THE LIST OF GROUPS WHERE I POST THE ADVERTISEMENT:\r\n*PURA-GERONA-TARLAC MARKETPLACE\r\n*Buy and Sell Tarlac\r\n*TARLAC Auto Buy And Sell\r\n*TARLAC BUY AND SELL\r\n*ST.MARTHA STATE HOMES MINI MARKET\r\n*Tarlac buy and sell\r\n*Fiesta Tabun Mabalacat Buy and Sell\r\n*PAMPANGA BUY AND SELL (STRICTLY GADGETS ONLY)\r\n*Magalang, Angeles, Mabalacat and Clark - Buy and Sell\r\n*BUY AND SELL ONLINE ANGELES CITY\r\n*gadget buy & sell & trade (angeles) (pampanga)city\r\n*Point Of Sale (POS) Software & Hardware Group\r\n*Buy and Sell (Magalang Pampanga)\r\n*PAMPANGA BUY AND SELL (KAPAMPANGAN BENTAHAN )\r\n*PAMPANGA BUY AND SELL\r\n*TABUN MABALACAT BUY AND SELL\r\n*Tarlac Online Bentahan\r\n\r\n-REPLY CLIENT ABOUT THE POS AND SEND HIM THE LOCATION, BECAUSE HE WANT A DEMO FOR THE GASOLINE POS SYSTEM'),
(3533, 'DUKE ESGUERRA', '2025-03-26', '04:58:11pm', ' DAY END REPORT\r\nðŸ“… Date: April 26, 2025\r\n\r\nâœ… Tasks Completed:\r\n\r\nContent Distribution: Shared vlogs across 150 Facebook pages to maximize reach and engagement.\r\n\r\nCustomer Support: Responded to Ester Morong regarding concerns about her cash drawer, ensuring resolution and smooth operations.\r\n\r\nMarketing & Promotions: Published advertisements on Facebook Marketplace and relevant POS-related pages to drive visibility and sales.\r\n\r\nTechnical Support: Assisted Best Price in updating their product data from the BP Server to the BP Admin, ensuring seamless system synchronization.'),
(3534, 'OJT MARK', '2025-03-27', '04:30:02pm', 'DAY END REPORT \r\n\r\nCleaned and organized the office\r\n\r\nEdited images for promotional content to enhance visual appeal.\r\n\r\nCreated and published an advertisement post to promote products/services effectively.\r\n - 6 pictures done'),
(3535, 'OJT KYLE', '2025-03-27', '04:43:13pm', ' DAY END REPORT\r\n03-27-2025\r\n\r\nOFFICE MAINTENACE:\r\n- CLEANED THE ELECTRIC FAN REMOVING DUST AND DEBRIS TO ENSURE BETTER AIRFLOW AND EFFICIENCY IN THE OFFICE.\r\n\r\nSOCIAL MEDIA & MARKETING EFFORTS:\r\n- DESIGNED AND EDITED A FACEBOOK POST IMAGE FOR THE RNZ ACCOUNT TO PROMOTE AND ADVERTISE IT SERVICES, USED CANVA FOR DESIGN, AND USED A BACKGROUND REMOVER TOOL TO ENHANCE THE VISUALS FOR THE IMAGES TO BE USED IN THE POST\r\n- CREATED A PROMOTIONAL PHOTO FOR A VIDEO ADVERTISEMENT TO IMPROVE ENGAGEMENT\r\n- RESEARCHED AND COMPILED 20 POTENTIAL RESTAURANT CLIENT AND 20  POTENTIAL COFFEE SHOP TO CONTACT FOR POS'),
(3536, 'Lance Garcia', '2025-03-27', '04:43:44pm', 'SEND RNZ MAINTENANCE ADVERTISEMENT TO THE FOLLOWING GROUP CHAT CLIENTS:\r\nWoWa tech support\r\nPOS CHICKEN MALL RNZ\r\nTIN TINS CHOCOLATE TECH SUPPORT\r\nPOS DR SQUARE   RNZ\r\nMalolos tech MS.D\r\nAMARIA GROCERY BATANGAS - RNZ POS\r\nRAPHAEL - RNZ POS\r\nPOS FRIENDSHIP GARDEN   RNZ\r\nIKAs PHARMACY and MINIMART - RNZ POS\r\nKGG Tech Support\r\nRGP POS SYSTEM\r\nPOS TECH SUPPORT  IN EAM MARKETING\r\nRNZ Tech Support - MDX Drug store\r\nJinmart Mabalacat - RNZ POS\r\nPOS Tech Support MMS Mini Mart\r\nKNK MART - RNZ POS\r\nRNZ POS - Monjayfer\r\nJINMART - RNZ POS\r\nODESSALOU PANDAN - RNZ POS\r\nJAYSON REYES TECH\r\nSHOHEI - RNZ POS\r\nMKM BUILDERS - RNZ POS\r\nERLINDA STORE - RNZ POS\r\nBEAUTY Express Tech Support\r\nTECH SUPPORT POORBOSS\r\n\r\nSEND ANNOUNCEMENT ABOUT MONTHLY MAINTENANCE TO THE FOLLOWING GROUP CHAT CLIENTS:\r\nJS pricing and receiving\r\nRVL convemart BATAAN Support\r\nBEST PRICE PORAC - RNZ POS\r\nM-Square RNZ POS\r\nTHE NEST - RNZ POS\r\nBULILIT 2 - RNZ POS\r\nBulilit3 Fuel Atlanta - RNZ POS\r\nRNZ (Sto Rosario) POS\r\nAtlantaFuel San P'),
(3537, 'CHRISTIAN BUNGQUE', '2025-03-27', '04:43:58pm', '-DELIVER LOYALTY CARDS AND UPDATE THE SYSTEM ABOUT THE LAUNDRY TAB AND TRAIN IN REGISTRATION OF LOYALTY CARDS.\r\n-TGP MARILAO UPDATING THE AMOUNTDUE COLUMN:\r\nTHE AMOUNTDUE FIELD IN THE PRODUCTS TABLE WAS REVIEWED AND UPDATED TO MATCH THE CORRECT COMPUTED VALUES, ENSURING CONSISTENCY IN THE TOTAL CALCULATION.\r\n-SHARE THE POST OF RNZ NUNAG TO THE DIFFERENT KIND OF GROUP PAGES'),
(3538, 'OJT LARWIN', '2025-03-28', '04:40:46pm', ' OFFICE CLEANING\r\n\r\n*MOP THE FLOOR USE DOWNY AND ZONROX TO ENSURE CLEAN, AND DISINFECTED WORKSPACE.\r\n\r\n*WIPE THE TABLES  REMOVE DUST AND DIRT TO MAINTAIN A NEAT AND ORGANIZED OFFICE ENVIRONMENT.\r\n\r\nRNZ COMPUTER MAINTENANCE\r\n*CLEAN THE COMPUTER USE A BLOWER TO REMOVE DUST FROM INTERNAL COMPONENTS, PREVENTING OVERHEATING AND IMPROVING PERFORMANCE.\r\n\r\n*WIPE SURFACES USE A DRY CLOTH TO CLEAN THE TABLE OF RNZ WORKSTATION.\r\n\r\nWE WENT TO LA PAZ SEMI CONO, THEN AFTER IN SEMI CONO WE GO IN OUR HOME TO WEIGHT IT. WE GOT 26 KILOS OF RICE AND DIVIDED IT AMONG THE THREE OF US, WITH EACH GETTING 8 1/2 KILOS.\r\n\r\nINTER.SAVE COMPUTER CENTER\r\n\r\nWE GO IN INTER.SAVE COMPUTER CENTER DMC BLDG, MACARTHUR HWY, ANGELES CITY, 2009 PAMPANGA, TO GET SA 3 SYSTEM UNIT'),
(3539, 'OJT MARK', '2025-03-29', '04:31:45pm', ' Day End Report \r\n\r\nToday, I dedicated time to improving the office environment by organizing and thoroughly cleaning the workspace and ensured that essential tools and equipment were neatly arranged. \r\n\r\nIn addition to the office cleanup, I worked on setting up a new unit by installing several important applications to ensure it was fully equipped for use. The applications I installed included Navicat, a customized RNZ wallpaper, UltraViewer, XAMPP, Notepad++, WinRAR, Sublime Text, and WPS Office. Each of these programs plays a crucial role in supporting various tasks such as database management, remote access, coding, and document creation. During this process, Sir Chano provided valuable guidance on the proper way to boot the system, which improved my understanding of startup procedures and system preparation.\r\n\r\nTo support our marketing efforts, I dedicated time to posting advertisements and sharing information with potential clients across various platforms. I also took the initia'),
(3540, 'CHRISTIAN BUNGQUE', '2025-03-29', '04:35:13pm', ' -ASST THE OJTS ABOUT THE TASK I GAVE TO THEM ABOUT INSTALLING APPLICATIONS IN THE POS UNIT.\r\n-ASST LAWRIN ABOUT THE TECH IN MSQUARE CONVENIENCE STORE.\r\n-GO TO DABSHOP TO BUY A 3 UPS 3 MOUSE AND KEYBOARD AND 3 MONITOR'),
(3541, 'OJT LARWIN', '2025-03-29', '04:36:41pm', ' MOP THE ENTIRE OFFICE INTERIOR THOROUGHLY USING ZONROX AND DOWNY TO DISINFECT AND LEAVE A FRESH CLEAN SCENT\r\n\r\nM-SQUARE ATTENDANCE NOT WORKING\r\nTHE WEBSITE IS NOT LOADING IN GOOGLE CHROME DISPLAYING A SITE CANT BE REACHED ERROR\r\nOPEN THE ATTENDANCE IN GOOGLE CHROME AND AT THE RIGHT SIDE NEED TO OPEN THE VPN EXTENSION AND CONNECT IT\r\n\r\nWE WENT TO DABSHOP LOCATED AT STALL B LOT 12 BLOCK 4 MACARTHUR HWY ANGELES CITY 2009 PAMPANGA WITH SIR CHANO TO BUY\r\n3PCS MONITOR INVISION 19INCH\r\n3PCS KEYBOARD WITH MOUSE A4TECH KRS-8572\r\n3PCS UNINTERRUPTIBLE POWER SUPPLY UPS\r\n\r\nI AM ACTIVELY PROMOTING THE RNZ POS SYSTEM BY SHARING ITS ADVERTISEMENT VIDEO IN VARIOUS BUY AND SELL GROUPS AND POS PHILIPPINES GROUPS TO MAXIMIZE REACH AND ENGAGEMENT I HAVE SHARED THE VIDEO ACROSS 100 FACEBOOK GROUPS'),
(3542, 'OJT ARLFRAN', '2025-03-29', '04:36:41pm', ' DAY END REPORT \r\nMARCH 29, 2015\r\n\r\n - WE STARTED THE DAY BY THOROUGHLY CLEANING THE OFFICE, ENSURING A TIDY AND ORGANIZED WORKSPACE. THIS INCLUDED SWEEPING AND MOPPING THE FLOORS. ADDITIONALLY, WE CLEANED THE BACK AREA OF THE OFFICE, REMOVING DIRT AND CLUTTER TO MAINTAIN A NEAT ENVIRONMENT. TO FURTHER IMPROVE CLEANLINESS, WE ALSO CLEARED OUT AND CLEANED THE CANALS. \r\n - WE SET UP THREE NEW SYSTEM UNITS AND POS TERMINALS BY FIRST REMOVING UNNECESSARY DESKTOP ICONS, LEAVING ONLY GOOGLE CHROME FOR ESSENTIAL USE. AFTER THAT, WE INSTALLED THE FOLLOWING IMPORTANT SOFTWARE:\r\n\r\nNAVICAT\r\nNOTEPAD\r\nSUBLIME TEXT\r\nUV\r\nWINRAR\r\nWPS OFFICE\r\nXAMPP\r\n\r\nTO COMPLETE THE SETUP, WE APPLIED THE RNZ WALLPAPER TO MAINTAIN CONSISTENCY AND BRANDING.\r\n\r\n -WE ACTIVELY POSTED AND SHARED OUR POS PACKAGES ACROSS 60+ FACEBOOK GROUPS, HELPING TO REACH POTENTIAL CLIENTS AND INCREASE ENGAGEMENT WITH OUR SERVICES.'),
(3543, 'OJT KYLE', '2025-03-29', '04:38:30pm', ' DAY END REPORT\r\n\r\nOFFICE MAINTENANCE\r\n\r\nSWEPT THE OUTSIDE OF THE OFFICE REMOVED DUST LEAVES AND DEBRIS FROM THE ENTRANCE WALKWAYS AND SURROUNDING AREAS\r\n\r\nCLEANED THE BACK OF THE OFFICE\r\n\r\nREFILLED THE 5 EMPTY WATER CONTAINER\r\n\r\nTECHS NOTES\r\n\r\nINSTALLED SOFTWARES TO THE UNIT LIKE XAMPP NAVICAT NOTEPAD WINRAR WPS AND SUBLIME\r\n\r\nCHANGED THE WALLPAPER TO RNZ SOFTWARE DEVELOPMENT SERVICES\r\n\r\nTHEY DISCUSSED TO US HOW TO INSTALL A BOOTABLE WINDOWS 10 IN FLASH DRIVE\r\n\r\nSOCIAL MEDIA MARKETING EFFORTS\r\n\r\nCREATED A FACEBOOK ACCOUNT TO PROMOTE ADVERTISE THE RNZ SOFTWARE DEVELOPMENT SERVICES AND SHARING PURPOSES\r\n\r\nSHARED SIR RABBIS VLOGS RECENT VLOG IN FACEBOOK GROUPS TO RELATED VLOGGING COMMUNITIES TO REACH AND ENGAGEMENT\r\n\r\nHERE ARE THE GROUPS\r\nVloggers PH\r\nSmall Vloggers Philippines\r\nVloggers Community Ph\r\nPhilippines vlogger group\r\nVloggers Paangat PH\r\nVloggers Around The World\r\nVloggers Bloggers Sharing Support Group Philippines\r\nSupport Local Vloggers PH\r\nVloggers Group Support PH\r\nVlogger'),
(3544, 'OJT ARLFRAN', '2025-03-29', '04:43:37pm', ' WE STARTED THE DAY BY THOROUGHLY CLEANING THE OFFICE ENSURING A TIDY AND ORGANIZED WORKSPACE THIS INCLUDED SWEEPING AND MOPPING THE FLOORS ADDITIONALLY WE CLEANED THE BACK AREA OF THE OFFICE REMOVING DIRT AND CLUTTER TO MAINTAIN A NEAT ENVIRONMENT TO FURTHER IMPROVE CLEANLINESS WE ALSO CLEARED OUT AND CLEANED THE CANALS \r\n\r\nWE SET UP THREE NEW SYSTEM UNITS AND POS TERMINALS BY FIRST REMOVING UNNECESSARY DESKTOP ICONS LEAVING ONLY GOOGLE CHROME FOR ESSENTIAL USE AFTER THAT WE INSTALLED THE FOLLOWING IMPORTANT SOFTWARE\r\n\r\nNAVICAT\r\nNOTEPAD\r\nSUBLIME TEXT\r\nUV\r\nWINRAR\r\nWPS OFFICE\r\nXAMPP\r\n\r\nTO COMPLETE THE SETUP WE APPLIED THE RNZ WALLPAPER TO MAINTAIN CONSISTENCY AND BRANDING\r\n\r\nWE ACTIVELY POSTED AND SHARED OUR POS PACKAGES ACROSS SIXTY PLUS FACEBOOK GROUPS HELPING TO REACH POTENTIAL CLIENTS AND INCREASE ENGAGEMENT WITH OUR SERVICES'),
(3545, 'OJT ARLFRAN', '2025-03-28', '04:44:38pm', ' WE STARTED THE DAY BY THOROUGHLY CLEANING THE ENTIRE OFFICE INCLUDING MOPPING THE FLOORS AND TIDYING UP THE EXTERIOR SURROUNDINGS\r\n\r\nCLEANED ALL THE COMPUTER UNITS OF OUR SENIORS BY OPENING THE SYSTEM UNITS REMOVING DUST AND DIRT USING A BLOWER AND WIPING DOWN EACH COMPONENT ADDITIONALLY WE CLEANED EVERY WORKSTATION INCLUDING DESKS AND PRINTERS\r\n\r\nSIR DUKE REMOVED THE AIR CONDITIONER FILTER AND I CLEANED IT USING A BIDET TO REMOVE ACCUMULATED DIRT AFTER THE CLEANING THE AIR CONDITIONER FUNCTIONED MORE EFFICIENTLY PROVIDING BETTER COOLING\r\n\r\nACTIVELY POSTED AND SHARED ADVERTISEMENTS ABOUT OUR POS PACKAGES ACROSS EIGHTY PLUS FACEBOOK GROUPS\r\n\r\nWENT TO MAYKEL INTERSAVE TO PICK UP THREE POS UNITS FROM ANGELES USING LARWIN TRICYCLE'),
(3546, 'OJT LARWIN', '2025-03-22', '06:38:29pm', 'CLEANING THE OFFICE\r\nPOST POST ADVERTISEMENT\r\nSHARE VLOG\r\nUPDATE THE PRICE OF BUDDYS MART\r\nUPDATE THE PRICE OF BP\r\nREFORMAT LAPTOP'),
(3547, 'OJT LARWIN', '2025-03-27', '06:40:14pm', ' HELP SIR RABI CLEANING IN OFFICE  \r\nWASH THE MUG  \r\nLIFT THE OFFICE CHAIR MOVED IT OUTSIDE  \r\n\r\nSIR RABI TAUGHT ME HOW TO AUTOMATICALLY OPEN XAMPP  \r\nWINDOWS R SEARCH SHELL STARTUP CLICK ENTER AND GO TO LOCAL DISK C  \r\nXAMPP FIND XAMPP START MAKE A SHORTCUT OF XAMPP START COPY THE SHORTCUT AND PASTE IT IN STARTUP FOLDER  \r\nOPEN XAMPP CLICK CONFIG CHECK APACHE MYSQL AND START CONTROL PANEL MINIMIZE THEN SAVE  \r\nRESTART THE PC AND CHECK  \r\n\r\nLEARN THE PROCESS FOR REGISTRATION OF LOYALTY CARD IN CAFE BENI VERIFY AND REGISTER THE CARD  \r\nTHE ADMIN VERIFIES THE CARD IN THE ADMIN DASHBOARD  \r\nTHE CASHIER REGISTERS THE CARD BY INPUTTING THE NAME ADDRESS PHONE NUMBER AND TAPPING THE CARD ON THE READER  \r\nAFTER REGISTRATION THE CARD IS NOW READY TO USE  \r\nORDER FOOD OR DRINKS CLICK THE PRICE CLICK THE PASTORS DISCOUNT INPUT THE DISCOUNT AND TAP THE CARD TO APPLY THE DISCOUNT  \r\nONE DAY ONLY DISCOUNT ON FOOD AND DRINKS USING THE LOYALTY CARD IN CAFE BENI');
INSERT INTO `bucket_dayendreport` (`id`, `fullname`, `xdate`, `xtime`, `xnote`) VALUES
(3548, 'OJT ARLFRAN', '2025-03-31', '04:31:41pm', ' DAY END REPORT \r\n\r\nCLEANED THE OFFICE TO MAINTAIN A NEAT AND ORGANIZED WORKSPACE\r\n\r\nINSTALLED POS PRINTER DRIVERS FOR 80MM PRINTERS AND TESTED THEM TO ENSURE THEY WERE FUNCTIONING PROPERLY ALL PRINTERS WERE VERIFIED TO BE WORKING\r\n\r\nSET UP THE CASH DRAWER AND TESTED ITS FUNCTIONALITY VERIFIED THAT IT WAS PROPERLY CONNECTED TO THE PRINTER AND THAT BOTH DEVICES WERE WORKING SIMULTANEOUSLY\r\n\r\nTESTED FOUR BARCODE SCANNERS USING BOTH MANUAL BANG BANG AND AUTOMATIC BANG BANG MODES CONFIRMED THAT ALL SCANNERS WERE WORKING PERFECTLY\r\n\r\nPOSTED ABOUT OUR POS PACKAGES IN FORTY PLUS FACEBOOK GROUPS BEFORE REACHING THE SHARING LIMIT\r\n\r\n SET UP THREE POS UNITS INCLUDING UPS BARCODE SCANNERS THERMAL PRINTERS AND CASH DRAWERS FOR DISPLAY PURPOSES TO TAKE PICTURES AND SHOWCASE THAT EVERYTHING WAS PROPERLY SET UP AND FUNCTIONING'),
(3549, 'OJT MARK', '2025-03-31', '04:34:18pm', ' DAY END REPORT\r\nAt the start of the day I swept the floor and organized the table where the units are placed. After that, I worked on technical tasks for Bakelkel and BestPrice.\r\nI updated products on Bakelkel BP Admin and BP using AnyDesk and UV. This included creating a database backup copying it to the desktop, and preparing it for the next update. The process was as follows\r\n1. BP Server  Copied the products and pasted them into the Bakelkel database.\r\n2. BP Admin  Copied the products and pasted them into the BP database.\r\nAfter completing the updates we set up and tested the units to ensure there were no issues with the parts or overall functionality.\r\nAdditionally I created an advertisement video using the units we set up for marketing purposes.'),
(3550, 'OJT LARWIN', '2025-03-31', '04:35:43pm', ' OFFICE CLEANING\r\nTHOROUGHLY MOP THE FLOOR USING DOWNY AND ZONROX TO EFFECTIVELY CLEAN AND DISINFECT THE AREA ENSURING A HYGIENIC AND SAFE WORKSPACE\r\n\r\nPOS SYSTEM SETUP INSTRUCTIONS\r\nI WAS TAUGHT BY SIR CHANO HOW TO SET UP THE ADMIN OR SERVER FOR THE POS SYSTEM\r\n\r\nOPEN NAVICAT AND ADD A NEW DATABASE NAME THE DATABASE AFTER THE STORE EG SRAPOSSYSTEM\r\n\r\nGO TO THE XAMPP HTDOCS FOLDER LOCATE THE FOLDER WITH THE STORES NAME AND FIND THE CONNECTION AND CONNECTION SERVER CLICK AND CHANGE THE SERVER NAME TO MATCH THE STORES NAME\r\n\r\nIN THE FOLDER BT1 THERE IS ANOTHER CONNECTION AND CONNECTION SERVER OPEN IT AND CHANGE THE SERVER NAME TO THE STORES NAME AS WELL\r\n\r\nOPEN XAMPP AND FIND THE MYSQL SERVER PRESS ENTER AND THEN TYPE SKIP GRANT TABLES THIS COMMAND ALLOWS THE SERVER TO READ STOCK DATA AND UPDATE PRICES MORE QUICKLY\r\n\r\nPOS HARDWARE SETUP ASSISTANCE\r\nI ALSO HELPED SIR LANCE AND SIR CHANO SET UP THE THREE POS HARDWARE SYSTEMS THE SETUP INCLUDES PLUGGING IN THE FOLLOWING DEVICES TO THE SYSTE'),
(3551, 'CHRISTIAN BUNGQUE', '2025-03-31', '04:42:02pm', '-SEND A PHOTO OF SSD IN ALL NEW POS\r\n-SETUP THE 3 POS OF SRA AND TEST THE SYSTEM AND UPDATE THE SYSTEM \r\n-MAKE A VIDEO FOR ALL POS OF SRA MINI GROCERY\r\n-MAKE A SCREEN RECORDING ABOUT THE WS LIMIT PROCESS AND THE ITEM COMPARISON'),
(3552, 'Lance Garcia', '2025-03-31', '04:54:23pm', ' -I set up a standalone POS and installed the necessary software. I also assisted the OJT in setting up three additional POS systems, recording the process on video to send to Maâ€™am Charmine. During the stress testing of the POS software, I identified bugs and immediately reported them to Sir Simon for resolution. Once he sent me the updated file, I applied the update to our POS systems and tested them to ensure the identified bugs had been fixed.'),
(3553, 'OJT KYLE', '2025-03-31', '08:25:37am', 'CLEANED THE OFFICE ENTRANCE BY SWEEPING AWAY DUST LEAVES AND DEBRIS\r\n\r\nTHOROUGHLY MOPPED THE OFFICE FLOOR TO REMOVE DIRT STAINS AND DUST ENSURING A CLEAR AND HYGIENIC WORKSPACE\r\n\r\nTECHS NOTES\r\n\r\nCOMPLETED THE SETUP OF THE THREE POS UNITS ENSURING THEY WERE CONFIGURED AND READY FOR THE INSTALLATION OF THE POS SOFTWARE\r\n\r\nSOCIAL MEDIA & MARKETING EFFORTS\r\n\r\nCONDUCTED RESEARCH AND COMPILED A LIST OF POTENTIAL RESTAURANT CLIENTS FOR RNZ SOFTWARE DEVELOPMENT SERVICES POS IDENTIFYING BUSINESS THAT COULD BENEFIT FROM THE SYSTEM TO ENHANCE THEIR OPERATIONS'),
(3554, 'OJT KYLE', '2025-03-28', '08:26:59am', ' OFFICE MAINTENANCE\r\n\r\nSWEPT THE OUTSIDE OF THE OFFICE\r\n\r\nTOOK OUT THE TRASH FROM THE BACK OF THE OFFICE\r\n\r\nCLEANED THE SENIOR STAFFS COMPUTER UNITS BY CAREFULLY BLOWING OUT DUST AND DEBRIS AND WIPED DOWN THE SURFACES WITH MICROFIBER TOWEL\r\n\r\nSWEPT THE INSIDE OF THE OFFICE\r\n\r\nWE WENT TO INTERSAVE TO GIVE THE PAYMENT TO MIKEL FOR THE 3 COMPUTER UNITS\r\n\r\nWE WENT TO LA PAZ SEMI CONO TO MILL THE RICE AND AFTERWARD WE RETURNED HOME TO WEIGH THE RICE WE ENDED UP WITH 26 KILOS WHICH WE DIVIDED AMONG THE THREE OF US WITH EACH PERSON RECEIVING 8.5 KILOS\r\n\r\nSOCIAL MEDIA & MARKETING EFFORTS\r\n\r\nEDITED DESIGNED A LOGO FOR THE RNZ SOFTWARE DEVELOPMENT SERVICES\r\n\r\nEDITED THE CURRENT DESIGNS FOR POS ADVERTISEMENT POST IMAGES'),
(3555, 'OJT KYLE', '2025-03-26', '08:28:32am', ' OFFICE MAINTENANCE\r\n\r\nSWEPT THE OUTSIDE AREA OF THE OFFICE\r\n\r\nCLEANED THE RESTROOM OF THE OFFICE\r\n\r\nSOCIAL MEDIA & MARKETING EFFORTS\r\n\r\nCREATED AN RNZ ACCOUNT FOR SHARING AND ADVERTISING PURPOSES\r\n\r\nSHARED SIR RABBIS VLOGS RECENT VLOG IN FACEBOOK GROUPS RELATED TO VLOGGING COMMUNITIES TO INCREASE REACH AND ENGAGEMENT\r\n\r\nHERE ARE THE GROUPS:\r\nPinoy Trending Videos & Philippine Vloggers\r\nPhilippines Vloggers\r\nVloggers Group of the Philippines\r\nSupport Local Vloggers\r\nVloggers Bloggers Sharing Support Group Philippines\r\n\r\nADVERTISED POSTED PROMOTIONAL CONTENT ABOUT THE RNZ POS IN RELEVANT FACEBOOK GROUPS\r\n\r\nHERE ARE THE GROUPS:\r\nPOS for Sale Philippines\r\nPOS Forum Philippines\r\nPoint of Sale Business Solution\r\nPoint of Sale POS Philippines\r\n\r\nDESIGNED EDITED A FACEBOOK POST IMAGE TO ADVERTISE THE RNZ SOFTWARE DEVELOPMENT SERVICES POS'),
(3556, 'OJT KYLE', '2025-03-21', '08:31:44am', ' SWEPT AND MOPPED THE ENTIRE OFFCIE TO MAINTAIN CLEANLINESS AND A HYGIENIC WORKSPACE.\r\nSHARED SIR RABBI S LATEST VLOG IN MULTIPLE FACEBOOK GROUPS RELATED TO VLOGGING COMMUNITIES\r\nSTUDIED THE PROCESS OF CONVERTING CASH TRANSACTIONS TO CARD PAYMENTS USING DIFFERENT METHODS\r\nUPDATED THE PRICE OF BUDDY S MART'),
(3557, 'OJT LARWIN', '2025-04-01', '04:36:49pm', 'Office Cleaning Mopped the floor using Downy and Zonrox for a clean and hygienic workspace\r\n\r\nVlog Promotion Shared Sir Rabis vlog across multiple Facebook vlogger groups reaching 200 plus shares for increased engagement and visibility\r\n\r\nPrice Update for Bakelkel and Best Price\r\n\r\nAccess Buddies server via AnyDesk dump and update product data in Bakelkel using UltraViewer\r\n\r\nAccess Best Price admin via UltraViewer update product data using AnyDesk\r\n\r\nMaintenance of Buddys and Gardens Mini Mart\r\n\r\nBacked up the database and monthly Z reading\r\n\r\nCleaned system units using a blower brush and rag\r\n\r\nReassembled hardware checked the printer and cleared temp and prefetch files'),
(3558, 'OJT KYLE', '2025-04-01', '04:37:31pm', 'DAY END REPORT\r\n\r\nOFFICE MAINTENANCE\r\n\r\nSwept the entire office ensuring dust dirt and debris were removed from the floor and mopped the floor thoroughly to remove any stains and spills\r\n\r\nCleaned the office entrance by sweeping away dust leaves and debris\r\n\r\nCleaned the CR including the toilet sink and floor\r\n\r\nSOCIAL MEDIA AND MARKETING EFFORTS\r\n\r\nDesigned and edited a customized cover photo for a Facebook account associated with RNZ Software Development Services utilizing Canva to create a visually appealing and professional design\r\n\r\nShared Sir Rabbis recent vlog in Facebook groups related to vlogging communities to increase reach and engagement\r\n\r\nHere are the groups\r\nVloggers Bloggers United Philippines\r\nVloggerhood Philippines\r\nVloggers Community PH\r\nVloggers community PH\r\nVlogger Group Philippines\r\nVloggers Bloggers Sharing Support Group Philippines\r\nSmall Vloggers Philippines\r\nPhilippine Vlogger Group\r\nVloggers PH\r\nPH Vloggers Community\r\nVloggers Paangat PH\r\nSupport Local Vlog'),
