(3560, 'OJT MARK', '2025-04-01', '07:23:16pm', 'Day End Report \r\nBegan the day by cleaning the office ensuring a tidy and organized workspace.\r\nShared a vlog to engage the audience and promote services.\r\nPosted advertisements to increase visibility and attract potential customers.\r\nEngaged in discussions with a potential client addressing inquiries and providing necessary information.\r\nWorked on printing the work order to ensure proper documentation and task tracking.\r\nSuccessfully scheduled a product demo for a retail business in Nueva Ecija tomorrow at 3 PM.\r\nProvided tech support in Bacolor for a unit that wouldnâ€™t turn on. Sir Lance and I troubleshot all possible issues and in the end resolved it by replacing the SIMUS battery which successfully fixed the problem.'),
(3561, 'OJT ARLFRAN', '2025-04-02', '04:31:25pm', ' DAY END REPORT\r\nAPRIL 2 2025\r\n\r\nSEARCHED FOR POTENTIAL CLIENTS ON GOOGLE MAPS SPECIFICALLY TARGETING LAUNDRY SHOPS RESTAURANTS CAFES COFFEE SHOPS AND OTHER BUSINESSES RECORDED THEIR BUSINESS NAMES AND CONTACT NUMBERS IN AN EXCEL SHEET FOR FUTURE OUTREACH AND MARKETING PURPOSES\r\n\r\nPOSTED AND SHARED OUR POS PACKAGES ON OUR WALL VARIOUS POS RELATED GROUPS AND BUY AND SELL GROUPS ON FACEBOOK TO REACH A WIDER AUDIENCE AND GENERATE MORE ENGAGEMENT\r\n\r\nSHARED SIR RABBI VLOG IN THIRTY DIFFERENT REELS AND VLOGGING GROUPS BEFORE REACHING THE DAILY SHARING LIMIT HELPING TO INCREASE ITS VISIBILITY AND ENGAGEMENT\r\n\r\nPROMOTED RNZ SOFTWARE DEVELOPMENT SERVICES BY SHARING MULTIPLE POSTS AND VIDEOS TO ENHANCE THE COMPANY ONLINE PRESENCE AND ATTRACT POTENTIAL CLIENTS\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n'),
