(3567, 'OJT ARLFRAN', '2025-04-03', '04:31:08pm', ' DAY END REPORT\r\nAPRIL 3 2025\r\n\r\nCLEANED THE ENTIRE OFFICE USING WALIS TAMBO THEN PREPARED A BUCKET OF MOP SOLUTION FOR LARWIN TO MOP THE FLOORS ALSO CHECKED THE BACK AREA OF THE OFFICE FOR ANY TRASH OR CLUTTER\r\n\r\nSET UP THE NETWORK CONNECTION OF THE POS TO THE SERVER USING COMMAND PROMPT AND NETWORK SETTINGS ENSURING A STABLE CONNECTION\r\n\r\nTESTED THE POS SYSTEM BY ADDING SUPPLIERS AND PRODUCTS TO VERIFY IF THE DATA WAS TALLY DISCOVERED A BUG WHERE THE SYSTEM STILL PROMPTED FOR CASH FLOAT ENTRY EVEN AFTER ENTERING THE AMOUNT ALREADY INFORMED SIR SIMON ABOUT THE ISSUE AND HE FIXED IT THEN CHECKED IF THE SUBTOTALS WERE CORRECT\r\n\r\nCLEANED THE WATER DISPENSER BY REMOVING RUST AND RESIDUE TO ENSURE PROPER HYGIENE \r\n\r\nPOSTED AND SHARED POS PACKAGES IN DIFFERENT GROUPS AND ON MY WALL TO PROMOTE OUR SERVICES\r\n\r\nSHARED SIR RABBI VLOG GALA SERYE BILI NG TOYS RESULTING IN FORTY ONE SHARES BEFORE REACHING THE DAILY LIMIT'),
(3568, 'ojtlarwin', '2025-04-03', '04:33:29pm', ' Thoroughly mop the floor using Downy and Zonrox to effectively clean and disinfect the area ensuring a hygienic and safe workspace\r\n\r\nI am actively marketing the RNZ POS system by sharing its advertisement video in multiple buy and sell groups as well as POS Philippines groups To increase visibility and engagement I have distributed the video across 100 Facebook groups\r\n\r\nTest the new 2 units POS by adding a supplier and product to the system to check its accuracy This includes verifying if transactions are correctly recorded and tallied checking the subtotal and ensuring that the VAT and net of VAT calculations match the grand total There is a bug where entering the cash float does not remove the previous entry prompting to enter the amount again Another bug occurs when a product qualifies for wholesale the VAT calculation does not match the grand total\r\n\r\nTo add a product click the add product button then select the type of VAT or non VAT brand name discountable basic name SKU descr'),
(3569, 'OJT LARWIN', '2025-04-03', '04:34:01pm', ' Thoroughly mop the floor using Downy and Zonrox to effectively clean and disinfect the area ensuring a hygienic and safe workspace\r\n\r\nI am actively marketing the RNZ POS system by sharing its advertisement video in multiple buy and sell groups as well as POS Philippines groups To increase visibility and engagement I have distributed the video across 100 Facebook groups\r\n\r\nTest the new 2 units POS by adding a supplier and product to the system to check its accuracy This includes verifying if transactions are correctly recorded and tallied checking the subtotal and ensuring that the VAT and net of VAT calculations match the grand total There is a bug where entering the cash float does not remove the previous entry prompting to enter the amount again Another bug occurs when a product qualifies for wholesale the VAT calculation does not match the grand total\r\n\r\nTo add a product click the add product button then select the type of VAT or non VAT brand name discountable basic name SKU descr'),
