(3571, 'Lance Garcia', '2025-04-03', '04:42:28pm', ' -On site visit bestprice porac for the monthly maintenance of their 3 POS terminals, including backing up and dumping their SQL data, saving it to their servers for backup purposes. Additionally, perform cleaning of the 3 POS terminals and process the Z-reading for the month of March 2025.\r\n\r\n-Tech support for Maestrang Kikay Atlanta, as they need to adjust their total sales for the month of March 2025, amounting to 927,199.61. Instruct the client to open UltraViewer to grant access, then back up the database. Retrieve the ITEMCOUNT.SQL and VOIDITEMS.SQL files, adjust the sales and void amounts through our system, delete the duplicates of the old ITEMCOUNT.SQL and VOIDITEMS.SQL files, and finally, execute the new ITEMCOUNT.SQL and VOIDITEMS.SQL files.\r\n\r\n-Tech support for Sto Domingo Atlanta, as they need to adjust their total sales for the month of March 2025, amounting to 2,807,088.30. Instruct the client to open UltraViewer to grant access, then back up the database. Retrieve the I'),
(3572, 'OJT KYLE', '2025-04-03', '04:45:37pm', ' OFFICE MAINTENANCE\r\nTHOROUGHLY CLEANED THE OFFICE ENTRANCE BY SWEEPING AWAY ACCUMULATED DUST FALLEN LEAVES AND SCATTERED DEBRIS TO ENSURE A TIDY AND WELCOMING APPEARANCE\r\nREFILLED THE 7 EMPTY WATER GALLONS IN THE OFFICE\r\n\r\nWE DEPOSITED CHECKS AND CASH IN MAYBANK AND PSBANK INTO THE RNZ SOFTWARE DEVELOPMENT SERVICES SAVINGS ACCOUNT\r\nWE ENSURED THAT THE INFO ARE ACCURATE FOR THE TRANSACTION\r\n\r\nTECH/NOTES\r\nWE LOG IN TO THE POS ADD A SUPPLIER AND LINK THE PRODUCTS WITH CORRECT STOCK AND PRICING PROCESS A TEST SCALE VERIFY INVENTORY UPDATES AND CHECK SALES RECORDS\r\n\r\nSOCIAL MEDIA & MARKETING EFFORTS\r\nADVERTISED SHARED PROMOTIONAL CONTENT ABOUT THE RNZ POS IN RELEVANT FACEBOOK GROUPS POST POS PROVIDER GROUPS\r\n\r\nTHESE GROUPS INCLUDE\r\nPHILIPPINES POS Systems IT Matters\r\nPos System\r\nPOS for SALE Philippines\r\nPOS FOR SALE BUY & SELL POS SUPPORT POS HARDWARE PHILIPPINES\r\nPOS for SALE in Philippines\r\nMURANG POINT OF SALE POS\r\nPos systempos solutionpos scale for retailrestaurantsupermarketbar\r\nPoi'),
(3573, 'OJT MARK', '2025-04-03', '08:29:03pm', ' Day End Report \r\nBefore heading for onsite visits I posted an advertisement on my RNZ Facebook account.\r\n1. Best Price  Porac\r\n    * Performed maintenance on the POS system (3 units).\r\n    * Cleaned and optimized all units for better performance.\r\n2. RVL Convenience Store Bataan\r\n    * Conducted maintenance on the POS system (2 units).\r\n    * Cleaned and ensured all systems were running smoothly.\r\nAfter returning to the office I posted advertisements in various groups to reach potential clients.'),
