(3579, 'OJT KYLE', '2025-04-04', '05:11:15pm', ' DAY END REPORT\r\n04 04 2025\r\n\r\nOFFICE MAINTENANCE\r\n\r\nSWEPT THE OFFICE ROOM AND CLEANED THE RESTROOM\r\n\r\nPACKED THE POS UNITS AND PERIPHERALS TO PREPARE THEM FOR SHIPPING\r\n\r\n\r\nCLIENT MAINTENANCE\r\n\r\nWE GO TO JOHNNYS SUPERMARKET TO MAINTENANCE THE 18 UNITS\r\n\r\nWE BACKED UP THE POS DATABASE BY OPENING THE NAVICAT LITE THEN DUMP THE DATA TO THE SERVERS FOLDER FOR BACK UP AND SHUTDOWN THE UNIT\r\n\r\nWE REMOVED PERIPHERAL CABLES AND CLEANED THE POS UNIT BY BLOWING THE DUST AWAY AND BRUSHING IT\r\n\r\nAFTER THE CLEANING WE RECONNECTED THE PERIPHERALS AND TESTED TO RUN THE POS UNIT TO TEST IF THE POS UNIT AND PRINTER IS WORKING PROPERLY\r\n\r\n\r\nTECH NOTES\r\n\r\nUPDATED THE PRICE OF BEST PRICE BY REQUESTING ULTRAVIEWER ANYDESK AND ACCESS THE BP SERVER TO BACKUP THE PRODUCT SQL DATA AND UPDATE THE PRODUCT TO BP POS\r\n'),
(3586, 'OJT ARLFRAN', '2025-04-05', '04:30:39pm', ' DAY END REPORT\r\nAPRIL 5 2025\r\n\r\n CREATED A LAYOUT OF THE PROMOTIONAL POSTER FOR THE STANDARD POS PACKAGES INTENDED FOR ONLINE MARKETING LIKE FACEBOOK GROUPS RELATED TO POS AND FOR POSTING ON MY PERSONAL WALL\r\n\r\n POSTED OUR POS PACKAGES ON MY WALL AND SHARED THEM TO VARIOUS BUY AND SELL GROUPS AROUND PAMPANGA AS WELL AS POS GROUPS ACROSS THE PH\r\n\r\n SHARED SIR RABBI VLOG VIDEOREELS CUTENESS OVERLOAD TO MULTIPLE FACEBOOK REELS AND VLOGGER GROUPS UNTIL THE ACCOUNT WAS TEMPORARILY DISABLED FOR ONE HUNDRED EIGHTY DAYS DUE TO EXCEEDING FACEBOOK SHARING LIMITS\r\n\r\n REMOVED COBWEBS AROUND THE OFFICE USING A MOP TO GET RID OF AGIW AND MOPPED THE FLOORS TO ENSURE THE OFFICE REMAINS FRESH AND TIDY EVEN WHEN LEFT UNATTENDED FOR A DAY'),
(3587, 'OJT MARK', '2025-04-05', '04:30:46pm', ' Day End Report  April 5, 2025 (Saturday)\r\n\r\nThoroughly cleaned the office mop to maintain cleanliness and hygiene.\r\nInspected and cleaned the PC unit as per Sir Rabbiâ€™s request from yesterday, ensuring optimal performance.\r\nReviewed laptop specifications to determine the appropriate charger compatibility.\r\nCreated and posted advertisements across multiple relevant Facebook groups to boost online visibility.\r\nActively promoted Sir Rabbiâ€™s latest vlog by sharing it across several Facebook communities to increase reach and engagement.\r\nResponded to a potential client from Batangas, addressing inquiries and providing necessary information.'),
(3588, 'OJT KYLE', '2025-04-05', '04:31:34pm', ' OFFICE MAINTENANCE\r\nSWEPT THE OUTSIDE ENTRANCE OF THE OFFICE\r\n\r\nUNIT MAINTENANCE\r\nWE FIRST CHECKED THE POS UNIT AND TOUCHSCREEN FUNCTIONALITY TO ENSURE THAT BOTH COMPONENTS WERE RESPONSIVE AND OPERATING\r\n\r\nAFTER THE INITIAL DIAGNOSTICS WE PROCEEDED WITH CLEANING THE UNIT BY BLOWING OUT THE INTERIOR TO REMOVE DUST AND DEBRIS ESPECIALLY AROUND THE VENTILATION AREAS AND INTERNAL\r\n\r\nAS PART OF THE MAINTENANCE WE ALSO REMOVED THE RAM STICK CLEANED THAIR CONTACTS TO ENSURE OPTIMAL PERFORMANCE AND REINSTALLED THEM SECURELY WE ALSO REPLACED THE OLD THERMAL PASTE ON THE CPU TO PREVENT OVERHEATING\r\n\r\nONCE THE CLEANING AND MAINTENANCE WERE COMPLETED WE REASSEMBLED THE UNIT AND CONDUCTED A SECOND TESTING TO CONFIRM THAT THE POS SYSTEM AND TOUCHSCREEN WERE FULLY FUNCTIONAL AND OPERATING SMOOTHLY\r\n\r\nSOCIAL MEDIA\r\n\r\nSHARED SIR RABBIS VLOGS ACROSS MULTIPLE RELEVANT FACEBOOK GROUPS TO MAXIMIZE REACH AND ENGAGEMENT\r\n\r\nJOINED MULTIPLE VLOGGERS AND POS RELATED FACEBOOK GROUPS'),
(3589, 'OJT LARWIN', '2025-04-05', '04:34:09pm', ' SIR SIMON GUIDED ME ON THE CONCERN REGARDING THE BEST PRICE IN PORAC BECAUSE THE X READING AND THE CASHIERS MONEY DID NOT MATCH.\r\n\r\nI SHARED 100 PLUS THE RNZ ADVERTISEMENT IN VARIOUS POS GROUPS AND BUY AND SELL GROUPS ON FACEBOOK TO REACH A WIDER AUDIENCE.\r\n\r\nI SHARED A VLOG FROM SIR RABBI IN A FACEBOOK GROUP WITHIN OVER 100 GROUPS OF VLOGGERS AND GROUPS OF REELS.'),
(3590, 'Lance Garcia', '2025-04-04', '04:06:13pm', ' -On site visit JS Angeles Balibago for the monthly maintenance of their 14 POS terminals, including backing up and dumping their SQL data, saving it to their servers for backup purposes. Additionally, perform cleaning of the 14 POS terminals.\r\n\r\n-Best Price reached out for assistance regarding a discrepancy between their day-end report and X-reading. The issue was analyzed, and possible causes such as system errors, manual entry mistakes, or misconfigured settings were considered. Provided troubleshooting steps and guidance to resolve the mismatch. Further monitoring is recommended to ensure accuracy in future reports.'),
