(3594, 'Lance Garcia', '2025-04-07', '04:32:26pm', '-Perform an onsite visit to Gardens Mart to deliver a replacement barcode scanner, as their old one is defective. Set up the new scanner and ensure it is fully operational for their use\r\n\r\n-Set up the laptop for Sir Rabbi to use in his demo, and create shortcuts for both the cashier and admin functions\r\n\r\n-Create a video tutorial on how to process transactions in cashiering and send it to SRA Mini Grocery\r\n'),
(3595, 'OJT MARK', '2025-04-07', '04:33:44pm', ' Day End Report\r\n* Arrived at the office and performed cleaning duties swept and mopped both inside and outside\r\n* Provided tech support for Buddys Best Price and Bakelkel.\r\n* After lunch, cleaned the office again sweeping and mopping.\r\n* Set up the POS system on a laptop for a meeting, including connecting the printer and barcode scanner.\r\n* Fixed the POS system to ensure the printer prints automatically upon payment.\r\n* Posted an advertisement on my RNZ official Facebook account.\r\n* Shared the advertisement across various relevant Facebook groups for wider reach.\r\n* Accompanied Sir to D Heights in Clark for a scheduled meeting with a Korean client.\r\n* Upon arrival at D Heights promptly set up the laptop and POS system to ensure a smooth and professional demonstration during the client meeting\r\n'),
(3596, 'DUKE ESGUERRA', '2025-04-07', '04:35:10pm', ' DAY END REPORT\r\nDate: April 07, 2025\r\n\r\nSummary of Accomplished Tasks:\r\n\r\nSales Adjustment â€“ The Nest Sampaloc\r\n\r\nSuccessfully completed the sales adjustment for The Nest Sampaloc branch.\r\n\r\nTotal amount adjusted: â‚±45,000.\r\n\r\nSales Adjustment â€“ The Nest San Pascual\r\n\r\nSuccessfully completed the sales adjustment for The Nest San Pascual branch.\r\n\r\nTotal amount adjusted: â‚±30,000.\r\n\r\nClient Communication â€“ Holiday Announcement\r\n\r\nSent out a formal announcement in the clientsâ€™ group chat regarding the upcoming holiday on April 09, 2025 (Day of Valor).\r\n\r\nEnsured all clients were informed in advance to avoid any scheduling conflicts.\r\n\r\nSupport Assistance â€“ RGP Urdaneta\r\n\r\nProvided assistance to the RGP Urdaneta team concerning a duplicate process issue related to the addition of supplies.\r\n\r\nIssue was resolved promptly to maintain accurate inventory records.'),
