(3603, 'DUKE ESGUERRA', '2025-04-10', '04:26:54pm', ' DAY END REPORT\r\nDate: April 10, 2025\r\n\r\n1. Shared Vlog Content\r\n\r\nSuccessfully shared the latest vlog of Sir Rabbi across multiple content creator pages on Facebook.\r\n\r\nTargeted pages with active engagement to help increase visibility and reach.\r\n\r\nEngagement metrics (likes, shares, comments) will be monitored and summarized in the upcoming report.\r\n\r\n2. Marketing and Advertisement\r\n\r\nPosted advertisements for RNZ Software Development Services on the following platforms:\r\n\r\nFacebook Marketplace\r\n\r\nRelevant Buy & Sell Groups on Facebook\r\n\r\nAds included service highlights, contact details, and a clear call-to-action to increase inquiries and leads.\r\n\r\n3. Client Maintenance Offer\r\n\r\nReached out to existing clients whose warranty period has expired.\r\n\r\nSent professional maintenance service offers outlining the benefits of continued support.\r\n\r\nAwaiting feedback and confirmation from clients regarding the proposed maintenance plans.'),
