(3607, 'OJT KYLE', '2025-04-11', '04:31:00pm', ' DAY END REPORT\r\n\r\nUpdated the Daily Time Record DTR and adjusted the corresponding time frame to reflect the most recent work schedule and attendance logs\r\n\r\nSocial Media / Advertising / Sharing\r\n\r\nI posted a SmartOrdering QR Code video created by Sir Ivan and shared it across multiple Facebook groups to increase visibility and engagement The groups included communities related to tech innovations interested in digital solutions for streamlining customer orders\r\nPOINT OF SALE BUSINESS SOLUTION\r\nPOS for SALE in Philippines\r\nPOS for SALE LUZON AREA\r\nPOS POINT OF SALE PHILIPPINES\r\nPOS SYSTEM PHILIPPINES\r\nPoint of Sale POS Philippines\r\nMURANG POINT OF SALE POS\r\nPOS Suppliers Philippines\r\nPos system for sale\r\nPoint of Sale Software POS\r\nPos system pos solution pos scale for retail restaurant supermarket bar\r\nPos System\r\nPOS FOR SALE BUY AND SELL POS SUPPORT POS HARDWARE PHILIPPINES\r\n\r\nShared Sir Rabbis recent vlogs in several Facebook groups dedicated to vloggers and content creators such '),
(3608, 'OJT ARLFRAN', '2025-04-11', '04:31:27pm', ' DAY END REPORT\r\nAPRIL 6 2025\r\n\r\nSWEPT THE ENTIRE OFFICE USING WALIS TAMBO TO REMOVE DUST AND DIRT FROM ALL CORNERS OF THE WORKSPACE AFTER SWEEPING LARWIN FOLLOWED UP BY MOPPING THE ENTIRE FLOOR TO KEEP IT CLEAN AND FRESH WHILE SIR CHANO CLEANED THE BACK AREA OF THE OFFICE AND I TOOK CARE OF CLEANING THE FRONT ENTRANCE TO ENSURE THE WHOLE SPACE WAS NEAT AND PRESENTABLE\r\n\r\nCREATED LAYOUT DESIGNS FOR TWO PROMOTIONAL POSTERS FOR RNZ POS PACKAGES ONE FOR THE STANDARD PACKAGE AND ANOTHER FOR THE TOUCH PACKAGE BOTH TAILORED FOR ONLINE MARKETING USE AND CLIENT ENGAGEMENT\r\n\r\nPOSTED THE PROMOTIONAL VIDEO ALONG WITH THE TWO LAYOUT POSTERS ON FACEBOOK AND SHARED THEM ACROSS VARIOUS POS RELATED GROUPS AND BUY AND SELL GROUPS TO HELP PROMOTE OUR SERVICES AND ATTRACT POTENTIAL CLIENTS\r\n\r\nSHARED SIR RABBI VLOGS IN DIFFERENT REELS HATAKAN AND VLOGGERS GROUPS ON FACEBOOK UNTIL I REACHED THE SHARING LIMIT FOR THE DAY'),
