(3610, 'OJT LARWIN', '2025-04-11', '04:31:49pm', 'OFFICE CLEANING\r\nMopped the floor using powder and zonrox to ensure a clean and disinfected workspace.\r\n\r\nUPDATE THE DTR AND TIME FRAME\r\nUpdated the Daily Time Record and documented the time frame of tasks and accomplishments.\r\n\r\nSHARED AN ADVERTISING VIDEO OF RNZ IN FACEBOOK GROUPS RELATED TO POINT OF SALE\r\nPoint of Sale\r\nPoint of Sale System POS\r\nPoint of Sale POS Software and Hardware Group\r\nPorac Buy Sell Promote Market Group\r\nManila Buy and Sell Group\r\nSapalibutad Buy and Sell\r\nAngeles Porac Mabalacat Buy and Sell\r\nBuy and Sell Madapdap Mawaque Sta Lucia\r\nXevera Fiesta Mabalacat Buy and Sell Group Official Page\r\nSanta Ana Arayat Mexico Candaba Buy and Sell\r\n\r\nPOSTED AND SHARED A VIDEO MADE BY SIR IVAN\r\nShowcased how to scan a QR code to conveniently order food and access menu options.\r\n\r\nSHARED SIR RABI VLOG\r\nPromoted across various Facebook groups for vloggers and reels to increase its reach and viewer engagement.'),
(3611, 'DUKE ESGUERRA', '2025-04-11', '04:45:43pm', ' DAY END REPORT\r\nDate: April 11, 2025\r\n\r\n1. Promotion of QR Code Ordering System\r\n\r\nShared the launch announcement of the new QR Code Ordering System across multiple Facebook group pages.\r\n\r\nTargeted active local and niche communities to increase awareness and encourage adoption.\r\n\r\nIncluded visual content and a short caption explaining how the system works to drive interest and interaction.\r\n\r\n2. Facebook Marketplace and Buy & Sell Groups Advertising\r\n\r\nPosted a dedicated advertisement on Facebook Marketplace and various Buy and Sell pages to attract a wider audience.\r\n\r\nHighlighted key benefits such as contactless ordering, speed, and user convenience.\r\n\r\nEnsured posts were made in high-traffic groups relevant to food services, tech-savvy users, and local businesses.\r\n\r\n3. Vlog Sharing â€“ Sir Rabbiâ€™s Content\r\n\r\nPromoted Sir Rabbiâ€™s latest vlog by sharing it across several Facebook content-sharing pages.\r\n\r\nShared in communities focused on:\r\n\r\nContent exchange (Follow to Follow g'),
(3612, 'ivan nunag', '2025-04-11', '04:50:46pm', 'DAY END REPORT 4/11/25\r\n\r\n- DEMO GAS STATION SYSTEM TO POTENTIAL CLIENT IN CAVITE, ABOUT ADMIN AND CASHIERING SYSTEM\r\n\r\n- CREATED A POS QUOTATION FOR KOREAN CLARK CLIENT, ABOUT RETAIL, RESTO AND INDOOR GOLF BUSINESS (PRICING AND PACKAGE DETAILS).\r\n\r\n- EDITED AND LIST A PICTURE OF POS HARDWARES FOR RETAIL,RETAIL, RESTO AND INDOOR GOLF (KOREAN CLIENT)\r\n\r\n- CREATED A POS QUOTATION FOR GAS STATION CLIENT, IN CAVITE INCLUDE TOUCH SCREEN MONITOR AND A SOFTWARTE (PRICING AND PACKAGE DETAILS).\r\n\r\n- ACTIVELY FOLLOW UP CLIENTS IN RNZ MAIN PAGE (MESSENGER)\r\n\r\n- CHECKED AND ENSURED TEAM MEMBERS TAPPED THEIR IDS AND PROPERLY ENTERED THE SYSTEM FOR ATTENDANCE TRACKING. \r\n\r\n- REPLY/ RESPONSE TO CLIENT WHO MESSAGE ON THE RNZ PAGE/ACCOUNT AND ANSWER THEIR QUESTIONS'),
(3613, 'Lance Garcia', '2025-04-11', '04:57:40pm', '-First  go to Johnnys Supermarket to collect the payment  then proceed to Maybank to deposit the cheque.\r\n-Send the advertisement video showcasing the new features of our RESTO POS System to the different group chats\r\n1. ANNYEONG - RNZ POS\r\n2.RAPHAEL - RNZ POS\r\n3.POS G24 RNZ\r\n-Post POS advertisement in different GROUPS:\r\n1. Pangasinense BUY AND SELL\r\n2. Pangasinan Buy and Sell \r\n3. PANGASINENSE\r\n4. PANGASINAN CLASSIFIEDS LETS BUY SELLTRADE AND FIND JOBS HERE GUYS\r\n5. Pangasinan Buy Sale and Trade group\r\n6. PANGASINAN BUY N SELL\r\n7. Pangasinense Buy & Sell\r\n8. Pangasinan Buy  Sell and Trade\r\n9. Buy And Sell Pangasinan\r\n10. Pangasinan Buy And SaLe TRADE ETC..\r\n11. BUY AND SELL PANGASINAN 06012020\r\n12. Tayug Pangasinan buy and sell\r\n13. Pangasinan Buy and Sell ng Kahit Ano\r\n14. Pangasinan Group of Buy and sell online business traders'),
(3614, 'OJT ARLFRAN', '2025-04-12', '04:31:33pm', ' DAY END REPORT\r\nAPRIL 12 2025\r\n\r\nKYLE SWEPT THE ENTIRE OFFICE AND AFTER HE FINISHED I MOPPED THE ENTIRE FLOOR TO MAINTAIN CLEANLINESS WHILE LARWIN WIPED DOWN ALL THE GLASS SURFACES USING A GLASS CLEANER \r\n\r\nLARWIN AND I SET UP TWO STANDALONE UNITS WHILE I INSTALLED THE NECESSARY DRIVERS ON ONE OF THE UNITS DURING THE INSTALLATION PROCESS WE TESTED THE SRA POS SYSTEM UPDATE ON THE OTHER UNIT\r\n\r\nTHE MAIN FOLDER OF THE SRA POS SYSTEM WAS UPDATED TO IMPROVE THE ADMIN PANEL SPECIFICALLY THE PRICING LOGIC FOR WHOLESALE AND RETAIL WAS MODIFIED TO DYNAMICALLY CALCULATE PRICES BASED ON A PERCENTAGE OF THE ORIGINAL PRODUCT PRICE WE ALSO CONDUCTED VERIFICATION TO ENSURE THAT EXPIRATION DATES AND DELIVERY DATES WERE PROPERLY RECORDED AND ALIGNED WITH SYSTEM EXPECTATIONS ALL FUNCTIONS RELATED TO THIS UPDATE WERE TESTED AND ARE NOW WORKING AS INTENDED\r\n\r\nEDITED THE POSTER LAYOUT FROM YESTERDAY TO ADD MORE DETAILS AND THEN SHARED IT ACROSS VARIOUS POS GROUPS ON FACEBOOK '),
(3615, 'OJT LARWIN', '2025-04-12', '04:31:33pm', ' I swept outside using a soft broom and cleaned the glass using Lix glass cleaner\r\n\r\nSRA POS System Sir Chano updated the code in the main folder In the admin panel we tested the updated wholesale and retail pricing now calculated based on a percentage of the original price We also verified that the expiration and delivery dates are accurate and properly aligned\r\n\r\nI am actively promoting the RNZ POS System by sharing its advertisement video in various buy and sell groups and POS Philippines groups to maximize reach and engagement'),
(3616, 'OJT KYLE', '2025-04-12', '04:32:42pm', 'DAY END REPORT\r\n04 12 2025\r\n\r\nOFFICE MAINTENANCE\r\n\r\nDid a cleaning by sweeping the entire office space to maintain a tidy and organized working environment\r\n\r\nRefilled the water dispenser to keep hydration accessible for everyone throughout the day\r\n\r\nINVENTORY MANAGEMENTS\r\n\r\nPerformed a detailed inventory of office supplies and equipments and updated the inventory document recorded in the RNZ GC\r\n\r\nSOCIAL MEDIA CONTENT CREATION\r\n\r\nCreated a summer themed promotional post using Canva The post highlights RNZ Software Development Services POS System\r\n\r\nSOCIAL MEDIA MARKETING\r\n\r\nAfter publishing the post on my RNZ Facebook account I actively shared it across various Facebook groups related to Point of Sale POS systems to increase visibility and engagement for RNZ services\r\n\r\nShared the most recent vlog from Sir Rabbi in multiple Facebook groups focused on vlogging and content creators This was done to help expand his audience reach and gather more views and interaction for his content'),
(3617, 'Lance Garcia', '2025-04-14', '04:30:46pm', '-Tech Support and Access Best Price sales on April 10 2025 are not tallying correctly. The issue is due to blank POSNUM fields in other transactions. These need to be edited and filled in to ensure the sales for April 10 2025 are accurate. After updating the missing POSNUM values I verify in the X Reading report if the sales for April 10 2025 are now tallying correctly.\r\n\r\n-Conducted an onsite visit to the Jinmart Balibago store for POS maintenance. Performed a backup and SQL dump and saved the files to a flash drive for backup purposes. Cleaned the system unit using a blower and reapplied thermal paste. Afterwards checked all peripherals including the thermal printer and barcode scanner to ensure they were functioning properly. Also deleted temporary files from the Prefetch temp and Temp folders to optimize system performance.'),
(3618, 'OJT LARWIN', '2025-04-14', '04:30:50pm', ' This morning I swept the office while Kyle took care of the mopping\r\nUpdated the Bakelkel product price, accessed the Buddies server to dump the product and executed in Bakelkel\r\nUpdated the Best Price product price, got access to the Best Price admin to dump the product, and executed at Best Price\r\nTested the QR code ordering and kitchen display of Best Western\r\nI am actively promoting the RNZ POS system by sharing its advertisement video in various buy and sell groups and POS Philippines groups to maximize reach and engagement'),
(3619, 'OJT MARK', '2025-04-14', '04:31:22pm', ' Day End Report \r\nTroubleshooting  Sir Ivan PC\r\n    * Investigated issue with PC not powering on.\r\n    * Identified the problem to be a faulty power cord and replaced it.\r\n    * PC is now functioning properly.\r\nPrepared Maintenance Bag\r\n    * Packed all necessary tools and equipment needed for maintenance tasks.\r\nOn Site Maintenance Jinmart Balibago\r\n    * Performed general maintenance at the location.\r\n    * Cleaned PC units including keyboard mouse and system unit.\r\n    * Reapplied thermal paste for improved CPU performance and cooling.\r\nQR System Testing\r\n    * Conducted testing of the QR based ordering system to ensure functionality and user experience.\r\nOffice Cleaning\r\n    * Cleaned the office thoroughly in the afternoon.\r\n    * Mopped the floor and cleared accumulated dirt.\r\nAdvertisement Posting\r\n    * Posted marketing materials in 90 different Facebook groups to boost visibility and engagement.'),
(3620, 'OJT KYLE', '2025-04-14', '04:34:29pm', ' DAY END REPORT  \r\n04142025  \r\n\r\nOFFICE MAINTENANCE  \r\nMopped the entire office area to keep the workspace clean and well organized  \r\n\r\nThoroughly cleaned and sanitized the restroom including toilet sink and floor ensured proper waste disposal and maintained a hygienic and odor free environment  \r\n\r\nTECH TESTING  \r\nTested the QR code ordering system to verify the accuracy of orders received at the cashiers window and ensured that the corresponding items appeared correctly on the kitchen display monitor Also conducted stress testing to evaluate the systems performance under high demand conditions  \r\n\r\nOrganized and prepared maintenance tools in a designated bag to ensure readiness for repair and maintenance tasks  \r\n\r\nSOCIAL MEDIA MARKETING  \r\nPromoted Sir Rabbis latest vlog by sharing it across several Facebook groups dedicated to vlogging and content creation aiming to boost audience reach views and engagement');
