(3621, 'OJT ARLFRAN', '2025-04-14', '04:54:49pm', ' DAY END REPORT\r\nAPRIL 15 2025\r\n\r\nWHILE LARWIN WAS SWEEPING INSIDE THE OFFICE AND KYLE WAS MOPPING THE ENTIRE FLOOR I SWEPT BOTH THE FRONT AND BACK AREAS OF THE OFFICE \r\n\r\nPRINTED FOUR COPIES OF THE RNZ PROPOSAL STAPLED EACH COPY AND ORGANIZED THEM INTO A FOLDER FOR PRESENTATION AND DOCUMENTATION PURPOSES\r\n\r\nASSISTED LARWIN IN UPDATING THE PRODUCT PRICES IN BUDDYS AND BP WHILE ALSO HELPING HIM IN EDITING THE RNZ LAYOUT FOR THE STANDARD PACKAGES TO MAKE SURE THE DESIGN AND INFORMATION WERE UP TO DATE\r\n\r\nTESTED THE WIFI QR FEATURE OF THE RNZ ROUTER INCLUDING SCANNING THE QR CODE OF BEST WESTERN AND TRYING OUT THE ORDERING PROCESS TO CHECK FUNCTIONALITY AND USER EXPERIENCE\r\n\r\nLAMINATED THE QR CODE TO MAKE IT MORE DURABLE AND PRESENTABLE FOR CLIENT USE'),
(3622, 'DUKE ESGUERRA', '2025-04-14', '04:58:51pm', ' DAY END REPORT\r\nDATE APRIL 14 2025\r\n\r\nASSISTED SKYTECH CAFE BENI WITH A DISCREPANCY IN THEIR PRINTED ORDER RECEIPT CLIENT PRESENTED A RECEIPT THAT SHOWED ONLY TWO ITEMS PRINTED EVEN THOUGH THREE ITEMS WERE ACTUALLY ORDERED INVESTIGATION AND INITIAL TROUBLESHOOTING WERE CONDUCTED TO IDENTIFY THE ISSUE\r\n\r\nPROVIDED SUPPORT TO KINGSVIEW LAUNDRY SHOP REGARDING THEIR REQUEST TO UPDATE THEIR POS BUSINESS INFORMATION EDITED THEIR CONTACT DETAILS TO INCLUDE THEIR MOBILE NUMBER AND REPLACED THE EMAIL ADDRESS WITH A LINK TO THEIR FACEBOOK PAGE\r\n\r\nPOSTED RNZ ADVERTISEMENT ON MULTIPLE FACEBOOK PLATFORMS INCLUDING FACEBOOK MARKETPLACE POS RELATED GROUPS AND LOCAL BUY AND SELL PAGES TO INCREASE VISIBILITY AND REACH POTENTIAL CUSTOMERS\r\n\r\nSHARED SIR RABBI VLOG CONTENT ON VARIOUS FACEBOOK GROUPS INCLUDING CONTENT CREATOR COMMUNITIES REELS TO REEL GROUPS AND FOLLOW TO FOLLOW ENGAGEMENT PAGES TO BOOST ONLINE ENGAGEMENT AND FOLLOWERSHIP\r\n\r\n\r\nASSISTED ON TESTING BEST WESTERN QR ORDERING SYSTEM TO ENSURE F'),
(3623, 'CHRISTIAN BUNGQUE', '2025-04-15', '04:30:02pm', ' -READY THE DEMO IN BEST WESTERN ABOUT THE CASHIER AND KITCHEN DISPLAY THEN ACCESS SIR RABBI THEN ASST HIM IN CASHIER\r\n-ACCESS HARVEST LOUNGE POS TO UPDATE THE BACKEND FOR THE DOWNLOAD SQL FILE OF LAUNDRY AND TEST'),
(3624, 'OJT ARLFRAN', '2025-04-15', '04:31:45pm', ' DAY END REPORT\r\nAPRIL 15 2025\r\n\r\nSWEEPED THE BACK AREA OF THE OFFICE USING WALIS TINGTING AFTER NOTICING THAT RATS HAD SCATTERED TRASH AROUND THE PLACE I ALSO SAW THAT THE TRASH CAN WAS FULL SO I SEALED THE PLASTIC BAG DISPOSED OF THE GARBAGE AND REPLACED IT WITH A NEW TRASH BAG\r\n\r\nSHARED THE NEW REELS VIDEO OF SIR RABBI TO MULTIPLE FACEBOOK REELS AND HATAKAN GROUPS \r\n\r\nSHARED OUR SUMMER POS PACKAGES IN VARIOUS POS RELATED FACEBOOK GROUPS\r\n\r\nREVISED THE POSTER LAYOUT I CREATED THE OTHER DAY BY ADDING OUR EMAIL ADDRESS AND CONTACT NUMBER TO MAKE IT MORE COMPLETE AND CLIENT READY\r\n\r\nDID ANOTHER ROUND OF SWEEPING IN THE AFTERNOON TO MAINTAIN CLEANLINESS THROUGHOUT THE DAY'),
