(3632, 'Lance Garcia', '2025-04-21', '04:31:38pm', '-tech support DS RIVERA because when he renders cut sales the POS and the SERVER is not connect\r\n-Tech Support Request for Cafe Beni Skytech \r\nThe sales for April 21 were not tallying correctly. Upon checking their system I found that the Date Shift Date and X-Date did not match. This mismatch caused the sales figures for April 21 to be inaccurate. To resolve the issue I manually aligned the Shift Date and Date with the X-Date one by one which corrected the sales data for that day. I then reported the update to Sir DS Rivera to confirm if the sales were already accurate.\r\n-print workerorder in RENIES TAGUIG for tommorow onsite visit\r\n-access RENIES TAGUIG to copy system file and dump sql for backup purposes'),
