(3646, 'OJT LARWIN', '2025-04-24', '04:31:27pm', ' DAY END REPORT\r\n04/24/2025\r\n\r\nPROMOTION OF RNZ POS SYSTEM\r\nI AM ACTIVELY PROMOTING THE RNZ POINT OF SALE (POS) SYSTEM .BY SHARING ITS ADVERTISEMENT VIDEO IN VARIOUS FACEBOOK GROUPS, INCLUDING BUY AND SELL COMMUNITIES AND POS-RELATED GROUPS IN THE PHILIPPINES. THIS HELPS INCREASE VISIBILITY AND ENGAGEMENT WITH POTENTIAL CUSTOMERS.\r\n\r\nGROUPS WHERE I SHARE THE RNZ POS CONTENT:\r\n-POINT OF SALE SYSTEM POS\r\n-POINT OF SALE (POS) SOFTWARE & HARDWARE GROUP\r\n-PORAC BUY, SELL, PROMOTE/MARKET GROUP\r\n-MANILA BUY AND SELL GROUP\r\n-SAPALIBUTAD BUY AND SELL\r\n-ANGELES-PORAC-MABALACAT BUY AND SELL\r\n-BUY & SELL (MADAPDAP, MAWAQUE, STA. LUCIA)\r\n-XEVERA FIESTA MABALACAT BUY AND SELL GROUP (OFFICIAL PAGE)\r\n-SANTA ANA, ARAYAT, MEXICO, CANDABA BUY & SELL\r\n\r\nCONTENT SHARING IN VLOGGER & REELS GROUPS\r\nI ALSO SHARED A REELS VIDEO FROM SIR RABBI ACROSS MORE THAN 100 FACEBOOK GROUPS DEDICATED TO VLOGGERS AND REELS ENTHUSIASTS. THIS HELPS BOOST CONTENT REACH AND ENGAGEMENT WITHIN A TARGETED ONLINE AUDIENCE.\r\n'),
(3647, 'OJT ARLFRAN', '2025-04-24', '04:31:30pm', ' DAY END REPORT\r\nAPRIL 24 2025\r\n\r\nUPON ARRIVING AT THE OFFICE WE SET UP OUR LAPTOPS TO CONTINUE EDITING THE LAYOUTS FOR THE POS PACKAGES WE HAVE BEEN WORKING ON\r\n\r\nWHILE EDITING WE ALSO SHARED THE NEW POST OF SIR RABBI WHICH WAS A PICTURE POSTED ACROSS MULTIPLE FACEBOOK GROUPS TO INCREASE ENGAGEMENT AND REACH\r\n\r\nPOSTED AN ADVERTISEMENT OF OUR POS PACKAGES ON MY PERSONAL WALL AND INITIATED SHARING TO VARIOUS BUY AND SELL AND POS RELATED FACEBOOK GROUPS\r\n\r\nNOTICED THAT THERE WAS A CONSIDERABLE AMOUNT OF SAND IN OUR WORK AREA SO I SWEPT IT USING WALIS TIMBO TO MAINTAIN CLEANLINESS\r\n\r\nLOOKED FOR POTENTIAL CLIENTS THE FIRST ONE WAS UNREASONABLY DEMANDING BUT THE SECOND LEAD FROM CITYSTATE HOTEL PALANCA QUIAPO IS CURRENTLY IN AN ONGOING CONVERSATION AND MENTIONED THAT A DEMO MIGHT BE SET NEXT WEEK'),
(3648, 'OJT KYLE', '2025-04-24', '04:32:36pm', ' DAY END REPORT  \r\n04242025  \r\n\r\nOFFICE GROUNDS MAINTENANCE  \r\n\r\nPerformed a thorough sweeping of the office exterior including the main entrance front steps and surrounding walkways This was done to keep the premises clean tidy and welcoming for staff and visitors  \r\n\r\nSOCIAL MEDIA PROMOTION SIR RABBIS VLOG  \r\n\r\nShared Sir Rabbis latest vlog in several Facebook groups focused on vloggers content creators and online video communities The Purpose was to increase its reach gain more views and encourage interaction through like comments and shares  \r\n\r\nMARKETING OUTREACH RNZ SOFTWARE POS PROMOTION  \r\n\r\nPromoted RNZs QR Code Ordering System promotional video in Facebook groups for restaurants cafes and food service business The post highlighted the systems convenience in allowing customers to view menus place orders and pay via their smartphones This was aimed at attracting businesses looking for modern contactless solutions to improve customer experience  \r\n\r\nShared a seperate post featur'),
(3649, 'Lance Garcia', '2025-04-24', '04:36:24pm', '-check the system error at RIENES STORE. The error occurs when the user attempts to view daily sales from the admin panel an error message is displayed during this process.\r\n\r\nAfter reviewing the issue I recommend advising the user to check sales using the following steps:\r\n1.Click on X Reading from the system menu.\r\n2.Enter the date they wish to view.\r\n3.Input the access code to proceed.\r\n\r\nThis method should allow the user to access their daily sales without encountering the error.\r\n\r\n-Clean the office by sweeping and mopping the floor.\r\n\r\n-Update the software for RIENES STORE by adding the Generate Barcode and Reprint Barcode buttons under the Product tab.\r\n\r\nAccess their POS Server and perform the following actions:\r\n\r\nCopy and replace the following files:\r\n1.index_barcode\r\n2.index_barcodereprint\r\n3.printbarcode\r\n4.reprintbarcode\r\n\r\nOnce the files have been updated test the implementation thoroughly to ensure that all functions are working correctly and the new features are operati'),
