(3658, 'Lance Garcia', '2025-04-28', '04:32:11pm', '-Sending out an announcement regarding the HOLIDAY on May 1 2025 Monday to various RNZ group chats\r\n\r\n-I am responding to Ester Morongs concern regarding the delivery date of the PC set she purchased\r\n\r\n-Tech Support Cafe Beni Magalang I assisted them after their printer drivers were deleted. I asked them to open UltraViewer so I could gain access and install the new printer drivers'),
(3659, 'DUKE ESGUERRA', '2025-04-28', '04:35:24pm', ' Day End Report\r\nDate April 28 2025\r\n\r\nAssisted Edgar with Static IP Setup on Raspberry Pi OS\r\n\r\nCollaborated with Edgar to successfully set up a static IP on the Raspberry Pi running OS. This involved configuring network settings to ensure a consistent IP address for the device. We tested the setup to verify its effectiveness, ensuring the Raspberry Pi remains accessible via the designated static IP without interruptions.\r\n\r\nMonitored Data Input on Port Forwarding Laptop for Barrier System Testing\r\n\r\nActively monitored the port forwarding laptop for any data input into the data sheet created by Sir Rabbi. This data was crucial for the ongoing testing of the Barrier System conducted earlier in the morning. I ensured that the data flow was uninterrupted and accurate, providing feedback on any discrepancies that may have occurred during the testing phase.\r\n\r\nMet with Sir Cicer at Johnnyâ€™s Supermarket Regarding Transaction Number Issue\r\n\r\nAttended a meeting with Sir Cicer at Johnnyâ€™s '),
(3660, 'OJT MARK', '2025-04-28', '04:36:09pm', ' Day End Report \r\n\r\n* Posted advertisements.\r\n* Shared advertisements across different Facebook groups.\r\n* Assisted Sir Rabbi and Sir Edgar with testing.\r\n* Accompanied and assisted Sir Duke at Johnnyâ€™s Supermarket.\r\n* Cleaned the office before logging out.\r\n\r\n1. POINT OF SALE (POS) PHILIPPINES \r\n2. CITY OF ANGELES BUY AND SELL\r\n3. POS FOR sale\r\n4. POS for SALE Philippines \r\n5. Angeles bentahan\r\n6. Pampanga angeles tarlac buy and sell\r\n7. Barangay sapalibutad\r\n8. Pandacaqui market\r\n9. Point of sale(POS) software and hardware\r\n10. Pos system/pos solution/ pos scale\r\n11. POS software UAE\r\n12. Pos system\r\n13. Scangle pos system and point of sales ecr/ pos\r\n14. Pos system\r\n15. Baguio city\r\n16. Baguio city buy and sell\r\n17. Urdaneta city pangasinan buy and sell\r\n18. Pangasinan buy and sell\r\n19. Pos terminal\r\n20. Pangasinan bentahan online\r\n21. Dagupan calasiao buy and sell\r\n22. Baguio city BUY AND SELL\r\n23. Global offline and online pos\r\n24. Tarlac auto buy and sell\r\n25. Pangasinan market'),
(3661, 'ivan nunag', '2025-04-29', '12:44:16pm', 'DAY END REPORT 4/29/25\r\n\r\n-  FINISHED UPDATING THE RNZ COMPANY PROFILE, MAKE SURE IT HAS THE RIGHT AND UPDATED INFORMATION.\r\n\r\n- CREATED A SCHEDULE FOR MONTH OF MAY IN PAYROLL SYSTEM\r\n\r\n- ASSISTED ON-THE-JOB TRAINEES (OJTS) BY PROVIDING COMPREHENSIVE GUIDANCE ON MARKETING TOOLS AND DETAILED INFORMATION ABOUT THE RNZ POS SYSTEM.\r\n\r\n- REPLY AND ASSIST THE CLIENT ON THEIR INQUIRIES ON RNZ PAGE (MESSENGER)\r\n\r\n- POSTED AN RNZ ADVERTISEMENT TO POS GROUPS\r\n\r\n- MONITORED STAFF ATTENDANCE BY ENSURING PROPER ID TAPPING AND SYSTEM LOGIN.'),
(3662, 'OJT MARK', '2025-04-29', '04:30:57pm', ' Day End Report â€“ April 29, 2025 (Tuesday)\r\n\r\nAssisted Sir Lance\r\nHelped with checking the unit for Ester Bataan.\r\n\r\nbox label mix-up contents did not match the label. Initiated checking of other units to verify consistency and avoid further mismatch.\r\nShared POS product advertisements on various Facebook groups\r\n\r\nGeneral POS-Related Groups\r\nPoint of Sale POS Philippines\r\nPOS for SALE Philippines\r\nPOS FOR SALE BUY AND SELL POS SUPPORT POS HARDWARE PHILIPPINES\r\nPOS System PHILIPPINES\r\nPOS for SALE in Philippines\r\nPoint Of Sale POS Software and Hardware Group\r\nPOS Suppliers Philippines\r\nPoint of Sale Software POS\r\nPos terminal\r\nPoint of Sale Group\r\nPoint of Sale POS Solutions Softwares and Hardware\r\nPos system\r\nBarcode scanner barcode printer pos system\r\nScangle POS system and point of sales ECR POS Community\r\nMURANG POINT OF SALE POS\r\nGlobal offline and online Pos GOOP\r\nPOS SYSTEM PHILIPPINES\r\nPampanga Angeles Mabalacat San Fernando Area Buy and Sell Groups\r\n\r\nCITY OF ANGELES BUY AND'),
(3663, 'DUKE ESGUERRA', '2025-04-29', '04:41:02pm', ' DAY END REPORT\r\nDate: April 29 2025\r\n\r\nJohnnys Supermarket - Blank Transaction Number Issue\r\n\r\nReprogrammed the file responsible for generating transaction numbers\r\n\r\nConducted a series of tests to verify that the issue no longer occurs\r\n\r\nUploaded the corrected version of the file to Johnnys Supermarket server\r\n\r\nConfirmed that transaction numbers are now generating properly during sales operations\r\n\r\nJohnnys Supermarket - Negative Quantity in Stock Ledger\r\n\r\nInvestigated the appearance of negative quantities in the stock ledger\r\n\r\nPerformed extensive testing on both Quantity In Receiving and Quantity Out Issuance transactions\r\n\r\nAfter multiple test runs determined that the negative stock issue was not due to a system bug\r\n\r\nRoot cause was identified as human error during manual encoding of stock transactions\r\n\r\nDiscussed the findings with Sir Cicer and explained how manual input errors can result in negative balances\r\n\r\nSir Cicer confirmed that he will visit the office tomorrow morn'),
(3664, 'Lance Garcia', '2025-04-29', '04:47:02pm', 'DAY END REPORT\r\n-post RNZ advertisement in various groups:\r\n1. LINGAYEN PANGASINAN BUY AND SELL\r\n2. Sison Buy And Sell Pangasinan\r\n3. LINGAYEN-Bugallon-Aguilar-Binmaley PANGASINAN Buy and Sell\r\n4. PANGASINAN BUY AND SELL TAYUG AREA ONLY\r\n5. PANGASINAN BUY AND SELL\r\n6. TABUN MABALACAT BUY AND SELL\r\n7. Pangasinan Buy and Sell ng Kahit Ano\r\n8.  Pangasinan Group of Buy and sell online business traders\r\n9. Tarlac buy and sell\r\n10. Mangaldan Buy And Sell Pangasinan Philippines\r\n11. Fiesta Tabun Mabalacat Buy and Sell\r\n12. Point Of Sale POS Software  Hardware Group\r\n13. Magalang Angeles Mabalacat and Clark - Buy and Sell\r\n\r\n-reply ESTER BATAAN concerns about the 1 set PC\r\n\r\n-Set up one 1 PC unit. Check all components thoroughly. Install an additional 4GB RAM. Test the functionality of the keyboard and mouse. Verify that the monitor is working properly.\r\n'),
(3665, 'OJT KYLE', '2025-04-29', '04:47:52pm', 'DAY END REPORT\r\n\r\nOFFICE GROUNDS MAINTENANCE\r\nConducted a thorough cleaning of the office exterior areas to ensure a tidy professional and inviting atmosphere for both staff and visitors\r\n\r\nSOCIAL MEDIA PROMOTION SIR RABBIS VLOG\r\nPromoted Sir Rabbis latest vlog by sharing it across various Facebook groups dedicated to vloggers content creators and video enthusiasts The goal was to expand its visibility boost viewership and increase engagement through likes comments and shares\r\n\r\nSOCIAL MEDIA CONTENT CREATION\r\nCreated a promotional graphic using Canva showcasing the STANDARD and TOUCH packages of RNZ Software Development Services Point of Sale POS System to strengthen brand presence and attract potential clients\r\n\r\nMARKETING OUTREACH RNZ SOFTWARE POS PROMOTION\r\nShared RNZ Softwares POS system marketing post in several Facebook groups focused on POS systems and related industries This targeted approach aimed to raise brand awareness reach a relevant audience and generate quality leads th'),
