(3667, 'DUKE ESGUERRA', '2025-04-30', '04:34:34pm', 'DAY END REPORT\r\nDate April 30 2025\r\n\r\n\r\n1. KidKid General Merchandise â€“ POS Login Issue\r\n\r\nIssue Reported\r\nThe staff at KidKid General Merchandise were unable to log in to their cashier terminal using their badge number and could not access the POS system\r\n\r\nFindings\r\nThe terminal was not connected to the RNZ router causing a network disconnection that prevented POS login and access\r\n\r\nAction Taken\r\nGuided the staff through a step by step walkthrough on how to reconnect the POS terminal to the RNZ router\r\nProvided instructions on identifying and troubleshooting similar connection issues in the future\r\n\r\n2. Stock Ledger Discrepancy â€“ SMP01 Terminal\r\n\r\nActivity\r\nDemonstrated to Sir Cicer the cause of negative or unsynchronized stock quantities in the office stock ledger\r\n\r\nFindings\r\nThe issue was traced to the SMP01 Terminal where item exchange transactions were incorrectly generating Sales Invoice SI numbers leading to inaccurate stock counts\r\n\r\nAction Taken and Instruction Received'),
