(3671, 'Lance Garcia', '2025-05-03', '04:31:24pm', '1. Access Beauty Express Telabastagan â€“ Cashier Icon Restoration\r\n\r\nIssue Reported\r\nThe Cashier application icon was missing from the desktop at Access Beauty Express Telabastagan and was believed to be deleted.\r\n\r\nFindings\r\nUpon inspection, it was found that the icon had been accidentally moved to the Recycle Bin.\r\n\r\nAction Taken\r\nAccessed the Recycle Bin and successfully restored the Cashier shortcut to the desktop.\r\nAdvised the staff to avoid accidental deletion and showed them how to manually create shortcuts as a backup measure.\r\n\r\n2. Buddys Mart Madapdap â€“ Onsite Monthly System Maintenance\r\n\r\nPurpose of Visit\r\nConducted an onsite visit to Buddys Mart Madapdap for scheduled monthly maintenance of their POS and back-office systems.\r\n\r\nSystems Maintained\r\n\r\n4 system units located in Buddys Mart Madapdap main store\r\n\r\n1 system unit located in their Bakelkel branch\r\n\r\nMaintenance Activities Performed\r\n\r\nCleaned internal hardware components to prevent overheating and dust buildup\r\n'),
