(3678, 'DUKE ESGUERRA', '2025-05-06', '04:46:45pm', ' DAY END REPORT\r\nDATE MAY 6 2025\r\n\r\nSUMMARY\r\n\r\nCLIENT REQUEST SHIFT END REPORT PRINTOUT M SQUARE BRANCH\r\nA CLIENT REQUESTED AN EXTRACT AND PRINTED COPY OF THEIR SHIFT END REPORT AT THE M SQUARE BRANCH THIS WAS DUE TO A POWER OUTAGE THAT DISRUPTED THE USUAL REPORT GENERATION PROCESS THE REPORT WAS SUCCESSFULLY RETRIEVED FROM THE SYSTEM AND PRINTED FOR THE CLIENT\r\n\r\nTECHNOTES INPUT LAST FRIDAY\r\nALL TECHNICAL NOTES FROM LAST FRIDAY HAVE BEEN COMPILED AND ACCURATELY ENTERED INTO THE SYSTEM THIS ENSURES CONSISTENT DOCUMENTATION AND TRACEABILITY OF SERVICE ACTIVITIES\r\n\r\nSALES ADJUSTMENT THE NEST SAMPALOC APRIL\r\nAPRIL SALES DATA FOR THE NEST SAMPALOC BRANCH WAS REVIEWED AND ADJUSTED TO CORRECT DISCREPANCIES THE UPDATES ARE NOW PROPERLY REFLECTED IN THE SYSTEM BASED ON VERIFIED TRANSACTION RECORDS\r\n\r\nSALES ADJUSTMENT THE NEST SAN PASCUAL APRIL\r\nSIMILAR ADJUSTMENTS WERE MADE TO THE SALES RECORDS OF THE NEST SAN PASCUAL BRANCH FOR APRIL THESE CORRECTIONS ARE NOW UPDATED AND VALIDATED IN THE SYST'),
(3679, 'OJT ARLFRAN', '2025-05-07', '04:12:13pm', ' DAY END REPORT\r\nMAY 07 2025\r\n\r\nUPON ARRIVING AT THE OFFICE I IMMEDIATELY SWEPT THE INSIDE AREA WHILE SIR CHANO CLEANED THE BACK AND LARWIN PROCEEDED TO MOP THE FLOOR\r\n\r\nWORKED ON THE LOGO LAYOUT SENT BY SIR RABBI CURRENTLY IN PROGRESS AND STILL UNDER REVISION\r\n\r\nSHARED SIR RABBIâ€™S LATEST POST IN VARIOUS FACEBOOK GROUPS INCLUDING REELS AND VLOGGERS COMMUNITIES\r\n\r\nRESHARED THE POS PACKAGE I POSTED LAST WEEK ACROSS DIFFERENT POS AND BUY AND SELL FACEBOOK GROUPS'),
(3680, 'OJT ARLFRAN', '2025-05-06', '04:12:26pm', ' DAY END REPORT\r\nMAY 06 2025\r\n\r\nAS USUAL SWEPT THE OFFICE FLOOR USING WALIS TIMBO WHILE LARWIN FOLLOWED UP WITH MOPPING\r\n\r\nSHARED MAâ€™AM CHARMAINEâ€™S REELS IN VARIOUS VLOGGERS AND FACEBOOK REELS GROUPS\r\n\r\nLOOKED FOR POTENTIAL CLIENTS IN POS GROUPS BY COMMENTING AND MESSAGING PROSPECTS ONE BY ONE\r\n\r\nWENT TO JOHNNYâ€™S WITH SIR CHANO USING LARWINâ€™S TRICYCLE TO PERFORM MONTHLY MAINTENANCE ON CASHIER UNITS STARTED BY BACKING UP EACH TERMINAL AND THEN PROCEEDED TO CLEAN EACH UNIT'),
