(3683, 'OJT KYLE', '2025-05-06', '04:33:32pm', ' DAY END REPORT  \r\n05062025  \r\n\r\nSOCIAL MEDIA PROMOTION SIR RABBIS VLOG  \r\nThe latest vlog by Sir Rabbi was strategically disseminated across various Facebook groups specifically geared toward vloggers digital content creators and video enthusiasts This effort was designed to expand the vlogs audience reach boost viewer engagement and foster interaction through increased likes comments and shares  \r\n\r\nMARKETING OUTREACH RNZ SOFTWARE POS PROMOTION  \r\nDisseminated RNZ Softwares POS system marketing post across multiple Facebook groups centered on PointofSale systems and related industries This targeted strategy aimed to enhance brand awareness engage a relevant audience and attract highquality leads through potential customer interest  \r\n\r\nOFFICE GROUNDS MAINTENANCE  \r\nThoroughly swept and mopped the office floors to maintain a clean safe and organized working environment  \r\nCleaned and sanitized the comfort room including the toilet sink and floor areas to ensure proper hygiene and a pl'),
(3684, 'Lance Garcia', '2025-05-07', '04:39:25pm', 'Objective:\r\nTo assist Edgar in locating and purchasing a 5G pocket WiFi device by contacting various computer shops in Angeles City.\r\n\r\nAction Plan:\r\nReach out to multiple computer and electronics shops in Angeles City to inquire about the availability of 5G pocket WiFi devices. The goal is to identify stores that currently have stock and gather details such as pricing, specifications, and purchasing options.');
