(3685, 'ivan nunag', '2025-05-07', '04:39:59pm', 'DAY END REPORT 5/7/25\r\n\r\n- CREATED AND EDITED A CUSTOM LOGO FOR TRANSITECH COMPANY BASED ON THEIR REQUESTED DESIGN PREFERENCES.\r\n\r\n- COMPILED ALL FINALIZED LOGO FILES AND SUBMITTED THEM TO SIR RABBI FOR REVIEW.\r\n\r\n- PREPARED A DETAILED QUOTATION INCLUDING PRICING AND PACKAGE OPTIONS FOR A POTENTIAL CLIENT.\r\n\r\n- RESPONDED TO CLIENT MESSAGES AND PROVIDED SUPPORT VIA THE RNZ FACEBOOK PAGE MESSENGER.\r\n\r\n- HANDLED CLIENT CALLS AND ANSWERED QUESTIONS REGARDING OUR POS SOLUTIONS AND SERVICES.\r\n\r\n- ACCURATELY INPUTTED EMPLOYEE OVERTIME RECORDS INTO THE SYSTEM FOR PAYROLL PROCESSING.\r\n\r\n- POSTED A PROMOTIONAL RNZ ADVERTISEMENT TO MULTIPLE POS-RELATED FACEBOOK GROUPS.\r\n\r\n- MONITORED STAFF ATTENDANCE BY ENSURING PROPER ID TAPPING AND SYSTEM LOGIN COMPLIANCE.'),
(3686, 'Lance Garcia', '2025-05-08', '04:31:46pm', '-Tech support request from Ester Farinas store: the system unit is not booting due to a BIOS error message.\r\n-Send announcement about no technical support on May 12 2025 due to ELECTION DAY in different group chats\r\n-Create a announcement aobut no technical support on May 12 2025 due to ELECTION DAY\r\n-Tech support request from Buddys mart to update their price in BAKELKEL STORE and BESTPRICE'),
(3687, 'OJT KYLE', '2025-05-08', '04:32:18pm', ' DAYEND REPORT  \r\nDate 05082025  \r\n\r\nTECHNICAL SUPPORT  \r\nChecked the monitor of the unit at Mylenes store to ensure it was functioning properly and addressed any immediate issues  \r\n\r\nSOCIAL MEDIA PROMOTION SIR RABBIS VLOG  \r\nShared Sir Rabbis latest vlog across multiple Facebook groups catering to vloggers and content creators to increase visibility enhance engagement and encourage viewer interaction  \r\n\r\nMARKETING INITIATIVE POS SYSTEM PROMO  \r\nPromoted RNZ Softwares POS system in targeted Facebook groups related to POS technologies to boost brand awareness engage relevant audiences and generate potential leads  \r\n\r\nFACILITY UPKEEP  \r\nSwept the exterior areas surrounding the office to maintain cleanliness reduce safety hazards and uphold a professional and tidy workplace environment  \r\n'),
(3688, 'CHRISTIAN BUNGQUE', '2025-05-08', '04:47:57pm', '-CALL THE BULILIT 3 TO WALK THROUGH ABOUT THEIR PRINTER HAVE ERROR, THEN MESSAGE MAM MARY TO UPDATE AND ASK IF THEY HAVE A EXTRA PRINTER SO THAT WE TEMPORALY INSTALLED IT\r\n-GO TO MYLENE STORE TO FIX THEIR MONITOR BECAUSE CLIENT SAID THE MONITOR THAS NOT TURN ON'),
(3689, 'DUKE ESGUERRA', '2025-05-09', '04:26:54pm', ' DAY END REPORT\r\nDate: May 9, 2025\r\n\r\nPrinter Driver Installation â€“ Atlanta Bulilit 3\r\n\r\nAccessed the system at Atlanta Bulilit 3 to address issues with their new Point-of-Sale (POS) printer.\r\n\r\nUninstalled the outdated or incompatible printer driver and performed a clean installation of the correct driver for the new POS printer.\r\n\r\nConducted a series of test prints to ensure the printer was fully operational.\r\n\r\nConfirmed with the on-site staff that the printer is now functioning correctly and integrated with the POS system.\r\n\r\nGlobe Internet Issue â€“ Head Office\r\n\r\nMade a follow-up call to Globe regarding the pending technician visit to address the office internet connectivity problem.\r\n\r\nGlobe technicians arrived and inspected the connection setup.\r\n\r\nIdentified and resolved the issue during their visit, successfully restoring stable internet connectivity at the office.\r\n\r\nVerified internet performance post-visit and confirmed functionality with multiple team members.\r\n\r\n'),
(3690, 'ivan nunag', '2025-05-09', '04:31:24pm', 'DAY END REPORT 5/9/25\r\n\r\n- WENT TO MAYBANK TO DEPOSIT MONEY INTO THE DESIGNATED ACCOUNT AND SECURE THE OFFICIAL RECEIPT.\r\n\r\n- PAY ELECTRICITY BILLS FOR OFFICE AND HOUSE AT ANGELES ELECTRIC CORPORATION.\r\n\r\n- CREATE A NEW EMAIL ACCOUNT FOR TRANS ITECH SOLUTIONS CORPORATION WITH SECURE LOGIN DETAILS.\r\n\r\n- GO TO 3 BIG BOYS OFFICE TO COLLECT THE OFFICIAL RECEIPT FOR SIR RABBI.\r\n\r\n- MEET MAâ€™AM ALMA AT ONE NORTH DAU TO COLLECT THE AGREED PAYMENT AND ISSUE A RECEIPT.\r\n\r\n- INPUT ODO OF EMPLOYEES AND OJT \r\n\r\n- POSTED A PROMOTIONAL RNZ ADVERTISEMENT TO MULTIPLE POS-RELATED FACEBOOK GROUPS.\r\n\r\n- MONITORED STAFF ATTENDANCE BY ENSURING PROPER ID TAPPING AND SYSTEM LOGIN COMPLIANCE.\r\n\r\n- RESPONDED TO CLIENT MESSAGES AND PROVIDED SUPPORT VIA THE RNZ FACEBOOK PAGE MESSENGER.'),
(3691, 'CHRISTIAN BUNGQUE', '2025-05-09', '04:46:34pm', '-CLEAN THE OFFICE THEN KEEP THE UNNESESSARY THING TO THEIR CORESPONDING PLACE\r\n-ASK THE CLIENT BULILIT 3 TO ACCESS THEIR POS THEN SAID TO DUKE TO INSTALL THAT PRINTER\r\n-CREATE A GC FOR OJTS TO MESSAGE THEIR ABOUT THEIR DOCUMENTS AND OTHERS TO SEND IT THEN CHECK THEIR DTR AND ALSO RE COMPUTE THEIR WORKING HOURS'),
(3692, 'OJT ARLFRAN', '2025-05-10', '04:31:41pm', ' DAY END REPORT\r\nMAY 10 2025\r\n\r\nAFTER BEING ABSENT FOR TWO DAYS UPON ARRIVING AT THE OFFICE I IMMEDIATELY SWEPT BOTH THE INSIDE AND BACK AREA WHILE LARWIN MOPPED THE FLOOR\r\n\r\nSHARED SIR RABBIâ€™S VIDEOS IN VARIOUS FACEBOOK GROUPS INCLUDING REELS VLOGGERS AND BISAYA COMMUNITIES\r\n\r\nALSO SHARED THE LATEST POST FROM RNZ SOFTWARE DEVELOPMENT SERVICES AND RESHARED THE POS PACKAGE POST I MADE\r\n\r\nBROUGHT OUT AND ARRANGED THREE POS UNITS TO CHECK WHAT COMPONENTS ARE STILL NEEDED TO COMPLETE EACH SETUP\r\n\r\nTOGETHER WITH LARWIN WE MOPPED THE OFFICE INCLUDING THE AREA NEAR THE DOOR SINCE RAINWATER CAME IN DUE TO THE HEAVY RAIN'),
(3693, 'CHRISTIAN BUNGQUE', '2025-05-10', '04:42:28pm', '-SUPPORT GLGM ABOUT THEIR PRODUCT TO CREATE A CUSTOMIZE BARCODE THEN PUNCH IT TO CASHIER\r\n-CHECK ALL THE DOCOUMENTS OF OJTS AND COMPUTE ALSO THEIR TIME AND THEIR REMAINING HRS\r\n-GO TO MYLENE TO CHECK THEIR POS, CREATE AND SEND QOUTATION FOR NEW POS UNIT\r\n-CREATE A REPORT REGARDING TO HARDWARES OF SRA AND ALSO THE HARDWARES THAT NEED TO ORDER'),
(3694, 'ivan nunag', '2025-05-13', '01:52:22pm', 'DAY END REPORT 5/13/25\r\n\r\n- STARTED EDITING RNZ VIDEO ADVERTISEMENT FOR POSTING BY COLLECTING VIDEOS AND MAKING SCRIPT FOR VOICE OVER.\r\n\r\n- PREPARE SRA HARDWARES AND PUT THEM ON THE CAR FOR DELIVERY.\r\n\r\n- POSTED THE NEW EDITED ADVERTISEMENT TO MULTIPLE POS-RELATED FACEBOOK GROUPS.\r\n\r\n- PREPARED A DETAILED QUOTATION INCLUDING PRICING AND PACKAGE OPTIONS FOR A POTENTIAL CLIENT.\r\n\r\n- MONITORED STAFF ATTENDANCE BY ENSURING PROPER ID TAPPING AND SYSTEM LOGIN COMPLIANCE.\r\n\r\n- RESPONDED TO CLIENT MESSAGES AND PROVIDED SUPPORT VIA THE RNZ FACEBOOK PAGE MESSENGER.'),
(3695, 'OJT ARLFRAN', '2025-05-13', '04:35:12pm', ' DAY END REPORT\r\nMAY 13 2025\r\n\r\nHELPED LOAD ALL POS UNITS AND EQUIPMENT INTO SIR DUKEâ€™S CAR FOR DELIVERY EACH ITEM WAS CAREFULLY PLACED INTO THE VEHICLE ONE BY ONE\r\n\r\nCLEANED THE BACK AREA OF THE OFFICE WHERE THERE WAS A LOT OF RAT DROPPINGS AND SCATTERED TRASH ALL WASTE WAS COLLECTED AND DISPOSED INTO THE TRASH BIN\r\n\r\nSHARED SIR RABBIâ€™S VIDEO ACROSS MULTIPLE FACEBOOK GROUPS INCLUDING REELS VLOGGERS AND BISAYA COMMUNITIES\r\n\r\nALSO SHARED POSTS FROM THE RNZ SOFTWARE DEVELOPMENT SERVICES PAGE INCLUDING THE SUMMER POS PACKAGE I ORIGINALLY POSTED BACK IN APRIL TO VARIOUS POS AND BUY AND SELL GROUPS\r\n\r\nATTEMPTED TO SHARE SIR RABBIâ€™S NEWEST POST BUT REACHED FACEBOOKâ€™S DAILY SHARING LIMIT\r\n\r\n'),
