(3697, 'Lance Garcia', '2025-05-13', '04:45:57pm', '-Onsite Visit Report\r\n\r\nClient: SRA Mini Grocery\r\n\r\nPurpose of Visit:\r\n\r\nDelivery of 2 sets of Point of Sale POS systems\r\n\r\nInstallation and setup of 1 set of POS system on-site\r\n\r\nActivities Carried Out:\r\n\r\nDelivered 2 complete POS units to the store.\r\n\r\nUnpacked and physically installed 1 POS system at the designated counter.\r\n\r\nConfigured the installed POS with the storeâ€™s hardware and network.\r\n\r\nInstalled and activated necessary POS software and peripherals receipt printer, barcode scanner, cash drawer etc.\r\nConducted initial testing of the installed system to ensure proper functionality.\r\n\r\nProvided basic training and orientation to store staff on how to operate the POS system.\r\n\r\nNoted feedback and any specific customization requests from the client if any.\r\n\r\nRemaining Task:\r\n\r\nThe second POS unit remains boxed and ready for installation at the clientâ€™s discretion.\r\n\r\nRemarks:\r\nThe setup was completed successfully. The system is fully operational and ready for daily transac'),
