(3703, 'DUKE ESGUERRA', '2025-05-15', '04:29:58pm', ' DAY END REPORT\r\nDATE MAY 15 2025\r\n\r\nDATA CLEANUP AND MONITORING â€“ BARRIER SYSTEM\r\n\r\nConducted a comprehensive review of the Barrier System database\r\n\r\nIdentified and deleted entries containing blank or incomplete data fields to maintain system accuracy and performance\r\n\r\nACCOUNT RECALIBRATION â€“ NEGATIVE BALANCES\r\n\r\nRefilled or reset all passenger accounts with negative balances\r\n\r\nSet each affected account to a standardized value of 2000 on the Barrier System Admin side to ensure consistency and usability across all users\r\n\r\nSYSTEM TESTING â€“ MODIFIED PAGES BY SIR RABBI\r\n\r\nPerformed functionality and interface testing on pages recently modified by Sir Rabbi\r\n\r\nVerified that changes were implemented correctly and assessed system stability after modification\r\n\r\nLogged observations for any inconsistencies or bugs for future follow up'),
