(3712, 'DUKE ESGUERRA', '2025-05-20', '04:56:45pm', ' DAY END REPORT\r\nMAY 20 2025\r\n\r\nBarrier System Monitoring and Passenger Reporting\r\n\r\nMonitored the barrier system throughout the day to ensure smooth operations and security\r\n\r\nConducted regular checks and reported the onboard passenger count to Mr Edgar for headcount validation and documentation purposes\r\n\r\nVisit to Elvistra â€“ Resto POS System Concerns\r\n\r\nVisited Elvistra to address their concerns regarding the Restaurant POS system\r\n\r\nDiscussed the issues with Maam Aira and proposed a full reset of the product list and inventory quantities set to zero This will allow their team to reconcile the actual stock and match it accurately in the POS for proper tracking and reporting\r\n\r\nHotel Pricing Request\r\n\r\nThe hotel management requested the reversion of their room rates to the original pricing structure removing all existing promotional discounts\r\n\r\nThis change aims to restore the standard room rates as previously implemented before the promo period'),
