(3725, 'DUKE ESGUERRA', '2025-06-09', '04:58:07pm', ' DAY END REPORT\r\nDate: June 09, 2025\r\n\r\n1. Client: Ester Morong\r\n\r\nIssue: POS device could not connect to the RNZ router.\r\n\r\nAction Taken: Diagnosed and resolved network connectivity issues, successfully re-established connection between the POS system and the RNZ router.\r\n\r\nAdditional Tasks:\r\n\r\nInvestigated and recovered missing sales transactions dated June 04, 2025.\r\n\r\nAdjusted the receipt layout to resize the printed receipt according to client preferences.\r\n\r\n2. Client: Sorisso Restaurant\r\n\r\nIssue 1: Kitchen printer receipts were displaying unnecessary information.\r\n\r\nAction Taken: Removed the device name from the kitchen receipt output.\r\n\r\nConfigured the system to display remarks only if remarks are provided.\r\n\r\nIssue 2: Receipts included VAT, which was not required.\r\n\r\nAction Taken: Disabled VAT display on all printed receipts in accordance with client instructions.\r\n\r\nIssue 3: Payment method was not appearing on the Day End Report.\r\n\r\nAction Taken: Identified and fixed the codi'),
