(208, '76279988', '2021-08-10', 'HANZ ALCANZARE', 'QC', 'Janiel Manalang', 'THE CLIENT WANT A REFUND IN SOFTWARE', 'THE CLIENT WANT A REFUND IN SOFTWARE', 'CHECK FIRST IF THE POS IS INSTALL IN COMPUTER IF  DID NOT  INSTALL OUR POS  DON`T PROCESS  THE REFUND', 'PENDING'),
