(263, '29710074', '2021-07-22', 'Lyn Prado', 'Sta. Teresita Quezon City', 'Janiel Manalang', 'THE SYSTEM UNIT TURNED OFF AFTER FEW MINUTES UPON TURNING ON AND THEN WE WILL WAIT TWO DAYS BEFORE WE CAN TURN ON AGAIN', 'THE POWER SUPPLY IS  NOT WORKING PROPERLY,\r\nTHE SLEEP MODE IS NOT TURNED OFF', 'WHEN WE ARRIVED AT THEIR STORE I CHECK THE COMPONENTS OF THE SYSTEM CLIENT AND THEY ARE ALL GOOD IN CONDITION THAT`S WHY AFTER THAT I ALREADY COME UP WITH THE SOLUTION THAT THE SLEEP MODE OF THE SYSTEM CLIENT IS NOT TURNED OFF. AND THEN AS SOON I TURNED ON AGAIN I TOLD MS. CRISTINA THE ACCESS THE POS FROM 1PM TO 4PM UNTIL WE CAME BACK  FORM MANAGER`S AND SHE TOLD US THAT POS  IS NOT TURNED OFF OR FORCE SHUTDOWN. EVEN IF IT`S IDLE OR NO INTERACTIONS BETWEEN THE USER AND THE POS\r\n\r\n\r\nACKNOWLEDGEME', 'DONE'),
