(865, '58355097', '2022-03-04', 'LERMA OCAMPO', 'ANGELES CITY', 'Janiel Manalang', 'THE POS CAN BE OPEN BECAUSE SOME OF ISSUE .', 'THE CAUSE FOR THAT ISSUE THE  XAMPP OF THE COMPUTER HAVE AN ERROR OR PROBLEM .', 'CHECK THE XAMPP UPON CHECKING THE  XAMPP HAVE AN ERROR THE APACHE CAN NOT BE  START . REINSTALL THE  XAMPP AND INSTALL IT AGAIN.', 'DONE'),
