(867, '58355097', '2022-03-05', 'LERMA OCAMPO', 'ANGELES CITY', 'Rabbi Zamora', '] client chat in, inform us that the pos is not running.', '] xamp is not working\r\n] check xamp for issues\r\n] ask tech questions. the client provides the answer. ask client to access pos tru anydesk.', '] upon checking the concern, tech found out that the xamp is not setup to auto run mode. \r\n] tech setup the xamp into autorun mode\r\n] xamp is now working. tech run the pos and it is now working properly\r\n] ask the client to restart pos.\r\n] ask customer to login and run it.\r\n] client confirmed that pos is now working properly', 'concern is resolved and completed');
