(868, '15724957', '2022-03-07', 'MR OGIE ABESAMIS', 'TALAVERA NUEVA ECIJA', 'Janiel Manalang', 'Client chat to inform us that the server is not connected to the server.', 'the router is a turnoff\r\nthe ip address change.', 'ï‚·upon checking the concern, the server is not connected to the cashier. because the router of the server need to rebooting to connected in the server ping again after checking that the server and cashier are connected already.\r\nï‚·ask customer to login and run it.\r\nï‚·client confirmed that pos is now working properly', 'CLOSED'),
