(903, '15724957', '2022-03-21', 'MR OGIE ABESAMIS', 'TALAVERA NUEVA ECIJA', 'aeron elison', 'Client chat in, inform us that the POS  monitor is not working properly.', ']The power cable is broken.\r\n]Broken monitor', ']Upon checking the concern the tech found out that the power cable is broken. \r\n]tech replace the power cable and the monitor is under observation. \r\n]tech will bring back the monitors after testing on first week of April.', 'done'),
