(907, '86334091', '2022-03-25', 'SUBIC SBGPFSI INC RESTO WITH SERVER', 'SUBIC FREE PORT ZONE', 'c ilagan', 'XXThe client inform us to void the double transaction in sales report record.', 'XXThe cashier was in a hurry so he didn`t realize if he had cleared his cart or if he had accidentally pressed f5.', 'XXdelete the double transaction record in database.\r\nXXStep by step process on how I resolve the issue:\r\n]first I backup the database then, I go to bucket itemcount then check for the duplicate record then delete it, after that I go to bucket reportitemcount then delete also the duplicate records same process with the transaction logs. \r\n', 'DONE'),
(908, '24838551', '2022-03-24', 'MARCRIELLE HARWARE AND LUMBER TRADING', 'NUEVA ECIJA', 'aeron elison', 'Client chat in and tell us on the site that she wants to upgrade one of her POS to SSD drive and windows 10. And the client also told us to network the new POS she bought, and ask us to network printer share.', 'Client chat in and tell us on the site that she wants to upgrade one of her POS to SSD drive and windows 10. And the client also told us to network the new POS she bought, and ask us to network printer share.', 'We do all the client request.\r\n]We troubleshoot the network for printer sharing.\r\n]We format the terminal 1 pos to windows 10 and clean the pc.\r\n] We network the new POS  to connect into the server.\r\n', 'Done/Close'),
