(914, '84996212', '2022-03-25', 'JOEL  CLARK', 'CLARK', 'Janiel Manalang', 'THE CLIENT INFORM  US ABOUT THE  DISCOUNT,  FONT SIZE IN THE RECEIPT  AND VOIDING DOUBLE TRANSACTION.', 'UPON CHECKING THAT CONCERN THEY DID NOT PROPERLY USE THE  PROPER  PROCESS IN THE POS \r\n\r\n\r\nTHEY DIDN`T CLEARCART AFTER TRANSACTION', 'FIRST: I BACKUP THE POS UNIT. \r\nSECOND:  I RESIZE THE FONT SIZE IN THE SCALE OF THE PRINTER SETTING\r\nTHIRD:  I REMOVE THE   DOUBLE TRANSACTION IN THE DATABASE  ITEM  BUCKET COUNT. \r\n4TH. TEACH THE  CLIENT  IN THE  DISCOUNT FOR  SPECIFIC REPORT HOW THE PROCESS  DISCOUNT.\r\n\r\n\r\nANSWER THE CLIENT IF THEY HAVE CONCERN  CLIENT HAVE CONCERN IN THE  ADMIN ACCOUNT TO RESIZE THE PROFIT  BOXES.', 'DONE/CLOSED'),
