(918, '86334091', '2022-03-25', 'SUBIC SBGPFSI INC RESTO WITH SERVER', 'SUBIC FREE PORT ZONE', 'c ilagan', 'XXThe Client inform us to void the pending table because its already processed.', 'XXThe cashier was in a hurry so he didn`t realize if he had cleared his cart or if he had accidentally pressed f5.', 'XXThe first step we made is to backup the whole database.\r\nXXThen we go to tab_pos to delete the existing logs.\r\nXXThen we go to bucket_tableadmin to delete also the existing logs to clear all table in the cashier POS.\r\n', 'DONE'),
(919, '1599692', '2022-03-26', 'RICKY CANLAS', 'ANGELES CITY', 'Rabbi Zamora', 'client chat in, inform us that they have a double punch transaction', 'possible cause is un stable internet connection since their system is upload online\r\n\r\npossible reason asawell that the computer refresh automatically that is why the system insert another transaction in the system', 'ask the client what is the SI num of the double transaction\r\n\r\nthe client provided the SI num\r\n\r\nupon checking the data server in the cloud it has double transaction\r\n\r\ntech support deleted the double transaction and delete the double item in the system', 'ask for other concern client no other concern client confirm problem is resolved'),
(920, '1599692', '2022-03-26', 'RICKY CANLAS', 'ANGELES CITY', 'Rabbi Zamora', 'client chat in, inform us that they a mistake in the restocking of their products in the admin page\r\n', '-the possible cause is mispunch on the qty of that particular item\r\n', '-tech support check the deliveries on that particular date provided by the client\r\n-tech ask maam che to check the deliveries on that date\r\n-maam che confirm that there has a mispunch on the restocking of the item\r\n-since maam che doesnt have any access to change the qty\r\n-tech support edit the qty on the server and also the qty in the delivery report to make it more accurate data\r\n-ask to check the data after editing them\r\n-maam che confirmed all data are accurate', '-ask about on how she can restock the item that has 0 qty -tech support provided the specific answer on this process client confirm problem is resolved'),
(921, '1599692', '2022-03-26', 'RICKY CANLAS', 'ANGELES CITY', 'Rabbi Zamora', 'client chat in, inform us that the QTY of 265-60-18 ARIVO TERRAMAX ARV PRO is still showing 0 in the POS server', '-tech support oversight to change the QTY last tech concern in the cloud server', '-tech support manually edited the QTY in the cloud server\r\n-maam stacy confirmed that qty is already correct', '-ask for other concern -client inform no other concern and the issue resolved'),
(922, '86334091', '2022-03-26', 'SUBIC SBGPFSI INC RESTO WITH SERVER', 'SUBIC FREE PORT ZONE', 'Rabbi Zamora', 'client chat in, inform us that they wanted to delete the transaction canceled by the food panda customer', '-their customer canceled the order from the food panda', '-since it is BIR accredited we can not delete any transactions in the pos', '-still pending, the provider will check other options about the issue -inform the client to provide reso on Monday -client confirmed'),
(923, '24838551', '2022-03-26', 'MARCRIELLE HARWARE AND LUMBER TRADING', 'NUEVA ECIJA', 'Rabbi Zamora', 'client chat in, inform us about the high temperature that she on the terminal 1', '-tech support will check on monday, march 28 2022, and provide proper resolution on this issue\r\n', '-all tech support are fully aware of the issue\r\n-inform the client to have an onsite tech on the said date', '-pending concern'),
(924, '24838551', '2022-03-28', 'MARCRIELLE HARWARE AND LUMBER TRADING', 'NUEVA ECIJA', 'aeron elison', 'Client chat in, Inform us about CPU not turning off after shutting down and over heating. ', ']Windows Update not finish\r\n]lack of windows drivers \r\n] Thermal paste for over heating.\r\n', '] Tech will update the windows\r\n] Tech will install all the drivers\r\n] Tech will change the thermal paste.\r\n]Tech will set the power option.', 'pending.'),
(925, '5572912', '2022-03-28', 'EURIKA ANN ORACAY', 'RODRIGUEZ, RIZAL', 'Janiel Manalang', ' WE ADVISE THE CLIENT   ABOUT NEW UPDATES IN THE POS LIKE THE EXPIRATION DATE OF THE PRODUCT.\r\n', 'THE CLIENT WANTS TO HAVE A DIFFERENT  EXPIRATION DATE ON THE ITEM.', 'FIRST I BACK UP BOTH FILES AND SQL.\r\nSECOND I TEST THE PHARMACY CASHIER AND GROCERY TO CHECK IF THEY PING EACH OTHER.\r\nAFTER TESTING  I WILL  DISCUSS THE NEW UPDATE WITH MS  APRIL.\r\nAND ASK THEM IF THEY HAVE CONCERNS.\r\nNO OTHER CONCERN FOR MA`AM APRIL.', 'DONE'),
(926, '24838551', '2022-03-28', 'MARCRIELLE HARWARE AND LUMBER TRADING', 'NUEVA ECIJA', 'aeron elison', 'Client chat in, Inform us about CPU not turning off after shutting down and over heating.', 'Windows update need to finish.\r\nLack of windows drivers\r\nThermal paste for overheating.\r\nWindows 10 is not compatible in intel 2nd generation processor and mother board.', 'Tech update the drivers of the exceeding operating system -- status system unit still not turning off after shutdown.\r\n\r\nTech install different drivers to make sure that the system will not lack in any drivers. - status still not turning off after shutdown.\r\n\r\nTech try to test the old hard disk of the system unit to verify that is a software malfunction -- status the system unit is shutting down and turning off . \r\n\r\nTech last resort is to format the unit in windows 7.\r\n\r\nTech reformat the syste', 'Done'),
(927, '15724957', '2022-03-29', 'MR OGIE ABESAMIS', 'TALAVERA NUEVA ECIJA', 'c ilagan', 'XXExpanding database.', 'XXto avoid error.', 'XXhere`s the step by step procedure apply to expanding database.\r\n\r\nADD to phpmyadmin/config.inc.php\r\nXXcfg[`ExecTimeLimit`] XX 6000XX\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\nAnd Change php.ini\r\n\r\npost_max_size XX 750M\r\nupload_max_filesize XX 750M\r\nmax_execution_time XX 5000\r\nmax_input_time XX 5000\r\nmemory_limit XX -1\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\nAnd Change my.ini\r\nmax_allowed_packet XX 200M (in my.ini)\r\n\r\nrestart XAMP\r\n', 'DONE!'),
(928, '24838551', '2022-03-29', 'MARCRIELLE HARWARE AND LUMBER TRADING', 'NUEVA ECIJA', 'c ilagan', 'XXExpanding database.', 'XXto avoid error.', 'XXhere`s the step by step procedure apply to expanding database.\r\nADD to phpmyadmin/config.inc.php\r\nXXcfg[`ExecTimeLimit`] XX 6000XX\r\nAnd Change php.ini\r\npost_max_size XX 750M\r\nupload_max_filesize XX 750M\r\nmax_execution_time XX 5000\r\nmax_input_time XX 5000\r\nmemory_limit XX -1\r\nAnd Change my.ini\r\nmax_allowed_packet XX 200M (in my.ini)\r\n\r\nrestart XAMP\r\n', 'DONE'),
(929, '5572912', '2022-03-30', 'EURIKA ANN ORACAY', 'RODRIGUEZ, RIZAL', 'Janiel Manalang', 'REASON\r\nTHE CLIENT INFORM US ABOUT THE POS SLOWLY PROCESSED IN THE CASHIER AND ADMIN SIDE\r\n', '\r\nCAUSE\r\nTHE POS UNIT CONSOLIDATED AND THEY HAVE AN NETWORK\r\nUPON CHECKING THE POS UNIT NEED TO BE RESTARTED.', 'RESOLUTION\r\n1ST I CHECK THE CASHIER  SHORTCUT AND THE ADMIN.\r\nI RESTART THE POS UNIT BECAUSE MA`AM IKA`S TOLD ME ABOUT ONLY THE  MONITOR TURNOFF  AND I RESTART THE POS UNIT TO AVOID THAT ERROR.\r\nUPON RESTARTING  THE POS UNIT I CHECK AND PROCESSED ON THE ADMIN SIDE ALREADY OK NO ERROR LIKE BEFORE.\r\nASK THEM IF THEY HAVE OTHER CONCERNS.\r\n', 'done'),
(930, '86334091', '2022-03-30', 'SUBIC SBGPFSI INC RESTO WITH SERVER', 'SUBIC FREE PORT ZONE', 'Janiel Manalang', '\r\nREASON:\r\nTHE CLIENT INFORM US ABOUT THE SALES ON AUGUST 31, 2021 SEPTEMBER 14, 2021', 'CAUSE:\r\nBECAUSE THE NEW UPDATE ARE ALREADY IMPLEMENTED THAT THE OLD TRANSACTION ERASE STARTS TO NEW POS.', 'REASON:\r\nI RENDER THE  2 POS SQL IN THE BOTH POS IN THE SUBIC RESTO\r\nAFTER I RENDER I SAVE IT AS  PDF THE FILES.\r\nWE SEND TO IN ACCOUNTING STAFF OF SUBIC.', 'DONE'),
(931, '84996212', '2022-03-31', 'JOEL  CLARK', 'CLARK', 'Janiel Manalang', 'Client inform us that the manager needs to teach about the inventory of the POS and  Want a onsite visit', 'Client inform us that the manager needs to teach about the inventory of the POS and  Want a onsite visit', 'Client inform us that the manager needs to teach about the inventory of the POS and  Want a onsite visit', 'PENDING'),
(932, '84996212', '2022-03-31', 'JOEL  CLARK', 'CLARK', 'Janiel Manalang', 'Client inform us that the manager needs to teach about the inventory in the POS ', 'TO CHECK THE INVENTORY PER PORTION.\r\nTO HAVE AN RECORD OF BEGINNING QTY AND ENDING.', 'FIRST I BACKUP THE POS FILES AND SQL.\r\nSECOND  WE TEACH THE MANAGER HOW ADD THE ingredients in the pos  to become a inventory.\r\n\r\nAFTER ADDING THE INGREDIENTS IN THE PRODUCT .\r\n\r\nfor example the  item is CHICKEN ADOBO CLICK THAT ITEM AND FIND ITEM SOURCE  AND THE  item source make it CHICKEN  is ingredients  under the item use make 1.\r\n\r\n', 'done'),
(933, '39086667', '2022-04-01', 'Lloyd Jansen Trinidad', 'Baliti, San Fernando City', 'c ilagan', 'Monthly Maintenance of the POS', 'For cleaning the POS', 'Backup and cleaning the POS and checking monthly sales.', 'DONE'),
(934, '5572912', '2022-04-01', 'EURIKA ANN ORACAY', 'RODRIGUEZ, RIZAL', 'Janiel Manalang', 'THE CLIENT INFORM US ABOUT SALES ON MARCH 29 AND 30  COMBINING ON MARCH 30.', 'THE WRONG DATE OF THE COMPUTER.\r\n', 'FIRST I CHECK THE DATE IN THE ITEM COUNT \r\nAFTER CHECKING THE DATE I CHANGE THE  DATE IN THE COMPUTER SETTING AND CHANGE THE TIME ZONE.\r\nAND CLICK THE DAY END REPORT AND CHECK IF THE MARCH 31 AND  APRIL 1 COMBINE BUT UPON CHECKING THE SALES OF  MARCH 31,2022  NOT APPEAR IN THE  APRIL 1 \r\nTHE POS IS READY TO USE.', 'DONE'),
(935, '51842014', '2022-04-04', 'KGG MINIMART', 'MAKATI', 'Janiel Manalang', '\r\nREASON\r\nXXFOR UPDATING THE MONTLY MAINTENANCE OF THE POS.', 'CAUSE\r\nXXFOR CHECKING AND LESS THE MONTLY SALES OF THE CLIENT', 'XXFIRST I BACKUP THE POS FILES AND SQL.\r\nXXCOPY AND REPLACE THE NEW UPDATE AND PASTE IN THE POS  DATABASE OF THE CLIENT\r\nXXBUCKET_ITEMCOUNT\r\nXXBUCKET_RECEIPT\r\nXXbucket_voiditems\r\nXXbucket_discountlist\r\nXXINFORM THE CLIENT UPDATE ALREADY DONE.', 'DONE'),
(936, '86305927', '2022-04-04', 'WOWA HARDWARES', 'EPZA', 'aeron elison', 'Client chat in to order one box of thermal paper and to check their printer.', 'Lack of electricity', '] We put the printer in other usb port\r\n] We also put the printer in other outlet. status working properly.\r\nmain issue is electricity', 'done'),
