(938, '5572912', '2022-04-04', 'EURIKA ANN ORACAY', 'RODRIGUEZ, RIZAL', 'Janiel Manalang', 'THE CLIENT INFORM US ABOUT THE SLOWLY POS.\r\n	', 'XX THE CLIENT INFORM US ABOUT THE SLOWLY POS.\r\nXX Because the of the transmit of the data of the pos.	\r\n', 'RESOLUTION\r\nXXmake a video  about the pos and told client about the pos not slowly.\r\nno other concern.\r\n', 'DONE'),
