(956, '58449021', '2022-04-18', 'MR OGIE ABESAMIS', 'TALAVERA NUEVA ECIJA', 'aeron elison', 'Client chat in about the system unit turning on and off and no input signal', 'Lack of electricity \r\nThe POS unit don`t have UPS\r\nRAM Failure.', 'Tech ask the client to try different Power Cable. still not working\r\n\r\nTech Clean the ram of the system unit. still not working\r\n\r\nTech replace the ram of the system unit. working properly \r\n\r\nTech conclude that the main problem of the system unit is  Ram Failure.\r\n\r\n\r\nHIGHLY RECOMMENDED \r\nAll POS unit need to have a UPS. Terminal 1, Terminal 3, and ATlanta fuel.', 'done'),
(957, '89926306', '2022-04-18', 'lolay store concepcion', 'CONCEPCION', 'Janiel Manalang', 'The client inform us about the POS not working. ', 'CAUSE OF THE  ISSUE THE RAM SLOT 1 NOT WORKING.', '@ FIRST I CLEAN THE POS UNIT AFTER CLEAN THE POS UNIT . \r\n@ I CHECK THE POS UNIT IF ALREADY WORKING THE POS UNIT.\r\n@UPON CHECKING THE POS UNIT THE RAM SLOT 1  NOT WORKING AND THE RAM IS WORKING  AND ONLY 1 RAM SLOT AND I ADVICE THE CLIENT 1 ONLY SLOT WORKING  IN THE MOTHER BOARD.', 'DONE'),
(958, '5572912', '2022-04-20', 'EURIKA ANN ORACAY', 'RODRIGUEZ, RIZAL', 'aeron elison', 'Negative value on the Exchange Item', 'Lower value on the exchange Item.', 'POS System of maam ika is ready for BIR registration, thats why as of 2021 rule of BIR Item exchange need to be higher or equal amount to exhange item, because BIR rule that the item that already taxed is not returnable.   ', 'done'),
