(1019, '5572912', '2022-04-29', 'EURIKA ANN ORACAY', 'RODRIGUEZ, RIZAL', 'aeron elison', 'Client chat in, Tell a concern about the sales of grocery and pharmacy are not tallied.', 'Human error,\r\nDuplicate barcodes.\r\nwrong process of the cashier', 'We back up the system and try to process in the office and its working properly .\r\nWe check the items that process on that certain date and we see errors on the quantity.\r\n\r\nOn Monday  we will check and process the products that process on the dayend report of maam nette to verify and prove that its not a system failure.', 'Pending'),
