(1040, '48486660', '2022-05-06', 'MARIE FRANCESS DIZON 2ND BRANCH', 'ANGELES CITY', 'Janiel Manalang', 'THE CLIENT INFORM US ABOUT THE POS NOT RUNNING. ', 'BECAUSE THE O.S OF THE  COMPUTER IS CORRUPTED.', 'UNDER MAINTENANCE ', 'PENDING....'),
(1041, '35595862', '2022-05-06', 'IRENE IGNACIO', 'VICTORIA TARLAC', 'keil ilagan', 'Client inform us that one of their item not found in the system', 'the root cause of the issue is the item they register have a space in the end of the item name.', 'tech inform the client to edit the item name and delete the space at the end of the item name.', 'DONE!'),
(1042, '48486660', '2022-05-10', 'MARIE FRANCESS DIZON 2ND BRANCH', 'ANGELES CITY', 'Janiel Manalang', 'THE CLIENT INFORM US ABOUT THE COMPUTER NOT RUNNING.', 'POSSIBLE CAUSE FOR THAT   ISSUE THE POS HAVE AN CORRUPTED O.S THAT WHY THE COMPUTER DID NOT OPEN.', 'WE  BACKUP THE FILES AND  SQL TO HAVE AN  BACKUP  TO TRANSFER TO ANOTHER XAMPP AND CHECKING IF RUNNING.\r\n\r\nAFTER THAT WE  REFORMAT THE HARDDISK  OF THE POS TO ERASE ALL VIRUS AND FILES NOT NEEDED\r\n\r\nAFTER REFORMAT WE INSTALL THE XAMPP ALL APPLICATION NEEDED TO RUN THE POS AFTER THAT WE  TEST THE POS AND EXPLAIN THE CLIENT WHY DID HAPPEN IN THE POS..\r\n\r\nNO OTHER CONCERN..', 'DONE'),
(1043, '97343534', '2022-05-11', 'Joel Ancheta', 'Paraque', 'Rabbi Zamora', 'reason for chatting:\r\nThe client informs us that POS in bulacan is not opening', 'Possible cause:\r\nthe pos is not shut down properly and they don`t have UPS in the store', 'RESO:\r\ntech ask to do the following tech procedure\r\n] ask the client to do a video call to perform the walk tru process\r\n] tech ask to get screwdriver and open the POS unit\r\n] tech ask the client to remove the RAM\r\n] tech ask to clean the 2 RAM using pencil eraser\r\n] tech ask to do the RAM DANCE in each RAM SLOT\r\n] tech ask to open every time he do the RAM DANCE\r\n] client inform and tech witness that the POS UNIT is now running\r\n\r\n\r\nRECOM:\r\n] ask the client to buy UPS\r\n] ask them do the proper s', 'STATUS: ] ask for any other concern ] no other concern ] client confirm that the concern is done and resolved'),
(1044, '33921243', '2022-05-11', 'MARJORIE TANALA', 'LIMAY BATAAN', 'Janiel Manalang', 'REASON FOR CHATTING \r\nTHE CLIENT INFORMS US ABOUT THE POS  IN (TRIPLE 7) LIMAY BATAAN, POS NOT RUNNING DUE TO APPLICATION ERROR. ', 'POWER INTERRUPTION (BROWNOUT)\r\nTHE GOOGLE CHROME NEED TO BE UPDATED', 'ASK THE CLIENT IF THE COMPUTER HAVE AN ISSUE OR  THE POS SYSTEM HAVE AN ISSUE BUT THE CLIENT TOLD US THE ICON OF THE POS  HAVE AN ISSUE..\r\n\r\nTECH ASK THEM TO ACCESS THE POS AFTER   WE ACCESS THE POS   WE FIND OUT THE GOOGLE CHROME  NEED TO UPDATED \r\n\r\nWE UPDATED THE GOOGLE CHROME AND CHECK THE SQL OF THE CLIENT  LAST DATA  WE FIND ARE MAY 9 2022\r\n\r\n', 'NO OTHER CONCERN .'),
(1045, '5572912', '2022-05-11', 'EURIKA ANN ORACAY', 'RODRIGUEZ, RIZAL', 'Janiel Manalang', 'REASON\r\n THE CLIENT INFORMS US THEY WANT RESCHEDULE RETRAINING FOR IKA`S PHARMACY. \r\n\r\nTHEY HAVE AN CONCERN ABOUT THE POS.', 'THEY WANT TO CLARIFY SOME CONCERN ABOUT THE POS  ATND  RETRAINING ABOUT THE POS', 'FIRST WE BACKUP THE POS BOTH FILES AND SQL .\r\nAFTER THAT WE CREATE OWN ACCOUNT AND OWN PRODUCT \r\n\r\nAFTER THAT WE PROCESS THE OWN ACCOUNT AND PRODUCT \r\nAFTER THAT WE TALLY THE ALL PROCESS BUT ALL PROCESS ARE TALLY . THEY HAVE NO ERROR.\r\n\r\nWE  MADE TRANSACTION BY THE CLIENT NO HAVE AND ERROR AND TALLY. THE TRANSACTION WE MADE.', 'NO OTHER CONCERN. DONE'),
(1046, '5173997', '2022-05-12', 'Joel Ancheta', 'Alabang', 'aeron elison', 'Client chat in and tell a concern about Cashier different interface.', 'Client register a new cashier.', 'Tech access the POS system with anydesk.\r\nTech back up the database\r\nTech access navicate and check the cashier table to fix the new registered cashier.', 'Done '),
(1047, '84729159', '2022-05-12', 'KONTESERA', 'BATAAN', 'aeron elison', 'The client inform us about the computer did not proceed on the desktop interface.  \r\nAnd encounter a blue screen display.\r\n', 'The computer operating system will be expired or corrupt soon.', 'Tech guide the client about the step by step procedure on cleaning the hard disk drive. \r\n Tech back up the system of the POS.\r\nTech remind the client about the operating system of the POS unit.\r\n', 'done'),
(1048, '54236631', '2022-05-12', 'VERONICA ATCHETA', 'EDSA', 'Janiel Manalang', 'REASON FOR TECH \r\n THE CLIENT CONCERN ABOUT THE TABLE 2\r\n\r\nTHE CLIENT PAID THE TABLE2 TO BUT THE TRANSACTION STILL IN THE TABLE 2.', 'THE CLIENT DID NOT CLEARCART AFTER TRANSACTION THAT`S WHY THE TRANSACTION  BE THERE.', 'RESOLUTION\r\nFIRST WE CHECK THE  TRANSACTION DOUBLE AND WE BACKUP THE FILES AND SQL \r\n\r\nAFTER THAT WE CLEAR ALL DATA IN TABLE 2.\r\n\r\nPLEASE ALWAYS CLEARTCART AFTER TRANSACTION THANKYOU.\r\n\r\nNO OTHER CONCERN.', 'DONE'),
(1049, '16364842', '2022-05-13', 'JONALYN BENGANO', 'TAGUIG', 'aeron elison', 'HARDWARE WARRANTY WILL START ON MAY 13, 2022, UNTIL AUGUST 13, 2022', 'HARDWARE WARRANTY WILL START ON MAY 13, 2022, UNTIL AUGUST 13, 2022', 'HARDWARE WARRANTY WILL START ON MAY 13, 2022, UNTIL AUGUST 13, 2022', 'DONE'),
(1050, '16364842', '2022-05-13', 'JONALYN BENGANO', 'TAGUIG', 'aeron elison', 'SOFTWARE WARRANTY WILL START ON MAY 13, 2022 UNTIL NOVEMBER 13, 2022', 'SOFTWARE WARRANTY WILL START ON MAY 13, 2022 UNTIL NOVEMBER 13, 2022', 'SOFTWARE WARRANTY WILL START ON MAY 13, 2022 UNTIL NOVEMBER 13, 2022', 'DONE'),
(1051, '16364842', '2022-05-13', 'JONALYN BENGANO', 'TAGUIG', 'aeron elison', 'SOFTWARE FREE TECH SUPPORT START ON MAY 13, 2022 UNTIL NOVEMBER 13, 2022', 'SOFTWARE FREE TECH SUPPORT START ON MAY 13, 2022 UNTIL NOVEMBER 13, 2022', 'SOFTWARE FREE TECH SUPPORT START ON MAY 13, 2022 UNTIL NOVEMBER 13, 2022', 'DONE'),
(1052, '97343534', '2022-05-17', 'Joel Ancheta', 'Paraque', 'aeron elison', 'Client Chat in and tell a concern about POS system unit auto repair appear.', 'System Unit Operating System is corrupted.', 'Tech do a onsite support\r\nTech Reinstall the operating system and make windows old - status same problem\r\nTech Install the operating system in different partition - status working properly \r\nTech install and back up the pos system of all wings \r\nTech fix all the issues, And the unit is now working properly.\r\nTech add new cashier in the POS unit.', 'DONE'),
(1053, '10715077', '2022-05-17', 'MARILOU SALVADOR', 'LAGUNDI MEXICO', 'Janiel Manalang', 'THE CLIENT INFORM US ABOUT THE POS NOT RUNNING .', 'UPON CHECKING POS THE POS HAVE AN VIRUS  \r\n\r\nTHE VIRUS MAKE ALL FILES  IN 1 DEFAULT IN MEDIA FILES THAT`S WHY THE  POS NOT RUNNING .', 'FIRST WE CHECK THE FILES \r\nAFTER CHECKING  THE FILES  THE ALL FILES BECOME 1 DEFAULT FILES \r\nAFTER CHECKING THE POS  WE BACKUP THE POS AND CREATE A NEW  USER NAME THE NEW  USER IS USER2\r\n\r\nWE REINSTALL THE POS IN THE NEW USER2 \r\n\r\n\r\nWE BACKUP THE POS AND NO OTHER CONCERN \r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n', 'DONE'),
(1054, '51842014', '2022-05-18', 'KGG MINIMART', 'MAKATI', 'keil ilagan', ']Client inform us if the purchase order can be downloadable.', ']Client inform us if the purchase order can be downloadable.', ']Tech send a copy of KGGâ€™s Purchase Order.\r\n]Tech send a walkthrough to a client on how to access/see the Purchase order list.\r\n\r\n  Walkthrough On how to access Purchase Order:\r\n	Ganito po para maaccess nyo po ung purchase order nyo po. \r\nFirst Mag login po sa Admin ] click sales report and others ] under sales report and others click ordering report. \r\nTpos po makikita nyo na po lahat ng purchase order nyo.\r\n', 'DONE'),
(1055, '65093303', '2022-05-17', 'ALAINNE TAN', 'TIMOG ANGELES CITY', 'Janiel Manalang', 'SOFTWARE FREE TECH SUPPORT START ON MAY 17, 2022 UNTIL NOVEMBER 17, 2022', 'SOFTWARE FREE TECH SUPPORT START ON MAY 17, 2022 UNTIL NOVEMBER 17, 2022', 'SOFTWARE FREE TECH SUPPORT START ON MAY 17, 2022 UNTIL NOVEMBER 17, 2022', 'DONE'),
