(1158, '00000004', '2022-07-08', 'Laila Dettmers', 'ANGELES CITY', '', 'THE WANT TO ONSITE VISIT TO CHECK THE POS. NO SALES START ON JUNE 15, 2022', 'POWER SHORTAGE.\r\nBROWNOUT \r\n', 'WE BACKUP THE FILES AND SQL.\r\n\r\nEXPLAIN THE CLIENT THE COMPUTER RESTORE THE OLD FILES AND DELETING THE SALES START ON JUNE 10 TO 14, 2022\r\n CAUSE THAT ISSUE POWER SHORTAGE (BROWNOUT) .', 'DONE'),
