(1160, '00000009', '2022-07-15', 'REENA GIMPAYA', 'STO THOMAS PAMPANGA', 'Janiel Manalang', 'Reason\r\nTHE CLIENT WANT A ONSITE TECH TO CHECKING FOR THEIR PRINTER.', 'Cause\r\nDID`T NOT PROPERLY WORKING.', 'WE BACKUP THE SQL AND FILES\r\nWE DO  MAINTENANCE AND CLEANING  BACKUP .\r\nAFTER THAT CLIENT SEND A MENU TO ADDING  ON.\r\nSEND THE ADDING MENU ON THE GC.', 'DONE'),
(1161, '66077668', '2022-07-15', 'Jayson Reyes', 'District 7, Epsa Pulung Cacutud', 'Janiel Manalang', 'Reason\r\nTHE CLIENT REQUESTED TO ADJUST AND REMOVE THE CUSTOMER INFORMATION ON THE RECEIPT', 'Cause\r\nTO maximize PAPER OF THE RECEIPT', 'Reso:\r\nTECH BACKUP THE SQL AND FILES.\r\nSIR RABBI ADJUST THE RECEIPT SIZE AND FONT SIZE.\r\nWE UPDATE THE RECEIPT OF SIR JAYSON', 'DONE'),
(1162, '15724957', '2022-07-18', 'MR OGIE ABESAMIS', 'TALAVERA NUEVA ECIJA', 'Janiel Manalang', 'THE CLIENT CHAT  ON THE GC,  ABOUT THE  POS ADMIN, DIDN`T WORK PROPERLY', 'POWER SHORTAGE.\r\nCHANGE IP ADDRESS', 'CALL THE CLIENT TO GO TO THE CASHIER SECTION OF ATLANTA.\r\nSEARCH THE CMD ON THE SEARCH BAR\r\nAFTER,  TYPE THE IP CONFIG  \r\nGET THE IP ADDRESS OR THE IPV4  CHANGE ON THE IP ADDRESS OF THE ADMIN SIDE. ', 'DONE'),
(1163, '96535672', '2022-07-19', 'CHRISTIAN DAVE VARGAS', 'CONCEPCION TARLAC', 'Janiel Manalang', 'CLIENT CHAT US ABOUT PRINTER NOT WORKING PROPERLY', 'CHANGE PORT AND REMOVE THE DRIVERS', 'FIRST WE SEND THE ANY DESK AFTER THAT WE TECH ABOUT THE PRINTER ISSUEE WE TEST.\r\nAFTER TEST WE TRY AND THE PRINTE ALREADY PROPERLY WORKING  \r\nWE CHANGE ONLY THE PORT OF THE PRINTER.', 'DONE'),
