(1187, '66077668', '2022-07-30', 'Jayson Reyes', 'District 7, Epsa Pulung Cacutud', 'Rabbi Zamora', 'CUS INFORM THAT HE HAS INSUF STOCK IN THE POS and cant process the payment', 'main cause of the issue is the insuff stocks reading by the pos and that is reason why he can process payment', 'remove the scripting for the insuff stocks, just to make them process the payment', 'DONE AND RESOLVE'),
