(1192, '34607711', '2022-08-01', 'LITTLE BASKET 2nd BATCH', 'ANGELES CITY', 'Benedict Vivar', 'ORDER THERMAL 80MM PENDING DUE TO LACK OF THE STOCK', 'ORDER THERMAL 80MM PENDING DUE TO LACK OF THE STOCK', 'ORDER THERMAL 80MM PENDING DUE TO LACK OF THE STOCK', 'PENDING'),
(1193, '95527061', '2022-08-02', 'JVP MINI GROCERY', 'PAMPANGA', 'Benedict Vivar', 'REASON\r\nTHE CLIENT CHATS WITH US ABOUT WANTING TO RETRAIN AGAIN AND CHECK THE POS.', 'CAUSE\r\nREFRESH AND WANT TO RETRAIN ABOUT ON THE POS.', 'RESO.\r\nRETRAIN THE CLIENT AND CHECK THE peripherals OF THE CLIENT LIKE POS AND HARDWARE.\r\nBUT UPON CHECKING THE POWER CORD OF THE ONE COMPUTER UNIT DIDN`T WORK.\r\nI SUGGEST TO THE CLIENT TO BE ADVISED BY SIR RABBI ABOUT THAT CONCERN.\r\nWE DIDN`T MAKE A SERVER BECAUSE LACK OF EQUIPMENT\r\nBECAUSE SIR RABBI TOLD ME ABOUT ONLY TRAINING THE CLIENT', 'PENDING'),
(1194, '40569761', '2022-08-02', 'ROSE AND RICE TRADING LLC', 'DUBAI UAE', 'Benedict Vivar', 'THEY WANT TO AVOID THE ERROR TRANSACTION \r\n I CAN`T AVOID THAT TRANSACTION BECAUSE THE DATABASE IS POSTED ONLINE I DON`T HAVE AN ACCESS TO THAT.', 'THEY WANT TO AVOID THE ERROR TRANSACTION \r\n I CAN`T AVOID THAT TRANSACTION BECAUSE THE DATABASE IS POSTED ONLINE I DON`T HAVE AN ACCESS TO THAT.', 'THEY WANT TO AVOID THE ERROR TRANSACTION \r\n I CAN`T AVOID THAT TRANSACTION BECAUSE THE DATABASE IS POSTED ONLINE I DON`T HAVE AN ACCESS TO THAT.', 'PENDING'),
