(1196, '00000004', '2022-08-03', 'Laila Dettmers', 'ANGELES CITY', 'jhang gomez', 'The client wants to buy a printer and do some maintenance because their unit is suddenly turning off', 'The processor heats up because it doesn`t have thermal paste', 'Cleaning maintenance of the POS  apply the thermal paste and dump backup SQL files', 'DONE'),
