(1571, '73047424', '2023-04-28', 'AMARIA GROCERY', 'LIPA BATANGAS', 'Rabbi Zamora', 'customer call in about the 2 terminals that received an error message on the system.\r\nerror message send and verify by the tech.\r\ncustomer request to fix the issue but it is out of office hours.', 'the 2 terminals can not connect to the server due to incorrect connection network.\r\ncheck the connection of the 2 terminals and they are connected in different network.\r\nexplain and educate the customer about the cause.\r\ncustomer understand the cause', 'since it is out of office hours. tech guy extend his help to the customer.\r\ntech ask to connect the server to the internet.\r\ncustomer advice zero knowledge to do it.\r\ntech send youtube linke to use USB tathering\r\ncustomer still can not connect to the internet\r\ntech ask the customer to get an internet cable.\r\ncustomer find and intenet cable\r\ntech ask to connect the cable to the server\r\ncustomer zero knowledge to do it\r\ntech send a picture about the ethernet port and router port\r\ncustomer connecte', 'TERMINAL 1 and 2 are fixed pending tech support for tom to connect the terminal 1 and 2 to the router of the server'),
(1572, '73047424', '2023-04-29', 'AMARIA GROCERY', 'LIPA BATANGAS', 'lance clarin garcia', 'I call the customer to assist him in server, to connect terminal 1 and 2 in our RNZ router, after I connect the 2 terminal, \r\nI put password in navicat in their server, terminal 1 and 2, then after I put password, I asked the client to test if the product he input in server if he can see in the 2 terminals, \r\nthen the client said the errors and I asked to send the anydesk ID to access the Server and the 2 terminals', 'since I put password in the navicat, I asked him to input a product and update in the server and asked him to check terminals 1 and 2 if the products updated showed in both terminals.\r\nThen the client said that there`s an error to the updated product', 'I asked the client to go to the server and give the server an access to the internet so that I can access it using anydesk. This is to check the database if what`s causing the problem, after that I saw that the cause of the error\r\nis in step 4,5 and 6_server, then I edited the sql passwords the same as the password of the navicat. I did this in server, terminal 1 and terminal 2. I told the client to try updating again in the server, after updating I asked\r\nhim to check both terminals again if th', 'Both terminals 1 and 2 is fixed and already connected to the RNZ router. The products updated in the server successfuly shows in both terminals. P.S: I adviced the client to wait til the update is finished and to input all products first before uploading to terminals 1 and 2. Also, I told him to wait because it is natural to wait for the upload to finish because sometimes it will take a long time.'),
(1573, '73047424', '2023-05-02', 'AMARIA GROCERY', 'LIPA BATANGAS', 'Chris Jaivic Ramos', 'customer chat in about 1 terminal that received an error message send and verify by sir rabbi customer request to fix the issue', 'the 1 terminal have error message the product they input have a comma. sir rabbi explain and educate the customer about the cause. customer understand the cause', 'sir rabbi said that the product they input have a comma then he told to the customer to remove the comma. Then the customer said that the problem has already solve. educated the customer about the concern customer understand and confirmed', '1 terminal has fixed'),
