(1582, '58449021', '2023-05-04', 'MR OGIE ABESAMIS', 'TALAVERA NUEVA ECIJA', 'Chris Jaivic Ramos', 'THE CLIENT(ATLANTA MAIN) ASKED FOR TECH SUPPORT REQUESTING TO ADD SALES WITH A TOTAL VALUE OF 21,725,719.26 AND TO ADJUST THE SI NUMBERS ', 'MONTHLY MAINTENANCE', 'I ASKED THE CLIENT TO OPEN THE ANYDESK TO GAIN ACCESS. AFTER GAINING ACCESS, I OPENED NAVICAT TO CREATE A BACKUP AND DUMP THE SQL FILE. I THEN MANUALLY ADDED THE TOTAL VALUE OF SALES THAT THE CLIENT ASKED. LASTLY I ADJUSTED THE SI NUMBERS. AFTER DOING ALL THIS I ASKED THEM TO CHECK IF ITS CORRECT AND MA`AM KATH APPROVED THE ADJUSMENTS.', 'DONE'),
(1583, '15724957', '2023-05-04', 'MR OGIE ABESAMIS', 'TALAVERA NUEVA ECIJA', 'Chris Jaivic Ramos', 'THE CLIENT(BULILIT 1) ASKED FOR TECH SUPPORT REQUESTING TO ADD SALES WITH A TOTAL VALUE OF 27,142.3 AND TO ADJUST THE SI NUMBERS', 'MONTHLY MAINTENANCE', 'I ASKED THE CLIENT TO OPEN THE ANYDESK TO GAIN ACCESS. AFTER GAINING ACCESS, I OPENED NAVICAT TO CREATE A BACKUP AND DUMP THE SQL FILE. I THEN MANUALLY ADDED THE TOTAL VALUE OF SALES THAT THE CLIENT ASKED. LASTLY I ADJUSTED THE SI NUMBERS. AFTER DOING ALL THIS I ASKED THEM TO CHECK IF ITS CORRECT AND MA`AM MINNIE APPROVED THE ADJUSMENTS', 'DONE'),
(1584, '34151934', '2023-05-04', 'MKM BUILDERS', 'NUEVA ECIJA', 'SIMON LEE', 'OWNER ASK FOR ASSISTANCE ABOUT THE POS SHE ASK IF IT IS POSSIPLE TO SHOW ALL THE PRODUCT LIST ONCE THEY CLICK THE PRODUCT BUTTON AND IF POSSIBLE THE EDIT ALL THE PRODUCTS QTY TO ZERO', 'THE CASHIERS AND OTHER EMPLOYEES WHO WAS TRAINED ARE ALREADY RESIGNED TO THE COMPANY THAT`S WHY THE OWNER HAVING TROUBLE OPERATING THE POS ', 'GIVING THE CLIENT A RESOLUTION ABOUT HAVING TROUBLE IN SEARCH PRODUCT BY UPDATING THE PRODUCT LIST ONCE YOU CLICK THE PRODUCT BUTTON IT WILL SHOW ALL THE PRODUCTS AND CAN PRINT A HARD COPY', 'WE ALREADY SEND QUOTATION TO THE CLIENT AND WAITING FOR APPROVAL'),
(1585, '58449021', '2023-05-04', 'MR OGIE ABESAMIS', 'TALAVERA NUEVA ECIJA', 'lance clarin garcia', 'maam ana catarina asked for fixing the SI number in the nest\r\nI asked her to open the anydesk to access the POS\r\nThen back up the SQL file and get the bucket_terminal info copy and paste in spreadsheet\r\nadvice maam ana catarina to not use the POS while Im fixing their concerns\r\nI fix the SI numbers in the month of APRIL start with 3851 and bucket_receipt\r\nadvice maam ana catarina to check if the SI numbers are okay', 'maam ana catarina asked for fixing the SI number in the nest\r\nI asked her to open the anydesk to access the POS\r\nThen back up the SQL file and get the bucket_terminal info copy and paste in spreadsheet\r\nadvice maam ana catarina to not use the POS while Im fixing their concerns\r\nI fix the SI numbers in the month of APRIL start with 3851 and bucket_receipt\r\nadvice maam ana catarina to check if the SI numbers are okay', 'maam ana catarina asked for fixing the SI number in the nest\r\nI asked her to open the anydesk to access the POS\r\nThen back up the SQL file and get the bucket_terminal info copy and paste in spreadsheet\r\nadvice maam ana catarina to not use the POS while Im fixing their concerns\r\nI fix the SI numbers in the month of APRIL start with 3851 and bucket_receipt\r\nadvice maam ana catarina to check if the SI numbers are okay', 'the SI number of the nest is OK said maam ana catarina'),
(1586, '58449021', '2023-05-04', 'MR OGIE ABESAMIS', 'TALAVERA NUEVA ECIJA', 'amiel Tech Support', 'Ms. Catarina requested to adjust the SI numbers for the month of April that should start from 000000003851', 'Incorrect SI numbers for the month of April', 'I requested for the clients Anydesk ID so that I can access their POS. After gaining access, I created a back-up and dump the sql file and then proceeded to adjust the SI numbers. Not sure  of the steps and also for confirmation, I asked for help from a Senior(Lance Garcia) to finish the task.', 'According the Ms. Catarina, the SI numbers for the month of April falls correctly into place'),
(1587, '15724957', '2023-05-04', 'MR OGIE ABESAMIS', 'TALAVERA NUEVA ECIJA', 'lance clarin garcia', 'the client (san pascual branch) asked for add sales in their, the sales they want is 5,255,731.10 and fix their SI numbers in the month of APRIL starting 7563', 'the client (san pascual branch) asked for add sales in their, the sales they want is 5,255,731.10 and fix their SI numbers in the month of APRIL starting 7563', 'I asked maam minnie to open the anydesk to access their POS\r\nafter gaining access, I do backup the sql and then manually added the total value of sales that the client asked\r\nthen I adjust their SI number that maam minnie said\r\nLastly after do all the fixing concerns I asked maam minnie to check if the sales they want is correct', 'maam minnie approved the sales they want'),
(1588, '93545390', '2023-05-04', 'BENNIE UY', 'BALIBAGO ANGELES CITY', 'lance clarin garcia', 'sir cicer asked for onsite tech support\r\nme and sir simon go to johnnys to fix their concerns\r\nI update the terminal 1 to 12 and SPM 1 and 2 with the wash update that simon do', 'sir cicer asked for onsite tech support\r\nme and sir simon go to johnnys to fix their concerns\r\nI update the terminal 1 to 12 and SPM 1 and 2 with the wash update that simon do', 'sir cicer asked for onsite tech support\r\nme and sir simon go to johnnys to fix their concerns\r\nI update the terminal 1 to 12 and SPM 1 and 2 with the wash update that simon do', 'all of the terminals are updated'),
