(1590, '15724957', '2023-05-04', 'MR OGIE ABESAMIS', 'TALAVERA NUEVA ECIJA', 'amiel Tech Support', 'Ma`am Maery asked for assistance to add sales and adjust the SI NUMBER for the month of April in BULILIT 2.', 'Insufficient sales for the month of April and is part of the regular monthly maintenance.', 'Asked for the client to open anydesk to gain access to their POS so that we can create a backup and dump the sql file. I then opened the item_count table and copy its contents to edit and add the desired total sales of ma`aam Maery. After adding sales I proceeded on adjusting the proper SI numbers. ', 'Ma`am maery gave the confirmation that Its done'),
(1591, '15724957', '2023-05-04', 'MR OGIE ABESAMIS', 'TALAVERA NUEVA ECIJA', 'christian Tech Support', 'Ma`am Maery requested assistance to update the SI NUMBER for the month of April in BULILIT 2 and add sales.', 'April`s sales were insufficient, and this is a normal monthly maintenance issue.\r\n', 'asked the client to open AnyDesk so that we could access their POS and dump the sql file and generate a backup of it. I then accessed the item_count table, copied its contents, and edited and added ma`aam Maery`s desired total sales. I continued to make the necessary SI number adjustments after adding sales.\r\n', 'Ma`am Maery confirmed that it was completed.'),
(1592, '58449021', '2023-05-04', 'MR OGIE ABESAMIS', 'TALAVERA NUEVA ECIJA', 'Chris Jaivic Ramos', 'THE CLIENT(THE NEST RESTO BAR) ASKED FOR TECH SUPPORT REQUESTING TO ADJUST THE SI NUMBERS', 'THE CLIENT(THE NEST RESTO BAR) ASKED FOR TECH SUPPORT REQUESTING TO ADJUST THE SI NUMBERS PART OF THE MONTHLY MAINTENANCE', 'I  ASKED THE CLIENT TO OPEN THE ANYDESK TO GAIN ACCESS. AFTER GAINING ACCESS, I OPENED NAVICAT TO CREATE A BACKUP AND DUMP THE SQL FILE. THEN I ADJUSTED THE SI NUMBERS. AFTER DOING ALL THIS I ASKED THEM TO CHECK IF ITS CORRECT AND MA`AM ANA APPROVED THE ADJUSMENTS.', 'DONE'),
(1593, '93545390', '2023-05-04', 'BENNIE UY', 'BALIBAGO ANGELES CITY', 'SIMON LEE', 'Client ask for assistance about their sales reading and other reports', 'Sales reading is not tally from their actual report', 'We ask sir cicer a written concerns of what terminal, date and value  should be printed on their report then we proceed to the terminals and create a back up SQL and file copy and paste all the newly update files and reprint all the reports needed, checking the possible cause of errors, in the middle of updating and reprint report sir Jayson ask to check the qty that appear in the screen and in charge invoice because the qty is being round off like if you input 3.25 the value that will appear in', 'All the current concerns are done and resolved and new concerns for development of the system'),
