(1596, '62490309', '2023-05-05', 'ESTER FARIÃ‘AS', 'MORONG BATAAN', 'amiel Tech Support', 'Client Ester asked for assistance due to missing SI numbers.', 'Missing SI numbers caused by sudden shutdown of the unit or during \"Pay now\" the cashiers will close the window/ software.', 'Accessed the pos using anydesk and created a backup and then dumped the sql file in case of an issue. I then procedeed to copy the transactionlogs, bucket_pos, bucket_receipt and bucket_item_count table to be able to easily adjust the missing SI numbers using spreadsheet. After adjusting, I then input the proper Si numbers on the database of the client', 'According to client the issue has been resolved.'),
(1597, '93545390', '2023-05-05', 'BENNIE UY', 'BALIBAGO ANGELES CITY', 'SIMON LEE', 'Client ask for assistance for some errors of the system that need to update or reprogram', 'client experiencing errors while using the system', 'List of update files for JS\r\nviewtransaction.php\r\n- update the details and relocate the buttons for better use.\r\nselectformmanagement.php\r\n- adding REPRINT REPORT button for the user have an authority to reprint preview report\r\n- reason for adding : client ask to add reprint so that they can reprint sales report if ever they have printer errors and other errors related to printing\r\n- file included are selectdatereprintwash.php, reprintnewxreading.php, and reprintnewzreading.php\r\ntab_pos1.php\r\n- ', 'Some other file are needs for improvement and some concerns are done'),
