(1599, '21270649', '2023-05-05', 'ROBBIE BOYD', 'BATAAN', 'jhang gomez', 'XXXXXXKITCHEN SPECS XXXXXX\r\n\r\n-I5 POS UNIT\r\n-4GB RAM\r\n-250 HDD\r\n-19 INC NVISION\r\n-A4 TECH KEYBOARD AND MOUSE\r\n-TP LINK ROUTER', 'XXXXXXKITCHEN SPECS XXXXXX\r\n\r\n-I5 POS UNIT\r\n-4GB RAM\r\n-250 HDD\r\n-19 INC NVISION\r\n-A4 TECH KEYBOARD AND MOUSE\r\n-TP LINK ROUTER', 'XXXXXXKITCHEN SPECS XXXXXX\r\n\r\n-I5 POS UNIT\r\n-4GB RAM\r\n-250 HDD\r\n-19 INC NVISION\r\n-A4 TECH KEYBOARD AND MOUSE\r\n-TP LINK ROUTERQ', 'DONE'),
(1600, '62490309', '2023-05-05', 'ESTER FARIÃ‘AS', 'MORONG BATAAN', 'christian Tech Support', 'Ester, the client, requested help since several SI numbers were missing.', 'Unexpected unit shutdowns that result in missing SI numbers or cashiers closing the window or software during \"Pay now\" transactions.', 'Using Anydesk, I accessed the pos, made a backup, and then, in case of trouble, dumped the sql file. To easily correct the missing SI numbers using a spreadsheet, I then copied the transactionlogs, bucket_pos, bucket_receipt, and bucket_item_count tables. I made the necessary adjustments and then entered the correct Si numbers into the client`s database.', 'The client claims that the problem has been fixed.'),
