(1917, '93545390', '2023-11-13', 'BENNIE UY', 'BALIBAGO ANGELES CITY', 'CRIS JAIVIC RAMOS', 'CLIENT ASKED FOR TECH SUPPORT DUE TO THE SERVER IS NOT WORKING', 'POSSIBLE ISSUE IS THE SYSTEM UNIT BECAUSE IT IS OLD', 'It seems like you`re describing a situation where Sir Jang and Sir Cicer are discussing a problem with a computer server. Sir Cicer explained that the server won`t boot, and it`s stuck on the loading screen. In response, Sir Jang suggested trying to use an extra SSD (Solid State Drive) to slave the server, copy the files from the server to the extra SSD, and then replace the necessary files and SQL (Structured Query Language) on the extra SSD to resume the operation of the employees.\r\n\r\nThis app', 'DONE'),
