(2022, '44362412', '2024-02-08', 'FRIENDSHIP GARDEN RESTAURANT', 'ENCLAVE FRIENDSHIP HIWAY', 'crisjohn sunga', 'Concern about the table color including in clear table and voiding, redirection of page to main index. Concern about the OR being blank in sales. ', 'The problem of orders remaining highlighted in red even after they`ve been settled.\r\nLikewise, the issue where voided items retained the red color even though there were no items.\r\nConcerning the redirection problem related to categories of products.\r\nConcern about an instance of a transaction lacking an official receipt.', 'The issue with the order being shown as red even after it`s settled has been resolved. Similarly, when an item is voided, the red color used to persist even though there were no items, but that has been fixed as well.\r\n\r\nRegarding the concern about category redirection, it has been addressed. Now, orders are directed to the respective category and not to the main screen.\r\n\r\nIn the sales section, we noticed a transaction without an official receipt (OR), but it was only one instance.', 'DONE AND COMPLETE'),
