(2036, '58449021', '2024-02-21', 'MR OGIE ABESAMIS', 'TALAVERA NUEVA ECIJA', 'crisjohn sunga', 'SI showing N/A in terminal 2 in specific report. It includes in starting SI or in ending SI.', 'conditions in the code and in database the xstatus is \"PAID\" for N/A instead of \"NOT\" or \"PENDING\".', 'in SI startreceipt added condition to exclude receiptnum with N/A also in the data base update the xstatus of the the receiptnum with N/A into \"NOT\" from 2022-01-01 to 2023-12-31.', 'DONE AND COMPLETE'),
