(2337, '15724957', '2025-04-07', 'MR OGIE ABESAMIS', 'TALAVERA NUEVA ECIJA', 'CHRISTIAN BUNGQUE', 'CLIENT WANT TO ADJUST THEIR SALES IN THE MONTH OF MARCH 2025 ATLANTA MAIN', 'MONTHLY ADJUST SALES IN TOTAL OF 57,222,954.87', '-ASK THE CLIENT TO OPEN THE ULTRAVIEWER TO GAIN ACCESS BACKUP THE DATABASE\r\n-BACK UP THE DATABASE\r\n-GET THE ITEMCOUNT.SQL AND VOIDITEMS.SQL\r\n-PAID ALL TRANSACTION OF MARCH\r\n-ADJUST THE SALES AND VOID AMOUNT TRU OUR SYSTEM.\r\n-DELETE THE DUPLICATE OF OLD ITEMCOUNT.SQL AND VOIDITEMS.SQL\r\n-EXECUTE THE NEW ITEMCOUNT.SQL AND VOIDITEMS.SQL', 'DONE'),
