(2339, '39536570', '2025-04-07', 'JACQUELYN GALANG', 'BAKELKEL MADAPDAP', 'OJT MARK', 'CLIENTS REQUESTED AN UPDATE TO THE PRICE', 'OUTDATED PRICE', 'Update products on bakelkel bp admin and bp. Anydesk and UV to update the product and create database for backup and copy to desktop to paste into the next. First one is bp server copy the products and paste into the bakelkel database and second one is bp admin copy the products to paste into the bp database.', 'DONE'),
(2340, '28522055', '2025-04-07', 'Girlie Pajarillo', 'Urdaneta City Pangasinan', 'DUKE ESGUERRA', 'CLIENT ASK FOR SUPPORT DUE TO DUPLICATED PROCESS OF ADD SUPPLY', 'HUMAN ERROR, WHEN THEIR INTERNET IS SLOW THEY CLICK THE SUBMIT BUTTON MULTIPLE TIMES RESULTING TO DUPLICATED PROCESS OF ADD SUPPLY', 'DELETED THE DUPLICATED PROCESS OF ADD SUPPLY  ON BUCKET_DEVREPORT AT RGP ONLINE DATABASE AT GODADDY', 'DONE'),
(2341, '89619961', '2025-04-08', 'JACQUELYN GALANG', 'NA', 'DUKE ESGUERRA', 'CLIENT REQUESTED SUPPORT REGARDING AN ISSUE WITH THEIR PRINTER NOT PRINTING RECEIPTS', 'THEIR POS PRINTER DRIVER WAS UNINSTALLED', 'REQUESTED ULTRAVIEW ACCESS CREDENTIALS FROM THE CLIENT TO CONNECT TO THEIR POS SYSTEM.\r\n\r\nBACKED UP THEIR SQL DATABASE TO ENSURE DATA SAFETY BEFORE PROCEEDING.\r\n\r\nCHECKED THE DEVICE AND FOUND THAT THE POS PRINTER DRIVER WAS UNINSTALLED.\r\n\r\nREINSTALLED THE CORRECT PRINTER DRIVER.\r\n\r\nCONTACTED THE CLIENT TO VERIFY THAT THE PRINTER IS NOW WORKING PROPERLY.', 'DONE'),
(2342, '10750156', '2025-04-10', 'JACQUELYN GALANG', 'MADAPDAP MABALACAT', 'Lance Garcia', 'CLIENT ASKED TO UPDATE THE PRICE OF BAKELKEL AND BEST PRICE', 'NEED TO UPDATE PRICE', 'ACCESS BUDDYS AND BP SERVER THEN BACK UP THEIR PRODUCT DATA TO UPDATE PRICE TO BP AND BAKELKEL', 'DONE'),
(2343, '97777579', '2025-04-10', 'JACQUELYN GALANG', 'PORAC', 'Lance Garcia', 'CLIENT ASKED TO UPDATE THE PRICE OF BEST PRICE', 'OUTDATED PRICE', 'REQUESTED ULTRAVIEWER/ANYDESK AND ACCESSED THE BP SERVER AND BACKED UP PRODUCT DATA FROM THR BP SERVER TO UPDATE PRICE OF BP', 'DONE'),
(2344, '18019772', '2025-04-08', 'ANALYN KIDKID', 'ILOGON BENGUET', 'Lance Garcia', 'Onsite visit to Maintenance to check their 2 POS units. Both POS terminals are showing error messages because the customer displays were removed.', 'The system unit is dirty, and there is an error message on the POS.', '-Inspect and check the two POS units at the Maintenance department.\r\n-Perform a full backup and data dump of both POS terminals, and save the files to our flash drive for backup purposes.\r\n-Clean the system unit, monitor, printer, keyboard, and mouse thoroughly.\r\n-Reapply thermal paste on the CPU\r\n-Reconnect and test the two customer displays to verify if the POS error message has been resolved.', 'Done'),
(2345, '30482321', '2025-04-10', 'Marnelli  Hipolito', 'Magalang Pamp', 'CHRISTIAN BUNGQUE', 'UPDATE THE SYSTEM AND DATABASE ABOUT FOR LOYALTY CARDS AND PAYMENT METHOD', 'UPDATE THE SYSTEM AND DATABASE ABOUT FOR LOYALTY CARDS AND PAYMENT METHOD', '-ASK THE CLIENT TO OPEN THE ULTRAVIEWER TO GAIN ACCESS BACKUP THE DATABASE\r\n-BACK UP THE DATABASE AND FILE SYSTEM\r\n-COPY THE NEW FILES IN THEIR POS AND ALSO IN DATABASE\r\n-RUN THE FIXQTY TO FIX THE QTY TRANSACTION BEFORE\r\n-TEST THE NEW UPDATE AND DEMO TO THEM\r\n-CHECK THE USERS ACOUNT IN THE DATABASE', 'DONE'),
(2346, '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', ''),
