(2348, '97777579', '2025-04-12', 'JACQUELYN GALANG', 'PORAC', 'CHRISTIAN BUNGQUE', 'CLIENT ASK FOR SUPPORT ABOUT THEIR SALES IN TERMINAL 2 DOES NOT TALLY', 'THE OTHER TRANSACTIONS IN APRIL 11 2025 DOES NOT HAVE A POS NUMBER(TERMINAL02)', '-ASK THE CLIENT TO OPEN THE ULTRAVIEWER TO GAIN ACCESS \r\n-BACKUP THE DATABASE\r\n-CHECK THE ALL TRANSACTIONS IN APRIL 11 2025 IN TERMINAL 2 THEN UPDATE THE OTHER TRANSACTIONS TO HAVE A POSNUM(TERMINAL02)\r\n-CHECK THE X READING OF APRIL 11 2025 IF TALLY', 'DONE'),
(2349, '97777579', '2025-04-12', 'JACQUELYN GALANG', 'PORAC', 'CHRISTIAN BUNGQUE', 'FOLLOW UP CHECKING IN ABOUT THE OTHER TRANSACTIONS OF TERMINAL IN APRIL 11 2025 DOES NOT HAVE A POS NUM OR TERMINAL NUMBER.', 'OTHER TRANSACTIONS OF APRIL 11 2025 DOES NOT HAVE A POSNUM OR TERMINAL NUMBER', 'UPDATE verifycashier.php TO AVOID LOSING THE POS NUMBER OR TERMINAL NUMBER OF TRANSACTIONS', 'DONE'),
(2350, '97777579', '2025-04-12', 'JACQUELYN GALANG', 'PORAC', 'CHRISTIAN BUNGQUE', 'DISABLE OF Z READING BUTTON ON CASHIER PAGE', 'DISABLE OF Z READING BUTTON ON CASHIER PAGE', 'DISABLE OF Z READING BUTTON ON CASHIER PAGE', 'DONE'),
(2351, '97777579', '2025-04-14', 'JACQUELYN GALANG', 'PORAC', 'Lance Garcia', 'The client has requested support regarding a discrepancy in their sales at Terminal 2', 'The other transactions on April 10, 2025, do not have a POS number (Terminal 02)', '-Ask the client to open UltraViewer to allow remote access.\r\n-Back up the database to ensure data safety.\r\n-Review all transactions dated April 10, 2025, for Terminal 2, and update any missing transactions to include the correct POS number (Terminal02).\r\n-Verify the X-reading for April 10, 2025, and ensure it tallies with the recorded transactions', 'Done'),
(2352, '39536570', '2025-04-14', 'JACQUELYN GALANG', 'BAKELKEL MADAPDAP', 'OJT LARWIN', 'The client requested a price update for Bakelkel', 'The pricing requires an update', 'To update the price for Bakekel access Buddies then backup their product data, get the product data and execute in bakelkel ', 'DONE'),
(2353, '97777579', '2025-04-14', 'JACQUELYN GALANG', 'PORAC', 'OJT LARWIN', 'The client requested a price update for Best Price', 'The pricing requires an update', 'To update the price for BP access BP server,then backup their product data get the product data and execute in bp\r\n', 'DONE'),
(2354, '39557470', '2025-04-14', 'JACQUELYN GALANG', 'MABALACAT PAMP', 'DUKE ESGUERRA', 'CLIENT REQUESTED TECHNICAL SUPPORT REGARDING A DISCREPANCY IN THE PRINT ORDER. THEY SHOWED A RECEIPT WITH ONLY TWO ITEMS PRINTED, DESPITE HAVING THREE ORDERS.', 'UPON REVIEWING THE ACTION LOGS, IT WAS FOUND THAT THE FIRST TWO ORDERS WERE ALREADY PROCESSED AND PRINTED. A THIRD ORDER WAS ADDED AFTERWARD BUT WAS NOT INCLUDED IN THE PRINT ORDER PROCESS.', 'ACCESSED THE CLIENTâ€™S POS SYSTEM VIA ULTRAVIEWER. BACKED UP THE SQL DATABASE AND REVIEWED THE ACTION LOGS WITH THE CLIENT. EXPLAINED THAT THE SYSTEM ONLY PRINTED THE FIRST TWO ITEMS BECAUSE THE THIRD ORDER HAD NOT YET BEEN PROCESSED AT THE TIME OF PRINTING.', 'DONE'),
(2355, '62712602', '2025-04-14', 'RAYMOND GONZALES', 'BALIBAGO', 'Lance Garcia', 'The client has requested maintenance for their POS system and a backup of their system and SQL database', 'The client has requested maintenance for their POS system and a backup of their system and SQL database', '-Conducting an on-site visit to carry out maintenance services\r\n-Perform a full backup and SQL database dump\r\n-Backup the POS (Point of Sale) system\r\n-Reapply thermal paste to the CPU\r\n-Clean the system unit thoroughly', 'Done'),
(2356, '15724957', '2025-04-14', 'MR OGIE ABESAMIS', 'TALAVERA NUEVA ECIJA', 'CHRISTIAN BUNGQUE', 'CLIENT ASK FOR SUPPORT ABOUT THEIR POS DISPLAY MONITOR IS FLICKERING BULILIT 4 PAG ASA', 'THE POWER CABLE OF THEIR MONITOR HAS A BLINKING LIGHT INDICATOR, WHICH COULD MEAN THAT THE CABLE IS ALREADY FAULTY', '-CALL THE CLIENT TO INVESTIGATE THE PROBLEM, THEN ASK THEM IF THEY HAVE A EXTRA MONITOR, THEN AFTER THAT TEST AND REPLACE THE MONITOR AND CABLE.', 'DONE'),
(2357, '97658963', '2025-04-14', 'MARQY CYMON', 'MAGALANG', 'DUKE ESGUERRA', 'CLIENT REQUESTED ASSISTANCE IN UPDATING THEIR POS BUSINESS INFORMATIONâ€”SPECIFICALLY TO CHANGE THE CONTACT NUMBER AND REPLACE THE EMAIL ADDRESS WITH THEIR FACEBOOK PAGE LINK.', 'BUSINESS INFORMATION WAS SET TO DEFAULT SETTINGS.', 'REQUESTED THE CLIENT`S ULTRAVIEWER  TO REMOTELY ACCESS THEIR POS UNIT. CREATED A BACKUP OF THE SQL DATABASE, UPDATED THE BUSINESS INFORMATION WITH THE CORRECT CONTACT NUMBER, AND REPLACED THE EMAIL ADDRESS WITH THEIR FACEBOOK PAGE LINK', 'DONE'),
(2358, '89619961', '2025-04-15', 'JACQUELYN GALANG', 'NA', 'CHRISTIAN BUNGQUE', 'CLIENT ASK FOR SUPPORT ABOUT THEIR ADMIN LAUNDRY DOWNLOAD SQL IS NOT WORKING', 'THE\r\nDOWNLOADITEMCOUNT DOES NOT HAVE A PASSWORD.', '-BACK UP FILE SYSTEM \r\n-UPDATE THE PHP FILE OF DOWNLOADITEMCOUNT TO HAVE A PASSWORD\r\n-THEN TEST IF IS WORKING', 'DONE'),
(2359, '51668118', '2025-04-16', 'VM JHELYN', 'STO DOMINGO NE', 'DUKE ESGUERRA', 'CLIENT REQUESTED SUPPORT BECAUSE THEIR POS SYSTEM WAS OFFLINE.', 'DISCOVERED THAT THE XAMPP AUTORUN SETTING WAS DISABLED, EVEN THOUGH XAMPP AUTOSTART WAS ENABLED.', 'OBTAINED ULTRAVIEWER ACCESS FROM THE CLIENT. REMOTELY ENABLED THE XAMPP AUTORUN SETTING. INSTRUCTED THE CLIENT TO RESTART THE POS UNIT TO VERIFY IF AUTORUN WORKS CORRECTLY AFTER REBOOT AND SHUTDOWN. CONFIRMED THAT XAMPP NOW STARTS AUTOMATICALLY.', 'DONE'),
(2360, '93545390', '2025-04-16', 'BENNIE UY', 'BALIBAGO ANGELES CITY', 'DUKE ESGUERRA', 'Client requested assistance due to a blank SI (Sales Invoice) number appearing in sales transactions.', 'Conducted a thorough investigation of the logs and identified that the issue occurred during an Item Exchange process. Upon testing the clientâ€™s POS program, an error was discovered that resulted in the SI number field being left blank.', 'Requested the clientâ€™s AnyDesk access to remotely inspect their POS system. Performed a full backup of their SQL database. While testing the POS, I monitored the error that triggered during the Item Exchange process. Located the file responsible for the error and found a missing code snippet that caused the SI number not to populate. Implemented the necessary code to ensure the terminal retrieves the correct SI number from the database. Confirmed with the client that the issue was resolved.\r\n', 'DONE'),
(2361, '39557470', '2025-04-21', 'JACQUELYN GALANG', 'MABALACAT PAMP', 'Lance Garcia', 'The client has requested technical support because the sales data for April 21, 2025, does not tally with the records under the cashier name Cindy David', 'Upon checking their system, the date and shift date do not match the xTime record of the cashier, Cindy David. It should reflect April 21, but the system still shows April 20. Cindy David logged in on April 20 and processed transactions dated April 21, which caused her sales to be recorded under April 20 in the system', '-I instructed the client to open UltraViewer so I could access their POS system.\r\n-Performed a backup and SQL dump for backup purposes\r\n-Just check the date where the issue is so I can edit it\r\n-I`ll edit April 20 and change it to April 21, including the shift date, so their sales for April 21 will match correctly.\r\n-I opened the admin side to check if Cindy David`s sales for April 21 are already tallying correctly', 'Done'),
(2362, '97777579', '2025-04-21', 'JACQUELYN GALANG', 'PORAC', 'DUKE ESGUERRA', 'THE CLIENT REQUEST SUPPORT TO UPDATE THEIR PRODUCTS FROM THE SERVER TO BEST PRICE', 'UPDATE THEIR OUTDATED PRODUCTS', 'ACCESS THE BP SERVER AND BACKUP THE PRODUCT SQL TO UPDATE THE PRICING TO BEST PRICE ADMIN PORAC', 'DONE'),
(2363, '89619961', '2025-04-21', 'JACQUELYN GALANG', 'NA', 'CHRISTIAN BUNGQUE', 'Client ask for support about the Their admin is unable to open the software.', 'the pos and admin have a new network', 'Set the IP address of both the admin and the POS so they can connect and see each other and also explain to sir do about their laundry is based on the number of transactions or quantity, which they deduct from the sales', 'DONE'),
(2364, '1207594', '2025-04-22', 'CARLOS NEYPES', 'SAN NARCISO ZAMBALES', 'CHRISTIAN BUNGQUE', '-THE CLIENT REQUESTED SUPPORT ABOUT THEIR REPRINT RECEIPT IS NOT THE SAME IN OFFICIAL RECEIPT', '-CLIENT SAID THEY HAVE 2 CASHIER THAT BOTH ORDER IN THE SAME TABLE', '-BACK UP DATABASE AND FILE SYSTEM\r\n-CHECK THE RECEIPT SIXX THAT THEY SEND AND ALSO CHECK ALSO THE LOGS OF CASHIERS\r\n-EXPLAIN TO MAM WEN DELLE ABOUT WHAT HAPPENED WITH THOSE TRANSACTIONS AND THE OTHERS.', 'DONE'),
(2365, '13555948', '2025-04-22', 'Heidi Quiamco Medallo', 'SUBIC BAY', 'CHRISTIAN BUNGQUE', 'CLIENT ASK FOR SUPPORT ABOUT WHAT IS THE FORMULA OF GETTING DISC AND ALSO IN RECEIPT', 'CLIENT ASK FOR SUPPORT ABOUT WHAT IS THE FORMULA OF GETTING DISC AND ALSO IN RECEIPT', 'CLIENT ASK FOR SUPPORT ABOUT WHAT IS THE FORMULA OF GETTING DISC AND ALSO IN RECEIPT', 'DONE'),
(2366, '16364842', '2025-04-22', 'JONALYN BENGANO', 'TAGUIG', 'Lance Garcia', 'The client has requested an on-site visit for maintenance of one Terminal POS and one Server POS. Upgrade software', 'The system unit is dirty and the new SSD on the server needs to be reformatted to improve performance', '-Clean two system units.\r\n-Reapply thermal paste on both system units\r\n-Back up the system database and SQL for backup purposes\r\n-Reformat the new SSD intended for the server.\r\n-upgrade software', 'Done'),
(2367, '16364842', '2025-04-24', 'JONALYN BENGANO', 'TAGUIG', 'Lance Garcia', 'The client requires remote access via UltraViewer to integrate `Generate Barcode` and `Reprint Barcode` functionalities within the Product tab interface.', 'The client requires remote access via UltraViewer to integrate `Generate Barcode` and `Reprint Barcode` functionalities within the Product tab interface.', 'Access the client`s UltraViewer to back up the existing system, then rename it for backup purposes. After that, copy and replace the following files: index_barcode, index_barcodereprint, printbarcode, and reprintbarcode. Finally, test the implementation to ensure it is functioning correctly.', 'Done'),
(2368, '71583918', '2025-04-24', 'MK AMANTE', 'NARVACAN ILOCOS SUR', 'CHRISTIAN BUNGQUE', 'ADJUST SALES FOR THE MONTH OF JANUARY AND FEBRUARY 2025', 'ADJUST SALES FOR THE MONTH OF JANUARY AND FEBRUARY 2025', '-BACK UP ITEM COUNT AND VOID ITEM AND EXPORT IT\r\n-ADJUST THE SALES OF JANUARY 1,775,770.54 AND FEBRUARY 1,463,130 AND ADJUST ALSO THE VOID ITEMS\r\n-IMPORT THE NEW ITEMCOUNT AND VOIDITEM TO THE AMANTE DATABASE ONLINE\r\n-CHECK THE ADJUSTED SALES IN THEIR POS ONLINE\r\n-CAPTURE IT TO SEND TO RNZ GC', 'DONE'),
(2369, '39557470', '2025-04-25', 'JACQUELYN GALANG', 'MABALACAT PAMP', 'Lance Garcia', 'The client has requested technical support because the sales data for April 24, 2025, does not tally with the records under the cashier name Cindy David', 'Upon checking their system, the date and shift date do not match the xTime record of the cashier, Cindy David. It should reflect April 25, but the system still shows April 24. Cindy David logged in on April 24 and processed transactions dated April 25, which caused her sales to be recorded under April 24 in the system', '-I instructed the client to open UltraViewer so I could access their POS system. \r\n-Performed a backup and SQL dump for backup purposes \r\n-Just check the date where the issue is so I can edit it \r\n-I`ll edit April 24 and change it to April 25, including the shift date, so their sales for April 25 will match correctly.\r\n -I opened the admin side to check if Cindy David`s sales for April 24 are already tallying correctly', 'Done'),
(2370, '39557470', '2025-04-25', 'JACQUELYN GALANG', 'MABALACAT PAMP', 'Lance Garcia', 'The client is requesting support to change the payment method for Sales Invoice No. 21906 from cash to card', 'An incorrect payment method was selected by the cashier', 'Back up the SQL database and update the payment method for Sales Invoice No. 21906 from cash to card', 'Done'),
(2371, '39557470', '2025-04-26', 'JACQUELYN GALANG', 'MABALACAT PAMP', 'CHRISTIAN BUNGQUE', 'The client is requesting support to change the payment method for Sales Invoice No. 22166 from cash to card', 'An incorrect payment method was selected by the cashier', 'Back up the SQL database and update the payment method for Sales Invoice No. 22166 from cash to card', 'DONE'),
(2372, '2060918', '2025-04-28', 'JACQUELYN GALANG', 'MAGALANG PAMP', 'Lance Garcia', 'The client is requesting tech support because they are unable to print a receipt at their POS', 'After checking their POS, I found that the printer drivers had been deleted', 'Access their computer via UltraViewer, install the new printer drivers, and ask the client if the printer is now able to print', 'Done'),
(2373, '15724957', '2025-04-28', 'MR OGIE ABESAMIS', 'TALAVERA NUEVA ECIJA', 'CHRISTIAN BUNGQUE', 'client send a photo about their receipt have a error line in unleaded\r\n-ESGUERRA GAS STATION', 'misinput of price, there is a special character in the original price of unlead at the end of number.', '-back up the database\r\n-check the readings and products data\r\n-remove the special character on the original price of unleaded and also update the transactions of unleaded that already input in POS lastly test', 'DONE'),
(2374, '93545390', '2025-04-29', 'BENNIE UY', 'BALIBAGO ANGELES CITY', 'DUKE ESGUERRA', 'Client requested assistance due to a missing transaction number on the Issuance page.', 'After voiding an item in the Issuance module, the system redirected to a page where the transaction number was not generated or displayed.', 'Remotely accessed the client`s POS system.\r\n\r\nCreated a backup of their existing database.\r\n\r\nCopied the server-side program for testing.\r\n\r\nIdentified and reprogrammed the affected modules:\r\n\r\nindex_supplier\r\n\r\nverifyVoidIssuanceItem\r\n\r\ndeleteItemListNowIssuance\r\n\r\nRan tests on the modified system to confirm the issue was resolved.\r\n\r\nOnce verified, remotely accessed the clientâ€™s server again, backed up the old system files, and deployed the updated files.\r\n\r\nDemonstrated to the client that t', 'DONE'),
(2375, '18019772', '2025-04-30', 'ANALYN KIDKID', 'ILOGON BENGUET', 'DUKE ESGUERRA', 'CLIENT REQUESTED SUPPORT DUE TO BEING UNABLE TO LOG IN USING THEIR BADGE ON THE CASHIER TERMINAL.', 'TERMINAL02 WAS DISCONNECTED FROM THE RNZ ROUTER, PREVENTING LOGIN ACCESS.', 'CONDUCTED A PHONE CALL WITH THE CLIENT TO GUIDE THEM THROUGH THE PROCESS OF RECONNECTING TERMINAL02 TO THE RNZ ROUTER. AFTER RECONNECTION, THE CLIENT WAS ASKED TO LOG IN TO CONFIRM SUCCESSFUL ACCESS. THE CLIENT WAS ALSO ADVISED ON STEPS TO FOLLOW IF THE POS GETS DISCONNECTED AGAIN IN THE FUTURE.\r\n', 'DONE'),
(2376, '39536570', '2025-05-02', 'JACQUELYN GALANG', 'BAKELKEL MADAPDAP', 'DUKE ESGUERRA', 'CLIENT REQUESTED SUPPORT TO UPDATE THEIR PRODUCT DATABASE, TRANSFERRING PRODUCT DATA FROM BUDDYâ€™S MART SERVER TO BAKELKEL', 'OUTDATED PRODUCT LISTINGS ON THE BAKELKEL', 'REQUESTED THE CLIENT TO OPEN ANYDESK ON THE SOURCE SERVER (BUDDYâ€™S MART) TO GAIN REMOTE ACCESS.\r\n\r\nPERFORMED A FULL SQL DATABASE BACKUP ON THE SOURCE SERVER.\r\n\r\nEXTRACTED (DUMPED) THE PRODUCT TABLE FROM THE SOURCE SERVER DATABASE.\r\n\r\nREQUESTED THE CLIENT TO OPEN ANYDESK ON THE BAKELKEL SYSTEM FOR ACCESS.\r\n\r\nPERFORMED A FULL SQL DATABASE BACKUP ON THE BAKELKEL SYSTEM AS A PRECAUTION.\r\n\r\nIMPORTED THE UPDATED PRODUCT TABLE INTO THE BAKELKEL DATABASES.', 'DONE'),
(2377, '97777579', '2025-05-02', 'JACQUELYN GALANG', 'PORAC', 'DUKE ESGUERRA', 'THE CLIENT REQUEST SUPPORT TO UPDATE THEIR PRODUCTS FROM THE SERVER TO BEST PRICE', 'UPDATE THEIR OUTDATED PRODUCTS', 'ACCESS THE BP SERVER AND BACKUP THE PRODUCT SQL TO UPDATE THE PRICING TO BEST PRICE ADMIN PORAC', 'DONE'),
(2378, '15724957', '2025-05-03', 'MR OGIE ABESAMIS', 'TALAVERA NUEVA ECIJA', 'CHRISTIAN BUNGQUE', 'CLIENT WANT TO ADJUST THEIR SALES IN THE MONTH OF ARPIL 2025 STO ROSARIO', 'MONTHLY ADJUST SALES IN TOTAL OF 1,097,940.24', '-ASK THE CLIENT TO OPEN THE ULTRAVIEWER TO GAIN ACCESS BACKUP THE DATABASE \r\n-BACK UP THE DATABASE -GET THE ITEMCOUNT.SQL AND VOIDITEMS.SQL \r\n-DELETE THE DUPLICATE OF OLD ITEMCOUNT.SQL AND VOIDITEMS.SQL \r\n-EXECUTE THE NEW ITEMCOUNT.SQL AND VOIDITEMS.SQL\r\n', 'DONE'),
(2379, '64857706', '2025-05-03', 'MS.PAULA JOY', 'STO ROSARIO TAVERA', 'CHRISTIAN BUNGQUE', 'CLIENT WANT TO ADJUST THEIR SALES IN THE MONTH OF ARPIL 2025', 'MONTHLY ADJUST SALES IN TOTAL OF 10102.35', '-ASK THE CLIENT TO OPEN THE ULTRAVIEWER TO GAIN ACCESS BACKUP THE DATABASE \r\n-BACK UP THE DATABASE -GET THE ITEMCOUNT.SQL AND VOIDITEMS.SQL \r\n-DELETE THE DUPLICATE OF OLD ITEMCOUNT.SQL AND VOIDITEMS.SQL \r\n-EXECUTE THE NEW ITEMCOUNT.SQL AND VOIDITEMS.SQL\r\n-CREATE E JOURNAL FOR THE MONTH OF APRIL AND SEND IT TO THEIR GC ADMINS', 'DONE'),
(2380, '3875473', '2025-05-03', 'JOY MERCADO', 'CALIBUTBUT TELABASTAGAN', 'Lance Garcia', 'The client is requesting tech support because the icon of CASHIER is deleted', 'After checking their POS, I found the  CASHIER icon in the recycle bin', 'Access their computer via ANYDESK and check the recycle bin then restore the CASHIER icon', 'Done'),
(2381, '15724957', '2025-05-03', 'MR OGIE ABESAMIS', 'TALAVERA NUEVA ECIJA', 'CHRISTIAN BUNGQUE', 'CLIENT WANT TO ADJUST THEIR SALES IN THE MONTH OF ARPIL 2025 STO DOMINGO', 'MONTHLY ADJUST SALES IN TOTAL OF 2,636,794.20', '-ASK THE CLIENT TO OPEN THE ULTRAVIEWER TO GAIN ACCESS BACKUP THE DATABASE \r\n-BACK UP THE DATABASE -GET THE ITEMCOUNT.SQL AND VOIDITEMS.SQL \r\n-PAID ALL TRANSACTIONS AND ADJUST THE SALES\r\n-DELETE THE DUPLICATE OF OLD ITEMCOUNT.SQL AND VOIDITEMS.SQL \r\n-EXECUTE THE NEW ITEMCOUNT.SQL AND VOIDITEMS.SQL', 'DONE'),
(2382, '16364842', '2025-05-05', 'JONALYN BENGANO', 'TAGUIG', 'DUKE ESGUERRA', 'THE CLIENT REPORTED THE FOLLOWING ISSUES:\r\n\r\nPOS SYSTEM COULD NOT CONNECT TO THE SERVER\r\n\r\nERROR ENCOUNTERED WHEN ATTEMPTING TO REPRINT A RECEIPT\r\n\r\nSPECIFIC REPORTS ON THE ADMIN PANEL WERE NOT DISPLAYING ANY DATA', 'THE IP ADDRESSES OF BOTH THE POS SYSTEM AND THE SERVER WERE CHANGED. THIS CAUSED THE FOLLOWING ISSUES:\r\n\r\nPOS TERMINAL FAILED TO CONNECT TO THE SERVER, PREVENTING CASHIER LOGINS\r\n\r\nREPRINT FUNCTION (POSCHECKOUTVIEW1.PHP) FAILED WHEN ACCESSED\r\n\r\nADMIN PAGE REPORTS DID NOT DISPLAY DATA DUE TO DISRUPTED SERVER COMMUNICATION', 'OBTAINED ULTRAVIEWER ACCESS FOR BOTH THE POS SYSTEM AND THE SERVER\r\n\r\nCONFIGURED STATIC IP ADDRESSES ON BOTH THE POS AND THE SERVER TO PREVENT FUTURE CONNECTIVITY ISSUES\r\n\r\nUPDATED THE CONNECTION SETTINGS IN POSCHECKOUTVIEW1.PHP TO RESOLVE THE RECEIPT REPRINT ERROR\r\n\r\nSIMON RESOLVED THE REPORT DISPLAY ISSUE ON THE ADMIN PAGE AND RE-ESTABLISHED THE POS-TO-SERVER CONNECTION', 'DONE'),
(2383, '64857706', '2025-05-06', 'MS.PAULA JOY', 'STO ROSARIO TAVERA', 'DUKE ESGUERRA', 'CLIENT REQUESTED TO EXTRACT AND PRINT THEIR SHIFT-END REPORT FOR YESTERDAYS SALES AS OF 11:30 PM', 'CLIENT WAS UNABLE TO PRINT THEIR SHIFT-END REPORT DUE TO A POWER OUTAGE', 'REQUESTED THE CLIENT TO PROVIDE THEIR ULTRAVIEWER ID AND PASSWORD TO REMOTELY ACCESS THEIR POS. ONCE CONNECTED, BACKED UP AND SAVED THEIR SQL DATABASE FOR SAFETY. SET THE SYSTEM DATE TO YESTERDAY TO ALLOW GENERATION OF THE SHIFT-END REPORT. PRINTED THE REPORT AND CONFIRMED WITH THE CLIENT THAT THE DATA WAS ACCURATE. AFTER CONFIRMATION, RESTORED THE SYSTEM DATE TO THE PRESENT TO ALLOW NORMAL POS OPERATIONS TO RESUME.', 'DONE'),
(2384, '15724957', '2025-05-06', 'MR OGIE ABESAMIS', 'TALAVERA NUEVA ECIJA', 'DUKE ESGUERRA', 'CLIENT NAME:\r\nATLANTA MAIN\r\n\r\n CLIENT REQUESTED TO ADJUST THEIR SALES FOR THE MONTH OF APRIL 2025', 'MONTHLY SALES ADJUSTMENT REQUIRED WITH A TOTAL AMOUNT OF 52,885,498.07 ', 'ASKED THE CLIENT TO OPEN ULTRAVIEWER TO GAIN ACCESS\r\n\r\nBACKED UP THE DATABASE\r\n\r\nRETRIEVED ITEMCOUNT.SQL AND VOIDITEMS.SQL FILES\r\n\r\nPAID ALL TRANSACTIONS AND ADJUSTED THE SALES\r\n\r\nEXECUTED THE UPDATED ITEMCOUNT.SQL AND VOIDITEMS.SQL FILES', 'DONE'),
(2385, '15724957', '2025-05-02', 'MR OGIE ABESAMIS', 'TALAVERA NUEVA ECIJA', 'DUKE ESGUERRA', 'CLIENT NAME:\r\nATLANTIC PLUS\r\n\r\nCLIENT REQUESTED TO ADJUST THEIR SALES FOR THE MONTH OF APRIL 2025', 'MONTHLY SALES ADJUSTMENT REQUIRED WITH A TOTAL AMOUNT OF 1,344,777.89  ', 'ASKED THE CLIENT TO OPEN ULTRAVIEWER TO GAIN ACCESS\r\n\r\nBACKED UP THE DATABASE\r\n\r\nRETRIEVED ITEMCOUNT.SQL AND VOIDITEMS.SQL FILES\r\n\r\nPAID ALL TRANSACTIONS AND ADJUSTED THE SALES\r\n\r\nEXECUTED THE UPDATED ITEMCOUNT.SQL AND VOIDITEMS.SQL FILES', 'DONE'),
