(2399, '53965776', '2025-05-06', 'RONALD ALLAN FRANCISCO', 'DINALUPIHAN BATAAN', 'CHRISTIAN BUNGQUE', 'CLIENT WANT TO ADJUST THEIR SALES FOR THE MONTH OF ARPIL 2025', 'MONTHLY ADJUST SALES FOR TERMINAL 1 AND TERMINAL 2', '-ASK THE CLIENT TO OPEN THE ANYDESK OR ULTRAVIEWER TO GAIN ACCESS BOTH TERMINAL\r\n-BACK UP THE DATABASE -GET THE ITEMCOUNT.SQL AND VOIDITEMS.SQL\r\n-DELETE THE DUPLICATE OF OLD ITEMCOUNT.SQL AND VOIDITEMS.SQL \r\n-EXECUTE THE NEW ITEMCOUNT.SQL AND VOIDITEMS.SQL\r\n-SCREENSHOT THE SPECIFIC REPORT FOR THE MONTH OF APRIL AND SEND IT TO SIR RAL', 'DONE'),
