(2402, '15724957', '2025-05-09', 'MR OGIE ABESAMIS', 'TALAVERA NUEVA ECIJA', 'DUKE ESGUERRA', 'Client requested support because their printer was not printing.', 'The client had replaced their POS printer and required the new printer driver to be installed.', 'Gained remote access via UV/AnyDesk.\r\n\r\nPerformed a database backup.\r\n\r\nReinstalled the printer driver.\r\n\r\nConducted a test print and verified functionality with the client.\r\n\r\nConfirmed that the printer is now working properly.\r\n', 'DONE'),
(2403, '39536570', '2025-05-10', 'JACQUELYN GALANG', 'BAKELKEL MADAPDAP', 'CHRISTIAN BUNGQUE', 'CLIENT REQUESTED SUPPORT TO UPDATE THEIR PRODUCT DATABASE, TRANSFERRING PRODUCT DATA FROM BUDDYâ€™S MART SERVER TO BAKELKEL AND ALSO IN BEST PRICE', 'OUTDATED PRODUCT LISTINGS ON THE BAKELKEL AND BEST PRICE', 'TO UPDATE THE PRICE FOR BAKEKEL AND BP ACCESS BUDDIES AND BP SERVER THEN BACKUP THEIR PRODUCT DATA, GET THE PRODUCT DATA AND EXECUTE IN BAKELKEL\r\n AND BEST PRICE', 'DONE'),
(2404, '15724957', '2025-05-11', 'MR OGIE ABESAMIS', 'TALAVERA NUEVA ECIJA', 'Rabbi Zamora', 'client chat in about the pos not working', 'Xamp Server is not auto start.', 'Set auto start the xamp server, \r\nrestart and open the cashier page.\r\ncashier confirmed that cashier is now working', 'done'),
(2405, '95327645', '2025-05-13', 'SBGP FOOD SERVICES INC.', 'MALVAR BATANGAS', 'DUKE ESGUERRA', 'Client requested support regarding a double discount appearing in their day-end report.\r\n', 'The client applied two discounts on a single table and refreshed the POS while processing the discount, resulting in duplicate entries.\r\n', '\r\nRequested the client`s UltraViewer access and connected to their POS system.\r\n\r\nCreated a backup of their SQL database for safety.\r\n\r\nInvestigated and confirmed the double discount entry.\r\n\r\nExplained and demonstrated the correct procedure for applying senior discounts to prevent recurrence.', 'DONE'),
