(2407, '39536570', '2025-05-14', 'JACQUELYN GALANG', 'BAKELKEL MADAPDAP', 'DUKE ESGUERRA', 'CLIENT REQUESTED SUPPORT TO UPDATE THEIR PRODUCT DATABASE, TRANSFERRING PRODUCT DATA FROM BUDDYâ€™S MART SERVER TO BAKELKEL AND ALSO IN BEST PRICE', 'OUTDATED PRODUCT LISTINGS ON THE BAKELKEL AND BEST PRICE', 'TO UPDATE THE PRICE FOR BAKEKEL AND BP ACCESS BUDDIES AND BP SERVER THEN BACKUP THEIR PRODUCT DATA, GET THE PRODUCT DATA AND EXECUTE IN BAKELKEL AND BEST PRICE', 'DONE'),
