(2409, '95327645', '2025-05-16', 'SBGP FOOD SERVICES INC.', 'MALVAR BATANGAS', 'CHRISTIAN BUNGQUE', 'CLIENT REQUESTED SUPPORT ABOUT THEIR SALES IN THE DATE OF 05-15-2025 ROYAL PARK', 'THE CLIENT USED Z READING BUTTON IN SALES REPORT', '-ACCESS THE POS AND BACK UP THE DATABASE\r\n-CALL THE CLIENT ABOUT WHAT IS THE TRANSACTIONS IN THAT DATE AND ALSO THE RECEIPTNUMBER\r\n-SET THE DATE TO 05-15-2025 THE RECEIPTNUMBER THEY SAID AND ALSO CHECK IF THE THEIR SALES IS TALLY ON THEIR MANUAL COMPUTE\r\n-INFORM THE CLIENT THAT DONT USED THE ZREADING BUTTON', 'DONE'),
(2410, '7875034', '2025-05-17', 'AIDEE GALANG HENSON', 'MADAPDAP PAMPANGA', 'CHRISTIAN BUNGQUE', 'CLIENT REQUESTED SUPPORT ABOUT THEIR PRINTER DOES NOT PRINTING PROPERLY', 'CHECK THE PRINTER TO SEE IF IT CAN STILL BE REPAIRED OR RESTORED TO ITS ORIGINAL PRINTING QUALITY\r\n', '-CALL CLIENT THE CLIENT THEN WALK THROUGH\r\n-CHECK THE CABLES OF PRINTER THEN CLEAN THE INSIDE OF PRINTER AND THE ROLLER AND ALSO CHECK IF HAVE A PAPER JAM\r\n-ACCESS AND REMOVE/DELETE ALL QUEING IN THE PRINTER\r\n-REINSTALL THE PRINTER DRIVERS\r\n-CALL THE CLIENT AND INFORM THEM OF THE POSSIBLE SOLUTIONS FOR THEIR BROKEN PRINTER.\r\n', 'DONE'),
(2411, '2060918', '2025-05-18', 'JACQUELYN GALANG', 'MAGALANG PAMP', 'Rabbi Zamora', 'The client is requesting tech support because they are unable to print a receipt at their POS. Client Chat in May 27 2025 6:28pm. But inform client our support that day is until 5pm. Inform also that today is sunday no tech available. But since they need the printer, tech extend his help to them. ', 'After checking their POS, tech found that the printer drivers had been deleted again. inform the only reason why printer driver was deleted.', 'Access their computer via UltraViewer, install the new printer drivers, backup procedure is done. test the printer and ask the client if the printer is now able to print. Client confirm printer is printing. Back up procedure was done again. Final test print was done. Ask the client if the printer is now able to print. Client confirm printer is printing.\r\n\r\ninform the client that RNZ support is from MON-SAT 8am to 5pm. ', 'DONE'),
(2412, '1599692', '2025-05-19', 'RICKY CANLAS', 'ANGELES CITY', 'CHRISTIAN BUNGQUE', '-Client requested to update their old system password for security purposes.\r\n-Intersave', '-Client needed to replace the existing password to maintain account security and ensure only authorized access.', '-Successfully updated the clientâ€™s old password to a new one as per their request.', 'Done'),
(2413, '7875034', '2025-05-19', 'AIDEE GALANG HENSON', 'MADAPDAP PAMPANGA', 'CHRISTIAN BUNGQUE', '-The client requested repair service for their printer, which was not printing properly.', '-The printer roller gear was found to be worn out, which resulted in improper feeding of the thermal paper and inconsistent print output.', '-Clean the printer roller gear and check if it can still be restored to working condition.\r\n-Tell the client what caused the issue and what they should do when they refill a thermal paper of printer.\r\n', 'Done'),
(2414, '62490309', '2025-05-21', 'ESTER FARIÃ‘AS', 'MORONG BATAAN', 'DUKE ESGUERRA', 'Client requested assistance as their printer was not printing.', 'The printer driver had been accidentally deleted', 'Provided remote support via phone. The client was having difficulty connecting the unit to their Wi-Fi network. Guided the client through the necessary steps to reconnect the unit to their internet and reinstall the printer driver. \r\nAlso educated the client on how to reinstall the driver independently in case the issue recurs in the future.\r\n', 'DONE'),
(2415, '39536570', '2025-05-21', 'JACQUELYN GALANG', 'BAKELKEL MADAPDAP', 'DUKE ESGUERRA', 'CLIENT REQUESTED SUPPORT TO UPDATE THEIR PRODUCT DATABASE, TRANSFERRING PRODUCT DATA FROM BUDDYâ€™S MART SERVER TO BAKELKEL AND ALSO IN BEST PRICE', 'OUTDATED PRODUCT LISTINGS ON THE BAKELKEL AND BEST PRICE', 'TO UPDATE THE PRICE FOR BAKEKEL AND BP ACCESS BUDDIES AND BP SERVER THEN BACKUP THEIR PRODUCT DATA, GET THE PRODUCT DATA AND EXECUTE IN BAKELKEL AND BEST PRICE', 'DONE'),
(2416, '97777579', '2025-05-22', 'JACQUELYN GALANG', 'PORAC', 'DUKE ESGUERRA', 'The client has requested support regarding a discrepancy in their sales at Terminal 1\r\n', 'The other transactions on May 15, 2025, do not have a POS number (Terminal01)\r\n', '-Ask the client to open UltraViewer to allow remote access. \r\n	-Back up the database to ensure data safety. \r\n	-Review all transactions dated May 15, 2025 to May 21, 2025, for Terminal 1, and update any missing transactions to include the correct POS number (Terminal01). \r\n	-Verify the X-reading for May 15, 2025 to May 21, 2025, and ensure it tallies with the recorded transactions\r\n', 'DONE'),
(2417, '97777579', '2025-05-24', 'JACQUELYN GALANG', 'PORAC', 'CHRISTIAN BUNGQUE', '-The client ask for support to update their price in Best Price', '-The pricing requires an update\r\n', '-To update the price in Best Price access Best Price computer updated price and then backup their product data get the product data and execute in Best price server', 'Done'),
(2418, '39536570', '2025-05-26', 'JACQUELYN GALANG', 'BAKELKEL MADAPDAP', 'DUKE ESGUERRA', 'CLIENT REQUESTED SUPPORT TO UPDATE THEIR PRODUCT DATABASE, TRANSFERRING PRODUCT DATA FROM BUDDYâ€™S MART SERVER TO BAKELKEL AND ALSO IN BEST PRICE', 'OUTDATED PRODUCT LISTINGS ON THE BAKELKEL AND BEST PRICE', 'TO UPDATE THE PRICE FOR BAKEKEL AND BP ACCESS BUDDIES AND BP SERVER THEN BACKUP THEIR PRODUCT DATA, GET THE PRODUCT DATA AND EXECUTE IN BAKELKEL AND BEST PRICE', 'DONE'),
(2419, '64857706', '2025-05-27', 'MS.PAULA JOY', 'STO ROSARIO TAVERA', 'DUKE ESGUERRA', 'Client requested assistance in extracting sales data from the previous day (May 26, 2025), specifically for the time range between 5:30 AM and 2:30 PM.\r\n', 'The client was unable to perform their daily cash breakdown due to a power outage on May 26, 2025.\r\n', '\r\nRequested UltraViewer access from the client to remotely connect to their POS system.\r\n\r\nBacked up the client`s SQL database to ensure data integrity.\r\n\r\nExtracted the requested sales data (from 5:30 AM to 2:30 PM, May 26) from the database.\r\n\r\nCompiled the extracted data into an Excel file.\r\n\r\nSent the finalized sales report to the client.\r\n', 'DONE'),
