(2424, '15724957', '2025-06-02', 'MR OGIE ABESAMIS', 'TALAVERA NUEVA ECIJA', 'DUKE ESGUERRA', '\r\nCLIENT: BULILIT 1(GULOD)\r\n\r\n\r\nCLIENT REQUESTED TO ADJUST THEIR SALES FOR THE MONTH OF MAY 2025\r\n\r\n', 'MONTHLY SALES ADJUSTMENT REQUIRED WITH A TOTAL AMOUNT OF 1,421,776.97  \r\n', 'ASKED THE CLIENT TO OPEN ULTRAVIEWER TO GAIN ACCESS BACKED UP THE DATABASE RETRIEVED ITEMCOUNT.SQL AND VOIDITEMS.SQL FILES EXECUTED THE UPDATED ITEMCOUNT.SQL AND VOIDITEMS.SQL FILES\r\n', 'DONE'),
(2425, '00000005', '2025-06-02', 'TINTIN IMPORTED CHOCOLATE SHOP', 'City of San Fernando', 'CHRISTIAN BUNGQUE', '-The client ask for support about their pos does not see the hard drive disk', '-The Operating System and other drive is set to Legacy mode so that the Operating system and other is not function properly.', '-Check the BIOS to see if it detects the hard disk of the POS.\r\n-Next, change the Legacy Mode option to \"UEFI\" so that the hard disk with the operating system can be detected.\r\nThen, set the boot option 1 to the hard disk drive, save the settings, and restart.\r\n-Lastly, shut down the system and check if it proceeds to boot into the operating system.\r\n', 'Done'),
