(2556, '10750156', '2025-08-04', 'JACQUELYN GALANG', 'MADAPDAP MABALACAT', 'Mark Tolentino', 'CLIENT ASKED TO UPDATE THE PRICE OF BAKELKEL AND BEST PRICE', 'NEED TO UPDATE PRICE', 'ACCESS BUDDYS AND BP SERVER THEN BACK UP THEIR PRODUCT DATA TO UPDATE PRICE TO BP AND BAKELKEL', 'DONE'),
