(2571, '89619961', '2025-08-08', 'JACQUELYN GALANG', 'NA', 'CHRISTIAN BUNGQUE', 'Client ask for support regarding to their void transaction because it was missing from the sales report and also the day end report printing that the amount that not appeared in pysical receipt.', 'Update the system to show the void transaction button and also adjust some size in printing in day end report', 'Access the client ultraviewer then update the file system then check and test if the button of void transaction has already appeared and lastly adjust the scale sizing in day end report', 'Done'),
(2572, '58449021', '2025-08-08', 'MR OGIE ABESAMIS', 'TALAVERA NUEVA ECIJA', 'DUKE ESGUERRA', 'THE NEST SAN PASCUAL CLIENT REQUESTED AN ADJUSTMENT TO THEIR SALES RECORDS FOR JULY 2025.\r\n\r\n', 'A MONTHLY SALES ADJUSTMENT TOTALING 27K S.I. 26026 \r\n', 'REQUESTED THE CLIENT TO OPEN ANYDESK FOR REMOTE ACCESS. -BACKED UP THE DATABASE. -RETRIEVED ITEMCOUNT.SQL AND VOIDITEMS.SQL FILES. -ADJUSTED THE SALES AND VOID AMOUNTS USING THE SYSTEM. -REMOVED DUPLICATE ITEMCOUNT.SQL AND VOIDITEMS.SQL FILES. -EXECUTED THE UPDATED ITEMCOUNT.SQL AND VOIDITEMS.SQL FILES.\r\n\r\n', 'DONE'),
