(2580, '7875034', '2025-08-12', 'AIDEE GALANG HENSON', 'MADAPDAP PAMPANGA', 'CHRISTIAN BUNGQUE', 'The client sent a message regarding sales on different dates where their profit is negative.', 'Some items have an original price that is much higher than the selling price.', 'Access the clientâ€™s POS to back up, then check all products with negative profit and send the list to the client so they can update either the original price or the selling price. For now, also fix the dates with negative sales caused by products priced higher in cost than their selling price.', 'Pending'),
(2581, '15724957', '2025-08-13', 'MR OGIE ABESAMIS', 'TALAVERA NUEVA ECIJA', 'CHRISTIAN BUNGQUE', 'The client sent a video regarding their POS system having no display.\r\nATLANTA MAIN', 'The client said their monitor lost its display, and they already tried replacing the cable, but the issue remained.', 'Call the client to assist them, then advise the client to try replacing the HDMI cable or the monitor to check the possible cause, and also try unplugging and plugging back all cables in the system unit.', 'Done'),
