(2584, '58449021', '2025-08-14', 'MR OGIE ABESAMIS', 'TALAVERA NUEVA ECIJA', 'CHRISTIAN BUNGQUE', 'The client requested support regarding their July sales report, as their S.I. numbers are not in sequence. SAMPALOC', 'Some transactions do not have the POS number set to TERMINAL01, which causes their sales not to appear.', 'Access and back up the database, then update their S.I. numbers and assign TERMINAL01 to each transaction. After that, execute the changes in their database, verify them, and send a screenshot to Maâ€™am Ana Catarina.', 'Done'),
(2585, '39557470', '2025-08-14', 'JACQUELYN GALANG', 'MABALACAT PAMP', 'CHRISTIAN BUNGQUE', 'The client sent a message and a photo regarding their shift end report, where some payment methods, other than cash, did not tally.', 'Update the day end report due to missing call variables.', 'Access the clientâ€™s system and back up the database, then retrieve the file system and database to check them. After identifying the issue, update the system, then access the clientâ€™s UV again and back up the file system before applying the update.', 'Done'),
(2586, '2060918', '2025-08-14', 'JACQUELYN GALANG', 'MAGALANG PAMP', 'CHRISTIAN BUNGQUE', 'Update the day end report due to missing call variables.', 'Update the day end report due to missing call variables.', 'Access the clientâ€™s system then back up the file system before applying the update and test.', 'Done'),
(2587, '97777579', '2025-08-14', 'JACQUELYN GALANG', 'PORAC', 'DUKE ESGUERRA', 'CLIENT REPORTED THAT THE MONITOR ON TERMINAL 03 SUDDENLY WENT BLACK AND HAD NO DISPLAY.\r\n', 'POSSIBLE DEFECTIVE POWER ADAPTER.\r\n', 'WHILE ON A VIDEO CALL WITH THE CLIENT, I INSTRUCTED THEM TO LOCATE THE POWER AC ADAPTER OF THE MONITOR, UNPLUG IT, AND TEST IT ON ANOTHER MONITOR. THEY CONFIRMED THAT IT WAS NOT WORKING. I THEN ASKED THEM TO CONNECT A WORKING POWER AC ADAPTER TO THE MONITOR THAT HAD GONE BLACK WITH NO DISPLAY, AND THEY CONFIRMED THAT IT WAS NOW WORKING WITH POWER AND DISPLAY. I INFORMED THEM THAT THE ISSUE WAS CAUSED BY A DEFECTIVE AC ADAPTER AND ADVISED THEM TO REPLACE IT. I ALSO INSTRUCTED THEM TO TAKE A PICTU', 'DONE'),
(2588, '89619961', '2025-08-14', 'JACQUELYN GALANG', 'NA', 'CHRISTIAN BUNGQUE', 'Update the day end report due to missing call variables.', 'Update the day end report due to missing call variables.', 'Access the clientâ€™s system then back up the file system before applying the update and test.', 'Done'),
(2589, '93545390', '2025-08-18', 'BENNIE UY', 'BALIBAGO ANGELES CITY', 'Mark Tolentino', 'CLIENT SEND A PHOTO ABOUT THE SAVING CONSIGNMENT REPORT WITH A ERROR LINE', 'DUE TO THEIR SSD NEWLY INSTALL OS AND ALSO REINSTALLED SYSTEM SOME SERVER CONFIGURATION HAS BEEN ERASED\r\n', 'ACCESS THIER POS TERMINAL 6 BACKUP SYSTEM AND DATABASE AND OPEN XAMPP CONTROL PANEL MYSQL MY.INI ADDED CONFIGURATION SKIP GRANT TABLES', 'DONE'),
(2590, '89106584', '2025-08-19', 'SORISO RESTAURANT AND PIZERIA', 'ANGELES CITY', 'DUKE ESGUERRA', 'CLIENT REQUESTED TO REDUCE THE PRINT SIZE AND REPORTED THAT THEY NEED TO LOGIN TWICE WHEN STARTING THE POS.', 'PRINT SIZE WAS INCORRECTLY SET TO 9999MM INSTEAD OF THE DEFAULT 297MM.\r\n\r\nDOUBLE LOGIN OCCURRED BECAUSE THE CLIENT WAS MANUALLY OPENING THE POS SOFTWARE EVEN THOUGH IT WAS ALREADY CONFIGURED TO AUTO-START.', 'CALLED THE CLIENT AND HAD THEM DEMONSTRATE THE LOGIN AND PRINT SIZE ISSUE.\r\n\r\nINFORMED THE CLIENT THAT THEY DO NOT NEED TO OPEN THE POS MANUALLY AFTER A FRESH START/RESTART SINCE IT IS SET TO AUTO-START.\r\n\r\nACCESSED THE POS REMOTELY AND RESET THE PRINT SIZE BACK TO THE DEFAULT 297MM.\r\n\r\nASKED FOR AND RECEIVED CLIENT CONFIRMATION THAT BOTH ISSUES WERE RESOLVED.', 'DONE'),
