(2599, '2060918', '2025-08-22', 'JACQUELYN GALANG', 'MAGALANG PAMP', 'CHRISTIAN BUNGQUE', 'The client called regarding their first and third transactions having the same service invoice number.\r\n', 'The client explained the processes they did in those transactions and mentioned that after settling the payment, the order was not removed. They also said that after printing the order, it was voided, so itâ€™s possible that the cart was not cleared or the client logged out on the page where the clear cart button is located. Then, they closed the POS, logged in again, and the transaction was still there. After that, they tried to process it again on the same table.\r\n', 'Access and back up the database, then retrieve it and render it on my PC to track each transaction. After checking, inform the client about what happened regarding their concern, and also remind the client to always ensure that the order is properly transacted and to clear the cart every time after settling the payment.', 'Done'),
(2600, '39557470', '2025-08-18', 'JACQUELYN GALANG', 'MABALACAT PAMP', 'CHRISTIAN BUNGQUE', 'Update the data of bucket_itemcount and also the report_itemcount due to new database tables', 'Update the data of bucket_itemcount and also the report_itemcount due to new database tables', 'Access and back up the database and the file system, then retrieve the existing database and insert their previous data into the new database and test it.', 'Done'),
(2601, '39557470', '2025-08-22', 'JACQUELYN GALANG', 'MABALACAT PAMP', 'CHRISTIAN BUNGQUE', 'Update bucket_itemcount and also bucket_carddetails due to new databases.', 'Update bucket_itemcount and also bucket_carddetails due to new databases.', 'Access and back up the database, then retrieve the existing database and insert their previous data into the new database and also the cards payment method and test it.', 'Done'),
