(2616, '73129282', '2025-08-30', 'RAYMOND GONZALES', 'MABALACAT', 'CHRISTIAN BUNGQUE', 'The client sent a message regarding their sales on August 29 is jumped by August 30.', 'The client said we opened the POS yesterday, and there was already a transaction punched in. By mistake, we did an X and Z reading because we thought we hadnâ€™t ended the shift the night before, since a transaction was already punched. Thatâ€™s why we ended the shift right away in the morning.', 'Access their POS and then back up the system and databases then check all the transaction that jump into august 30 and then query them to set to august 29.', 'Done'),
