(2625, '93545390', '2025-09-02', 'BENNIE UY', 'BALIBAGO ANGELES CITY', 'DUKE ESGUERRA', 'Client reported duplicate processing in Issuance and Receiving.\r\n', 'The previous process only checked the transaction status before updating. When two users clicked â€œPOSTâ€ at the same time, both checks passed, allowing duplicate posting.\r\n', 'Contacted the client and asked them to demonstrate the Issuance process. Requested Anydesk access to the server for verification. Updated the posting code to include a status re-check before processing. The system now validates if the transaction is still pending before updating. If another user has already posted it, the code stops further processing. This ensures that even if two users attempt to post at the same time, only one transaction is processed.\r\n\r\n', 'DONE'),
(2626, '64857706', '2025-09-03', 'MS.PAULA JOY', 'STO ROSARIO TAVERA', 'CHRISTIAN BUNGQUE', 'Client want to adjust their sales in the month of August 2025', 'Monthly adjust sales', '-Ask the client to open the ultraviewer to gain access backup the database -back up the database -get the itemcount.Sql and voiditems.Sql -delete the duplicate of old itemcount.Sql and voiditems.Sql -execute the new itemcount.Sql and voiditems.Sql -create e journal for the month of may and send it to their gc admins', 'Done'),
