(2636, '58449021', '2025-09-09', 'MR OGIE ABESAMIS', 'TALAVERA NUEVA ECIJA', 'DUKE ESGUERRA', 'THE NEST SAMPALOC CLIENT REQUESTED AN ADJUSTMENT TO THEIR SALES RECORDS FOR AUGUST 2025.\r\n', 'A MONTHLY SALES ADJUSTMENT TOTALING 35K S.I. 53412 \r\n\r\n', 'REQUESTED THE CLIENT TO OPEN ANYDESK FOR REMOTE ACCESS. -BACKED UP THE DATABASE. -RETRIEVED ITEMCOUNT.SQL AND VOIDITEMS.SQL FILES. -ADJUSTED THE SALES AND VOID AMOUNTS USING THE SYSTEM. -REMOVED DUPLICATE ITEMCOUNT.SQL AND VOIDITEMS.SQL FILES. -EXECUTED THE UPDATED ITEMCOUNT.SQL AND VOIDITEMS.SQL FILES.\r\n\r\n', 'DONE'),
(2637, '58449021', '2025-09-08', 'MR OGIE ABESAMIS', 'TALAVERA NUEVA ECIJA', 'DUKE ESGUERRA', 'THE NEST SAN PASCUAL CLIENT REQUESTED AN ADJUSTMENT TO THEIR SALES RECORDS FOR AUGUST 2025.\r\n\r\n', 'A MONTHLY SALES ADJUSTMENT TOTALING 30K S.I. 26164 ', 'REQUESTED THE CLIENT TO OPEN ANYDESK FOR REMOTE ACCESS. -BACKED UP THE DATABASE. -RETRIEVED ITEMCOUNT.SQL AND VOIDITEMS.SQL FILES. -ADJUSTED THE SALES AND VOID AMOUNTS USING THE SYSTEM. -REMOVED DUPLICATE ITEMCOUNT.SQL AND VOIDITEMS.SQL FILES. -EXECUTED THE UPDATED ITEMCOUNT.SQL AND VOIDITEMS.SQL FILES.\r\n\r\n', 'DONE'),
(2638, '89106584', '2025-09-15', 'SORISO RESTAURANT AND PIZERIA', 'ANGELES CITY', 'DUKE ESGUERRA', ' Customer requested assistance in changing the management code for system access.\r\n', 'Customer requested assistance in changing the management code for system access.\r\n', 'Accessed the clientâ€™s POS via UltraViewer, \r\ncreated a backup of the database (SQL), \r\nupdated the management code to the clientâ€™s requested value, and confirmed with the client that the change was completed successfully.\r\n', 'DONE'),
(2639, '15724957', '2025-09-17', 'MR OGIE ABESAMIS', 'TALAVERA NUEVA ECIJA', 'DUKE ESGUERRA', 'CLIENT REPORTED THAT THEIR MONITOR WAS FLICKERING AND SHOWING NO SIGNAL AFTER REPLACING THE POWER ADAPTER.\r\n', 'FAULTY POWER ADAPTER, AND DEFECTIVE HDMI CABLE', 'CONDUCTED A WALKTHROUGH CALL WITH THE CLIENT TO VERIFY CONNECTIONS.\r\n\r\nCONFIRMED THAT ALL POWER AND DISPLAY CABLES WERE PROPERLY INSERTED.\r\n\r\nGUIDED THE CLIENT TO TEST THE HDMI CABLE BY UNPLUGGING AND RECONNECTING.\r\n\r\nCONFIRMED THAT THE ISSUE ORIGINATED FROM THE POWER ADAPTER.\r\n\r\nADVISED THE CLIENT TO REPLACE IT WITH A NEW ADAPTER.\r\n\r\nAFTER REPLACING THE ADAPTER, THE SYSTEM STILL SHOWED NO SIGNAL.\r\n\r\nINSTRUCTED THE CLIENT TO REPLACE THE OLD HDMI CABLE.\r\n\r\nAFTER REPLACEMENT, DISPLAY WAS RESTORED ', 'DONE'),
(2640, '61930634', '2025-09-18', 'MYCA APOSTOL GONZALES', 'CUT CUT AC', 'CHRISTIAN BUNGQUE', 'Client ask for support about to their printer does not print and also cashdrawer does not automatically open when printing.', 'The cash drawer does not open automatically due to the driver of printer 58mm printer has been delete and also the print cant print.', 'Determine what is the type of their printer then access their POS and reinstall the printer and test page and ask the client if does have printed test page.', 'Done'),
(2641, '75182796', '2025-09-20', 'JININA CASTRO', 'CUTUD MAGALANG ROAD', 'CHRISTIAN BUNGQUE', 'Client send a photo of their shift report or day end report that their sales is not tally', 'Base on data that I check on their actions within this month almost the process of day end report has printed past 12am.', 'Access the client POS to back up their database and check the the data to determine what the issue and lastly explain to them in how to proper day end report or shift end report.', 'Done'),
(2642, '15724957', '2025-09-24', 'MR OGIE ABESAMIS', 'TALAVERA NUEVA ECIJA', 'CHRISTIAN BUNGQUE', 'REFORMAT AND RETRIEVE THE DATA OF ATLANTA MAIN AND RE INSTALL THEIR POS SYSTEM', 'THE POS SYSTEM HAS VIRUS OF RANSOMWARE', 'REFORMAT AND RETRIEVE THE DATA OF ATLANTA MAIN AND RE INSTALL THEIR POS SYSTEM', 'DONE');
