(2643, '6291749', '2025-09-25', 'LORENCE SAPANGBATO', 'SAPANGBATO ANGELES CITY', 'Mark Tolentino', 'INSTALLATION OF EPSON LX-310 DOT MATRIX PRINTER WITH 1 YEAR WARRANTY AND USER TRAINING INCLUDED ON HOW TO USE THE PRINTER', 'INSTALLATION OF EPSON LX-310 DOT MATRIX PRINTER WITH 1 YEAR WARRANTY AND USER TRAINING INCLUDED ON HOW TO USE THE PRINTER', 'INSTALLATION OF EPSON LX-310 DOT MATRIX PRINTER WITH 1 YEAR WARRANTY AND USER TRAINING INCLUDED ON HOW TO USE THE PRINTER', 'DONE'),
(2644, '39557470', '2025-09-25', 'JACQUELYN GALANG', 'MABALACAT PAMP', 'CHRISTIAN BUNGQUE', 'Client send a video or photo about their admin does not turning on', 'Base in diagnose the client said the power went out and then suddenly came back, causing their admin system unit to fluctuate ', 'I performed troubleshooting on their admin computer, including RAM reseating (RAM dance), changing the SATA slot, resetting the CMOS. I also fixed the connection between their admin unit and the POS so they can connect properly.', 'Done'),
(2645, '89619961', '2025-09-25', 'JACQUELYN GALANG', 'NA', 'DUKE ESGUERRA', 'CLIENT REPORTED THAT RECEIPT PRINTING FAILED WITH AN ERROR MESSAGE.\r\n', 'PRINTER DRIVER WAS DELETED.', 'REQUESTED ULTRAVIEWER ACCESS FROM CLIENT TO REMOTELY ACCESS THEIR POS SYSTEM. REINSTALLED THE 58MM PRINTER DRIVER, PERFORMED A TEST PRINT, AND CONFIRMED WITH THE CLIENT THAT THE RECEIPT WAS SUCCESSFULLY PRINTED.', 'DONE'),
