(2651, '15724957', '2025-09-27', 'MR OGIE ABESAMIS', 'TALAVERA NUEVA ECIJA', 'CHRISTIAN BUNGQUE', 'Client ask for support regarding to their POS that they cant reach.\r\nBULILIT 3', 'The Xammp control panel has stopped.', 'Remove the startup of xammp then run as administrator of xampp then install the apache and mysql then start both and restart the POS.', 'Done'),
(2652, '22085394', '2025-09-27', 'ROSALIE  M. CABRERA', 'MAIMPIS SAN FERNANDO', 'CHRISTIAN BUNGQUE', 'Client ask for support regarding to their POS that automatically process the transactions while punching some items and they need to reprint the receipt\r\nbecause they not print the receipt\r\n', 'Due to the cursor of the mouse is not directly in the barcode fill so that the transcation will automatically process the payment.\r\n', 'Access the client POS and then backup the database and find the receipt number to send to them and reprint it and also tell them what is the reason why the transaction it automatically process payment.', 'Done'),
(2653, '39536570', '2025-09-27', 'JACQUELYN GALANG', 'BAKELKEL MADAPDAP', 'CHRISTIAN BUNGQUE', 'Client want to update their products in bestprice and also in bakelkel\r\n', 'Outdated price of products of bestprice and also in bakelkel', 'To update the price for bakekel and bp access buddies and bp server then backup their product data, get the product data and execute in each bakelkel and best price\r\n', 'Done'),
(2654, '97777579', '2025-09-27', 'JACQUELYN GALANG', 'PORAC', 'CHRISTIAN BUNGQUE', 'Outdated price of products of bestprice and also in bakelkel', 'Outdated price of products of bestprice and also in bakelkel', 'To update the price for bakekel and bp access buddies and bp server then backup their product data, get the product data and execute in each bakelkel and best price\r\n', 'Done'),
(2655, '80864793', '2025-09-30', 'TINE SAGMIT', 'BERTHAPHIL CLARK', 'DUKE ESGUERRA', 'CLIENT REQUESTED TO INCREASE THE FONT SIZE OF THE KITCHEN AND BAR PRINTOUTS.', 'THE FONT SIZE FOR THE KITCHEN AND BAR PRINTS WAS UNINTENTIONALLY REDUCED WHEN THE CLIENT PREVIOUSLY REQUESTED TO DECREASE THE RECEIPT PRINT SIZE IN THE PRINT SETTINGS.', 'ACCESSED THE CLIENTâ€™S POS SYSTEM VIA ULTRAVIEWER.\r\n\r\nCONTACTED THE CLIENT AND CREATED A BACKUP OF THE SQL DATABASE.\r\n\r\nREVIEWED AND MODIFIED THE KITCHEN AND BAR PRINT LAYOUT CODE TO INCREASE THE FONT SIZE.\r\n\r\nPERFORMED TEST PRINTS TO ENSURE CHANGES WERE APPLIED CORRECTLY.\r\n\r\nCONFIRMED WITH THE CLIENT THAT THE NEW FONT SIZE WAS ACCEPTABLE.', 'DONE'),
