(2665, '80864793', '2025-10-04', 'TINE SAGMIT', 'BERTHAPHIL CLARK', 'CHRISTIAN BUNGQUE', 'Client ask for support regarding to their admin and adjustment sales system that they cant reach', 'The POS or server is dynamic ip address so that they possible changed the ip.', 'Access their POS then static the ip address base on save ip address or linked in their macbook and also tell to them that make sure is the same network', 'Done'),
(2666, '15724957', '2025-10-06', 'MR OGIE ABESAMIS', 'TALAVERA NUEVA ECIJA', 'DUKE ESGUERRA', 'CLIENT REQUESTED THE ADDITION OF A NEW PRODUCT TO THEIR SYSTEM.\r\n', 'CLIENT REQUESTED THE ADDITION OF A NEW PRODUCT TO THEIR SYSTEM.\r\n', 'CLIENT PROVIDED ACCESS VIA ULTRAVIEWER. ACCESSED THE CLIENT`S SYSTEM THROUGH ULTRAVIEWER.\r\nCREATED A BACKUP OF THE DATABASE (SQL) BEFORE MAKING ANY CHANGES.\r\nREQUESTED ITEM DETAILS FOR THE NEW PRODUCT FROM THE CLIENT.\r\nMANUALLY ENTERED THE PRODUCT \"GREASE 3 500G\" INTO THE PRODUCT TABLE AND ADDED IT TO PRINTDAYEND1.PHP.\r\nREQUESTED CLIENT CONFIRMATION, AND CLIENT CONFIRMED THAT THE PRODUCT HAS BEEN SUCCESSFULLY ADDED.\r\n', 'DONE'),
