(2733, '10750156', '2025-11-07', 'JACQUELYN GALANG', 'MADAPDAP MABALACAT', 'CHRISTIAN BUNGQUE', 'Client send a video record about their Terminal 3 does not turn on', 'This morning, when they turned on Terminal 3, it didnâ€™t proceed to the POS. So they checked inside the CPU â€” the fan was spinning, but it would automatically shut down again.', 'Call the client then assist them on what the step by step procedure to troubleshoot the computer doing ram dance, resetting CMOS batt, uplug and plug the power connector 4pin in motherboard then test each step if they proceed in POS and after that assist also to test the printer ', 'Done'),
(2734, '39536570', '2025-11-07', 'JACQUELYN GALANG', 'BAKELKEL MADAPDAP', 'CHRISTIAN BUNGQUE', 'Client ask for support regarding to their sales for the date of october 26 and november 3 does not tally in their physical count ', 'Some of their transaction does not have a posnum that could be terminal 4 so the pos cannot read that transactions', '-Back up the database and check the date also the transactions then update to input a posnum in each transactions and also update their system to avoid that issue', 'Done'),
(2735, '20292695', '2025-11-07', 'GIAN GOMEZ', 'BLK 5 SAN MANUEL TARLAC CITY', 'DUKE ESGUERRA', 'CLIENT WANT TO ADJUST THEIR SALES FOR THE MONTH OF OCTOBER 2025\r\n', 'MONTHLY ADJUST SALES WORTH 13.1K AND 3.1K VOID\r\n', '-ASK THE CLIENT TO OPEN THE ANYDESK TO GAIN ACCESS BACKUP THE DATABASE -BACK UP THE DATABASE -GET THE ITEMCOUNT.SQL AND VOIDITEMS.SQL -DELETE THE DUPLICATE OF OLD ITEMCOUNT.SQL AND VOIDITEMS.SQL -EXECUTE THE NEW ITEMCOUNT.SQL AND VOIDITEMS.SQL\r\n\r\n', 'DONE'),
(2736, '97777579', '2025-11-07', 'JACQUELYN GALANG', 'PORAC PAMPANGA', 'Mark Tolentino', 'CLIENT ASKED TO UPDATE THE PRICE OF BAKELKEL AND BEST PRICE', 'NEED TO UPDATE PRICE', 'ACCESS BUDDYS AND BP SERVER THEN BACK UP THEIR PRODUCT DATA TO UPDATE PRICE TO BP AND BAKELKE', 'DONE'),
