(2738, '39536570', '2025-11-07', 'JACQUELYN GALANG', 'BAKELKEL MADAPDAP', 'Mark Tolentino', 'CLIENT ASKED TO UPDATE THE PRICE OF BAKELKEL AND BEST PRICE', 'NEED TO UPDATE PRICE\r\n', 'ACCESS BUDDYS AND BP SERVER THEN BACK UP THEIR PRODUCT DATA TO UPDATE PRICE TO BP AND BAKELKEL\r\n', 'DONE'),
(2739, '58449021', '2025-11-07', 'MR OGIE ABESAMIS', 'TALAVERA NUEVA ECIJA', 'DUKE ESGUERRA', 'THE NEST SAMPALOC CLIENT REQUESTED AN ADJUSTMENT TO THEIR SALES RECORDS FOR OCTOBER 2025 AND HAD A CONCERN REGARDING THEIR DAY END REPORTC WHICH CONTAINS ERROR ON PRINTING\r\n\r\n', 'A MONTHLY SALES ADJUSTMENT TOTALING 29K S.I. 53780 \r\nTHE SOFTWARE REQUIRES DATA EXPANSION\r\n\r\n', 'REQUESTED THE CLIENT TO OPEN ANYDESK FOR REMOTE ACCESS. -BACKED UP THE DATABASE. -RETRIEVED ITEMCOUNT.SQL AND VOIDITEMS.SQL FILES. -ADJUSTED THE SALES AND VOID AMOUNTS USING THE SYSTEM. -REMOVED DUPLICATE ITEMCOUNT.SQL AND VOIDITEMS.SQL FILES. -EXECUTED THE UPDATED ITEMCOUNT.SQL AND VOIDITEMS.SQL FILES.\r\nEXECUTED DATA EXPANSION ON THE SOFTWARE\r\n', 'DONE'),
(2740, '97777579', '2025-11-08', 'JACQUELYN GALANG', 'PORAC PAMPANGA', 'CHRISTIAN BUNGQUE', 'Client want to update their products in bestprice and also in bakelkel', 'Outdated price of products of bestprice and also in bakelkel.\r\n', 'To update the price for bakekel and bp access buddies and bp server then backup their product data, get the product data and execute in each bakelkel and best price\r\n', 'Done'),
(2741, '58449021', '2025-11-11', 'MR OGIE ABESAMIS', 'TALAVERA NUEVA ECIJA', 'DUKE ESGUERRA', 'CLIENT REQUESTED TO FIX THE BEGGINING S.I TO 54009 FOR THE MONTH OF OCTOBER 2025\r\n\r\n', 'CLIENT REQUESTED TO FIX THE BEGGINING S.I TO 54009 FOR THE MONTH OF OCTOBER 2025\r\n\r\n', 'REQUESTED THE CLIENT TO OPEN ANYDESK FOR REMOTE ACCESS. \r\n-BACKED UP THE DATABASE. \r\n-RETRIEVED ITEMCOUNT.SQL  FILES. \r\n-FIXED THE S.I OF OCT 2025 \r\n-REMOVED DUPLICATE ITEMCOUNT.SQL FILES. \r\n-EXECUTED THE UPDATED ITEMCOUNT.SQL FILE. ', 'done'),
(2742, '10750156', '2025-11-11', 'JACQUELYN GALANG', 'MADAPDAP MABALACAT', 'CHRISTIAN BUNGQUE', 'Client send a photo regarding the day end report on their cashier have over/short cash balancing on the date of  November 7-10 on terminal 3', 'Some of the transactions do not match the shift date, and some transactions are also included under a different date.', 'We ask the client to send the proof of sales in each date then access the client POS terminal 3 then back up database, update the proper date and shiftdate of some transactions bases on their physical cash on hand for november 7-10 2025', 'Done'),
(2743, '39536570', '2025-11-12', 'JACQUELYN GALANG', 'BAKELKEL MADAPDAP', 'CHRISTIAN BUNGQUE', 'Client want to update their products in bestprice and also in bakelkel', 'Outdated price of products of bestprice and also in bakelkel', 'To update the price for bakekel and bp access buddies and bp server then backup their product data, get the product data and execute in each bakelkel and best price', 'Done'),
(2744, '97777579', '2025-11-12', 'JACQUELYN GALANG', 'PORAC PAMPANGA', 'CHRISTIAN BUNGQUE', 'Client want to update their products in bestprice and also in bakelkel', 'Outdated price of products of bestprice and also in bakelkel.', 'To update the price for bakekel and bp access buddies and bp server then backup their product data, get the product data and execute in each bakelkel and best price', 'Done'),
(2745, '7875034', '2025-11-12', 'AIDEE GALANG HENSON', 'MADAPDAP PAMPANGA', 'CHRISTIAN BUNGQUE', 'Client ask for support and send a photo regarding in their receipt that are a vat type\r\n', 'Update the system into non vat type', 'Access the client POS to back up the database and file system then get the back up files then our programmer update the system and test, lastly access the client and back up the database then update the file system and test.', 'Done'),
(2746, '4888185', '2025-10-23', 'CATHERINE DAUS', 'ZAMORA ST BAGUIO CITY', 'CHRISTIAN BUNGQUE', 'Client ask for support to be offline thier POS system', 'Installing offline the POS system', 'Access the client, install their system and back up the database then test the system and lastly call the client and answer all their concerns.', 'Done'),
(2747, '4888185', '2025-11-08', 'CATHERINE DAUS', 'ZAMORA ST BAGUIO CITY', 'CHRISTIAN BUNGQUE', 'Client ask for support regarding to their 58mm printer doest not print and also on how to set the whole sale price of the item\r\n', 'Client said they relocate the POS hardware so that the usb port of the printer is replaced.', 'Call the client then ask them to check the printer paper then after that re install the printer and also teach them how to use the whole price ', 'Done'),
(2748, '4888185', '2025-11-12', 'CATHERINE DAUS', 'ZAMORA ST BAGUIO CITY', 'DUKE ESGUERRA', 'CLIENT REPORTED THAT THE BARCODE SCANNER IS NOT FUNCTIONING CORRECTLY AND IS HAVING DIFFICULTY READING BARCODES.\r\n', 'REVIEWED CLIENT VIDEOS SHOWING SCANNER NOT SCANNING PROPERLY. SUSPECTED THAT THE SCANNER WAS RESET TO DEFAULT SETTINGS.\r\n', 'SENT A BARCODE TO THE CLIENT FOR TESTING, INCLUDING AN AUTOSENSE SCAN AND A CODE 128 BARCODE. INSTRUCTED THE CLIENT TO RESTART THE PC AND CONNECT THE BARCODE SCANNER TO A DIFFERENT USB PORT. REQUESTED CONFIRMATION AFTER TESTING, AND THE CLIENT CONFIRMED THAT THE SCANNER WAS ABLE TO SCAN DIFFERENT ITEMS SUCCESSFULLY.\r\n\r\n', 'DONE'),
(2749, '97777579', '2025-11-13', 'JACQUELYN GALANG', 'PORAC PAMPANGA', 'Mark Tolentino', 'CLIENT ASKED TO UPDATE THE PRICE OF BAKELKEL AND BEST PRICE', 'NEED TO UPDATE PRICE', 'ACCESS BUDDYS AND BP SERVER THEN BACK UP THEIR PRODUCT DATA TO UPDATE PRICE TO BP AND BAKELKEL', 'DONE'),
(2750, '10750156', '2025-11-13', 'JACQUELYN GALANG', 'MADAPDAP MABALACAT', 'Mark Tolentino', 'CLIENT ASKED TO UPDATE THE PRICE OF BAKELKEL AND BEST PRICE', 'NEED TO UPDATE PRICE', 'ACCESS BUDDYS AND BP SERVER THEN BACK UP THEIR PRODUCT DATA TO UPDATE PRICE TO BP AND BAKELKEL', 'DONE'),
(2751, '39536570', '2025-11-13', 'JACQUELYN GALANG', 'BAKELKEL MADAPDAP', 'Mark Tolentino', 'CLIENT ASKED TO UPDATE THE PRICE OF BAKELKEL AND BEST PRICE', 'NEED TO UPDATE PRICE', 'ACCESS BUDDYS AND BP SERVER THEN BACK UP THEIR PRODUCT DATA TO UPDATE PRICE TO BP AND BAKELKEL\r\n', 'DONE'),
(2752, '99289273', '2025-11-13', 'SIMON AND STANLEY INTERNATIONAL TRADING AND DEV`T CO. INC.', 'LOT C 5B BLK C SUBIC COMMERCIAL LIGHT  XX INDUSTRIAL PARK DEWEY AVE. CBD AREA SUBIC BAY FREEPORT ZONE 2222', 'DUKE ESGUERRA', 'According to the client, the unit suddenly failed to start.\r\n\r\n', 'The unit powers on but shows no display. Based on inspection of the power cable, the unit appears to have experienced a power surge.\r\n\r\n', 'Upon testing, the unit powered on but had no display. Each internal component was carefully removed and reseated, including the RAM modules, CMOS battery, and CPU. Static discharge was performed on the motherboard to ensure no residual electrical buildup. After reinstalling all components and reconnecting the power, the unit displayed output successfully. A stress test was then conducted to verify system stability and confirm that the issue had been fully resolved.', 'DONE'),
(2753, '8322230', '2025-11-14', 'CENTRAL GRILL', 'ANGELES CITY', 'CHRISTIAN BUNGQUE', 'software warranty 1yr \r\nstart november 5 2025  \r\nend november 5 2026', 'software warranty 1yr \r\nstart november 5 2025  \r\nend november 5 2026', 'software warranty 1yr \r\nstart november 5 2025  \r\nend november 5 2026', 'done'),
(2754, '8322230', '2025-11-14', 'CENTRAL GRILL', 'ANGELES CITY', 'CHRISTIAN BUNGQUE', 'hardware warranty 3months\r\nstart november 5 2025\r\nend february 5 2026', 'hardware warranty 3months\r\nstart november 5 2025\r\nend february 5 2026', 'hardware warranty 3months\r\nstart november 5 2025\r\nend february 5 2026', 'Done'),
(2755, '8322230', '2025-11-14', 'CENTRAL GRILL', 'ANGELES CITY', 'CHRISTIAN BUNGQUE', 'The client want cancel all printed kitchen and bar order and also want to less time for taking order', 'Train the client in how to cancel the print and also create a 1 category to less time for taking order', 'Train the client in how to cancel the print and also create a 1 category to less time for taking order and also train them on how the process for taking order in bucket items', 'Done'),
