(2763, '89106584', '2025-11-19', 'SORISO RESTAURANT AND PIZERIA', 'ANGELES CITY', 'DUKE ESGUERRA', 'THE CLIENT HAS REQUESTED THAT THE GROSS TOTAL AND SERVICE CHARGE VALUES ON THE RECEIPT BE DISPLAYED IN BOLD TEXT FOR ENHANCED READABILITY.', 'CUSTOMERS WERE HAVING DIFFICULTY READING THE PRINTED RECEIPTS DUE TO LIGHT OR SMALL FONT STYLES.\r\n', 'CLIENT PROVIDED ULTRAVIEWER ACCESS FOR REMOTE SUPPORT. BACKED UP THE CLIENTâ€™S SQL DATABASE AS A PRECAUTION. UPDATED FONT STYLES IN THE FOLLOWING FILE: POSCHECKOUTPRINTNOW1.PHP APPLIED BOLD STYLING TO ALL RELEVANT TEXT ELEMENTS AS PER CLIENTâ€™S REQUEST. NOTIFIED THE CLIENT OF THE COMPLETED CHANGES AND REQUESTED CONFIRMATION TO ENSURE THE ADJUSTMENTS MET THEIR EXPECTATIONS', 'DONE'),
(2764, '15724957', '2025-11-19', 'MR OGIE ABESAMIS', 'TALAVERA NUEVA ECIJA', 'DUKE ESGUERRA', 'CLIENT CALLED FOR SUPPORT DUE TO MONITOR DISPLAY ISSUES.\r\nATLANTA MAIN', 'THE ISSUE WAS CAUSED BY THE MONITORâ€™S DISPLAY CORD BEING ACCIDENTALLY PULLED LOOSE.\r\n', 'UPON CALLING THE CLIENT AND ASKING IF THEY HAD CHECKED THE DISPLAY CORD, THEY CONFIRMED THAT THEY ALREADY DID AND THAT THE ISSUE WAS ALREADY FIXED.\r\n\r\n', 'DONE'),
(2765, '89106584', '2025-11-20', 'SORISO RESTAURANT AND PIZERIA', 'ANGELES CITY', 'DUKE ESGUERRA', 'The client reported that a transaction made via PayMaya did not appear on Ricaâ€™s Day-End Report for yesterday.\r\n', 'Upon checking their system, we discovered that the payment was processed under a different cashier account.\r\n', 'Requested the client to provide access via UltraViewer to their POS system.\r\n\r\nSaved and backed up the SQL database.\r\n\r\nVerified transaction data against references and item counts.\r\n\r\nBackdated the system to generate the Day-End Report for the cashier who processed the transaction.\r\n\r\nReset the system date to the current day.\r\n\r\nConfirmed with the client that the Day-End Report for yesterday was successfully reprinted.\r\n', 'DONE'),
(2766, '97777579', '2025-11-22', 'JACQUELYN GALANG', 'PORAC PAMPANGA', 'CHRISTIAN BUNGQUE', 'Client want to update their products in bestprice and also in bakelkel.\r\n', 'Outdated price of products of bestprice and also in bakelkel', 'To update the price for bakekel and bp access buddies and bp server then backup their product data, get the product data and execute in each bakelkel and best price\r\n', 'Done'),
(2767, '39536570', '2025-11-22', 'JACQUELYN GALANG', 'BAKELKEL MADAPDAP', 'CHRISTIAN BUNGQUE', 'Client want to update their products in bestprice and also in bakelkel.', 'Outdated price of products of bestprice and also in bakelkel', 'To update the price for bakekel and bp access buddies and bp server then backup their product data, get the product data and execute in each bakelkel and best price\r\n', 'Done'),
(2768, '93545390', '2025-11-25', 'BENNIE UY', 'BALIBAGO ANGELES CITY', 'DUKE ESGUERRA', 'The client reported that they were unable to log in using their badge ID after pressing \"Continue Update.\"\r\n\r\n', 'The error occurred because the program was turned off while processing the \"Continue Update,\" which resulted in the deletion of some database tables.\r\n\r\n', 'Gained access to Terminal 04 via AnyDesk.\r\n\r\nBacked up and saved the SQL database.\r\n\r\nChecked the database to identify which tables were deleted.\r\n\r\nDeleted old IBD files associated with the missing tables.\r\n\r\nRestored the deleted tables from the backup.\r\n\r\nRan \"Continue Update\" and verified that the terminal was functioning correctly.\r\n\r\nConfirmed that the client could successfully log in with their badge ID.\r\n\r\n', 'done'),
(2769, '80864793', '2025-11-26', 'TINE SAGMIT', 'BERTHAPHIL CLARK', 'CHRISTIAN BUNGQUE', 'Client ask for support regarding to their kitchen printer does not print', 'The printer driver of kitchen printer has deleted', 'Onsite visit the store then check the printer, install the printer driver then setup the port that connected to Bluetooth then try to test print page and also process in cashiering to send it to kitchen, bar and receipt printer and also record the process for kitchen that the printer is working.', 'Done'),
(2770, '93545390', '2025-11-26', 'BENNIE UY', 'BALIBAGO ANGELES CITY', 'CHRISTIAN BUNGQUE', 'Client ask for support regarding to their terminal 4 for updating selling item list.', 'Possible cause system recovery with missing sales data dated November 11-25 2025\r\n', 'Access terminal 4 and back up data for recovering updating issue we recover the missing sql table for them to continue update their selling item list and for the missing sales we manually generate sales base on Sir Cicer excel data.', 'Done'),
