(2784, '58355097', '2025-12-03', 'LERMA OCAMPO', 'ANGELES CITY', 'CHRISTIAN BUNGQUE', 'The client requested support regarding their system unit, which suddenly went black screen, and their printer, which is also not functioning', 'I checked each part and found that the cause is grounding â€” most of the ports at the back are affected. Additionally, when the printerâ€™s USB port is connected, the system fails to boot and becomes very slow, which leads to the black screen issue.', 'I conducted onsite testing and diagnosis of the system unit and the printer. First, I connected all the printers and the other USB ports of the POS. I also tried installing the printer, but the POS still couldnâ€™t detect it. I tested multiple USB ports and even used a USB hub, but the printer remained undetected.\r\n\r\nAfter that, I disconnected other ports to test whether the system would still encounter a black screen or get stuck on the loading screen. I also showed the client the difference in', 'Done'),
(2785, '89619961', '2025-12-03', 'JACQUELYN GALANG', 'NA', 'CHRISTIAN BUNGQUE', 'Client ask for support regarding to their admin icon shortcut is deleted', 'They cannot access or find their admin icon ', 'Access the client POS then check their recycle bin if in there and then create a shortcut icon for admin.', 'Done'),
(2786, '58449021', '2025-12-04', 'MR OGIE ABESAMIS', 'TALAVERA NUEVA ECIJA', 'DUKE ESGUERRA', 'THE NEST SAN PASCUAL CLIENT REQUESTED AN ADJUSTMENT TO THEIR SALES RECORDS FOR NOVEMBER 2025.\r\n', 'A MONTHLY SALES ADJUSTMENT TOTALING 28K S.I. 26783 \r\n', 'REQUESTED THE CLIENT TO OPEN ANYDESK FOR REMOTE ACCESS. -BACKED UP THE DATABASE. -RETRIEVED ITEMCOUNT.SQL AND VOIDITEMS.SQL FILES. -ADJUSTED THE SALES AND VOID AMOUNTS USING THE SYSTEM. -REMOVED DUPLICATE ITEMCOUNT.SQL AND VOIDITEMS.SQL FILES. -EXECUTED THE UPDATED ITEMCOUNT.SQL AND VOIDITEMS.SQL FILES.\r\n\r\n', 'DONE'),
(2787, '64857706', '2025-12-04', 'MS.PAULA JOY', 'STO ROSARIO TAVERA', 'CHRISTIAN BUNGQUE', 'Client want to adjust their sales in the month of November 2025\r\n', 'Monthly adjust sales', '-Ask the client to open the ultraviewer to gain access backup the database -back up the database -get the itemcount.Sql and voiditems.Sql -delete the duplicate of old itemcount.Sql and voiditems.Sql -execute the new itemcount.Sql and voiditems.Sql -create e journal for the month of November and send it to their gc admins', 'Done'),
(2788, '28522055', '2025-12-04', 'Girlie Pajarillo', 'Urdaneta City Pangasinan', 'CHRISTIAN BUNGQUE', 'Client ask for support for additional admin account.', 'Additional admin account', '-Ask the client to directly send it to me the additional account user and password then upload it the new account for admin and ask the client to test it.\r\n', 'Done'),
(2789, '15724957', '2025-12-04', 'MR OGIE ABESAMIS', 'TALAVERA NUEVA ECIJA', 'CHRISTIAN BUNGQUE', 'Client send the monthly adjustment sales for the month of November 2025\r\nBULILIT 2\r\n', 'Monthly sales adjustment Need sales - 744,285.29 SI No. - 21856', 'Asked the client to open ultraviewer to gain access backed up the database dump itemcount.sql and voiditems.sql and adjusted the sales after that access executed the updated itemcount.sql and voiditems.sql files to their database.', 'Done'),
(2790, '15724957', '2025-12-04', 'MR OGIE ABESAMIS', 'TALAVERA NUEVA ECIJA', 'CHRISTIAN BUNGQUE', 'Client send the monthly adjustment sales for the month of November 2025\r\nSTO ROSARIO', 'Monthly sales adjustment Need sales - 1,112,238.6 SI No. - 17139', 'Asked the client to open ultraviewer to gain access backed up the database dump itemcount.sql and voiditems.sql and adjusted the sales after that access executed the updated itemcount.sql and voiditems.sql files to their database.', 'Done'),
(2791, '15724957', '2025-12-04', 'MR OGIE ABESAMIS', 'TALAVERA NUEVA ECIJA', 'DUKE ESGUERRA', 'Client send the monthly adjustment sales for the month of November 2025 BULILIT 3\r\n', 'Monthly sales adjustment Need sales - 835,280.04 SI No. - 44273\r\n', 'Asked the client to open ultraviewer to gain access backed up the database dump itemcount.sql and voiditems.sql and adjusted the sales after that access executed the updated itemcount.sql and voiditems.sql files to their database.\r\n', 'done'),
(2792, '7875034', '2025-12-09', 'AIDEE GALANG HENSON', 'MADAPDAP PAMPANGA', 'CHRISTIAN BUNGQUE', 'Client send the monthly adjustment sales for the month of November 2025', 'Monthly sales adjustment Need sales 20,219.00', 'Access the client POS to back up the database then get the sql data to adjust the sales then after that dump again the sql to render it to their databases then print adjustment sales report for the month of november', 'Done'),
(2793, '7875034', '2025-10-01', 'AIDEE GALANG HENSON', 'MADAPDAP PAMPANGA', 'CHRISTIAN BUNGQUE', 'Client send the monthly adjustment sales for the month of September 2025', 'Monthly sales adjustment Need sales 20,198.00', 'Onsite maintenance then adjust the sales then print adjustment sales report for the month of September', 'Done'),
(2794, '53965776', '2025-12-08', 'RONALD ALLAN FRANCISCO', 'DINALUPIHAN BATAAN', 'DUKE ESGUERRA', 'CLIENT WANT TO ADJUST THEIR SALES FOR THE MONTH OF NOVEMBER 2025 BOTH TERMINAL 1 AND 2', 'MONTHLY ADJUST SALES', '	--ASK THE CLIENT TO OPEN THE ANYDESK OR ULTRAVIEWER TO GAIN ACCESS BOTH TERMINAL -BACK UP THE DATABASE -GET THE ITEMCOUNT.SQL AND VOIDITEMS.SQL -DELETE THE DUPLICATE OF OLD ITEMCOUNT.SQL AND VOIDITEMS.SQL -EXECUTE THE NEW ITEMCOUNT.SQL AND VOIDITEMS.SQL -SCREENSHOT THE SPECIFIC REPORT FOR THE MONTH OF MAY AND SEND IT TO SIR RAL', 'DONE'),
(2795, '53965776', '2025-12-09', 'RONALD ALLAN FRANCISCO', 'DINALUPIHAN BATAAN', 'DUKE ESGUERRA', 'THE CLIENT HAS REQUESTED THE REMOVAL OF DECIMAL VALUES FROM THEIR ADJUSTED SALES FIGURES.\r\n', 'THE CLIENT HAS REQUESTED THE REMOVAL OF DECIMAL VALUES FROM THEIR ADJUSTED SALES FIGURES.\r\n', '--ASK THE CLIENT TO OPEN THE ANYDESK OR ULTRAVIEWER TO GAIN ACCESS BOTH TERMINAL \r\n-BACK UP THE DATABASE \r\n-GET THE ITEMCOUNT.SQL\r\n-DELETE THE DUPLICATE OF OLD ITEMCOUNT.SQL\r\n-EXECUTE THE NEW ITEMCOUNT.SQL \r\n-SCREENSHOT THE SPECIFIC REPORT FOR THE MONTH OF MAY AND SEND IT TO SIR RAL\r\n', 'DONE'),
(2796, '95327645', '2025-12-09', 'SBGP FOOD SERVICES INC.', 'MALVAR BATANGAS', 'Mark Tolentino', 'CLIENT REPORTED THAT THE SI NUMBER SKIPPED. WHEN ATTEMPTING TO PRINT THE MISSING SI, THE SYSTEM ONLY DISPLAYED AN ERROR MESSAGE.', 'THE SI NUMBER DOES NOT EXIST, LIKELY DUE TO THE PROCESS OF CHANGING TABLES.', 'TRACKED AND VERIFIED THE MISSING SI NUMBER AND SIMULATED THE PROCESS TO IDENTIFY THE CAUSE OF THE SKIPPED SI NUMBER.', 'DONE'),
(2797, '97777579', '2025-12-10', 'JACQUELYN GALANG', 'PORAC PAMPANGA', 'DUKE ESGUERRA', 'CLIENT REQUESTED ASSISTANCE TO VERIFY IF THEIR NEWLY INSTALLED CASH DRAWER IS WORKING.\r\n\r\n', 'THEIR PREVIOUS CASH DRAWER WAS NO LONGER FUNCTIONING.\r\n\r\n', 'REQUESTED THE CLIENTâ€™S ANYDESK ACCESS TO CONNECT TO THEIR POS AND MADE A CALL TO COORDINATE. VERIFIED THE PRINTER DRIVER SETTINGS AND PERFORMED A TEST PRINT. ASKED THE CLIENT TO CONFIRM WHETHER THE CASH DRAWER OPENEDXX THEY CONFIRMED IT DID. THE CLIENT ALSO REQUESTED TO TEST THE CASH DRAWER ON ANOTHER TERMINAL, WHICH CONFIRMED THAT THE OLD CASH DRAWER WAS NO LONGER WORKING.\r\n\r\n', 'done'),
(2798, '93545390', '2025-12-11', 'BENNIE UY', 'BALIBAGO ANGELES CITY', 'DUKE ESGUERRA', 'REQUESTED ASSISTANCE DUE TO A MEMORY ALLOCATION ERROR ON TERMINAL04\r\n\r\n', ' TERMINAL04 REQUIRED DATA EXPANSION SETTINGS TO BE ADJUSTED IN XAMPP TO RESOLVE THE MEMORY LIMIT ISSUE.\r\n', 'REQUESTED THE CLIENT TO PROVIDE ANYDESK ACCESS. ACCESSED TERMINAL04 REMOTELY, SAVE AND BACKUP SQL AND PERFORMED DATA EXPANSION BY UPDATING THE XAMPP CONFIGURATION (E.G., PHP.INI MEMORY LIMIT). AFTER APPLYING THE CHANGES.\r\n\r\n', 'DONE'),
(2799, '330124', '2025-12-13', 'MARK DY', 'TELABASTAGAN', 'CHRISTIAN BUNGQUE', 'The client is requesting assistance regarding the Z-reading printout. Some information was missing from the printed report\r\n', 'The margins of the printout need adjustment', 'Access the POS, back up the database, update the file system to adjust the printout, then test and reprint the Z-reading.', 'Done'),
(2800, '330124', '2025-12-13', 'MARK DY', 'TELABASTAGAN', 'CHRISTIAN BUNGQUE', 'Client ask for support about the 1 cashier input wrong cash float', 'Input wrong amount of cashfloat', 'Access the pos to Update the cashfloat in proper amount ', 'Done'),
(2801, '330124', '2025-12-13', 'MARK DY', 'TELABASTAGAN', 'Rabbi Zamora', 'Receipt printer not printing.', 'The printer was offline and not responding due to an accumulation of pending print queues.\r\n', 'Requested permission to access the POS system.\r\n\r\nChecked the printer status and confirmed that the printer was offline.\r\n\r\nReviewed the print queue and identified multiple pending print jobs.\r\n\r\nDeleted all existing print queues.\r\n\r\nInstructed the cashier to power off the printer.\r\n\r\nInstructed the cashier to power on the printer after a short interval.\r\n\r\nPerformed a test print to verify printer functionalityXX printer responded successfully.\r\n\r\nAsked the cashier to re-print the receipt.\r\n\r\nCa', 'DONE'),
(2802, '49277499', '2025-12-22', 'MARLENE DE MATA', 'ESSEL TELABASTAGAN', 'DUKE ESGUERRA', 'CLIENT REQUESTED TECHNICAL SUPPORT BECAUSE THEIR POS IS NOT CONNECTING TO THE SERVER.\r\n\r\n', 'UPON CHECKING THE SERVER, THE FIREWALL WAS ENABLED.\r\n', 'ASKED THE CLIENT FOR ANYDESK ACCESS TO THE SERVER AND BOTH POS SYSTEMS.\r\nACCESSED THE SERVER AND BACKED UP THE DATABASE.\r\nDISABLED THE FIREWALL AND CHECKED BOTH POS SYSTEMS FOR CONNECTIVITY.\r\nUPON VERIFICATION, BOTH POS SYSTEMS WERE SUCCESSFULLY CONNECTED TO THE SERVER.\r\nINFORMED THE CLIENT THAT THE ISSUE HAS BEEN RESOLVED AND THEY MAY NOW USE THEIR POS SYSTEMS.\r\n', 'DONE'),
(2803, '330124', '2025-12-22', 'MARK DY', 'TELABASTAGAN', 'DUKE ESGUERRA', 'CLIENT REPORTED THAT THE RECEIPT PRINTER ISNT PRINTING WHEN PROCESSING ORDER SLIP AND RECEIPTS\r\n', 'UPON CHECKING THE PRINTER IS AT OFFLINE MODE.\r\n', 'ASKED THE CLIENT FOR ANYDESK ACCESS TO THEIR POS.\r\nUNINSTALLED THE OLD POS DRIVER AND INSTALLED THE NEW DRIVER.\r\nCONFIRMED WITH THE CASHIER THAT THE TEST PRINT WAS SUCCESSFUL.\r\nFOR THE FINAL PROCESS, ASKED THE CASHIER TO PRINT AN ORDER SLIP AND CONFIRMED THAT IT IS NOW PRINTING PROPERLY.\r\n', 'DONE'),
(2804, '58008085', '2025-12-26', 'MYMZ LOGISTICS', 'ANGELES CITY', 'Mark Tolentino', 'Client requested the payslips of all employees under CYPF.\r\n', 'Client request', 'Provided all requested payslips of employees under CYPF via email.\r\n', 'DONE'),
