(2823, '330124', '2026-01-09', 'MARK DY', 'TELABASTAGAN', 'CHRISTIAN BUNGQUE', 'The client raised a concern regarding the day-end report. The printed report was cut off, causing the amount to be incomplete', 'There is a special character inputted on cashfloat amount', 'Accessed the clientâ€™s POS system to check the cash float amount for that day and corrected it to ensure proper input of the amount. The POS system was also updated to prevent this issue from occurring again. Lastly, the day-end report was printed', 'Done'),
