(2827, '66165111', '2026-01-13', 'MARK DY', 'CITY OF SAN FERNANDO', 'CHRISTIAN BUNGQUE', 'The client raised a concern regarding to discrepancy of the purchase item of dinner rate', 'Is there a transaction of dinner rate is discounted so that the total amount of the dinner rate in purchase item list is discounted amount', 'Access the POS client, then back up and render the database. After that, review all dinner rate items transactions on January 10, 2026, and check if any discounts were applied and send to Sir Mark Dy.', 'Done'),
(2828, '60573025', '2026-01-13', 'MARK DY', 'BULACAN', 'CHRISTIAN BUNGQUE', 'The client raised a concern regarding to their POS system, each process is running slowly.', 'A possible cause is a loose router connection or a loose UTP LAN cable.\r\n', 'I called the client to troubleshoot the issue, tested each process while they were experiencing slowness, advised them to temporarily disconnect the UTP LAN cable from the POS which improved the processing speed, and instructed them to reconnect the LAN cable when accessing the admin account, during closing, and to check again the next morning if the system remains fast.', 'Done'),
(2829, '88556487', '2026-01-13', 'CHARLOTTE SIBAL', 'INFINITY AC', 'CHRISTIAN BUNGQUE', 'Sir Edwin concern about the adjustment sales for the date January 10 2026 is not all the transactions is adjust', 'In January 10 2026 is there a transactions duplicated but the duplicated have no items listed in report itemcount so that the Sales Management system does continue the adjustment of sales in some transactions', 'Check the all transaction on January 10 2026 then call the client what is the issue and solution then access the client POS to refund that duplicated transaction then tell the Sir Edwin to try to adjust the sales', 'Done.'),
(2830, '66165111', '2026-01-14', 'MARK DY', 'CITY OF SAN FERNANDO', 'DUKE ESGUERRA', 'APPLICATION FOR REGISTERED POS, FULL DATA RESET', 'APPLICATION FOR REGISTERED POS, FULL DATA RESET', ' ACCESS THE CLIENT POS VIA ULTRAVIEWER.\r\nPERFORMED SYSTEM AND SQL DATA BACKUP.\r\nUPDATED RECEIPT FORMAT FROM ORDER SLIP TO SERVICE INVOICE.\r\nUPDATED BUSINESS INFORMATION ON THE SYSTEM.\r\nRESET ALL SALES DATA TO ZERO.\r\nREQUESTED THE CASHIER TO PERFORM A TEST TRANSACTION, CAPTURE A PHOTO OF THE PRINTED RECEIPT, AND REPRINT THE RECEIPT TO VERIFY THAT ALL UPDATES WERE APPLIED. UPON VERIFICATION, ALL RECEIPT DETAILS WERE CONFIRMED CORRECT.\r\nRESTORED THE TRUNCATED SALES DATA BACK TO THE DATABASE.\r\nNOTIF', 'DONE'),
(2831, '15123060', '2026-01-14', 'MARK DY', 'ANGELES CITY', 'DUKE ESGUERRA', 'APPLICATION FOR REGISTERED POS, FULL DATA RESET, AND THERMAL PRINTER DRIVER REINSTALLATION\r\n', 'APPLICATION FOR REGISTERED POS, FULL DATA RESET, AND THERMAL PRINTER DRIVER REINSTALLATION\r\n', ' ACCESS THE CLIENT POS VIA ULTRAVIEWER.\r\nPERFORMED SYSTEM AND SQL DATA BACKUP.\r\nUPDATED RECEIPT FORMAT FROM ORDER SLIP TO SERVICE INVOICE.\r\nUPDATED BUSINESS INFORMATION ON THE SYSTEM.\r\nRESET ALL SALES DATA TO ZERO.\r\nREQUESTED THE CASHIER TO PERFORM A TEST TRANSACTION, CAPTURE A PHOTO OF THE PRINTED RECEIPT, AND REPRINT THE RECEIPT TO VERIFY THAT ALL UPDATES WERE APPLIED. UPON VERIFICATION, ALL RECEIPT DETAILS WERE CONFIRMED CORRECT.\r\nRESTORED THE TRUNCATED SALES DATA BACK TO THE DATABASE.\r\nNOTIF', 'DONE'),
(2832, '60573025', '2026-01-15', 'MARK DY', 'BULACAN', 'DUKE ESGUERRA', 'APPLICATION FOR REGISTERED POS AND FULL DATA RESET.\r\n', 'APPLICATION FOR REGISTERED POS AND FULL DATA RESET.\r\n', 'ACCESS THE CLIENT POS VIA ULTRAVIEWER.\r\nPERFORMED SYSTEM AND SQL DATA BACKUP.\r\nUPDATED RECEIPT FORMAT FROM ORDER SLIP TO SERVICE INVOICE.\r\nUPDATED BUSINESS INFORMATION ON THE SYSTEM.\r\nRESET ALL SALES DATA TO ZERO.\r\nREQUESTED THE CASHIER TO PERFORM A TEST TRANSACTION, CAPTURE A PHOTO OF THE PRINTED RECEIPT, AND REPRINT THE RECEIPT TO VERIFY THAT ALL UPDATES WERE APPLIED. UPON VERIFICATION, ALL RECEIPT DETAILS WERE CONFIRMED CORRECT.\r\nRESTORED THE TRUNCATED SALES DATA BACK TO THE DATABASE.\r\nNOTIFI', 'DONE'),
(2833, '75182796', '2026-01-15', 'JININA CASTRO', 'CUTUD MAGALANG ROAD', 'CHRISTIAN BUNGQUE', 'Client concern about to generate the requirements for closing POS', 'Client need to generate the requirements for POS\r\n', 'Access the client to back up and then access the client to generate each requirements and send also a e journal txt file in gc.\r\n', 'Done'),
(2834, '49277499', '2026-01-16', 'MARLENE DE MATA', 'ESSEL TELABASTAGAN', 'DUKE ESGUERRA', 'The client reported that they were unable to access the POS system and that their desktop files appeared to be missing.\r\n\r\n\r\n', 'Possible causes include the XAMPP service being closed or not running, the system being accessed under a different user account, or the system temporarily loading into a recovery or alternate user environment, which caused the POS system and desktop files to appear missing.\r\n\r\n', 'Requested remote access via AnyDeskXX however, connection could not be established due to intermittent connectivity on the clientâ€™s side.\r\n\r\nConducted a phone walkthrough with the client and instructed them to check Drive C:, where the POS system files were confirmed to be present.\r\n\r\nVerified that the system shortcut and other files were missing from the desktop. Advised the client to restart the unit and switch users if another user account was available.\r\n\r\nAfter restarting, the system auto', 'DONE'),
(2835, '2060918', '2026-01-17', 'JACQUELYN GALANG', 'MAGALANG PAMP', 'CHRISTIAN BUNGQUE', 'The client asked for support because their receipt printer does not print and beeping error\r\n', 'The printer is not detected when the printer cover is closed with paper loaded', 'Call the client to assit for troubleshooting then try to cancel all jobs and also reinstall the drivers, lastly try to replace to another working printer then test\r\n', 'Done'),
(2836, '39536570', '2026-01-19', 'JACQUELYN GALANG', 'BAKELKEL MADAPDAP', 'CHRISTIAN BUNGQUE', 'The client asked for support because their receipt printer does not print', 'The storage of the system unit is almost full so that the printer it will error due to no space in storage', 'Access the client POS then check what is the issue then delete the unnecessary files, lastly install the printer driver then test print', 'Done'),
(2837, '97777579', '2026-01-19', 'JACQUELYN GALANG', 'PORAC PAMPANGA', 'CHRISTIAN BUNGQUE', 'The client concern about the sales in Terminal 3 for the sales of January 18 2026 does not tally', 'Some of the transactions of that date are doesnt have a pos number so that in X Reading did not tally', 'Access the POS client then back up and check all the transactions for that date then update the some transactions to set the pos number then test.', 'Done'),
(2838, '93545390', '2026-01-20', 'BENNIE UY', 'BALIBAGO ANGELES CITY', 'DUKE ESGUERRA', 'The client reported that some transactions on TERMINAL04, dated January 18, 2026, were incorrectly backdated to January 17, 2026.\r\n\r\n', 'The PC system date and time were not properly synchronized with the current date and time. The CMOS battery may be weak and requires replacement.\r\n\r\n', 'The client provided an Excel file indicating the transactions that required date corrections.\r\nRequested AnyDesk access from the client.\r\nPerformed SQL data backup and system backup.\r\nDumped the bucket_itemcount.sql file and edited the SQL data, updating the XDATE and SHIFTDATE of SI No. 132094 to 132168 to 01-18-2026.\r\nCross-checked the corrected transactions against the Excel file and confirmed that the sales data correctly matched 01-17-2026 and 01-18-2026.\r\nAfter rectifying the dates, upload', 'DONE'),
(2839, '97777579', '2026-01-21', 'JACQUELYN GALANG', 'PORAC PAMPANGA', 'Mark Tolentino', 'CLIENT ASKED TO UPDATE THE PRICE OF BAKELKEL AND BEST PRICE', 'NEED TO UPDATE PRICE', 'ACCESS BUDDYS AND BP SERVER THEN BACK UP THEIR PRODUCT DATA TO UPDATE PRICE TO BP AND BAKELKEL', 'DONE'),
