(2842, '58008085', '2026-01-21', 'MYMZ LOGISTICS', 'ANGELES CITY', 'DUKE ESGUERRA', 'Client requested an update to the employee email address in the system.\r\n\r\n', 'The employees currently do not have designated email addresses on record.\r\n', 'Requested the full names of the employees whose email addresses needed to be updated. The client provided the list of employee names, and their email addresses were successfully updated in the system. The client was informed that the employee email addresses have been updated.\r\n', 'DONE'),
