(2845, '16364842', '2026-01-23', 'JONALYN BENGANO', 'TAGUIG', 'Mark Tolentino', 'Client provided a video showing the issue. Based on the video, the admin unit appears to be experiencing a Blue Screen error. Client requested if a temporary POS setup can be arranged so they can continue processing transactions while the issue is being resolved.', 'System instability resulting in a Blue Screen error on the admin unit.', 'Contacted the client to coordinate and perform guided diagnostic procedures on the unit. Advised the client to check and reseat the RAM (cleaning the contacts using an eraser), verify that the SSD is properly connected, remove and reseat the CMOS battery, and open the unit for inspection. The unit was booted into BIOS to confirm whether the SSD was detected. Instructed the client to insert the SSD into Terminal 1 to access and back up the system data from the admin unit. Configured Terminal 1 to', 'DONE'),
(2846, '60573025', '2026-01-27', 'MARK DY', 'BULACAN', 'Mark Tolentino', 'Client Requested Assistance In Editing The Day End Report.', 'Incorrect Input Of Denomination Values.\r\n', 'Accessed And Edited The Denomination Entries For â‚±500 And â‚±50.', 'done'),
(2847, '58008085', '2026-01-27', 'MYMZ LOGISTICS', 'ANGELES CITY', 'DUKE ESGUERRA', 'Received a request from the client to update the CYPF petty cash balance amounting to â‚±25,050.25.\r\n', 'Received a request from the client to update the CYPF petty cash balance amounting to â‚±25,050.25.\r\n', 'Updated the CYPF petty cash balance in the system based on the amount provided by the client and informed the client that the update has been successfully completed.\r\n', 'DONE'),
