(2852, '330124', '2026-01-29', 'MARK DY', 'TELABASTAGAN', 'DUKE ESGUERRA', 'Received a request from the client to fix the cash float amount to 29,295.\r\n', 'The client entered an incorrect cash float amount, which required correction to 29,295.\r\n\r\n', 'Requested UltraViewer access to the clientâ€™s POS.\r\nPerformed SQL backup, edited the cash float to the correct amount, and confirmed completion with the client.\r\n\r\n', 'DONE'),
