(2854, '39536570', '2026-02-02', 'JACQUELYN GALANG', 'BAKELKEL MADAPDAP', 'CHRISTIAN BUNGQUE', 'Client want to update their products in bestprice and also in bakelkel.', 'Outdated price of products of bestprice and also in bakelkel', 'To update the price for bakekel and bp access buddies and bp server then backup their product data, get the product data and execute in each bakelkel and best price\r\n', 'Done'),
