(2862, '16364842', '2026-02-05', 'JONALYN BENGANO', 'TAGUIG', 'CHRISTIAN BUNGQUE', 'Replace the old SSD to new SSD', 'Due to the old SSD it experiencing BSOD', 'Call the client and assist them to install the new SSD and then install also drivers and updated system, lastly test the admin system and terminal', 'Done'),
(2863, '20292695', '2026-02-05', 'GIAN GOMEZ', 'BLK 5 SAN MANUEL TARLAC CITY', 'DUKE ESGUERRA', 'CLIENT WANT TO ADJUST THEIR SALES FOR THE MONTH OF JANUARY 2026\r\n\r\n', 'MONTHLY ADJUST SALES WORTH 14K AND 2K VOID\r\n\r\n\r\n', '-ASK THE CLIENT TO OPEN THE ANYDESK TO GAIN ACCESS BACKUP THE DATABASE -BACK UP THE DATABASE -GET THE ITEMCOUNT.SQL AND VOIDITEMS.SQL -DELETE THE DUPLICATE OF OLD ITEMCOUNT.SQL AND VOIDITEMS.SQL -EXECUTE THE NEW ITEMCOUNT.SQL AND VOIDITEMS.SQL\r\n', 'DONE'),
(2864, '58449021', '2026-02-06', 'MR OGIE ABESAMIS', 'TALAVERA NUEVA ECIJA', 'CHRISTIAN BUNGQUE', 'Client send the monthly adjustment sales for the month of January 2026\r\nTHE NEST SAN PASCUAL\r\n', 'Monthly sales adjustment Need sales worth 30k SI No. - 27256', 'Asked the client to open ultraviewer to gain access backed up the database dump itemcount.sql and voiditems.sql and adjusted the sales after that access executed the updated itemcount.sql and voiditems.sql files to their database.', 'Done'),
(2865, '58449021', '2026-02-06', 'MR OGIE ABESAMIS', 'TALAVERA NUEVA ECIJA', 'CHRISTIAN BUNGQUE', 'Client send the monthly adjustment sales for the month of January 2026\r\nTHE NEST SAMPALOC\r\n', 'Monthly sales adjustment Need sales worth 35k SI No. - 55009', 'Asked the client to open ultraviewer to gain access backed up the database dump itemcount.sql and voiditems.sql and adjusted the sales after that access executed the updated itemcount.sql and voiditems.sql files to their database.', 'Done'),
(2866, '16364842', '2026-02-07', 'JONALYN BENGANO', 'TAGUIG', 'CHRISTIAN BUNGQUE', 'Client ask for support regarding to their POS while login their badge number is always incorrect but the bage number they input is correct.', 'The ip address of the server is dynamic so they change automatically', 'Call the client then ask them to open their ultraviewer to access then ping the POS then check also the ip address of server then set it to static ip address.', 'Done'),
(2867, '39557470', '2026-02-07', 'JACQUELYN GALANG', 'MABALACAT PAMP', 'CHRISTIAN BUNGQUE', 'Client ask for support regarding the date and time of POS has changed.', 'Need to sync the date and time of the POS', 'Access the client POS then check the date and time then set it to automatically and also in timezone then sync it, lastly inform the client to monitor the date and time', 'Done'),
(2868, '60573025', '2026-02-07', 'MARK DY', 'BULACAN', 'CHRISTIAN BUNGQUE', 'Client ask for support regarding to their POS display have a line and a blinking unknown display in task bar', 'Check and troubleshoot what is the issue of the display of monitor', 'We called the client and assisted them in troubleshooting to identify the main problem. We first checked the display cable by unplugging and reconnecting it to each connected hardware. We also tested the monitor without the display cable to see if the lines were still present. After verifying the results, we determined that the possible issue is the monitor hardware itself. Lastly, we raised the issue to our head/boss and informed the client that we will provide an update.', 'Done'),
(2869, '60452560', '2026-02-07', 'ANDREWS FOOD MFG', 'BALAGTAS , BULACAN', 'CHRISTIAN BUNGQUE', 'Client ask for support regarding to their Attendance in production is slow tap in and also the camera dont work', 'The lan cable is loosing and then the usb port of camera need to plug to another usb port', 'Call the client then assist them to troubleshoot the problem first assist them to unplug and plug the camera and lan cable then restart the pc then test', 'Done'),
(2870, '97777579', '2026-02-09', 'JACQUELYN GALANG', 'PORAC PAMPANGA', 'DUKE ESGUERRA', 'CLIENT ASKED TO UPDATE THE PRICE OF BEST PRICE\r\n', 'ACCESS BP SERVER THEN BACK UP THEIR PRODUCT DATA TO UPDATE PRICE TO BP.\r\n\r\n', 'NEED TO UPDATE PRICE\r\n\r\n', 'DONE'),
(2871, '9195499', '2026-02-10', 'MLK TILES CUTCUT', 'CUTCUT AC', 'CHRISTIAN BUNGQUE', 'Client encountered an error page when adding and saving a new product.', 'The product description contained an apostrophe (special character).\r\n', 'Checked the POS admin and verified the issue. Advised the client to remove the apostrophe from the product description and retry saving. Product was successfully saved.', 'Done'),
(2872, '60573025', '2026-02-10', 'MARK DY', 'BULACAN', 'DUKE ESGUERRA', 'Client reported that the touchscreen monitor suddenly lost display and is currently showing a black screen, despite the unit being powered on.\r\n\r\n', 'Probable cause is either a faulty VGA cable or an internal monitor issue, as evidenced by a prolonged blinking status light on the lower portion of the monitor.\r\n', 'Upon troubleshooting via video call, the client was instructed to power cycle the touchscreen monitor to check if any display would appearXX however, no display was observed. The client was then asked to check all cables connected to the monitor and confirmed that all were properly plugged in.\r\n\r\nThe client was instructed to turn off the surrounding lights to verify if there was any backlight present on the monitor, but no backlight was detected. To further isolate the issue, the VGA cable was c', 'DONE'),
(2873, '10750156', '2026-02-10', 'JACQUELYN GALANG', 'MADAPDAP MABALACAT', 'DUKE ESGUERRA', 'CLIENT ASKED TO UPDATE THE PRICE OF BAKELKEL AND BEST PRICE', 'NEED TO UPDATE PRICE', 'ACCESS BUDDYS AND BP SERVER THEN BACK UP THEIR PRODUCT DATA TO UPDATE PRICE TO BP AND BAKELKEL', 'DONE'),
(2874, '97777579', '2026-02-10', 'JACQUELYN GALANG', 'PORAC PAMPANGA', 'DUKE ESGUERRA', 'CLIENT ASKED TO UPDATE THE PRICE OF BAKELKEL AND BEST PRICE\r\n', 'NEED TO UPDATE PRICE\r\n', 'ACCESS BUDDYS AND BP SERVER THEN BACK UP THEIR PRODUCT DATA TO UPDATE PRICE TO BP AND BAKELKEL', 'DONE'),
(2875, '60452560', '2026-02-11', 'ANDREWS FOOD MFG', 'BALAGTAS , BULACAN', 'CHRISTIAN BUNGQUE', 'Client ask for support regarding to their payroll system in production and office are not working or cant reach the site', 'The issue when there is a internet access of each server and pc production and office it will reach the site but when it comes offline they cant reach', 'Access all the the computer server, production and office then check all the ip after that set the one router as access point then check again the IPs of each unit then make sure to test all the ssystem connected to server', 'Done'),
(2876, '58449021', '2026-02-11', 'MR OGIE ABESAMIS', 'TALAVERA NUEVA ECIJA', 'CHRISTIAN BUNGQUE', 'Client ask for support regarding the computation of the receipt and other process of rendering sales does not tally in subtotal and vat exempt sale', 'Reprogram the system', 'Access the POS then test each process to know the cause of issue of wrong computation then tell Simon to how to update that then after that test and access again the the nest 1 and 2 to update', 'Done'),
(2877, '39536570', '2026-02-12', 'JACQUELYN GALANG', 'BAKELKEL MADAPDAP', 'CHRISTIAN BUNGQUE', 'Client want to update their products in bestprice and also in bakelkel.', 'Outdated price of products of bestprice and also in bakelkel', 'To update the price for bakekel and bp access buddies and bp server then backup their product data, get the product data and execute in each bakelkel and best price', 'Done'),
