(2879, '330124', '2026-02-12', 'MARK DY', 'TELABASTAGAN', 'DUKE ESGUERRA', 'The client requested to adjust their cash float balance for today.', 'The client requested to adjust their cash float balance for today.', 'Accessed the clientâ€™s UltraViewer for remote support. Saved and backed up the SQL database before making any changes. Updated the cash float amount to 30,173 as requested. Informed the client that the update was successfully completed.', 'DONE'),
(2880, '330124', '2026-02-12', 'MARK DY', 'TELABASTAGAN', 'DUKE ESGUERRA', 'Client requested assistance in printing their Day End Report and X-Reading for February 11, 2026.', 'The client was unable to generate and print the previous dayâ€™s Day End Report and X-Reading from the system.', 'Accessed the clientâ€™s system via UltraViewer for remote support.\r\nCreated and secured a backup of the SQL database prior to making any adjustments.\r\nSuccessfully generated and printed the X-Reading report for February 11, 2026.\r\nTemporarily adjusted the system date to the required backdate in order to generate and print the Cashier Day End Report.\r\nAfter all reports were successfully printed, restored the system date and time to the current settings.\r\n\r\n\r\nReports successfully printed. System d', 'DONE'),
(2881, '330124', '2026-02-13', 'MARK DY', 'TELABASTAGAN', 'DUKE ESGUERRA', 'Client requested assistance in printing their Day End Report for February 12, 2026.\r\n', 'The client was unable to generate and print the previous dayâ€™s Day End Report from the system.\r\n', 'Accessed the clientâ€™s system via UltraViewer for remote support.\r\nCreated and secured a backup of the SQL database prior to making any changes.\r\nTemporarily adjusted the system date to the required backdate to generate and print the Cashier Day End Report.\r\nAfter successfully printing all required reports, restored the system date and time to the current settings.\r\n\r\nAll requested reports were successfully printed. The system date and time have been returned to the present configuration, and t', 'DONE'),
(2882, '58008085', '2026-02-16', 'MYMZ LOGISTICS', 'ANGELES CITY', '', 'Received a request from the client to update the LINEHAUL petty cash balance amounting to â‚±22,229.72 .\r\n\r\n', 'Received a request from the client to update the LINEHAUL petty cash balance amounting to â‚±22,229.72 .\r\n\r\n', 'Updated the LINEHAUL petty cash balance in the system based on the amount provided by the client and informed the client that the update has been successfully completed.\r\n\r\n', 'DONE'),
(2883, '88556487', '2026-02-17', 'CHARLOTTE SIBAL', 'INFINITY AC', 'DUKE ESGUERRA', 'Client requested assistance in adding an add-on product to their GrabFood menu in the POS system.\r\n', 'The add-on item was not yet created or properly linked in the POS system under the GrabFood menu.\r\n\r\n', 'Accessed the clientâ€™s POS system via remote support.\r\nSaved and backed up the SQL database prior to making any changes.\r\nVerified the existing GrabFood menu setup in the POS.\r\nCreated and configured the requested add-on product.\r\nSaved all changes and confirmed with the client that the add-on is now properly reflected in the POS GrabFood menu.\r\n', 'DONE'),
(2884, '58449021', '2026-02-18', 'MR OGIE ABESAMIS', 'TALAVERA NUEVA ECIJA', 'CHRISTIAN BUNGQUE', 'The client ask for support regarding to their printer does not print and also they want to print the day end report yesterday SAN PASCUAL', 'The printer driver is deleted so they cant print the day end report', 'Access the client POS then install the driver printer and test print page after that backdate the POS then render day end report', 'Done'),
(2885, '60573025', '2026-02-21', 'MARK DY', 'BULACAN', 'CHRISTIAN BUNGQUE', 'The client ask for support regarding to their touchscreen monitor flickering display while touching the monitor.', 'Possible reason the display cable of the back of monitor is loosen.', 'Call the client and assist them in unplugging and properly reconnecting the display cable. After that, ask them to test the monitor by touching different areas to check if it flickers again. The issue was resolved afterward. I also informed the client that if the problem happens again, they can just message to gc.', 'Done'),
(2886, '6291749', '2026-02-23', 'LORENCE SAPANGBATO', 'SAPANGBATO ANGELES CITY', 'DUKE ESGUERRA', 'Client reported that there are some missing line on printing receipt on dot matrix printer.\r\n', 'Possible causes include misaligned or worn-out ribbon cartridge, clogged print head pins, incorrect paper alignment, or printer head needing cleaning.\r\n', 'Called the client and conducted a walkthrough troubleshooting of the printer. Instructed the client to adjust the thickness lever to level 2 and perform a test printXX however, the issue persisted.\r\nVerified the printer usage and confirmed that a significant number of receipts had already been printed. Advised the client to replace the printer ribbon cartridge with a new one. The client agreed to purchase and install a new ribbon cartridge.\r\n', 'Done'),
(2887, '93545390', '2026-02-23', 'BENNIE UY', 'BALIBAGO ANGELES CITY', 'DUKE ESGUERRA', 'Client reported they have duplicated transaction on stockledger.\r\n', 'When processing the unposting of a receiving transaction, the system does not delete or remove the corresponding item entries from the stock ledger. As a result, the stock ledger retains the previously posted records even after the transaction has been unposted, causing inventory discrepancies.\r\n\r\n', 'Conducted thorough testing of the receiving and unposting process and verified the issue. Carefully reviewed the codes in posttowarehousenow.php and unposttowarehousenow.php.\r\n\r\nUpdated and added a deletion function in unposttowarehousenow.php to ensure that once a receiving transaction is unposted, the corresponding entries in the stock ledger are properly deleted.\r\n\r\nPerformed multiple tests of posting and unposting transactions, and all tests were successful with correct stock ledger adjustme', 'DONE'),
(2888, '15724957', '2026-02-23', 'MR OGIE ABESAMIS', 'TALAVERA NUEVA ECIJA', 'DUKE ESGUERRA', 'Client reported that the date printed on the receipt was incorrectly set to tomorrowâ€™s date instead of the current date.\r\n', 'A Z-reading process was performed, which automatically advanced the business date to the next day. As a result, the receipt date was set to tomorrow instead of the current date.\r\n', 'Accessed the clientâ€™s POS system and created a secure SQL database backup prior to making any changes.\r\n\r\nVerified that the PC date and time were correctly set to todayâ€™s date. Checked the item count records and confirmed that some entries were incorrectly dated for tomorrow.\r\n\r\nReviewed the Z-reading and confirmed that a Z-reading had already been performed today.\r\n\r\nCorrected all records that were dated for tomorrow and updated them to reflect todayâ€™s correct date. Informed the client th', 'Done'),
(2889, '97777579', '2026-02-23', 'JACQUELYN GALANG', 'PORAC PAMPANGA', 'DUKE ESGUERRA', 'Client want to update their products in bestprice.\r\n', 'Outdated price of products of bestprice.\r\n', 'Accessed the BP Server and created a secure backup of the product database prior to making any changes.\r\n\r\nExtracted the updated product data and executed the necessary price updates in Best Price systems.\r\n\r\nVerified that the updated prices were successfully applied and ensured data consistency across all affected systems.\r\n\r\n', 'Done'),
