(2891, '330124', '2026-02-25', 'MARK DY', 'TELABASTAGAN', 'CHRISTIAN BUNGQUE', 'The client ask for support in printing Day end report for Feb. 24 2026', 'The client was unable to generate and print the previous dayâ€™s Day-End Report.', 'Accessed the clientâ€™s POS system, adjusted the system date to February 24, 2026, accessed each cashier badge requested by the client, and printed the corresponding Day-End Reports.', 'Done'),
