(2913, '66165111', '2026-03-10', 'MARK DY', 'CITY OF SAN FERNANDO', 'CHRISTIAN BUNGQUE', 'The client requested support regarding some transactions that were settled as Gift Certificate but should have been PayMaya. They also requested an adjustment in the cash breakdown and added a cash-out entry. After the adjustments were made, we generated the Day End Report yesterday.', 'The transactions were recorded with the wrong payment method (Gift Certificate instead of PayMaya), causing cash breakdown discrepancies that required manual adjustment', '-Call the client then clarify their concern then access the POS then backup database and adjust some transaction to be set to proper payment method', 'Done'),
(2914, '97777579', '2026-03-10', 'JACQUELYN GALANG', 'PORAC PAMPANGA', 'DUKE ESGUERRA', 'Client want to update their products in bestprice.\r\n\r\n', 'Outdated price of products of bestprice.\r\n', 'Accessed the BP Server and created a secure backup of the product database prior to making any changes. Extracted the updated product data and executed the necessary price updates in Best Price systems. Verified that the updated prices were successfully applied and ensured data consistency across all affected systems.\r\n\r\n', 'Done'),
(2915, '66165111', '2026-03-11', 'MARK DY', 'CITY OF SAN FERNANDO', 'CHRISTIAN BUNGQUE', 'Client ask for support regarding to some transaction that process to the old account and then some transaction process to the new account and also they want to render the day end report yesterday.', 'The client requested to delete their previous account and create a new one. However, some transactions were already processed using the old account, while the remaining transactions were processed using the newly created account.', 'Access the client POS and back up database then adjust some transaction to proper cashier name then backdate to render the day end report yesterday\r\n', 'Pending for confirmation'),
