(2919, '15123060', '2026-03-13', 'MARK DY', 'ANGELES CITY', 'DUKE ESGUERRA', 'Client reported that their printer is printing blank page.\r\n', 'A small piece of paper was stuck inside the printer and blocked the thermal print head, preventing the printer from printing text.\r\n\r\n', 'Called the client and asked the cashier to send a video to verify the receipt paper. Confirmed that the thermal paper was inserted correctly, but the manual test print was blank.\r\n\r\nInstructed the cashier to clean the paper tray and check inside the printer. A small piece of paper was found blocking the print head. Asked them to remove it, reinsert the thermal paper, and perform a test print.\r\n\r\nThe printer printed text properly after the small paper was removed. Verified by printing a receipt, ', 'Done'),
