(2924, '97777579', '2026-03-16', 'JACQUELYN GALANG', 'PORAC PAMPANGA', 'DUKE ESGUERRA', 'Client want to update their products in bestprice.\r\n\r\n', 'Outdated price of products of bestprice.\r\n', 'Accessed the BP Server and created a secure backup of the product database prior to making any changes. Extracted the updated product data and executed the necessary price updates in Best Price systems. Verified that the updated prices were successfully applied and ensured data consistency across all affected systems.\r\n\r\n', 'Done'),
(2925, '71467033', '2026-03-17', 'RUDYLYN LEUTERIO', 'MARILAO BULACAN', 'CHRISTIAN BUNGQUE', 'The client requested support because they are unable to log in to both the POS cashier and admin page.', 'The MySQL service in XAMPP is not performing properly and automatically stops, which causes data errors.', 'First, diagnose the root cause of why the client is unable to log in to both the POS cashier and admin pages. Next, access and secure the clientâ€™s backup XAMPP folder, including all important POS data files.After that, retrieve and verify the necessary data.Then, uninstall and reinstall XAMPP to resolve system issues.\r\nProceed with setting up the POS system again and restore the database.\r\nFinally, test the POS system thoroughly, including login functionality and printing, to ensure everything', 'Done'),
(2926, '93545390', '2026-02-24', 'BENNIE UY', 'BALIBAGO ANGELES CITY', 'DUKE ESGUERRA', 'Client reported that a double Z reading was processed on Terminal 10.\r\n\r\n', 'Sales dated February 23 were carried over and recorded under February 24 due to the execution of the Z-reading, causing a shift in the reported sales date.\r\n', ' Requested AnyDesk access for Terminal 10 and accessed the POS system\r\n\r\nSaved and created a backup of the SQL database\r\n\r\nUpdated records by changing all entries with xdate XX 2026-02-24 (affected by the shift) to xdate XX 2026-02-23\r\n\r\nCoordinated with the client to verify the corrected sales dates\r\n\r\nClient confirmed that all adjusted records are now accurate and correct\r\n', 'DONE'),
(2927, '93545390', '2026-03-11', 'BENNIE UY', 'BALIBAGO ANGELES CITY', 'DUKE ESGUERRA', 'Client reported that the Z-Reading total (beginning and ending balance) on Terminal 10 dated March 07, 2026 does not match their recorded sales data.\r\n\r\n', 'Client reported that the Z-Reading total beginning and ending on terminal10 dated march 07, 2026 is different from their records.\r\n\r\n', 'Requested AnyDesk access for Terminal 10 and accessed the POS system\r\n\r\nSaved and created a backup of the SQL database\r\n\r\nCopied the SQL database to a local PC for further checking\r\n\r\nReviewed the Z-reading totals and identified discrepancies\r\n\r\nUpon client instruction, injected the specified amount dated December 31, 2023 to correct the beginning and ending balances reflected in the March 7 Z-reading\r\n\r\nVerified other dates in March and confirmed that all records are accurate\r\n\r\nInformed the cl', 'Done'),
