(2930, '93545390', '2026-03-24', 'BENNIE UY', 'BALIBAGO ANGELES CITY', 'DUKE ESGUERRA', 'Client reported that the Z-Reading total (beginning and ending balance) on Terminal 10 dated March 07, 2026 does not match their recorded sales data.\r\n\r\n', 'Client reported that the Z-Reading total (beginning and ending balance) on Terminal 10 dated March 18, 2026 does not match their recorded sales data.\r\n\r\n', 'Requested AnyDesk access for Terminal 10 and accessed the POS system Saved and created a backup of the SQL database Copied the SQL database to a local PC for further checking Reviewed the Z-reading totals and identified discrepancies Upon client instruction, injected the specified amount dated December 31, 2023 to correct the beginning and ending balances reflected in the March 18 Z-reading Verified other dates in March and confirmed that all records are accurate Informed the client confirmed th', 'DONE'),
(2931, '88556487', '2026-03-24', 'CHARLOTTE SIBAL', 'INFINITY AC', 'CHRISTIAN BUNGQUE', 'The client requested support regarding to their kitchen tablet cant connect to the system', 'The link in the app of kiosk app is not set to the system link start up', 'Call the client then access the POS get the ip address of the POS and then test the link of kitchen panel in POS then assist the client to input that link into kitchen tablet then run the system ', 'Done'),
(2932, '80864793', '2026-03-25', 'TINE SAGMIT', 'BERTHAPHIL CLARK', 'DUKE ESGUERRA', 'The client reported that the touchscreen is not functioning.\r\n\r\n', 'The USB cable connected to the monitor is not securely plugged in.\r\n', 'Advised the client to unplug and replug the USB cable into the USB port at the back of the PC unit.\r\n\r\n', 'DONE'),
(2933, '97777579', '2026-03-26', 'JACQUELYN GALANG', 'PORAC PAMPANGA', 'DUKE ESGUERRA', 'Client want to update their products in bakelkel.\r\n\r\n', 'Outdated price of products of bakelkel.\r\n', 'Accessed the Buddys Server and created a secure backup of the product database prior to making any changes. Extracted the updated product data and executed the necessary price updates in Bakelkel systems. Verified that the updated prices were successfully applied and ensured data consistency across all affected systems.\r\n\r\n', 'Done'),
(2934, '9195499', '2026-03-26', 'MLK TILES CUTCUT', 'CUTCUT AC', 'CHRISTIAN BUNGQUE', 'Client ask for support regarding to their date and time of the POS is cant sync', 'Replace the CMOS battery', 'Deploy in MLK Cutcut then replace the CMOS of the POS pc then tell the client to monitor the POS if they change date and time', 'Done'),
(2935, '88556487', '2026-03-30', 'CHARLOTTE SIBAL', 'INFINITY AC', 'DUKE ESGUERRA', 'Client requested to update the price of Chocolate Pistachio Crunch to 180 and Grab Chocolate Pistachio Crunch to 220\r\n', 'Outdated Price\r\n\r\n', 'Accessed the client UV, performed SQL save and backup, updated the prices of Chocolate Pistachio Crunch and Grab Chocolate Pistachio Crunch via the admin panel, and informed the client that the product prices have been successfully updated.\r\n', 'DONE'),
(2936, '15123060', '2026-03-31', 'MARK DY', 'ANGELES CITY', 'DUKE ESGUERRA', 'Client reported that they selected the wrong payment method and requested to change it from PayMaya to cash.\r\n', 'The issue was caused by the client accidentally selecting the wrong payment method (PayMaya instead of cash) during the transaction.\r\n\r\n', 'The client provided access to their POS via UltraViewer. Upon accessing the system, a backup of the SQL database was created and saved. The payment method for S.I. 3289 was updated to cash in the bucket_itemcount, bucket_reference, and transactionlogs tables. The client was then advised to reprint the receipt for verification.\r\n\r\n', 'DONE'),
(2937, '9195499', '2026-04-01', 'MLK TILES CUTCUT', 'CUTCUT AC', 'CHRISTIAN BUNGQUE', 'The client ask for support regarding to their shortcut system icon is deleted', 'Possible they delete the shortcut icon', 'Access the client POS then check the in Recycle Bin then restore the icon and open or test the icon system', 'Done'),
(2938, '60573025', '2026-04-01', 'MARK DY', 'BULACAN', 'DUKE ESGUERRA', 'Client reported that their screen suddenly turned black.\r\n\r\n', 'The issue was likely caused by explorer.exe being accidentally closed, which resulted in a black screen display.\r\n\r\n', ' Requested the client to provide a video of their monitor. Upon review, the mouse cursor was visible on the screen, indicating that the system was still responsive. The client was then advised to restart the computer. After rebooting, the client confirmed that the issue was resolved.\r\n\r\n', 'Done'),
(2939, '58449021', '2026-04-08', 'MR OGIE ABESAMIS', 'TALAVERA NUEVA ECIJA', 'DUKE ESGUERRA', 'Client send the monthly adjustment sales for the month of March 2026 THE NEST SAN PASCUAL\r\n\r\n', 'Monthly sales adjustment Need sales worth 30k SI No. - 28439 \r\n', '28k SI No. - 27706	Asked the client to open ultraviewer to gain access backed up the database dump itemcount.sql and voiditems.sql and adjusted the sales after that access executed the updated itemcount.sql and voiditems.sql files to their database.\r\n', 'DONE'),
(2940, '15123060', '2026-04-08', 'MARK DY', 'ANGELES CITY', 'DUKE ESGUERRA', 'Client requested assistance in printing the Z-Reading report for the months of March.\r\n\r\n', 'The Z-Reading report was required by the clientâ€™s Accounting Department for documentation and internal reporting purposes.\r\n', 'Accessed the clientâ€™s POS system.\r\n\r\nSaved and created a backup of the SQL database prior to making any changes.\r\n\r\nTemporarily backdated the system date to March 31, 2026 to generate and print the required End-of-Month Z-Reading reports.\r\n\r\nAfter client verification of the printed Z-Readings, restored the system date to the current date.\r\n', 'DONE'),
(2941, '330124', '2026-04-08', 'MARK DY', 'TELABASTAGAN', 'DUKE ESGUERRA', 'Client requested assistance in printing the Z-Reading report for the months of March.\r\n', 'The Z-Reading report was required by the clientâ€™s Accounting Department for documentation and internal reporting purposes.\r\n\r\n', 'Accessed the clientâ€™s POS system.\r\n\r\nSaved and created a backup of the SQL database prior to making any changes.\r\n\r\nTemporarily backdated the system date to March 31, 2026 to generate and print the required End-of-Month Z-Reading reports.\r\n\r\nAfter client verification of the printed Z-Readings, restored the system date to the current date.\r\n', 'Done'),
(2942, '66165111', '2026-04-08', 'MARK DY', 'CITY OF SAN FERNANDO', 'DUKE ESGUERRA', 'Client requested assistance in printing the Z-Reading report for the months of March.\r\n', 'The Z-Reading report was required by the clientâ€™s Accounting Department for documentation and internal reporting purposes.\r\n\r\n', 'Accessed the clientâ€™s POS system.\r\n\r\nSaved and created a backup of the SQL database prior to making any changes.\r\n\r\nTemporarily backdated the system date to March 31, 2026 to generate and print the required End-of-Month Z-Reading reports.\r\n\r\nAfter client verification of the printed Z-Readings, restored the system date to the current date.\r\n', 'DONE'),
