(2965, '99289273', '2026-04-27', 'SIMON AND STANLEY INTERNATIONAL TRADING AND DEV`T CO. INC.', 'LOT C 5B BLK C SUBIC COMMERCIAL LIGHT  XX INDUSTRIAL PARK DEWEY AVE. CBD AREA SUBIC BAY FREEPORT ZONE 2222', 'DUKE ESGUERRA', 'Client reported a duplicate settlement for invoice no. 2402 (Grab transaction).\r\n\r\n', 'Client reported a duplicate settlement for invoice no. 2402 (Grab transaction).\r\n\r\n', 'Upon checking the clientâ€™s data, a duplicate invoice no. 2402 was identified. The cashier was advised to obtain approval from their management prior to deletion. A backup of the clientâ€™s SQL database was created before proceeding. After approval, the duplicated invoice was deleted, and the client confirmed that their shift report is now tally.\r\n', 'DONE'),
(2966, '97777579', '2026-04-28', 'JACQUELYN GALANG', 'PORAC PAMPANGA', 'DUKE ESGUERRA', 'Client want to update their products in bestprice and also in bakelkel', 'Outdated price of products of bestprice and also in bakelkel', 'To update the price for bakekel and bp access buddies and bp server then backup their product data, get the product data and execute in each bakelkel and best price', 'DONE'),
