(2968, '93545390', '2026-04-27', 'BENNIE UY', 'BALIBAGO ANGELES CITY', 'CHRISTIAN BUNGQUE', 'Update SPM1 or TERMINAL9 regarding to their concern in duplicate items in item exchange and also in the clearing item of if the transaction is settled but after clearing cart or charge invoide it will back again all the items', 'Update the system', 'Access the client POS then backup database and files system then update and test the system', 'Done'),
(2969, '88556487', '2026-05-04', 'CHARLOTTE SIBAL', 'INFINITY AC', 'DUKE ESGUERRA', 'The client requested to generate a Z-Reading report for the month of April.\r\n', 'The client requested to generate a Z-Reading report for the month of April.\r\n', 'Accessed the clientâ€™s POS system remotely, performed an SQL backup and data safeguarding, and temporarily adjusted the system date to April 30 to generate the Z-Reading. After successfully generating the report, the system date and time were reverted to the current settings. The Z-Reading for the month of April was then printed, and the client confirmed receipt of the printed report.\r\n', 'Done'),
