(2981, '64857706', '2026-05-04', 'MS.PAULA JOY', 'STO ROSARIO TAVERA', 'DUKE ESGUERRA', 'Client reported that their POS doest not have any internet access.\r\n\r\n', 'Their wifi was disabled from the settings.\r\n\r\n', 'Coordinated with the client via call and conducted step-by-step troubleshooting. Initially instructed the client to transfer the Wi-Fi dongle to a different USB portXX however, the issue persisted with no internet connectivity.\r\n\r\nGuided the client to access the Control Panel ] Network and Sharing Center ] Change Adapter Settings, where it was identified that the wireless network adapter was disabled. Advised the client to enable the Wi-Fi adapter.\r\n\r\nAfter enabling the network adapter, the clie', 'DONE'),
