(2986, '15724957', '2026-05-06', 'MR OGIE ABESAMIS', 'TALAVERA NUEVA ECIJA', 'DUKE ESGUERRA', 'Client reported that their POS system encountered a â€œNo Signalâ€ display and subsequently booted into recovery mode.\r\n', 'The issue was likely caused by an improper shutdown of the unit, which led the system to enter Recovery Mode.\r\n', 'The client provided an image of the POS terminal showing that the unit had entered Recovery Mode. The client was instructed to select the â€œRestart my PCâ€ option. After performing the restart, the client confirmed that the POS system is now functioning properly.\r\n', 'DONE'),
