(2988, '15123060', '2026-05-07', 'MARK DY', 'ANGELES CITY', 'DUKE ESGUERRA', 'Client requested assistance in printing the Z-Reading report for the months of April 2026\r\n\r\n', 'The Z-Reading report was required by the clientâ€™s Accounting Department for documentation and internal reporting purposes.\r\n', 'Accessed the clientâ€™s POS system. Saved and created a backup of the SQL database prior to making any changes. Temporarily backdated the system date to April 30, 2026 to generate and print the required End-of-Month Z-Reading reports. After client verification of the printed Z-Readings, restored the system date to the current date.\r\n', 'Done'),
